L["resurrection: not offered -- not enough mana for |cffffffff%s|r."] = "复活：不推荐——法力不足，无法施放|cffffffff%s|r。"
L["resurrection: %d left alone -- they released their spirit, and the game tells where a spirit is, never its body."] = "复活：%d人未推荐——他们已释放灵魂，游戏只会告知灵魂的位置，不会告知尸体的位置。"
