L["Manners found no spell called %s in your spellbook. Type it as your spellbook shows it, or its spell id."] = "Manners 在你的法术书中找不到名为%s的法术。请按法术书显示的样子输入，或输入它的法术 ID。"
L["%s is not in your spellbook: Manners adds only a spell this character knows."] = "%s不在你的法术书中：Manners 只添加这个角色已学会的法术。"
