L["%s is cast on an enemy, so it cannot go on you."] = "%s是对敌人施放的法术，所以无法加在你身上。"
L["Manners already reminds you of %s: its switch is %s, on Who to buff under Myself."] = "Manners 已经会提醒你%s：它的开关是%s，在给谁加增益的我自己下。"
L["%s is a buff Manners already offers: its switch is on Who to buff, under What to cast."] = "%s是 Manners 已经提供的增益：它的开关在给谁加增益的施放什么下。"
L["%s is on your list already."] = "%s已经在你的列表中。"
L["Your list is full: ten spells at most. Remove one first."] = "你的列表已满：最多十个法术。请先移除一个。"
