L["%s is not on your list."] = "%s不在你的列表中。"
L["%s (not in your spellbook now)"] = "%s（目前不在你的法术书中）"
L["%s (Manners now reminds you of it itself)"] = "%s（Manners 现在已自行提醒你）"
L["Spells of your own (%d of %d):"] = "我自己的法术（%d / %d）："
L["No spells of your own yet. Add one on Who to buff, under Add a spell of my own, or with /manners spell add <name or id>."] = "还没有我自己的法术。请在给谁加增益的添加我自己的法术下添加，或使用 /manners spell add <名称或ID>。"
L["Type /manners spell add <name or id>, or /manners spell remove <name or id>."] = "请输入 /manners spell add <名称或ID>，或 /manners spell remove <名称或ID>。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- you are in a fight."] = "你自己的增益：暂不推荐——你正在战斗中。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- skipped for now."] = "你自己的增益：暂不推荐——已暂时跳过。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- the game will not say your name."] = "你自己的增益：暂不推荐——游戏无法告知你的名字。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- you are on your never-offer list."] = "你自己的增益：暂不推荐——你已在你的永不推荐名单中。"
