L["Scrolls"] = "卷轴"
L["%s: no timer -- never topped up."] = "%s：没有计时——不会补加。"
L["%s: length unknown -- topped up at %s left, %s in a raid or dungeon."] = "%s：持续时间未知——剩余%s时补加，团队或地下城中为%s。"
L["(%s as a group cast)"] = "（群体版为%s）"
L["%s: lasts %s -- topped up at %s left, %s in a raid or dungeon, %s outside your group."] = "%s：持续%s——剩余%s时补加，团队或地下城中为%s，队伍之外为%s。"
L["%s: lasts %s -- topped up at %s left, %s in a raid or dungeon."] = "%s：持续%s——剩余%s时补加，团队或地下城中为%s。"
L["When a top-up is due"] = "补加时机"
L["When a top-up is due (top-ups are off)"] = "补加时机（补加已关闭）"
L["this class has no buffs to cast on other players."] = "此职业没有可以给其他玩家加的增益。"
L["|cffff8080not during a fight|r -- the prompt cannot be put on screen while one is on. Try again when it ends."] = "|cffff8080战斗中不行|r——战斗中无法把提示框放到屏幕上。战斗结束后再试。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r is installed. It starts once you learn |cffffd100%s|r from your class trainer, and says hello properly then."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r已安装。等你从职业训练师那里学会|cffffd100%s|r后它就开始工作，到时再正式向你问好。"
L["You have learned |cffffd100%s|r, so Manners can start returning buffs."] = "你已学会|cffffd100%s|r，Manners现在可以开始回赠增益了。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r is installed, but this class has no buffs to cast on other players."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r已安装，但此职业没有可以给其他玩家加的增益。"
L["It is still worth keeping for an alt that does -- it will say hello again there."] = "不过仍值得为有增益的小号保留它——到时它会在那边再打一次招呼。"
L["With %s on, the prompt comes up when somebody could give you a buff you are missing, and a press asks them for it."] = "开启%s后，当有人能给你缺少的增益时提示框会出现，按一下即可向对方请求。"
L["It can also ask other players for a buff you are missing, one polite line at a press: tick %s in the options (|cffffd100/manners|r)."] = "它还可以向其他玩家请求你缺少的增益，每按一次说一句客气话：在选项（|cffffd100/manners|r）中勾选%s。"
L["Ask people for a buff I'm missing"] = "向别人请求我缺少的增益"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r is installed, but nothing will be offered to anybody: %s."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r已安装，但不会向任何人推荐任何增益：%s。"
L["|cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings the rest of this back once that changes."] = "情况改变后，输入|cffffd100/manners welcome|r可再次查看其余说明。"
L["Nothing to do: your own buffs are switched off under %s."] = "无事可做：你自己的增益都在“%s”下关闭了。"
L["Myself"] = "我自己"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts your own buffs on a small prompt when none of them is up -- your class has none for other players. Clicking the prompt casts it on you."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会在你自己的增益一个都不在身上时，把它们放到一个小提示框上——你的职业没有可以给其他玩家加的增益。点击提示框即可对你自己施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts your own buffs on a small prompt when none of them is up; nothing is offered to anybody else: %s. Clicking the prompt casts it on you."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会在你自己的增益一个都不在身上时，把它们放到一个小提示框上；不会给其他任何人推荐增益：%s。点击提示框即可对你自己施放。"
L["Only one person can have %s at a time, so it goes to one member of your group who is not of your class, and only while none of yours is on anybody in it."] = "同一时间只有一个人能拥有%s，所以它会给队伍中一名不是你同职业的成员，并且只在队伍里没有任何人身上有你的该效果时才会提示。"
L["Only one person can have %s at a time, so it goes to a tank of your group (the tank role, or main tank in a raid), and only while none of yours is on anybody in it."] = "同一时间只有一个人能拥有%s，所以它会给队伍中的一名坦克（坦克职责，团队中则为主坦克），并且只在队伍里没有任何人身上有你的该效果时才会提示。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody in your group who is missing your |cffffd100%s|r -- or who has just buffed you -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt casts it."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会把队伍中缺少你的|cffffd100%s|r的人（或刚给你加过增益的人）放到一个小提示框上。点击提示框即可施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody in your group who is missing your |cffffd100buff|r -- or who has just buffed you -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt casts it."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会把队伍中缺少你的|cffffd100增益|r的人（或刚给你加过增益的人）放到一个小提示框上。点击提示框即可施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody who buffs you -- and any stranger nearby who is missing one of yours -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt buffs them."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会把给你加增益的人（以及附近缺少你某个增益的陌生人）放到一个小提示框上。点击提示框即可给对方加增益。"
L["|cffff8080Friendly nameplates are off|r, so Manners cannot tell who a stranger is: a passer-by who buffs you, or who is missing your buff, never comes up on the prompt. %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on."] = "|cffff8080友方姓名板已关闭|r，Manners无法认出陌生人：给你加增益的路人，或缺少你增益的路人，都不会出现在提示框上。点击%s（在“%s”，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可开启。"
L["The one thing that is not automatic: |cffffd100/manners macro|r or |cffffd100Put Manners on an action bar|r in the options puts a macro on your cursor for your bars, or bind a key under Options > Keybindings > Manners."] = "唯一不能自动完成的一步：输入|cffffd100/manners macro|r或点击选项中的|cffffd100把Manners放到动作条上|r，把宏放到光标上再放进动作条；或在选项 > 快捷键 > Manners中绑定快捷键。"
L["|cffff8080It is switched off on this profile|r, so no prompt will appear -- |cffffd100/manners on|r when you want it."] = "|cffff8080此配置文件已将其关闭|r，因此不会出现提示框——需要时输入|cffffd100/manners on|r。"
L["The prompt is on screen now, with somebody real on it already. |cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings this back."] = "提示框已经在屏幕上了，上面已有一位真实的玩家。输入|cffffd100/manners welcome|r可再次查看这段说明。"
L["That is the prompt, with a pretend name on it. |cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings this back."] = "这就是提示框，上面是一个虚构的名字。输入|cffffd100/manners welcome|r可再次查看这段说明。"
L["does not exist (or its existence is withheld)"] = "不存在（或其存在被隐藏）"
L["withheld: %s"] = "被隐藏：%s"
L["this buff is not readable here"] = "此处无法读取该增益"
L["%s has no unit token right now, so {unit} cannot be filled"] = "%s目前没有单位标识，因此无法填入{unit}"
L["until you log out"] = "直到你登出"
L["until %s"] = "至%s"
L["1 minute"] = "1分钟"
L["%d minutes"] = "%d分钟"
L["snoozed until you log out -- though Manners is switched off, so no prompt appears either way."] = "免打扰至你登出——不过 Manners 已关闭，所以无论如何都不会出现提示。"
L["snoozed until you log out. In a fight the prompt stays as the fight found it, and follows the snooze once this one ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it."] = "免打扰至你登出。战斗中提示保持战斗开始时的样子，免打扰结束后再跟随。|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可结束免打扰。"
L["snoozed until you log out. The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged and casts nothing; once you lock it, it stays away. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it."] = "免打扰至你登出。提示已解锁，会一直显示以便拖动，不会施放任何法术；锁定后它就不再出现。|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可结束免打扰。"
L["snoozed until you log out or reload -- no prompt until then. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it."] = "免打扰至你登出或重载界面——在此之前不会出现提示。|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r 可结束免打扰。"
L["snoozed for %s, %s -- though Manners is switched off, so no prompt appears either way."] = "已开启免打扰%s，%s——不过Manners已关闭，所以无论如何都不会出现提示框。"
L["snoozed for %s, %s. In a fight the prompt stays as the fight found it, and follows the snooze once this one ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已开启免打扰%s，%s。战斗中提示框保持战斗开始时的样子，本场战斗结束后再进入免打扰。输入|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r可提前结束。"
L["snoozed for %s, %s. The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged and casts nothing; once you lock it, it stays away until the snooze ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已开启免打扰%s，%s。提示框已解锁，所以会留在屏幕上供你拖动，但不会施法；锁定后，它会一直隐藏到免打扰结束。输入|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r可提前结束。"
L["snoozed for %s -- no prompt %s. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已开启免打扰%s——%s期间不显示提示框。输入|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r可提前结束。"
L["the snooze is over, but Manners is switched off -- |cffffd100/manners on|r to see the prompt again."] = "免打扰已结束，但Manners已关闭——输入|cffffd100/manners on|r可重新显示提示框。"
L["the snooze is over -- the prompt can appear again once this fight ends."] = "免打扰已结束——本场战斗结束后提示框可以再次出现。"
L["the snooze is over -- the prompt can appear again."] = "免打扰已结束——提示框可以再次出现。"
L["not snoozed -- the prompt is free to appear."] = "未开启免打扰——提示框可以正常出现。"
L["there is nothing to import -- paste a settings string that starts with MNR1:."] = "没有可导入的内容——请粘贴以MNR1:开头的设置字符串。"
L["that is not a Manners settings string -- one starts with MNR1:."] = "这不是Manners的设置字符串——设置字符串以MNR1:开头。"
L["that is far longer than any Manners settings string, so it was not read."] = "这比任何Manners设置字符串都长得多，因此没有读取。"
L["that string was made by a newer version of Manners -- update the addon to read it."] = "该字符串由更新版本的Manners生成——请更新插件后再读取。"
L["that string is incomplete or has been changed -- copy it again in one piece, and paste a long one into the box under Share as text (%s)."] = "该字符串不完整或已被改动——请重新完整复制；较长的字符串请粘贴到“以文本分享”下的文本框中（%s）。"
L["that string is damaged -- part of it is not a setting Manners can read. Copy it again in one piece."] = "该字符串已损坏——其中一部分不是Manners能读取的设置。请重新完整复制。"
L["that string gives %s a value it cannot have, so nothing was changed."] = "该字符串给%s设置了一个不可能的值，因此没有做任何更改。"
L["settings imported -- every one of them is the default."] = "设置已导入——全部都是默认值。"
L["settings imported -- 1 differs from the defaults."] = "设置已导入——有1项与默认值不同。"
L["settings imported -- %d differ from the defaults."] = "设置已导入——有%d项与默认值不同。"
L["1 setting from a newer version of Manners was left out."] = "有1项来自更新版本Manners的设置被略过。"
L["%d settings from a newer version of Manners were left out."] = "有%d项来自更新版本Manners的设置被略过。"
L["The string had speaking a line when you buff switched on. That is left off, because it talks to other players: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "该字符串开启了加增益时说一句台词。此项保持关闭，因为它会对其他玩家说话：如有需要，请在“我说什么”标签页中开启。"
L["The string had /thank people who buff me switched on. That is left off, because everybody near you sees it: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "该字符串开启了“对给我加增益的人/thank”。此项保持关闭，因为附近的所有人都会看到：如有需要，请在“我说什么”标签页中开启。"
L["The string had whispering a thank-you to people you can't buff back switched on. That is left off, because it talks to other players: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "该字符串开启了向无法回赠增益的人密语道谢。此项保持关闭，因为它会对其他玩家说话：如有需要，请在“我说什么”标签页中开启。"
L["The string had thanking people even when you can't see who it was switched on. That is left off, because everybody near you sees it: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "该字符串开启了“看不到是谁也道谢”。此项保持关闭，因为附近的所有人都会看到：如有需要，请在“我说什么”标签页中开启。"
L["The string had asking people for a buff switched on. That is left off, because it talks to other players: switch it on under Who to buff if you want it."] = "该字符串开启了向别人请求增益。此项保持关闭，因为它会对其他玩家说话：如有需要，请在“给谁加增益”标签页中开启。"
L["What you say when you buff, and where, is kept as you had it, because you have speaking switched on."] = "加增益时说什么、在哪里说，都保持你原来的设置，因为你已开启发言。"
L["How you ask for a buff, and where, is kept as you had it, because you have asking switched on."] = "请求增益时怎么说、在哪里说，都保持你原来的设置，因为你已开启向别人请求增益。"
