L["nobody has buffed you recently."] = "最近没有人给你加增益。"
L["your own buff: offered to you when you are missing it."] = "你自己的增益：你缺少它时会推荐给你。"
L["your own buff: nothing you cast goes on yourself alone."] = "你自己的增益：你没有只对自己施放的增益。"
L["prompt is UNLOCKED -- it will not buff anyone until you /manners lock"] = "提示框已解锁——在你输入/manners lock之前不会给任何人加增益"
L["|cffffd100snoozed %s|r -- no prompt until then; /manners snooze off ends it"] = "|cffffd100免打扰%s|r——在此之前不显示提示框；输入/manners snooze off可结束"
L["|cffffd100mounted|r -- \"Hide the prompt while I'm mounted\" keeps it away until you get off"] = "|cffffd100骑乘中|r——已开启“骑乘时隐藏提示框”，下坐骑后提示框才会出现"
L["|cffffd100saving mana|r -- until you are back to %d%% mana, only your own buff and people who buffed you or asked are offered"] = "|cffffd100节省法力值|r——在法力值回到%d%%之前，只推荐你自己的增益，以及给你加过增益或向你要过增益的人"
L["|cffffd100saving mana|r -- until you are back to %d%% mana, only people who buffed you or asked are offered"] = "|cffffd100节省法力值|r——在法力值回到%d%%之前，只推荐给你加过增益或向你要过增益的人"
L["|cffffd100saving mana|r -- until you are back to %d%% mana, only your own buff is offered"] = "|cffffd100节省法力值|r——在法力值回到%d%%之前，只推荐你自己的增益"
L["|cffffd100saving mana|r -- until you are back to %d%% mana, nothing is offered"] = "|cffffd100节省法力值|r——在法力值回到%d%%之前，什么都不推荐"
L["|cffffd100ready check|r -- your party or raid comes first until the pull"] = "|cffffd100就位确认|r——开怪前你的小队或团队优先"
L["|cffffd100party|r -- no line goes out when you buff: %s is on"] = "|cffffd100小队|r——加增益时不说台词：%s已开启"
L["Say nothing in a party"] = "在小队中不说话"
L["|cffffd100raid|r -- no line goes out when you buff: %s is on"] = "|cffffd100团队|r——加增益时不说台词：%s已开启"
L["Say nothing in a raid"] = "在团队中不说话"
L["|cffffd100first name only|r -- a line says only the first word of a name"] = "|cffffd100只叫名字|r -- 台词只说名字的第一个词"
L["|cffffd100lines left out|r -- In character never says %d of its lines"] = "|cffffd100已排除的台词|r -- 入戏永远不会说其中 %d 句台词"
L["|cffffd100raid groups|r -- in a raid, only groups %s are offered unasked"] = "|cffffd100团队小队|r——在团队中，只主动推荐以下小队：%s"
L["|cffffd100raid groups|r -- every group is unticked, so in a raid nobody is offered unasked"] = "|cffffd100团队小队|r——所有小队都未勾选，所以在团队中不会主动推荐任何人"
L["|cffff8080/manners try is armed:|r %s -- clear it with a bare /manners try"] = "|cffff8080/manners try已就绪：|r%s——不带参数输入/manners try可清除"
L["there is no |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- did you mean |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners help|r lists them all."] = "没有|cffffd100/manners %s|r这个命令——你是想输入|cffffd100/manners %s|r吗？输入|cffffd100/manners help|r可列出全部命令。"
L["there is no |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- did you mean |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners dev|r lists the testing tools."] = "没有|cffffd100/manners %s|r这个命令——你是想输入|cffffd100/manners %s|r吗？输入|cffffd100/manners dev|r可列出测试工具。"
L["Your own buffs wait while you rest in a city or an inn, and come up when you leave. To be reminded in town too, tick %s on %s."] = "在城市或旅店休息时，你自己的增益提醒会等待，离开后才出现。想在城里也收到提醒，请勾选%s（位于%s）。"
L["Somebody just buffed you, but with friendly nameplates off the game would not say who. The prompt offers to thank them with your emote, but Manners cannot buff them back: %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on."] = "刚才有人给你加了增益，但友方姓名板已关闭，游戏不会告诉你是谁。提示框会提出用你的表情道谢，但Manners无法回报对方：点击%s（在“%s”，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可开启。"
L["Somebody just buffed you, but with friendly nameplates off the game would not say who. Manners thanks them with your emote where it may, but cannot buff them back: %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on."] = "刚才有人给你加了增益，但友方姓名板已关闭，游戏不会告诉你是谁。Manners会在允许的地方用你的表情道谢，但无法回报对方：点击%s（在“%s”，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可开启。"
L["Somebody just buffed you, but with friendly nameplates off the game would not say who, so Manners cannot buff them back or thank them. %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on, or %s on %s thanks them with your emote all the same."] = "刚才有人给你加了增益，但友方姓名板已关闭，游戏不会告诉你是谁，所以Manners既无法回报也无法道谢。点击%s（在“%s”，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可开启，或者开启%s（在“%s”）照样用你的表情道谢。"
L["Thank them even when I can't see who it was"] = "看不到是谁也道谢"
L["Somebody just buffed you, but with friendly nameplates off the game would not say who, so Manners cannot buff them back. %s on %s (|cffffd100/manners|r) turns them on."] = "刚才有人给你加了增益，但友方姓名板已关闭，游戏不会告诉你是谁，所以Manners无法回报对方。点击%s（在“%s”，|cffffd100/manners|r）即可开启。"
L["Somebody just put a buff on you, but the game did not say who, and more than one player in sight cast it at that moment, so Manners did not guess whom to buff back. %s on %s keeps it under What happened lately."] = "刚刚有人给你加了一个增益，但游戏没有说明是谁，而且当时视野内有不止一名玩家施放了它，所以 Manners 没有乱猜该回赠谁。%s（位于%s）会把它记录在 What happened lately 下。"
L["Somebody just put a buff on you, but the game did not say who. Manners saw a cast at that moment, but could not be sure whose buff it was, so there is nobody to buff back this time. %s on %s keeps it under What happened lately."] = "刚刚有人给你加了一个增益，但游戏没有说明是谁。Manners 当时看到了一次施放，但无法确定那是谁的增益，所以这次没有可回赠的人。%s（位于%s）会把它记录在 What happened lately 下。"
L["Somebody just put a buff on you, but the game did not say who, and Manners saw no player in sight cast it on you, so there is nobody to buff back this time. It sees the casts of people on a nameplate, your target, your focus, your mouseover and your group. %s on %s keeps it under What happened lately."] = "刚刚有人给你加了一个增益，但游戏没有说明是谁，Manners 也没有看到视野内有玩家对你施放，所以这次没有人可回赠。它能看到姓名板上的玩家、你的目标、你的焦点、鼠标指向的玩家和你的队伍所施放的法术。%s（位于%s）会把它记录在 What happened lately 下。"
L["Thank ye kindly, {name}! First round's on me when we're back at the forge."] = "多谢啦，{name}！回到熔炉边，头一轮酒我请！"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Ye've a friend in the mountain now."] = "承情啦，{name}。山里从此多了你这个朋友！"
L["Thank ye, {name}! I'd have been fine without it, mind. But thank ye."] = "谢啦，{name}！没它我也扛得住，真的。不过还是谢啦！"
L["Bless ye, {name}! I'd hug ye, but ye'd be needin' a healer after."] = "好人哪，{name}！真想抱你一下，可抱完你得找治疗。"
L["Paid back already, {name}. Quicker than I've ever settled a bar tab."] = "这就还上了，{name}。我结酒账都没这么快过。"
L["I'll tell this at the Thunderbrew like ye saved me life, {name}. Thank ye!"] = "到了雷酒酿酒厂，我就说你救了我一命，{name}！谢啦！"
L["Grand, {name}! I'd carve ye a statue, but this is quicker."] = "痛快，{name}！本想给你刻座石像，还是这个来得快。"
L["The Titans made us of stone, {name}, but that still touched me. Thank ye."] = "泰坦用石头造了我们，{name}，可我这颗石头心还是被你捂热了。谢啦！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Back at ye, before me pride notices I needed it."] = "谢啦，{name}。赶紧还你，别让我的面子发现我用得着它。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Muradin said a debt left unpaid rusts. Here, before it does."] = "谢啦，{name}。穆拉丁说过，欠账不还会生锈。给，趁它还没锈。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Even me ram looked impressed, and he hates everybody."] = "谢啦，{name}。连我的山羊都服气了，它可是谁都看不顺眼。"
L["The Explorers' League'll ask where ye dug up such manners, {name}. Thanks!"] = "探险者协会准得问，{name}：这么稀罕的礼数，打哪儿出土的？谢啦！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Warmed me right down to me boots, that did."] = "谢啦，{name}。从头暖到我的靴子底了！"
L["Mined half o' Khaz Modan, {name}. Never struck a vein that rich. Yer cut."] = "我挖遍半个卡兹莫丹，{name}，没碰上过这么富的矿脉。这份归你！"
L["Like a Kharanos hearth in a Dun Morogh blizzard, that, {name}. Thank ye."] = "雪中送炭啊，{name}，赛过丹莫罗暴风雪里卡拉诺斯的炉火。谢啦！"
L["Came back to ye like a Wildhammer's stormhammer, {name}. Less painful, mind."] = "像蛮锤的风暴之锤，嗖地飞回你手里，{name}。放心，不砸脸。"
L["Come to Ironforge, {name}. Me mam'll feed ye till ye can't stand. Thank ye!"] = "来铁炉堡吧，{name}。我娘能把你喂得站不起来。谢啦！"
L["Checked it fer gunpowder out o' habit, {name}. Clean as a whistle. Here's yers!"] = "习惯性查了查有没有火药，{name}。干干净净。这份是你的！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Ye'll be the talk o' the Great Forge tonight."] = "谢啦，{name}。今晚大锻炉那边，大伙儿都得聊你。"
L["Not even Magni could've done that kinder, {name}. Louder, aye. Thank ye."] = "麦格尼都没你这么贴心，{name}。嗓门比你大，那倒是。谢啦！"
L["Thank ye, {name}. I'd offer me beard as surety, but I'm terrible fond of it."] = "谢啦，{name}。本想拿胡子给你作抵押，可我实在舍不得。"
L["Back at ye, {name}, quick as a ram goin' downhill. Stoppin' is the hard part."] = "还你，{name}，快得像山羊下坡。难的是停下来。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. Ye'd make a fine honorary dwarf. We'll work on yer singin'."] = "谢了，{name}。你能当个好样的荣誉矮人。唱歌嘛，咱再练练。"
L["Thank ye, {name}. If ye ever need a tunnel dug, I'm yer dwarf."] = "谢啦，{name}。哪天要挖隧道，找我就对了。"
L["Keep yer powder dry and yer friends closer, me da said. Here, {name}."] = "我爹说过：火药要干，朋友要近。给，{name}。"
L["Aye, {name}, ye only had to ask. Hold still now, like a good anvil."] = "好嘞，{name}，开口就成。站着别动，跟块好铁砧似的。"
L["Say no more, {name}. Stone and steel, here it comes."] = "甭多说，{name}。石头和钢铁作证，接好咯！"
L["Ask a dwarf fer help, {name}, and ye'll get it. Loudly."] = "找矮人帮忙，{name}，准帮。就是嗓门大了点。"
L["Right, {name}. Brace yerself; I do everything like I'm swingin' a hammer."] = "行，{name}。站稳咯，我干什么都跟抡锤子似的。"
L["Aye, {name}, and a story about it ye didn't ask fer. Where to begin..."] = "好嘞，{name}，外加一个你没问的故事。话说当年……"
L["One {buff}, pulled fresh like a proper pint, {name}."] = "{buff}一杯，现打的，跟扎啤一样鲜，{name}！"
L["Done, {name}. Dwarven work: over-built, under-priced and guaranteed."] = "好了，{name}。矮人出品：料超足，价超低，终身保修！"
L["Easy, {name}. Last time I helped a gnome, it cost me both eyebrows."] = "小事，{name}。上回帮侏儒的忙，赔进去我两条眉毛。"
L["Aye, {name}. Mountain kings never refuse. I'm more a foothill, but same rule."] = "好嘞，{name}。山丘之王从不推辞。我顶多算个小土坡，规矩一样。"
L["Tempered and quenched, {name}. Mind, it's still hot."] = "淬过火了，{name}。当心，还烫手呢。"
L["Done afore ye finished, {name}. Dwarves hear 'please' through solid rock."] = "你话没说完我就弄好了，{name}。矮人隔着石头都听得见“请”字。"
L["Aye, {name}. In Dun Morogh ye help quick, or ye both freeze standin' there."] = "好嘞，{name}。在丹莫罗，帮忙得趁快，不然俩人都冻成冰棍。"
L["Aye, {name}. Ye'll feel it in yer boots first. That's how ye know it's dwarven."] = "好嘞，{name}。脚底板先热乎起来——那就对了，矮人出品。"
L["Aye, {name}. Say no, and ye'd ask a gnome, and then I'd feel responsible."] = "好嘞，{name}。我要是不答应，你就得去找侏儒，那我可良心不安。"
L["Course, {name}. A dwarf who won't help is no dwarf. Just a short, grumpy rock."] = "那当然，{name}。不肯帮忙的矮人算啥矮人？就是块又矮又倔的石头。"
L["Mountaineer's promise, {name}: done right, done once. Mostly."] = "巡山人的承诺，{name}：一次做对，一次到位。大体上吧。"
L["Fer you, {name}? Easy as findin' ale in Ironforge."] = "给你办，{name}？比在铁炉堡找麦酒还容易。"
L["Ask a Bronzebeard, {name}, and ye get it with both hands. Here."] = "找我们铜须家的人帮忙，{name}，那都是双手奉上。给。"
L["Aye, {name}. Stand on that rock while I see to ye. Good rock, that. Granite."] = "好嘞，{name}。站那块石头上，我给你弄好。好石头，花岗岩。"
L["Aye, {name}. In the mines, ye shout and somebody comes runnin'. Here I am."] = "好嘞，{name}。在矿井里，一嗓子喊出去就有人跑来。我这不就来了。"
L["Here, {name}, a wee somethin' to keep ye on yer feet. Wee, like me."] = "喏，{name}，一点小意思，保你站得稳。小，跟我一个样。"
L["Off ye go, {name}, with a wee blessin' from me. Steady as the mountain."] = "带上我一点小祝福，{name}，去吧，稳如大山！"
L["Here, {name}. Ale's for after; this is for before."] = "拿着，{name}。麦酒打完再喝，这个开打前用。"
L["Magni'd melt down his crown fer a friend, {name}. This is the cheaper option."] = "麦格尼会为朋友熔掉王冠，{name}。这个是平价版。"
L["A dwarf's got yer back, {name}. Well, yer knees. Close enough."] = "矮人给你撑腰，{name}。呃，撑到膝盖。差不多。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a trogg bothers ye, tell it a dwarf sent ye. Then run."] = "拿着，{name}。要是穴居人找你麻烦，就说是矮人派你来的。然后快跑。"
L["If it wears off, {name}, give it a good thump. That's how we fix everything."] = "要是失效了，{name}，就使劲拍两下。我们修什么都这么修。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give ye some stubbornness too, but I'm usin' all mine."] = "拿着，{name}。本想再分你点倔脾气，可我的全自己用着呢。"
L["That'll warm ye, {name}. Mind the wendigos: big, hairy and grumpy. Like me."] = "这能让你暖和点，{name}。小心雪怪：又大又毛又暴躁。跟我一样。"
L["Take this, {name}. Me grandad fought three wars with a pickaxe and this."] = "拿着，{name}。我爷爷就凭一把矿镐和这个，打了三场战争。"
L["Dwarven make, {name}. Drop it off Thandol Span and it'd still work. Don't."] = "矮人出品，{name}。从萨多尔大桥扔下去都照样好使。别扔啊。"
L["Stonewrought Dam holds back a whole loch, {name}. This'll hold ye together."] = "斯通华特大坝拦得住一整片湖，{name}。这个保你不散架。"
L["Won't keep yer boots dry in the Wetlands, {name}. Nothin' does. The rest, aye."] = "在湿地可保不住你靴子干，{name}。啥也保不住。别的都包了。"
L["Old miner's rule, {name}: never go down a hole without a lamp, a mate and this."] = "老矿工的规矩，{name}：下洞得带三样——矿灯、伙计，还有这个。"
L["Brann Bronzebeard went explorin' with less, {name}, and wrote three books."] = "布莱恩·铜须带的比这还少，{name}，照样写了三本书。"
L["Mountaineers swear by it, {name}. Ye'll climb no better, but land softer."] = "巡山人都信这个，{name}。爬得不会更好，摔得倒能轻点。"
L["Ironforge's gates have never fallen, {name}. Neither should ye. Take this."] = "铁炉堡的大门从来没倒过，{name}。你也别倒。拿着。"
L["Me cousins down Blackrock way would've set it alight first, {name}. Fer luck."] = "我那帮住黑石山那边的表亲，{name}，准得先点把火再给你。图个吉利。"
L["Off to Uldaman, {name}? Take this, and touch nothin' with runes on it."] = "去奥达曼，{name}？拿着这个，带符文的东西一概别碰。"
L["Fer the road, {name}. It's no keg o' Thunderbrew, but it travels better."] = "路上用，{name}。比不上一桶雷酒，可比它好带。"
L["A gift from under the mountain, {name}. Mind yer head on the way out."] = "山底下来的礼物，{name}。出去时当心脑袋。"
L["A rifleman needs dry powder and a good mate, {name}. I'm the mate. Here."] = "火枪手要两样：干火药和好伙计，{name}。我就是那伙计。给。"
L["If yer road passes Grim Batol, {name}, keep walkin'. And take this."] = "路过格瑞姆巴托的话，{name}，别停脚。拿上这个。"
L["From one explorer to another, {name}. The League'll want yer notes after."] = "探险家对探险家，{name}。回头探险者协会准要你的笔记。"
L["If ye ride a gryphon, {name}, hold on with yer knees and yer prayers. Here."] = "要是骑狮鹫，{name}，膝盖夹紧，嘴里念着祷告。给。"
L["A dwarf never lets a friend walk into the dark unready, {name}. Take this."] = "矮人绝不让朋友毫无准备地走进黑暗，{name}。拿着。"
L["Stone and hammer keep ye, cousin {name}!"] = "愿石与锤护佑你，老伙计{name}！"
L["Three Hammers, one round, and this one's on me, cousin {name}!"] = "三锤之会，干一轮，这份算我请的，{name}老表！"
L["Yer cousin's cousin wed mine, {name}, I'd wager. Family gets the good stuff."] = "你表哥的表哥娶了我家的，{name}，我敢打赌。自家人，给好的。"
L["Two dwarves, and one of us freshly blessed, {name}. Pity whatever's in our way."] = "两个矮人，其中一个刚受了祝福，{name}。挡路的可要倒霉了。"
L["Bronzebeard, Wildhammer, Dark Iron, Earthen, {name}: one family. Here, cousin."] = "铜须、蛮锤、黑铁、土灵，{name}：一家人。拿着，老表。"
L["Here, {name}. Between the pair of us now, we could out-stubborn a mountain."] = "拿着，{name}。这下咱俩能比大山还倔。"
L["Me grandmother'd climb out of her tomb if I did any less fer kin, {name}."] = "对自家人少出一分力，{name}，我奶奶能从坟里爬出来。"
L["The Titans carved us from the same rock, {name}, so here's a chip off mine."] = "泰坦用同一块石头雕出了咱俩，{name}，这块是我那边掰下来的。"
L["Kin's kin, {name}, far from the mountain or under it. This is how we mind ours."] = "自家人就是自家人，{name}，山外山下都一样。我们就这么照应自己人。"
L["There, {name}, that'll see ye through. Stand behind me. Aye, I know. Crouch."] = "好了，{name}，这能撑住你。站我后面。对，我知道。蹲低点。"
L["Right, {name}: ye get this, I take the front, and we argue about loot after."] = "好，{name}：这个给你，我打头阵，战利品回头再吵。"
L["Here, {name}. If I sing after this, the fight's gone well. Or very badly."] = "拿着，{name}。要是之后我唱起歌，说明仗打得好。要么就是糟透了。"
L["Dwarves never leave a mate behind, {name}, nor without a blessin'. Nor a keg."] = "矮人从不丢下伙伴，{name}，也不让伙伴没祝福就上。酒桶也不丢。"
L["There, {name}. Beards out! Them without beards, look fierce. This helps."] = "好了，{name}。胡子亮出来！没胡子的，摆个凶相。这个能帮上忙。"
L["Knocked on the nearest rock fer luck, {name}, and put the luck on ye. Solid."] = "敲了敲最近的石头讨个彩头，{name}，彩头都给你了。结实。"
L["Here, {name}, from me pack. It's mostly gunpowder in there. And a sandwich."] = "拿着，{name}，从我背包里掏的。里头大多是火药。还有块三明治。"
L["That'll hold ye, {name}. Dwarves don't retreat. Our legs aren't built fer it."] = "这能撑住你，{name}。矮人不后退。咱的腿不是干那个的。"
L["Take this, stay close, {name}. If it goes dark, follow the cursin'. That's me."] = "拿着，跟紧，{name}。要是黑了，就跟着骂声走。那就是我。"
L["Ye're sorted, {name}. Dwarves always know which way is down. Up's yer problem."] = "你这边妥了，{name}。矮人总知道哪边是下。上头归你管。"
L["Here, {name}. Anythin' o' stone, let me talk to it first. Might be a cousin."] = "拿着，{name}。凡是石头做的，让我先跟它聊聊。说不定是亲戚。"
L["There, {name}, that'll take a knock. If the ceilin' creaks, I'll tell ye."] = "好了，{name}，挨一下没问题。天花板要是吱呀响，我会告诉你。"
L["There, {name}, some mountain fer ye. I'll hold the line. Mountains don't move."] = "好了，{name}，分你一点大山的劲儿。我来守线。大山不挪窝。"
L["That'll stiffen yer ankles, {name}. Troggs go fer ankles. Mine, mostly."] = "这能让你脚踝硬气点，{name}。穴居人专咬脚踝。多半是我的。"
L["There, {name}, fer the low beams. Says the only one here who never needs it."] = "好了，{name}，防矮房梁用的。说这话的是唯一用不着的那个。"
L["A hammer, a grudge, a good breakfast, and this fer ye, {name}. We'll be fine."] = "一把锤子，一肚子怨气，一顿好早饭，再加上给你的这个，{name}。稳了。"
L["Ironforge's carvers never quit halfway, {name}. Nor does a dwarf's blessin'."] = "铁炉堡的石匠从不半途而废，{name}，矮人的祝福也一样。"
L["Keep up, {name}! There's a spring in yer step now. Short legs; we never stop."] = "跟上，{name}！现在你脚下带劲了。腿短，可咱从不停。"
L["Mornin', {name}! Too early for ale. Almost. Have this first."] = "早啊，{name}！喝麦酒还太早。就差一点。先来这个。"
L["Up with the forge fires, {name}! A dwarf's day starts with a hammer and this."] = "熔炉一点火我就起了，{name}！矮人的一天从锤子和这个开始。"
L["Early, {name}? Nonsense. The mine's been open two hours. Here."] = "早？{name}，瞎说。矿井都开工俩钟头了。给。"
L["Mornin', {name}. Me eyes are still abed, but me hands knew to give ye this."] = "早啊，{name}。眼睛还赖在床上，手倒知道把这个给你。"
L["Mornin', {name}. Porridge, a pipe and this. The other two are mine."] = "早啊，{name}。一碗粥、一斗烟，外加这个。前两样归我。"
L["The rams had me up at dawn, {name}. Headbutted the door till I came out. Here."] = "天刚亮山羊就把我叫起来了，{name}。拿脑袋撞门撞到我出来。给。"
L["Mornin', {name}. Ears still ringin' from last night's singin'. Here."] = "早啊，{name}。昨晚唱的歌，我耳朵到现在还嗡嗡响。给。"
L["Steady, {name}. Ye've a better nose than any dwarf in Ironforge."] = "稳住，{name}。你的鼻子比铁炉堡哪个矮人都灵。"
L["That's the spot, {name}. Ye've earned a scratch, and a share o' me jerky."] = "就是这儿，{name}。挠挠你，再分你点肉干。"
L["Easy now, {name}. The road's long, but we've stout hearts between us."] = "慢点，{name}。路还长，可咱俩胆子都大。"
L["Well fought, {name}! Ye've the heart of a mountain, so ye have."] = "打得好，{name}！你有一颗大山般的心。"
L["Ha! Grand work, {name}. I'll tell it at the Thunderbrew with ye in it."] = "哈！干得漂亮，{name}。我要在酒馆里讲你的故事。"
L["That's me partner! Fine work, {name}. Not a trogg could've stood it."] = "这才是我的搭档！干得好，{name}。穴居人可扛不住。"
L["Easy, {name}, easy. I've got ye. Rest a while."] = "别急，{name}，别急。有我在。歇一会儿。"
L["There now, {name}. Ye're tougher than granite, but rest anyway."] = "好了，{name}。你比花岗岩还结实，可还是歇歇吧。"
L["Shh, {name}. Nothin' gets past me while ye catch yer breath."] = "嘘，{name}。你喘口气，什么都过不了我这关。"
L["My thanks, {name}. Let me return the kindness before a bard gets it wrong."] = "多谢，{name}。趁吟游诗人还没把这事唱走样，我先还你。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. Let no one say we forget a friend."] = "有心了，{name}。可别让人说我们忘了朋友。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd knight you, but apparently I 'need permission'."] = "谢谢你，{name}。真想封你为骑士，可人家说我“得先批准”。"
L["Repaid on the spot, {name}. In Stormwind that'd take three forms and a stamp."] = "当场还清，{name}。在暴风城，这得填三张表再盖个章。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Prompter than Stormwind ever paid its stonemasons."] = "谢了，{name}。比暴风城给石匠结工钱快多了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Mother said always return a kindness. And the dish."] = "多谢，{name}。我娘说过，受人恩惠要还，借的盘子也要还。"
L["Thank you, {name}. In Elwynn, no kindness goes home unanswered."] = "谢谢你，{name}。在艾尔文森林，没有哪份好意会空手而归。"
L["You shame me, {name}; I should have thought of it first. Allow me."] = "惭愧，{name}，本该我先想到的。请容我回敬。"
L["Heartier than Westfall Stew, {name}, and I've wept over that stew. Thank you."] = "比西部荒野炖肉还暖心，{name}，那锅炖肉我可是哭过的。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll tell Marshal Dughan. He won't care, but I'll tell him."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我会告诉杜汉元帅的。他不会在意，但我会说。"
L["Job's done, {name}! My grandad built half of Stormwind saying that. Thanks."] = "工作完成，{name}！我爷爷喊着这句，盖了半座暴风城。谢了！"
L["Lakeshire will finish its bridge before I forget this, {name}. So, never."] = "要我忘了这事，{name}，除非湖畔镇的桥修好了。所以，永远不会。"
L["Kul Tirans say a kindness goes back on the next tide, {name}. There it goes."] = "库尔提拉斯人说，好意要随下一波潮水送回去，{name}。潮来了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Northshire's brothers would call that the Light at work."] = "谢谢你，{name}。北郡的修士们会说，这是圣光的作为。"
L["Not since Mum packed my lunches, {name}, have I felt so looked after. Thanks."] = "自从我娘给我装午饭，{name}，就没人这么照顾过我。谢谢。"
L["Into my memoirs, {name}. Chapter nine: 'Everyone Was Lovely'. Thank you."] = "写进我的回忆录，{name}。第九章：“人人都很可爱”。谢谢你。"
L["I'll toast you at the Pig and Whistle, {name}. Then the pig. Then the whistle."] = "我要在猪和哨子旅馆为你干杯，{name}。再敬猪。再敬哨子。"
L["Thanks, {name}. My next horse gets your name. He'll be a very good horse."] = "谢了，{name}。我下一匹马就用你的名字。它会是匹好马。"
L["I owe you a pint at the Lion's Pride, {name}. This will tide you over."] = "欠你一杯，{name}，狮王之傲旅店见。先拿这个垫着。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. In Elwynn that's neighbourly. Out here, it's heroic."] = "多谢，{name}。在艾尔文森林，这叫邻里情。在这儿，这叫英雄。"
L["Thanks, {name}. We humans don't live long enough to leave a kindness waiting."] = "谢了，{name}。我们人类活不了那么久，好意可不能拖。"
L["Thanks, {name}. If the Stockade held folk for kindness, you'd be in for life."] = "谢了，{name}。暴风城监狱要是抓好心人，你得蹲一辈子。"
L["By the Light, {name}, that was good of you. Uther would have liked you."] = "圣光在上，{name}，你真是好心。乌瑟尔会喜欢你的。"
L["Darkshire could use folk like you, {name}. Your kindness, returned."] = "夜色镇正缺你这样的人，{name}。你的好意，我回敬了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still and look heroic; it helps the bards."] = "当然，{name}。站好，摆出英雄样，方便诗人作歌。"
L["Right away, {name}. Keep your shield high."] = "马上就好，{name}。盾牌举高些！"
L["More work? Gladly, {name}. It beats the lumber mill."] = "又有活儿？乐意之至，{name}。总比去伐木场强。"
L["Of course, {name}. Humans excel at helping and overpromising. This is helping."] = "当然，{name}。人类最擅长两件事：帮忙和夸海口。这回是帮忙。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Westfall farm manners: you help first and ask why later."] = "当然，{name}。西部荒野的庄稼人规矩：先帮忙，再问为什么。"
L["Hold still, {name}, like a statue in the Valley of Heroes. You'd fit right in."] = "别动，{name}，就像英雄谷里的雕像。你站那儿毫不违和。"
L["Right away, {name}. The Light helps those who ask. So do I, and I'm quicker."] = "马上，{name}。圣光帮助求助之人。我也是，而且我更快。"
L["Sailors' rule, {name}: somebody calls for help, you row. Here."] = "水手的规矩，{name}：有人喊救命，就划过去。给。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand up straight; my old sergeant is watching, somewhere."] = "当然，{name}。站直了，我那老军士长还在哪儿盯着呢。"
L["Of course, {name}. A polite request is rarer than a quiet night in Duskwood."] = "当然，{name}。客气的请求比暮色森林的安静夜晚还稀罕。"
L["Right away, {name}. I'll play the Archbishop; you pretend to be impressed."] = "马上，{name}。我来扮大主教，你负责假装很感动。"
L["Stormwind rose from rubble, {name}. I can manage one {buff}."] = "暴风城都能从废墟里重建，{name}。一个{buff}还能难倒我？"
L["Of course, {name}. Last one I did was a Westfall scarecrow. Long story."] = "当然，{name}。上一个是西部荒野的稻草人。说来话长。"
L["Aye, {name}. Kul Tiran terms: a handshake, and I spare you the shanty."] = "行，{name}。库尔提拉斯的规矩：握个手，我就不唱水手号子了。"
L["Right away, {name}. Bolvar says the realm runs on small kindnesses."] = "马上，{name}。伯瓦尔说，王国靠点滴善意运转。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Elwynn folk never turn away a neighbour, armour and all."] = "乐意，{name}。艾尔文的乡亲从不把邻居拒之门外，穿着盔甲也一样。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Light provides. Today it's using me as the courier."] = "当然，{name}。圣光自有供应。今天派我当信使。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stormwind raised me on the Light, porridge and saying yes."] = "当然，{name}。暴风城是用圣光、燕麦粥和“好”字把我养大的。"
L["Right away, {name}. At Northshire we answered before the second bell."] = "马上，{name}。在北郡，第二声钟响前就得应答。"
L["The road ahead is long, {name}. This won't shorten it, but it'll help."] = "前路漫长，{name}。这个缩不短路，但能帮上忙。"
L["Fair winds and following seas, {name}, and this to carry you along."] = "一路顺风顺水，{name}，带上这个送你一程。"
L["Take this, {name}. Elves have centuries to be generous; I've got fifty years."] = "拿着，{name}。精灵能慷慨几百年，我只有五十年，得抓紧。"
L["A little something, {name}. Don't tell the guards; they'll all want one."] = "一点小意思，{name}。别告诉卫兵，不然人人都要。"
L["Here, {name}. If a kobold asks, you don't have a candle."] = "给，{name}。狗头人要是问起，你就说没带蜡烛。"
L["For you, {name}. A human gift: well meant, hastily made, surprisingly sturdy."] = "给你，{name}。人类的礼物：心意满满，做工匆忙，意外结实。"
L["Mind the murlocs, {name}. Take this; I've seen what they do to a picnic."] = "小心鱼人，{name}。拿着这个，我见过它们怎么祸害野餐。"
L["Every road needs a hero, {name}. Today it's me, apparently. Take this."] = "每条路都需要一位英雄，{name}。今天好像轮到我了。拿着。"
L["Stay out of Duskwood after dark, {name}. It's always dark. Take this."] = "天黑后别进暮色森林，{name}。那儿一直是黑的。拿着。"
L["Redridge gnolls take anything not nailed down, {name}. This is nailed down."] = "赤脊山的豺狼人见啥拿啥，{name}，除非钉死了。这个钉死了。"
L["If you meet Hogger, {name}, take this and a friend. Mostly the friend."] = "要是碰上霍格，{name}，带上这个，再带个朋友。主要是朋友。"
L["The Light and a good pair of boots, {name}. Now you've got one of them."] = "圣光加一双好靴子，{name}。现在你有其中一样了。"
L["Every hero in Stormwind began with a kindness and a borrowed sword, {name}."] = "暴风城的英雄，{name}，都起步于一份好意和一把借来的剑。"
L["Here, {name}. The Defias can't steal this one. They've tried everything else."] = "给，{name}。迪菲亚偷不走这个。别的他们都偷遍了。"
L["Uther blessed strangers on the road, {name}. I've less hammer, same idea."] = "乌瑟尔会为路上的陌生人祝福，{name}。我锤子小点，心意一样。"
L["Take this, {name}. Goldshire custom: no traveller leaves empty-handed."] = "拿着，{name}。闪金镇的规矩：旅人不能空手离开。"
L["The wolves in Elwynn look friendly, {name}. They are not. Take this."] = "艾尔文森林的狼看着挺友善，{name}。其实不是。拿着。"
L["Lothar held the line with less, {name}. Granted, he had a very big sword."] = "洛萨拿得比这少也守住了防线，{name}。当然，他有把很大的剑。"
L["Westfall farmers share even in a bad year, {name}. So here's my share."] = "西部荒野的农夫荒年也肯分享，{name}。这份是我的。"
L["Redridge, Duskwood, Westfall, {name}: worse roads every mile. Take this."] = "赤脊山、暮色森林、西部荒野，{name}：出了艾尔文路路更难走。拿着这个。"
L["Take this, {name}. The guards can't be everywhere. Out here, they're nowhere."] = "拿着，{name}。卫兵不可能无处不在。在这儿，他们压根不在。"
L["Bound for Hillsbrad, {name}? Southshore's still ours. Barely. Take this."] = "要去希尔斯布莱德，{name}？南海镇还在我们手里。勉强吧。拿着。"
L["Stromgarde still stands, {name}, mostly out of stubbornness. So will you. Here."] = "激流堡还立着，{name}，主要靠一股倔劲。你也会的。给。"
L["A Stormwind welcome, {name}: a smile, a blessing and the way to the inn."] = "暴风城式的欢迎，{name}：一个微笑，一份祝福，再指条去旅店的路。"
L["The Argent Dawn says the Light is for all who'll carry it, {name}. Carry some."] = "银色黎明说，圣光属于每个愿意背负它的人，{name}。你也背点。"
L["Arathor's children stand together, {name}, and share what strength they have."] = "阿拉索的子民同进退，{name}，有力量就一起分享。"
L["A fellow human, {name}! Take this. Then let's found a kingdom before lunch."] = "同为人类，{name}！拿着。然后咱们午饭前建个王国。"
L["Stormwind or Boralus, {name}, we'll both moan about the weather. This helps."] = "暴风城也好伯拉勒斯也罢，{name}，咱俩都得抱怨天气。这个能顶点用。"
L["Human to human, {name}: everything happens to us, so here's a little help."] = "人类对人类，{name}：倒霉事总找上咱们，所以给你帮点小忙。"
L["Short lives, long to-do lists, {name}. We humans must help each other along."] = "命短，待办清单长，{name}。咱们人类得互相搭把手。"
L["Stormwind stone or Kul Tiran oak, {name}, this will help you outlast them all."] = "暴风城的石头也好，库尔提拉斯的橡木也好，{name}，有了这个你比谁都撑得久。"
L["Humans stick together, {name}, so take this. The rest are taller or furrier."] = "人类得抱团，{name}，所以拿着。别的种族不是更高就是毛更多。"
L["We built half the world on bread, stubbornness and favours like this, {name}."] = "咱们人类靠面包、倔劲和这样的好意建起了半个世界，{name}。"
L["Don't tell the dwarves, {name}: humans invented the tavern. And this round."] = "别告诉矮人，{name}，酒馆是咱们人类发明的。这一轮也算我的。"
L["There, {name}. Humans have always won by outnumbering things, and by sharing."] = "好了，{name}。人类向来靠人多取胜，也靠互相帮衬。"
L["You're ready, {name}. Stay in formation. We haven't got one, but stay in it."] = "你准备好了，{name}。保持队形。咱们没队形，但也得保持。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll draw up a plan too, and we can all ignore it together."] = "拿着，{name}。我再定个计划，然后大家一起无视它。"
L["Every hero in the songs had friends who did this, {name}. I'll be yours."] = "歌谣里的英雄都有朋友这样照应，{name}。我来当你的那个朋友。"
L["There, {name}. Stormwind taught me to march and to mind who marches with me."] = "好了，{name}。暴风城教会我行军，也教会我照顾并肩行军的人。"
L["That should keep us safe, {name}. If not, we regroup at the nearest inn."] = "这下应该不会出岔子，{name}。真出了，就到最近的旅店集合。"
L["I made us a flag, {name}, and you a blessing. The flag's a hankie on a stick."] = "我给咱们做了面旗，{name}，给你加了个祝福。旗嘛，就是根棍上挂块手帕。"
L["A light of your own, {name}. Humans can't see in the dark, and we hate it."] = "拿着，{name}，给你一点自己的光。人类在黑暗里看不见，我们最讨厌那样。"
L["That's for your back, {name}; I'll watch it too. The Light has the rest."] = "这是护你后背的，{name}；我也替你盯着。剩下的交给圣光。"
L["There, {name}. Humans rise to the occasion, and this should stop the tripping."] = "好了，{name}。人类总能临危而起，有了这个，起来时就不会再绊倒了。"
L["Your share, {name}. Do this well; some elf will tell the story for an age."] = "这份是你的，{name}。好好干；总有个精灵会把这事讲上一千年。"
L["Farmers, sailors, bakers, {name}: every army Stormwind raised got one of these."] = "农夫、水手、面包师，{name}：暴风城召集的每支军队都领过这么一份。"
L["Form up, {name}, and take this. One steady line beats a crowd of brave fools."] = "列队，{name}，拿上这个。一道稳固的阵线胜过一群莽夫。"
L["We'll make Stormwind proud, {name}. This should keep the town criers kind."] = "咱们要让暴风城骄傲，{name}。有了这个，传令官嘴下也会留情。"
L["The Light keeps us, {name}. Here's some for you. I've packed bandages too."] = "圣光护佑我们，{name}，这一份是给你的。我也带了绷带。"
L["Take this, {name}. Everyone goes home; I promised somebody's mother. Yours."] = "谁都得平安回家，{name}，所以拿着。我答应过某人的母亲。多半是你妈。"
L["We look like a proper Stormwind patrol now, {name}. Shinier, even."] = "现在像支正规的暴风城巡逻队了，{name}。还更亮闪闪。"
L["Stay sharp, {name}, this'll help. Lordaeron learned: never trust the bread."] = "打起精神，{name}，这个能帮上忙。洛丹伦吃过大亏才明白：千万别信面包。"
L["Easy there, {name}. Stormwind's finest couldn't ask for better company."] = "放轻松，{name}。暴风城的精英也找不到更好的伙伴。"
L["Good to have you at my side, {name}. Truly."] = "有你在身边真好，{name}。真的。"
L["Who's the best hunting partner in the Eastern Kingdoms? You are, {name}."] = "东部王国最好的狩猎伙伴是谁？是你，{name}。"
L["Well done, {name}! The Light itself couldn't have timed that better."] = "干得好，{name}！圣光都没法把时机抓得更准。"
L["That's how it's done, {name}. I'd put you up against any knight."] = "就该这样，{name}。哪个骑士我都敢让你上。"
L["Brilliant, {name}. You turned that fight before I'd drawn twice."] = "漂亮，{name}。我还没拉两次弓，你就扭转了战局。"
L["Easy, {name}. I'm here. Lie still and let me look at you."] = "别动，{name}。我在这儿。躺好，让我看看你。"
L["You're all right, {name}. I've got you. Breathe."] = "没事了，{name}。有我在。呼吸。"
L["Steady, {name}. Rest now; I'll keep watch for both of us."] = "稳住，{name}。歇着吧，我替咱俩守着。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Returned the same day, which for a kaldorei is rushing."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。当天就还，对卡多雷来说已经很赶了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Elune smiles on the generous."] = "谢谢你，{name}。艾露恩眷顾慷慨之人。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Even the wisps glow brighter, and they're hard to impress."] = "谢谢你，{name}。连小精灵都亮了几分，它们可不好打动。"
L["Elune saw that, {name}. She sees everything, so I had best return it."] = "艾露恩看见了，{name}。她什么都看得见，我还是赶紧还上吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness planted, kindness grown. Here."] = "谢谢你，{name}。种下善意，长出善意。给。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Ancients will hear of this. They're dreadful gossips."] = "谢谢你，{name}。古树们会听说这事的，它们最爱嚼舌根。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll tell the Sentinels to stop aiming at you."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我会让哨兵们别再瞄着你了。"
L["My people never hurry, {name}. For you, an exception."] = "我族从不着急，{name}。为你破例一次。"
L["Ande'thoras-ethil, {name}. May your troubles be diminished, as mine just were."] = "Ande'thoras-ethil，{name}。愿你烦恼消减，一如我的刚才。"
L["We gave up immortality at Hyjal, {name}. Kindness has been worth double since."] = "我们在海加尔山舍弃了永生，{name}。从那以后，善意就值双倍了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My ears went a shade darker. Kaldorei blush there first."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我的耳朵颜色深了一层。卡多雷先红的就是耳朵。"
L["Azshara's court never gave a thing away, {name}. You've outdone a queen."] = "艾萨拉的宫廷从不白送东西，{name}。你比女王还大方。"
L["The owls turned their heads for that, {name}. All the way round. High praise."] = "猫头鹰都为此扭过头来，{name}。转了一整圈。这可是高度评价。"
L["I outlived the Sundering, {name}. I'll not outlive a debt to you. Here."] = "我熬过了大分裂，{name}。可不能让欠你的人情活得比我长。给。"
L["All those centuries of memories, {name}, and this one goes near the front."] = "几百年的回忆里，{name}，这一段排得很靠前。"
L["I'll tell the moon about you tonight, {name}. She likes a good story."] = "今晚我会跟月亮讲讲你，{name}。她爱听好故事。"
L["In Darnassus they'd sing of that, {name}. Quietly, for about a century."] = "在达纳苏斯，人们会为此歌唱，{name}。轻声地，唱上一百年左右。"
L["Thank you, {name}. A Sentinel settles a debt of honour by moonset. So do I."] = "谢谢你，{name}。哨兵的荣誉之债，月落前必还。我也一样。"
L["Shan'do Stormrage would approve, {name}. He'll tell you himself, when he wakes."] = "玛法里奥导师会赞许的，{name}。等他醒来，会亲口告诉你。"
L["The Cenarion Circle preaches balance, {name}. You've just tipped it my way."] = "塞纳里奥议会讲究平衡，{name}。你刚把天平往我这边拨了拨。"
L["Better than a moonwell, {name}. Don't tell the priestesses I said so."] = "比月亮井还好，{name}。别告诉女祭司们是我说的。"
L["Even Fandral would smile at that, {name}, and his face has forgotten how."] = "连范达尔都会笑的，{name}，虽然他的脸早忘了怎么笑。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd send a hippogryph with my thanks, but they bite."] = "谢谢你，{name}。本想派只角鹰兽送去谢意，可它们咬人。"
L["That warms me like moonlight, {name}. Not very warm, I admit. Still, thank you."] = "像月光一样暖着我，{name}。好吧，月光不算很暖。还是谢谢你。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Be still, and let the moonlight find you."] = "乐意之至，{name}。静下心来，让月光照拂你。"
L["Of course, {name}. Elune's blessings are meant to be shared."] = "当然，{name}。艾露恩的祝福本就该与人分享。"
L["At last, {name}! I've waited ten thousand years for someone to ask."] = "终于，{name}！等人开口，我等了一万年。"
L["No riddle, no omen from Elune, {name}. Just a plain yes, for once."] = "不打哑谜，不等艾露恩显兆，{name}。就一个字：好。"
L["Of course, {name}. Ask in Darnassian next time and I'll add a bow."] = "当然，{name}。下次用达纳苏斯语问，我再附赠一个鞠躬。"
L["Elune already said yes, {name}. I'm merely catching up."] = "艾露恩早就答应了，{name}。我只是跟上而已。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand still and pretend you're a tree. It helps."] = "当然，{name}。站着别动，假装自己是棵树。管用的。"
L["Step into the light, {name}. The last kaldorei I did this for Shadowmelded."] = "站到亮处来，{name}。上一个卡多雷，我还没施完他就影遁了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Ask a kaldorei anything, except how old we are."] = "当然，{name}。问卡多雷什么都行，就别问年龄。"
L["In Darnassus, {name}, this takes a moonwell and a priestess. Out here, just me."] = "在达纳苏斯，{name}，这得有月亮井和女祭司。在外头，就我一个。"
L["The last army to ask me for help was fighting demons, {name}. You're politer."] = "上一支向我求助的军队在打恶魔，{name}。你比他们有礼貌。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Consider it on loan from Elune. She's never once collected."] = "乐意之至，{name}。就当是向艾露恩借的。她从没来收过账。"
L["Of course, {name}. One moment; my hair is older than kingdoms, and it tangles."] = "当然，{name}。稍等，我的头发比好些王国还老，老打结。"
L["Darnassian has nine words for 'yes', {name}. I'll spare you eight of them."] = "达纳苏斯语的“好”有九种说法，{name}。饶你八种。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Sentinels would want a password. I'll accept 'please'."] = "当然，{name}。哨兵会要口令。我嘛，一个“请”字就够了。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'll be swift. Swift for a kaldorei, that is. Do sit down."] = "当然，{name}。我会很快。以卡多雷的标准。请坐吧。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The Sentinels taught me to answer a call before it echoes."] = "乐意，{name}。哨兵教过我：呼声未起回音，就要应答。"
L["Be still, {name}. What's done in haste is undone by nightfall, the druids say."] = "别动，{name}。德鲁伊说，仓促而成的事，入夜就会散。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Elune asks little of us: kindness, patience and good aim."] = "乐意，{name}。艾露恩对我们所求不多：善良、耐心，外加准头。"
L["Of course, {name}. The forest gave me plenty. It would sulk if I didn't share."] = "当然，{name}。森林给了我很多。我不分享，它会闹别扭的。"
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Her light goes with you. Walk softly; trees sleep lightly."] = "艾露恩-阿多尔，{name}。她的光与你同行。脚步轻些，树木睡得浅。"
L["May the forest shelter you, {name}, wherever you roam."] = "愿森林庇护你，{name}，无论你去往何方。"
L["A gift from the shadows, {name}. No, don't look. You won't find me."] = "来自暗影的礼物，{name}。别找了，你找不到我的。"
L["Elune lights your path, {name}. I'm merely holding the lantern."] = "艾露恩照亮你的路，{name}。我只是提灯的。"
L["The owls pointed you out, {name}. They have strong opinions. Here."] = "猫头鹰指认了你，{name}。它们很有主见。给。"
L["Tyrande would insist, {name}, and nobody argues with Tyrande."] = "泰兰德会坚持的，{name}，没人敢跟泰兰德争。"
L["Take this, {name}. The last one went to a hippogryph. It was less grateful."] = "拿着，{name}。上一份给了角鹰兽，它可没你这么领情。"
L["Take this, {name}. Half the wildlife's a druid, and all of it is watching."] = "拿着，{name}。这儿的野兽一半是德鲁伊，全都在看着。"
L["Walk with Elune, {name}. If she's busy, walk with this."] = "愿艾露恩与你同行，{name}。她要是忙，就带上这个。"
L["A ward against satyrs, {name}. Once Highborne; you can tell by the sneer."] = "防萨特的护佑，{name}。它们曾是上层精灵。看那冷笑就知道。"
L["The trees spoke well of you, {name}. I thought I'd add my blessing."] = "树木们对你赞不绝口，{name}。我想在它们的话上再添一份祝福。"
L["Most furbolgs are friendly, {name}. This is for the other ones."] = "熊怪大多挺友善，{name}。这个是防另外那些的。"
L["Moonwell water would be better, {name}, but it travels badly. This doesn't."] = "月亮井的水更好，{name}，可惜不好带。这个好带。"
L["A gift from Teldrassil, {name}. It's a long way down; I nearly dropped it."] = "来自泰达希尔的礼物，{name}。下来的路太长，我差点把它摔了。"
L["I'd stay to chat, {name}, but kaldorei chats run to the next full moon. Here."] = "本想和你聊聊，{name}，可卡多雷一聊就聊到下个满月。给。"
L["Bandu thoribas, {name}: prepare to fight. There. Now you're prepared."] = "Bandu thoribas，{name}：准备战斗。好了，现在你准备好了。"
L["From the kaldorei, the moon and a very old tree, {name}. Mostly from me."] = "卡多雷、月亮和一棵很老的树送你的，{name}。主要是我送的。"
L["Ashenvale remembers every axe, {name}. Carry this, and leave yours sheathed."] = "灰谷记得每一把斧头，{name}。带上这个，你的斧头就收着吧。"
L["With this, {name}, the Sentinels will know you're a friend. Probably. Wave."] = "带着这个，{name}，哨兵就知道你是朋友了。大概吧。多挥挥手。"
L["May the moon guide you, {name}, and this keep you until it rises."] = "愿月光指引你，{name}。月亮升起前，就让这个护着你。"
L["Moonglade welcomes all who come in peace, {name}. So does this."] = "月光林地欢迎所有和平来客，{name}。这个也是。"
L["Darkshore is beautiful, {name}, and full of things that bite. Take this."] = "黑海岸很美，{name}，也到处是会咬人的东西。拿着。"
L["My people learned the hard way not to hoard magic, {name}. So, here."] = "我的族人吃过大亏，才学会不囤积魔法，{name}。所以，给你。"
L["Felwood was a forest once, {name}. Take this; stay well where it didn't."] = "费伍德森林曾经也是寻常森林，{name}。拿着这个，它没能保全，愿你平安。"
L["Bound for Stonetalon, {name}? Take this. Mind the goblins' saws; the trees do."] = "要去石爪山脉吗，{name}？拿着这个。当心地精的锯子，树木都提防着。"
L["Take this, {name}. If you meet an Ancient, bow. They notice, and never forget."] = "拿着，{name}。遇到古树要鞠躬。它们会注意到，而且永远记得。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Elune keeps her children close, and so do I."] = "伊什努-阿拉，{name}。艾露恩护佑她的孩子，我也一样。"
L["Of course I saw you, {name}. It takes a kaldorei to spot one in need of this."] = "我当然看见你了，{name}。只有卡多雷才看得出同族需要这个。"
L["Kaldorei to kaldorei, {name}: we gave up eternity, not each other. Take this."] = "卡多雷对卡多雷，{name}：我们放弃了永生，没放弃彼此。拿着。"
L["A kaldorei never leaves kin in the dark, {name}. Unless it's for cover."] = "卡多雷从不把同胞丢在黑暗里，{name}。除非是为了影遁。"
L["Two kaldorei, {name}, and no helmet fits either pair of ears. This does."] = "两个卡多雷，{name}，哪顶头盔都套不上咱们的耳朵。这个倒合适。"
L["Sentinel, druid or simply stubborn, {name}? This suits all three."] = "哨兵、德鲁伊，还是单纯倔，{name}？这个三样都合适。"
L["Twenty thousand years of 'we tried that', {name}. This, though, always works."] = "两万年来都是“那个试过了”，{name}。不过这个向来管用。"
L["There, {name}. Now let's Shadowmeld together sometime and see who notices."] = "好了，{name}。哪天咱俩一起用影遁，看谁能发现。"
L["Our shan'do sleeps in the Dream, {name}. I'll mind you for him until he wakes."] = "我们的導師在梦境中沉睡，{name}。他醒来之前，我替他照看你。"
L["Our people are few, {name}, so each of us gets looked after. Here."] = "我们族人稀少，{name}，所以每一个都得照应。给你。"
L["Quick one, {name}? Take this now. By kaldorei reckoning we're already done."] = "速战速决，{name}？那先拿着这个。按卡多雷的算法，咱们已经结束了。"
L["That's from the one you can't see, {name}. Not a mistake; that's the plan."] = "这是看不见的那个人给你的，{name}。不是失误，是计划。"
L["Elune watches the whole party, {name}. I just pass her light along."] = "艾露恩看顾着整支队伍，{name}。我只是把她的光传下去。"
L["Ten thousand years of companions, {name}. You lot rank high enough for this."] = "一万年的旅伴，{name}。你们这伙人够格拿这个。"
L["Here, {name}. We misplaced half a continent once. I'm not misplacing you."] = "拿着，{name}。我们弄丢过半块大陆。可不会弄丢你。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I fall, I'll float about as a wisp, looking wise."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我倒了，就变成小精灵飘来飘去，一脸睿智。"
L["I fought beside Neltharion once, {name}. He never got this from me. You do."] = "我曾与奈萨里奥并肩作战，{name}。他从没从我这得到过这个。你得到了。"
L["Take this and follow me, {name}. I know these paths. They were a forest, mind."] = "拿着，跟我来，{name}。这些路我熟。不过上次还是片森林。"
L["Here, {name}. With this, we shan't fail. If we do, I'll remember you for ages."] = "拿着，{name}。有了这个就不会失败。真败了，我会记你几千年。"
L["Heroes charge in blind for millennia, {name}. Take this; let's try eyes open."] = "几千年来英雄们都闭眼冲锋，{name}。拿着，咱们睁着眼试试。"
L["That'll keep you till dawn, {name}. I'll take first watch. And second."] = "这能撑你到天亮，{name}。头一班岗我来站。第二班也是。"
L["Here, quietly, {name}. Keep your voices low; the forest listens, and remembers."] = "悄悄地，拿着，{name}。说话小声点，森林在听，也记着。"
L["We held the Legion with fewer, {name}, and less help than this. We'll be fine."] = "我们曾以更少的人、更少的援助挡住燃烧军团，{name}。没事的。"
L["A Sentinel never looses an arrow she'd want back, {name}, nor a blessing."] = "哨兵从不射出会后悔的箭，{name}，祝福也一样。"
L["Dark in there, {name}? Take this and follow me. The night is where we live."] = "里面黑吗，{name}？拿着，跟我走。黑夜是我们的家。"
L["Moving out, {name}, blessed and silent as owls. Or as dwarves, if we can't."] = "出发，{name}，带着祝福，像猫头鹰一样安静。做不到就像矮人那样。"
L["Take this, {name}. I watch the shadows; nothing moves in them without my say."] = "拿着，{name}。阴影我来盯，没我点头，里头什么都动不了。"
L["The moon's up, {name}; here's her blessing. For a kaldorei, it's mid-morning."] = "月亮升起来了，{name}，给你她的祝福。对卡多雷来说，现在才上午。"
L["Everyone sensible is asleep, {name}, so Elune's light is all yours tonight."] = "明理的人都睡了，{name}，今晚艾露恩的光全归你。"
L["Elune's light is on you, {name}. Here's a second layer."] = "艾露恩的光芒照着你，{name}。这个再给你加一层。"
L["Dark at last, {name}. Now I see perfectly, and you get this before I see more."] = "总算黑了，{name}。现在我看得一清二楚，先把这个给你。"
L["Same stars as ten thousand years ago, {name}. Same blessing. Both aged well."] = "还是一万年前那些星星，{name}。这祝福也没变。都老得挺好。"
L["Moonrise, {name}. Every kaldorei just woke up a little. Here's my share of it."] = "月出了，{name}。每个卡多雷都醒了几分。这份是我的，分给你。"
L["Morning, {name}. My people slept through these; this will help us both adapt."] = "早，{name}。我的族人向来睡过这时候；这个能帮咱俩适应。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Elune's gone to bed, so I'm covering for her."] = "天亮了，{name}。艾露恩睡觉去了，我替她值班。"
L["The sun's up, {name}, and so, reluctantly, am I. Have this while I wake."] = "太阳出来了，{name}，我也不情不愿地起来了。我醒醒神，你先拿着这个。"
L["Too bright, {name}. I'll squint through this one; Elune forgives squinting."] = "太亮了，{name}。我就眯着眼施法吧，艾露恩会原谅眯眼的。"
L["Daybreak, {name}: the one hour a night elf is easy to spot. Quick, take this."] = "破晓了，{name}：暗夜精灵唯一好找的时辰。快，拿着。"
L["Up early, {name}? I'm up late. Let's meet in the middle, with this."] = "起得早，{name}？我是睡得晚。我们在中间碰个头，带上这个。"
L["Elune walks with us, {name}. Breathe the forest in while it is quiet."] = "艾露恩与我们同行，{name}。趁森林安静，深呼吸吧。"
L["The wild remembers us both, {name}. Stay close a while."] = "荒野记得我们俩，{name}。在我身边待一会儿。"
L["Ten thousand years of hunters, {name}, and none had a truer friend."] = "万年来的猎人里，{name}，没人有比你更忠实的朋友。"
L["Swift and true, {name}. Cenarius himself would be proud of you."] = "迅捷又精准，{name}。塞纳留斯也会为你骄傲。"
L["Well hunted, {name}. The forest sings of that one tonight."] = "猎得好，{name}。今晚森林会为此歌唱。"
L["That was the wild at its finest, {name}. Well done."] = "这才是荒野最美的样子，{name}。干得好。"
L["Be still, {name}. Elune's light is on you; let it mend you."] = "别动，{name}。艾露恩的光照着你，让它治愈你。"
L["Hush, {name}. I am here, and the night is gentle."] = "嘘，{name}。我在这儿，夜色很温柔。"
L["Rest, {name}. The Emerald Dream can wait a while longer for you."] = "歇着吧，{name}。翡翠梦境还能再等你一会儿。"
L["The shadows remember kindness, {name}. So do I."] = "暗影记得善意，{name}。我也一样。"
L["My thanks, {name}. The ren'dorei do not forget a kindness."] = "多谢，{name}。虚空精灵不会忘记恩情。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The voices approve of you, which is frankly alarming."] = "谢谢你，{name}。那些低语很认可你，说实话这有点吓人。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Few give gifts to someone who glows this ominously."] = "谢谢你，{name}。肯给浑身冒着不祥紫光的人送礼的可不多。"
L["Kindness is rare in the Void, {name}. I'll return yours before it notices."] = "虚空里难得有善意，{name}。趁它没发现，我赶紧还你。"
L["Silvermoon threw us out, {name}. Kindness like yours deserves returning."] = "银月城把我们赶了出来，{name}。你这样的好意值得回报。"
L["Returned in full, {name}. It may be slightly purple. That's normal."] = "如数奉还，{name}。可能有点发紫。正常现象。"
L["The Void only takes, {name}. I, however, give back."] = "虚空只会索取，{name}。而我，懂得回报。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The whispers went quiet. That's how I know it was sincere."] = "谢谢你，{name}。低语都安静了。所以我知道你是真心的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd smile, but people say it's unsettling. So: imagine one."] = "谢谢你，{name}。本想笑一个，可听说我笑起来瘆人。你脑补一下吧。"
L["Returned, {name}: cold hands, warm intentions. That's us in a sentence."] = "还你了，{name}：手是凉的，心是热的。一句话概括我们。"
L["Returned, {name}. You may hear it twice; my spells echo now."] = "还你了，{name}。你可能会听到两遍，我的法术现在有回声。"
L["The Void offered me forbidden knowledge, {name}. Yours was the nicer gift."] = "虚空给过我禁忌的知识，{name}。你的礼物更贴心。"
L["Alleria says the Void can be mastered, {name}. Kindness, I find, is easier."] = "奥蕾莉亚说虚空可以驾驭，{name}。我发现，善意更容易。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Most people give us a wide berth. You gave me this."] = "多谢，{name}。别人见了我们都让出老远，你却给了我这个。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My shadow bowed as well. It never does. You've impressed it."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我的影子也鞠了个躬。它从不鞠躬。你把它折服了。"
L["As you wish, {name}. The shadows answer kindly today."] = "如你所愿，{name}。今日暗影格外温顺。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. The Void obeys us, not the other way round."] = "交给我，{name}。虚空听我们的，不是反过来。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The whispers said no, so it's an easy yes."] = "当然，{name}。低语说不行，那就一定行。"
L["Of course, {name}. One {buff}, lightly seasoned with the Void."] = "当然，{name}。一份{buff}，撒了点虚空调味。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still; the shadows are shy with strangers."] = "当然，{name}。别动，暗影怕生。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Ren'dorei manners: the Void waits its turn."] = "乐意之至，{name}。虚空精灵的礼节：虚空得排队。"
L["Asked so nicely, {name}? Then you'll have my best."] = "问得这么客气，{name}？那就给你我最好的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand in the light, please; the Void gets ideas in corners."] = "当然，{name}。请站到亮处，虚空在角落里容易动歪心思。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Void asked why. I said 'manners'. It's still puzzled."] = "当然，{name}。虚空问为什么。我说“礼貌”。它还没想明白。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Nobody asks us for anything but 'please stop whispering'."] = "乐意之至，{name}。别人找我们，只会说“求你别再嘀咕了”。"
L["Happy to, {name}. Just let me finish arguing with myself. There. I won."] = "乐意效劳，{name}。等我跟自己吵完。好了，我赢了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I could rift over there first, but that feels showy."] = "当然，{name}。我可以先开个空间裂隙过去，但那样有点显摆。"
L["Asking questions got us exiled, {name}. Answering one is quite safe, I'm told."] = "我们就是因为多问才被流放的，{name}。听说回答问题倒挺安全。"
L["Of course, {name}. A slight chill and a faint chorus are both perfectly normal."] = "当然，{name}。有点发冷、隐约听见合唱，都属正常现象。"
L["A touch of shadow for you, {name}. Quite safe. Mostly."] = "送你一丝暗影，{name}。很安全。大概吧。"
L["Walk carefully in the dark places, {name}. This will light a little of them."] = "在黑暗之地要小心行走，{name}。这个能照亮一点。"
L["A little something from the Telogrus Rift, {name}. It's cleaner than it sounds."] = "泰洛古斯裂隙的一点心意，{name}。比听起来干净。"
L["Take this, {name}. Any tentacles you see are purely decorative."] = "拿着，{name}。看到的触须纯属装饰。"
L["The shadows asked after you, {name}. Take this; they can mind their manners."] = "阴影们打听你呢，{name}。我把这个给了你，叫它们放规矩点。"
L["Here, {name}. We walked into the Void so you wouldn't have to."] = "给，{name}。我们替你走进了虚空，你就不必去了。"
L["I checked your shadow, {name}. Nothing lurking. Take this anyway."] = "我查过你的影子了，{name}。没藏东西。不过这个还是拿着。"
L["Umbric sends his regards, {name}, and this. He doesn't, but he would."] = "安布里克向你问好，{name}，还送了这个。其实没有，但他会的。"
L["Take this, {name}. It may whisper a compliment. Pretend you didn't hear."] = "拿着，{name}。它也许会低声夸你一句。假装没听见就好。"
L["Here, {name}. Looks sinister, works beautifully. Rather like me."] = "给，{name}。看着阴森，效果极好。跟我挺像。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Void had worse in mind for you. I intercepted."] = "拿着，{name}。虚空给你准备的可没这么好。我半路截下了。"
L["If the dark whispers at you today, {name}, pay it no mind. Take this."] = "今天要是黑暗对你低语，{name}，别理它。拿着这个。"
L["Here, {name}. We ren'dorei don't often get to be the nice surprise."] = "给，{name}。我们虚空精灵难得当回“惊喜”，而不是“惊吓”。"
L["I left Quel'Thalas with only a knack for the dark, {name}. Here's the knack."] = "离开奎尔萨拉斯时，我就带走一手黑暗本事，{name}。给你露一手。"
L["Here, {name}. Don't thank the shadows; they'll only want something. Thank me."] = "给，{name}。别谢暗影，它们只会找你要东西。谢我就好。"
L["I owe a kindness for every ominous look I've given, {name}. I'm badly behind."] = "我每给人一个阴森的眼神，就欠一份善意，{name}。我欠得太多了。"
L["We ren'dorei look after our own, {name}."] = "我们虚空精灵会照顾自己人，{name}。"
L["Silvermoon's loss, {name}. Here: we look after our own splendidly without it."] = "是银月城的损失，{name}。拿着：没了它，我们照样把自己人照顾得好好的。"
L["Your whispers and mine should meet sometime, {name}. Here's a start."] = "你的低语和我的低语该见个面了，{name}。这算个开头。"
L["Two ren'dorei, {name}. Take this; then look brooding. It's expected."] = "两个虚空精灵凑一块了，{name}。拿着，然后摆个忧郁脸。大家都这么期待。"
L["Nobody else understands the hair, {name}. Here, from one of the few who do."] = "没人懂这头发，{name}。拿着，这是少数懂的人给你的。"
L["Telogrus felt like home in the end, {name}. Draughty, dark. This will warm you."] = "特罗古斯最后也算个家了，{name}。漏风又黑。这个能让你暖和点。"
L["Ren'dorei to ren'dorei, {name}: mine whispered to give you this. Yours?"] = "虚空精灵对虚空精灵，{name}：我的低语叫我把这个给你。你的呢？"
L["Stay close, {name}, and take this. The whispers are much quieter in company."] = "待近点，{name}，拿着这个。有人作伴，低语就安静多了。"
L["There, {name}. If the shadows start giving orders, ignore them. I usually do."] = "好了，{name}。要是阴影开始发号施令，别理它们。我一般都不理。"
L["Here, {name}. Keep an eye on my shadow. It wanders off when there's a fight."] = "拿着，{name}。帮我盯着我的影子。一打架它就乱跑。"
L["That glow is my gift to you, {name}. If I start glowing purple too, I'm keen."] = "那道光是我送你的，{name}。要是我也开始发紫光，说明我来劲了。"
L["Ren'dorei make fine companions, {name}. We bring our own dark, and gifts."] = "虚空精灵是好旅伴，{name}。自带黑暗，也带这样的礼物。"
L["Here, {name}. If I talk to nobody, I'm fine. If nobody talks back, worry."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我好像在跟空气说话，没事。要是空气不回话，那才要担心。"
L["Yours, {name}. If it goes wrong I'll open a rift. Only for me, but I'll wave."] = "这是你的，{name}。要是出岔子，我就开个裂隙。只够我一人，不过我会挥手。"
L["Enjoy this little gift, {name}. Ren'dorei rarely get invited anywhere twice."] = "享受这份小礼物吧，{name}。虚空精灵很少被邀请第二次。"
L["Take this, {name}. Keep the lanterns lit; not for me, but the shadows behave."] = "拿着，{name}。灯笼别灭；我用不着，可阴影会老实点。"
L["Here, {name}. Watch the corners; I'll keep an eye on what's in them."] = "拿着，{name}。你盯角落，角落里的东西我来盯。"
L["The Void gave me power, {name}. It never said I'd have friends to share it."] = "虚空给了我力量，{name}。可没说我会遇到值得分享的同伴。"
L["For you, {name}. If you hear whispers mid-fight, they're cheering. For us."] = "这是给你的，{name}。打着打着听见低语，那是在喝彩。给咱们的。"
L["Take this, {name}. Anything eldritch turns up, I'll talk. I speak a little."] = "拿着，{name}。要是冒出什么不可名状的东西，让我来说话。我会一点。"
L["Night suits the ren'dorei, {name}. We match the decor. Here's a little of it."] = "夜色衬虚空精灵，{name}。我们和这布景很搭。分你一点。"
L["The shadows are longest now, {name}, and in a very generous mood."] = "此时暗影最长，{name}，心情也格外大方。"
L["Late, {name}? The whispers love a late hour, and asked me to give you this."] = "晚了吧，{name}？低语最爱深夜，它们让我把这个给你。"
L["Midnight, {name}. My shadow and I agree on one thing tonight: you get this."] = "午夜了，{name}。今晚我和我的影子达成一致：这个给你。"
L["Stars out, {name}. I've seen what's between them. This keeps that away."] = "星星出来了，{name}。我见过星星之间是什么。拿着，它能挡住那些。"
L["The Void whispers, {name}, but you're the only voice I listen to."] = "虚空在低语，{name}，可我只听你的声音。"
L["Stay near, {name}. Out here, you're the steadiest thing I have."] = "靠近点，{name}。在外头，你是我最可靠的依靠。"
L["You never flinch at the shadows, {name}. I could learn from you."] = "你从不惧怕阴影，{name}。我该向你学学。"
L["Well done, {name}. Even the Void took a step back from that."] = "干得好，{name}。连虚空都退了一步。"
L["Perfect, {name}. Alleria herself would want you at her side."] = "完美，{name}。奥蕾莉亚本人都会想让你陪在身边。"
L["That's it, {name}! Darkness on our side, and you in front."] = "就是这样，{name}！黑暗站在我们这边，而你冲在前面。"
L["Easy, {name}. I'll keep the whispers away while you rest."] = "别急，{name}。你休息时，我替你挡住低语。"
L["Breathe, {name}. The dark lets go of us both in time."] = "呼吸，{name}。黑暗终会放过我们俩。"
L["Stay with me, {name}. Rest now; the shadows are mine to watch."] = "陪着我，{name}。歇吧，阴影由我来盯。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Kindness received, catalogued and returned!"] = "谢啦，{name}！好意已接收、归档并返还！"
L["Reciprocity engaged! Much obliged, {name}."] = "互惠模式已启动！多谢啦，{name}。"
L["By my calculations, {name}, you're owed exactly one {buff}."] = "据我计算，{name}，你应得的正好是一份{buff}。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I'd build you a thank-you machine, but it'd explode."] = "谢啦，{name}！本想给你造台感谢机，不过它肯定会炸。"
L["Thank you, {name}! Gnomeregan's finest couldn't have timed that better."] = "谢谢你，{name}！诺莫瑞根最顶尖的专家也掐不了这么准。"
L["You're too kind, {name}! Returning the favour took only four schematics."] = "你太好了，{name}！还这个人情只画了四张图纸。"
L["Drat, {name}! I was going to invent gratitude, but you beat me to it."] = "可恶，{name}！我本来要发明“感恩”的，被你抢先了。"
L["Oh, {name}, how kind! My heart's doing that whirring thing again."] = "哎呀，{name}，你真好！我的心又开始嗡嗡转了。"
L["Noted in my lab journal, {name}, page four hundred: 'people are lovely'."] = "已记入实验日志，{name}，第四百页：“人们真可爱”。"
L["Splendid, {name}! Returning it at once, before I'm tempted to improve it."] = "太棒了，{name}！马上还你，免得我忍不住要改进它。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Kindness is a reversible reaction. I checked. Here's yours."] = "谢啦，{name}！善意是可逆反应，我验证过了。这是你的。"
L["My mechanostrider would salute you, {name}, but it only knows falling over."] = "我的机械陆行鸟本想向你敬礼，{name}，可它只会摔倒。"
L["My transporter would've sent this to Gadgetzan, {name}. Hand-delivered instead!"] = "用我的传送器，这个准被送到加基森去，{name}。所以亲手送来！"
L["Oh, thank you, {name}! I haven't felt this good since before the troggs."] = "哎呀，谢谢你，{name}！自打穴居人来了以后，我就没这么开心过。"
L["I'll name my next invention after you, {name}! It's a very small cannon."] = "我的下一个发明要用你命名，{name}！是一门很小很小的炮。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Ironforge has been good to us gnomes, and so have you."] = "谢啦，{name}！铁炉堡待我们侏儒不薄，你也一样。"
L["Thanks, {name}! You're on my list of favourites. It's short. Mostly clockwork."] = "谢谢你，{name}！你上了我的最爱名单。名单很短，大多是发条装置。"
L["Thanks, {name}! A gift with no gears in it. I didn't know they made those."] = "谢啦，{name}！一份没有齿轮的礼物。原来还有这种东西！"
L["Thank you, {name}! I'd pay you back with interest, but my abacus is in pieces."] = "谢谢你，{name}！本想连本带利还你，可我的算盘散架了。"
L["Paid back, {name}! In Gnomeregan, you'll get a window seat. We'll add windows."] = "还你了，{name}！等我们夺回诺莫瑞根，给你留个靠窗座。窗户再加。"
L["Exactly what I needed, {name}, and I didn't even have to build it. Thanks!"] = "正是我需要的，{name}，而且还不用我自己造。谢啦！"
L["The tall folk rarely notice us gnomes, {name}. You did. Thank you!"] = "高个子们很少注意到我们侏儒，{name}。你注意到了。谢谢你！"
L["Thanks, {name}! Tinker Town will hear all about it. Loudly, over the machinery."] = "谢啦，{name}！侏儒区会听我讲个够。在机器轰鸣声里大声讲。"
L["It worked first time, {name}! Nothing I make works first time. Marvellous!"] = "一次就成功了，{name}！我造的东西从没一次成功过。太妙了！"
L["Request received, {name}! Processing... done!"] = "请求已收到，{name}！处理中……完成！"
L["One upgrade, coming right up, {name}! Stand still for calibration."] = "升级马上就来，{name}！别动，正在校准。"
L["Of course, {name}! I built a machine for this. It's in pieces, so: by hand."] = "当然，{name}！我专门造了台机器干这个。它散架了，所以：手工。"
L["Certainly, {name}! Stand on the X. There's no X. Stand anywhere."] = "没问题，{name}！站到X上。没有X。随便站吧。"
L["Right away, {name}! Goggles on. Not for you, I just like them."] = "马上，{name}！戴好护目镜。不是给你的，我就是喜欢戴。"
L["{buff}, {name}? Simple in theory and practice. Suspicious!"] = "{buff}，{name}？理论上简单，实际上也简单。可疑！"
L["Happy to, {name}! Keep hands, feet and eyebrows well clear."] = "乐意效劳，{name}！手、脚和眉毛都离远点。"
L["Right away, {name}! Stand back three paces. Four. Five. There, perfect."] = "马上，{name}！退后三步。四步。五步。嗯，刚刚好。"
L["Happy to, {name}! It beats sorting springs by size. Though that's fun too."] = "乐意，{name}！总比给弹簧按大小排队强。虽然那也挺好玩。"
L["Excellent request, {name}! No moving parts. I'll try to add some next time."] = "好需求，{name}！零活动部件。下回我争取加几个。"
L["Standard model or deluxe, {name}? They're the same. Deluxe sounds nicer."] = "标准版还是豪华版，{name}？其实一样。豪华版听着气派。"
L["Coming up, {name}! Fresh off the workbench, still warm, only slightly smoking."] = "新鲜出炉，{name}！还热乎，只冒了一点点烟。"
L["Approved, {name}! Stamped, signed and filed under 'obviously'."] = "批准，{name}！已盖章、签字，归入“那还用说”类。"
L["Of course, {name}! A twist of the gyromatic micro-adjustor... there!"] = "当然，{name}！拧一下陀螺微调器……好了！"
L["Gnomes never refuse a problem, {name}. Occasionally we cause them. Here!"] = "侏儒从不推掉难题，{name}。偶尔还亲手制造。给！"
L["Right away, {name}! Tested on three volunteers and one very brave squirrel."] = "马上，{name}！已在三名志愿者和一只特别勇敢的松鼠身上测试过。"
L["Happy to, {name}! Measure twice, zap once. Gnome proverb. Well, my proverb."] = "乐意，{name}！量两次，电一次。侏儒谚语。好吧，我的谚语。"
L["Of course, {name}! The High Tinker says help where you can. I can, so here!"] = "当然，{name}！大工匠说，能帮就帮。我能，所以给！"
L["On it, {name}! I'll need a ladder. No? Just this, then."] = "这就来，{name}！我得找把梯子。不用？那就只给这个。"
L["Delighted, {name}! It's nice to fix something that doesn't fight back."] = "荣幸之至，{name}！能修个不还手的东西真好。"
L["Hold still, {name}, this is perfectly safe. Probably!"] = "别动，{name}，绝对安全。应该吧！"
L["Science says you need this, {name}. Who am I to argue?"] = "科学表明你需要这个，{name}。我哪敢反驳？"
L["A small upgrade for you, {name}. No cogs required."] = "给你个小升级，{name}。无需齿轮。"
L["Take it, {name}, I've a spare. I've three spares of everything."] = "拿着，{name}，我有备用的。每样东西我都备了三份。"
L["Try this, {name}! Version one had legs. Version two is much better."] = "试试这个，{name}！第一版长了腿。第二版好多了。"
L["The High Tinker says share our genius, {name}. Here's a sample!"] = "大工匠说要分享我们的天才，{name}。这是试用装！"
L["Gnomeregan Forever, {name}! This lasts rather less, but it's free."] = "诺莫瑞根永存，{name}！这个存不了那么久，但它免费。"
L["I'm small, {name}, but my gifts come full-sized. Here!"] = "我个子小，{name}，送的礼可是标准尺寸。给！"
L["Don't worry, {name}! It worked on the chicken, and the chicken's thrilled."] = "放心，{name}！在鸡身上试过了，那只鸡乐坏了。"
L["Field notes say it works on everyone, {name}. Let's make it unanimous!"] = "实地笔记显示对谁都有效，{name}。让结论全票通过吧！"
L["One size fits all, {name}, gnome to tauren. I measured. The tauren was patient."] = "均码，{name}，侏儒到牛头人都合身。我量过，牛头人很耐心。"
L["Take this, {name}! Unlike my Net-o-Matic, it never lands on me."] = "拿着，{name}！它不像我的撒网器，从不罩住我自己。"
L["The Gnomish Army Knife does twelve things badly, {name}. This does one well."] = "侏儒军刀十二样功能样样不灵，{name}。这个就一样，但好用。"
L["Guarantee void if exposed to troggs, dragonfire or enthusiasm, {name}. Enjoy!"] = "遇穴居人、龙焰或热情即失去保修，{name}。请慢用！"
L["Nothing up my sleeves, {name}! Well, a spanner and two fuses. Nothing sinister."] = "袖里空空，{name}！呃，就一把扳手、两根引信。绝无恶意。"
L["Here, {name}! It's small, but so is a keystone, and look what those hold up."] = "给，{name}！别嫌小，拱心石也不大，整座拱门全靠它撑着。"
L["I'd explain how it works, {name}, but that takes three days and a chalkboard."] = "原理我可以讲，{name}，不过得三天外加一块黑板。"
L["That hum's my gift settling, {name}. If you hear ticking, it's my pocket watch."] = "那嗡嗡声是我的礼物在生效，{name}。要是听见滴答声，那是我的怀表。"
L["A dash of arcane, a pinch of science, {name}, and no troggs involved. Here!"] = "一点奥术，一撮科学，{name}，全程无穴居人参与。给！"
L["Ironforge took us gnomes in when we needed it, {name}. I'm passing it along."] = "我们侏儒落难时，铁炉堡收留了我们，{name}。我把这份情传下去。"
L["Here, {name}! It doesn't whistle, spin or catch fire. I'm working on all three."] = "给，{name}！它不会吹哨、不会转、也不会着火。三样我都在改进。"
L["Here, {name}! Unwrapped, sorry. The wrapping machine wrapped itself again."] = "给，{name}！没包装，抱歉。包装机又把自己包起来了。"
L["My mechanostrider wanted to give you something, {name}. It lacks the hands."] = "我的机械陆行鸟也想送你点东西，{name}。可惜它没有手。"
L["Off on an adventure, {name}? Take this, and bring me back anything that ticks."] = "要去冒险，{name}？拿上这个，看到会嘀嗒响的都给我带回来。"
L["Reliable as the Deeprun Tram, {name}. That's a compliment, I promise. Here!"] = "跟矿道地铁一样可靠，{name}。我保证这是夸奖。给！"
L["For you, {name}! One part magic to two parts confidence. Mostly confidence."] = "给你，{name}！一份魔法兑两份自信。主要是自信。"
L["For Gnomeregan, {name}! Here, eye to eye. Always nice to give at eye level."] = "为了诺莫瑞根，{name}！来，平视着给。能平视着送礼真好。"
L["Fellow gnome, {name}! A boost for you. I'll hold the schematic, you the bucket."] = "侏儒老乡，{name}！给你加把劲。图纸我拿，水桶你拿。"
L["Flesh or cogs, {name}, we're all gnomes. Some need oiling. This is oil."] = "血肉也好齿轮也罢，{name}，咱都是侏儒，有的得上点油。这就是油。"
L["Gnome to gnome, {name}: here's a boost. You did turn the reactor off, yes?"] = "侏儒对侏儒，{name}：给你加把劲。反应堆你关了吧？"
L["Two gnomes, {name}! With this boost and you on my shoulders, we're a night elf."] = "两个侏儒，{name}！加上这股劲，你再骑我肩上，咱俩差不多就是个暗夜精灵了。"
L["I checked my sums on this, {name}. You check yours; we're both offended."] = "这个我把账算过了，{name}。你也算算，然后咱俩一起不服气。"
L["That one's free, {name}. You still owe me a sprocket. Every gnome does."] = "这个免费，{name}。你还欠我个链轮。每个侏儒都欠我一个链轮。"
L["Here, {name}. One day we'll walk back into Gnomeregan together, lights on."] = "拿着，{name}。总有一天咱们一起走回诺莫瑞根，灯火通明。"
L["Between gnomes, {name}: this one won't explode. I checked. Twice. Mostly."] = "侏儒之间说句实话，{name}：这个不会炸。我检查过。两遍。差不多吧。"
L["A start, {name}. Shall we build something huge, to see the tall folk's faces?"] = "先给你这个，{name}。咱们造个巨无霸，看看大个子们的表情？"
L["Party-wide calibration complete, {name}! Nobody touch anything shiny."] = "全队校准完毕，{name}！谁都别碰亮晶晶的东西。"
L["I've run the numbers, {name}: with this on you, we win. I rounded up."] = "我算过了，{name}：你身上有了这个，咱们赢。我四舍五入了。"
L["There, {name}. If I shout 'duck', don't look for a duck. Last time went badly."] = "好了，{name}。我要是喊“趴下”，别低头找东西。上回就这么砸了。"
L["There, {name}. Formation: tall folk at the front, me somewhere safe and clever."] = "好了，{name}。阵型：大个子在前，我躲在安全又聪明的地方。"
L["Everyone gets one, {name}! Standardised parts are the secret of a good machine."] = "人人有份，{name}！标准化零件是好机器的秘诀。"
L["My plan, {name}: step one, give you this. Step two is still in development."] = "我的计划，{name}：第一步，把这个给你。第二步还在研发中。"
L["Don't panic, {name}. That's my gadget for any mishap. Version two next week."] = "别慌，{name}。这就是我应对各种意外的小玩意儿。二代下周出。"
L["Here, {name}. If I vanish, check under the nearest boot. Politely, please."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我不见了，去最近的靴子底下找找。客气点。"
L["Yours, {name}. When this is over, I want samples. Of everything. Big one first."] = "这是你的，{name}。完事后我要样本。每样都要。先要大家伙的。"
L["On purpose, {name}. Like every explosion today. I'll decide which ones later."] = "这股劲是故意给的，{name}。今天每次爆炸也都是故意的。哪些是，回头再定。"
L["Clipboard ready, {name}! First entry: gave you this. Then everyone's heroics."] = "记录板就绪，{name}！第一条：给了你这个。接着记大家的英勇事迹。"
L["There, {name}. If we get separated, follow the smoke. It'll be me."] = "好了，{name}。要是走散了，跟着烟走。那就是我。"
L["Here, {name}. Everyone keep their fingers. I've counted. I'll recount after."] = "拿着，{name}。大家都保住手指头。我数过了。完事再数一遍。"
L["Ready, {name}? Spare gears, spare fuses, and now a spare boost for you."] = "准备好了吗，{name}？备用齿轮、备用保险丝，现在再给你备一股劲。"
L["Take this, {name}, and leave the traps to me. I built most of them. Not these."] = "拿着，{name}，陷阱交给我。大部分是我造的。这几个不是。"
L["Here, {name}, before we go in. Anyone seen my wrench? It's mildly important."] = "进去前先拿着，{name}。有人看见我的扳手吗？有那么一点重要。"
L["For Gnomeregan, {name}! And for you, here. And for everywhere else, too."] = "为了诺莫瑞根，{name}！也为了你，拿着。顺便为了别的所有地方。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I'm carried off, retrieve my notes first. Then me."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我被叼走了，先把我的笔记抢回来。再救我。"
L["An experiment, {name}. Hypothesis: with this on you, we win. Let's test it."] = "这是个实验，{name}。假设：你身上有了这个，咱们就赢。试试看。"
L["Morning, {name}! Up since three. The toaster needed an engine; you needed this."] = "早上好，{name}！三点就起了。烤面包机要换引擎，你要这个。"
L["Good morning, {name}! The coffee brews itself now, so I had time for this."] = "早上好，{name}！咖啡现在自己会煮了，所以我有空弄这个。"
L["Early start, {name}! Best ideas come before breakfast. This was one of them."] = "起得早，{name}！好点子都在早饭前冒出来。这就是其中一个。"
L["Morning, {name}! Tinker Town's been clanking since dawn, and so have I. Here!"] = "早，{name}！侏儒区天一亮就叮当响，我也是。给！"
L["Up early, {name}? I dreamt of a better sprocket and couldn't wait. Here!"] = "起这么早，{name}？我梦见一个更好的齿轮，等不及了。给！"
L["Morning, {name}! The sun's a bit dim today, so I made you a brighter one."] = "早，{name}！今天太阳有点暗，我给你造了个更亮的。"
L["By my calculations, {name}, you are ninety percent wonderful."] = "根据我的计算，{name}，你有百分之九十棒。"
L["Who needs a mechanostrider with you around, {name}? Not me!"] = "有你在，谁还要机械陆行鸟啊，{name}？我不要！"
L["Remind me to build you a little hat, {name}. A sensible hat."] = "提醒我给你做顶小帽子，{name}。要正经的那种。"
L["Splendid, {name}! Efficiency rating: off the charts!"] = "漂亮，{name}！效率评分：爆表！"
L["Marvellous, {name}! I couldn't have engineered a better bite."] = "太妙了，{name}！我都设计不出更好的一口。"
L["Ha! Textbook, {name}. I'm writing that one down for Mekkatorque."] = "哈！教科书级别，{name}。我得记下来给大机械师看。"
L["Easy, {name}. Diagnostics say you need rest. Lots of rest."] = "别急，{name}。诊断结果：需要休息。大量休息。"
L["There, there, {name}. Nothing a little patching won't fix."] = "好啦好啦，{name}。补一补就没事了。"
L["Hold still, {name}. Bandages first, inventions later."] = "别动，{name}。先包扎，再搞发明。"
L["The Light rewards kindness, {name}. I'm simply its fastest courier."] = "圣光会回报善意，{name}。我只是它最快的信使。"
L["Archenon poros, {name}. Your gift is returned."] = "Archenon poros，{name}。你的馈赠，我来回报。"
L["Thanks, {name}. I'd offer a lift in the Exodar, but you've seen how it lands."] = "谢了，{name}。本想让你搭埃索达，可你见过它是怎么着陆的。"
L["A gift freely given, {name}. The naaru hum a little louder. Returned."] = "无私的馈赠，{name}。纳鲁的嗡鸣都响了些。回赠你。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. On Argus we'd have carved that in crystal. Here."] = "好心肠，{name}。在阿古斯，这事得刻进水晶里。给。"
L["Across a dozen worlds, {name}, kindness is the one tongue I never had to learn."] = "走过十几个世界，{name}，善意是我唯一不用学的语言。"
L["What a kindness, {name}. It almost makes up for the Legion. Almost."] = "真是好心，{name}。差点就抵得过燃烧军团欠的账了。差点。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd say it in Draenei, but that takes eleven minutes."] = "谢谢你，{name}。用德莱尼语说得花十一分钟。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My people call that a debt of honour. Here."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我族称之为荣誉之债。给。"
L["Sargeras once offered my people gifts, {name}. We ran. Yours, I'll keep."] = "萨格拉斯也给我族送过礼，{name}。我们跑了。你的，我收下。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I've fled demons across the stars, but never from a debt."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我躲恶魔躲过了星海，但从不躲债。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll add you to my prayers. The list goes back to Argus."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我会为你祈祷。名单从阿古斯就开始排了。"
L["The Legion took a world from us, {name}. Folk like you keep giving bits back."] = "燃烧军团抢走一个世界，{name}，好心人正一点点还给我们。"
L["You gave first, {name}. A prophet would call it an omen. I call it manners."] = "你先给的，{name}。先知会说这是预兆，我说这是礼数。"
L["With the Light's compliments, {name}. It asked me to add 'nicely done'."] = "圣光向你致意，{name}。它还让我补一句：“干得漂亮”。"
L["Of course, {name}. The naaru guide your steps; this puts a spring in them."] = "当然，{name}。纳鲁指引你的脚步，这个让它更轻快。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The Light answers those who ask."] = "乐意之至，{name}。圣光会回应祈求之人。"
L["Velen foresaw you asking, {name}. I foresaw saying yes."] = "维伦预见了你会开口，{name}。我预见了我会答应。"
L["The Light is not rationed, {name}. Take as much as you like."] = "圣光不限量供应，{name}。随便拿。"
L["Of course, {name}. I've outrun the Burning Legion; I can manage this."] = "当然，{name}。燃烧军团我都跑赢了，这点事不在话下。"
L["At once, {name}. Hooves planted, crystals humming, here it comes."] = "马上，{name}。蹄子站稳，水晶嗡鸣，来了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. I followed a talking crystal across the stars. This is easy."] = "乐意，{name}。我跟着会说话的水晶穿越星海，这算什么。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Velen taught us patience. Luckily, this takes none."] = "当然，{name}。维伦教会我们耐心。幸好这个用不着。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The naaru never say no. They say 'hmmm', but it means yes."] = "乐意，{name}。纳鲁从不说不，只会“嗡——”，意思是行。"
L["On the Exodar this took three crystals and a prayer, {name}. Here: the prayer."] = "在埃索达，这得三块水晶加一段祷文，{name}。祷文给你。"
L["Of course, {name}. I only refuse demons, and they so rarely say please."] = "当然，{name}。我只拒绝恶魔，而它们几乎从不说“请”。"
L["Gladly, {name}. We were refugees long enough to know what asking costs."] = "乐意之至，{name}。我们流亡太久，知道开口求人有多难。"
L["Of course, {name}. My people crossed the stars looking for friends. Found one."] = "当然，{name}。我族跨越星海寻找朋友。找到一个了。"
L["Ask a draenei, {name}: one yes, one blessing, possibly a history lesson."] = "找德莱尼，{name}：一声好、一份祝福，没准加堂历史课。"
L["The Light is with you, {name}. Go in peace, or at least go prepared."] = "圣光与你同在，{name}。平安前行，至少有备而行。"
L["Walk in the Light, {name}. May it shelter you always."] = "行于圣光之中，{name}。愿它永远庇护你。"
L["Take this, {name}. My people always travel Light."] = "拿着，{name}。我族出门向来轻装：只装圣光。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Legion is always coming. I'd know."] = "拿着，{name}。燃烧军团总会再来。我最清楚。"
L["I'm out of miracles today, {name}. Will {buff} do?"] = "今天的奇迹用完了，{name}。{buff}凑合一下？"
L["For the road, {name}. Mine has been twenty-five thousand years long."] = "路上用吧，{name}。我这条路已经走了两万五千年。"
L["Blessed by a naaru, {name}. Well, I stood near one. It still counts."] = "受过纳鲁祝福，{name}。好吧，我在一位旁边站过。也算。"
L["Take this, {name}. It glows a bit. Everything we own does."] = "拿着，{name}。它有点发光。我们的东西都这样。"
L["Here, {name}. We draenei pack for the end of the world. We've had the practice."] = "给，{name}。我们德莱尼打包都按世界末日准备。练过好几回了。"
L["Take this, {name}. The crystals only hum like that for friends."] = "拿着，{name}。水晶只为朋友这样嗡鸣。"
L["The naaru shine on all, {name}. Here is your share."] = "纳鲁普照众生，{name}。这是你的那一份。"
L["A stranger shared bread with me on Azuremyst, {name}. I'm still paying it back."] = "在秘蓝岛，有个陌生人分过我面包，{name}。我到现在还在还。"
L["Velen sees a thousand futures, {name}. I see one: you, better prepared. Here."] = "维伦能看见千种未来，{name}。我只看见一种：你准备得更好。"
L["Don't drink from the streams on Bloodmyst, {name}. Do take this."] = "秘血岛的溪水别喝，{name}。这个尽管拿。"
L["Eredar magic from before the fall, {name}. We only kept the good kind. Here."] = "堕落之前的艾瑞达魔法，{name}。我们只留下了好的那种。给。"
L["Archenon poros, {name}! The children of Argus look after one another."] = "Archenon poros，{name}！阿古斯的子民互相照应。"
L["Home is where two draenei meet, {name}. Today it's here; this is my welcome."] = "两个德莱尼相聚之处便是家，{name}。今天就在这儿；这是我的欢迎。"
L["We crossed the stars together, {name}. Sharing the Light still means something."] = "我们一同穿越群星，{name}。分享圣光依然意义非凡。"
L["Tails up, {name}; take this. Argus would be proud of what we made of exile."] = "尾巴翘起来，{name}，拿着这个。阿古斯会为我们在流亡中的作为而骄傲。"
L["Two draenei, {name}: fifty thousand years of worry. This should ease yours."] = "两个德莱尼，{name}：五万年的忧虑。这个能让你少操点心。"
L["Horns, hooves, hope, {name}, and this. The Legion found no cure for any of it."] = "角、蹄、希望，{name}，再加上这个。燃烧军团对哪样都束手无策。"
L["Children of Velen, {name}: exiled, hopeful and dreadfully polite. Hence this."] = "维伦的子民，{name}：流亡、怀抱希望、还客气得要命。所以给你这个。"
L["Third world's the charm, {name}. Take this; we're owed one that stays put."] = "第三个世界该转运了，{name}。拿着；我们早该有个安稳的家园。"
L["There, {name}. I lost a world once; I'm keeping hold of this party."] = "好了，{name}。我曾失去过一个世界；这支队伍我会牢牢守住。"
L["Millennia on the run, {name}. Sharing the Light with friends is nicer."] = "逃亡了几千年，{name}。和朋友分享圣光要好得多。"
L["The naaru would call sharing Light a fellowship, {name}. I call it good luck."] = "纳鲁会把分享圣光称作情谊，{name}。我管它叫好运。"
L["I've watched worlds end, {name}. With this on you, nothing ahead worries me."] = "我见过世界终结，{name}。你身上有了这个，前路再险我也不担心。"
L["Stay together, {name}. The Light finds us easier that way; I just proved it."] = "待在一起，{name}。这样圣光更容易找到我们；我刚证明了。"
L["Take this; stay close, {name}. We draenei are very good at leaving in a hurry."] = "拿着，待近点，{name}。我们德莱尼最擅长匆忙撤离。"
L["Draenei take the long view, {name}. This fight's a footnote. This gift isn't."] = "德莱尼看得长远，{name}。这场仗只是个注脚。这份礼物可不是。"
L["Here, {name}. Now I go first; anything watching sees a very tall optimist."] = "拿着，{name}。现在我打头；谁在看，都会看到一个个子很高的乐天派。"
L["We draenei follow prophets, {name}. Today I'll follow you, blessed as you are."] = "德莱尼追随先知，{name}。今天我就追随你，你已受了祝福。"
L["The Exodar carried thousands, {name}. I'd rather carry this little party. Here."] = "埃索达载过成千上万的人，{name}。我更愿意扶持这支小队。给你。"
L["Shoulder to shoulder, blessed, {name}. Mine's higher, but the principle holds."] = "并肩而立，带着祝福，{name}。我的肩高些，道理一样。"
L["A short prayer for the party, {name}. The long one would take an age."] = "为小队念段短祷文，{name}。长的要念上一个纪元。"
L["The Naaru smile on us, {name}. Rest a moment with me."] = "纳鲁在对我们微笑，{name}。陪我歇一会儿。"
L["You are a good friend, {name}. Argus never gave me better."] = "你是个好朋友，{name}。阿古斯从没给过我更好的。"
L["Walk with me, {name}. The road is kinder with two."] = "陪我走吧，{name}。两个人的路更温柔。"
L["Light be praised, {name}! You fought with a true heart."] = "赞美圣光，{name}！你战斗时心怀真诚。"
L["Well done, {name}. Velen himself would bless you for that."] = "干得好，{name}。维伦本人都会为此祝福你。"
L["Magnificent, {name}. The crystals of the Exodar shine for you."] = "了不起，{name}。埃索达的水晶为你闪耀。"
L["Be at peace, {name}. The Light is with you, and so am I."] = "安心吧，{name}。圣光与你同在，我也是。"
L["Hush, {name}. Rest now. I will not leave your side."] = "嘘，{name}。歇吧。我不会离开你身边。"
L["Breathe, {name}. We have outlasted worse than this together."] = "呼吸，{name}。比这更糟的我们都一起熬过来了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Gilneas never forgets a kindness, and nor does my nose."] = "多谢，{name}。吉尔尼斯永不忘恩，我的鼻子也是。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You have my gratitude, and my best howl."] = "谢谢你，{name}。感激不尽，再送你一声狼嚎！"
L["Thank you, {name}. If worgen had tails, mine would be wagging."] = "谢谢你，{name}。狼人要是有尾巴，我的早摇起来了。"
L["You've made a friend for life, {name}. Loyalty is rather our thing."] = "你交了个一辈子的朋友，{name}。忠诚可是我们的看家本领。"
L["The beast in me wants to growl, {name}. The Gilnean in me insists on thanks."] = "我心里的野兽想咆哮，{name}。我心里的吉尔尼斯人坚持要道谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd offer a hand, but mine have claws now."] = "谢谢你，{name}。本想跟你握手，可我的手现在长爪子了。"
L["We walled ourselves off for years, {name}. You make that look silly."] = "我们筑墙自守多年，{name}。你让那堵墙显得真傻。"
L["Obliged, {name}. You've earned a spot by the fire. The good spot."] = "承情，{name}。炉火边有你一个位置。最好的那个。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Gilneas had a word for folk like you: neighbour."] = "谢谢你，{name}。在吉尔尼斯，你这样的人有个称呼：邻居。"
L["Returned, {name}, with a stiff upper lip. The lower one shows teeth; ignore it."] = "如数奉还，{name}，绅士风度不变。至于龇出来的牙，别在意。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd tip my hat, but it doesn't fit over the ears these days."] = "谢谢你，{name}。本想脱帽致意，可如今帽子套不下这对耳朵了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Most folk just scratch my ears and hope for the best."] = "谢谢你，{name}。大多数人只会挠挠我耳朵，然后祈祷别出事。"
L["Returned, {name}. A Gilnean pays debts; a worgen pays them at a sprint."] = "还你，{name}。吉尔尼斯人欠债必还，狼人还得飞快。"
L["My mother would have had you round for tea, {name}. Thank you."] = "换作我母亲，早请你上门喝茶了，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still, I don't bite. Much."] = "当然，{name}。别动，我不咬人。不怎么咬。"
L["Right you are, {name}. Stand steady now."] = "没问题，{name}。站稳了。"
L["Right away, {name}. Stay, now. I've always wanted to say that."] = "马上，{name}。待着，别动。这话我一直想对别人说。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Rain or shine, and in Gilneas it's rain."] = "乐意之至，{name}。风雨无阻，反正吉尔尼斯只有雨。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Mind the claws."] = "当然，{name}。小心爪子。"
L["Say no more, {name}. These ears heard you before you'd decided to ask."] = "不用多说，{name}。你还没决定开口，这对耳朵就听见了。"
L["Of course, {name}. You asked nicer than the last fellow who threw me a stick."] = "当然，{name}。你比上次冲我扔木棍的家伙客气多了。"
L["Glad to, {name}. Few people ask a seven-foot wolf for favours. I love it."] = "乐意，{name}。很少有人找一头七尺高的狼帮忙。我太喜欢了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I'll stay in this form. The other one causes a scene."] = "当然，{name}。我就保持这个样子。另一个样子容易引起围观。"
L["Straight to business without tea, {name}? How un-Gilnean."] = "不喝茶就直奔正题，{name}？太不吉尔尼斯了。"
L["Of course, {name}. In Gilneas, nobody had to ask twice."] = "当然，{name}。在吉尔尼斯，谁都不用开口第二次。"
L["Of course, {name}. It would be rude to keep you waiting."] = "当然，{name}。让你久等就太失礼了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Anything but a bath."] = "当然，{name}。只要别让我洗澡就行。"
L["Stay off the moors after dark, {name}. Take this."] = "天黑后别去荒原，{name}。拿着这个。"
L["Keep your wits about you, {name}, and this too. Something is always hunting."] = "保持警觉，{name}，也带上这个。总有东西在狩猎。"
L["I'd have brought this sooner, {name}, but I stopped to chase something."] = "本该早点送来的，{name}，可我半路去追了个东西。"
L["For you, {name}. No, I don't want a treat. Well. Perhaps a small one."] = "给你的，{name}。不，我不要零食。好吧，要一点点。"
L["Gilneans always offer, {name}. The claws are just part of the outfit."] = "吉尔尼斯人向来乐于助人，{name}。爪子只是行头的一部分。"
L["An old Gilnean remedy, {name}. Good for colds, gloom and most curses. Not mine."] = "吉尔尼斯老偏方，{name}。治感冒、郁闷和多数诅咒。我的除外。"
L["Run with this, {name}. Trust me, I know about running."] = "带着它跑吧，{name}。信我，跑这事我懂。"
L["Brought you this, {name}. Don't make a fuss over it."] = "给你带来的，{name}。别大惊小怪。"
L["Here, {name}. Gilnean roads were never safe alone, and nor are these."] = "给，{name}。吉尔尼斯的路从来不宜独行，这里的也一样。"
L["For you, {name}. Not everything that prowls was as well raised as I was."] = "给你的，{name}。在外头游荡的，可不都像我这么有家教。"
L["From a Gilnean of good family, {name}. The fur is new; the manners are old."] = "出自吉尔尼斯名门，{name}。毛是新长的，教养是祖传的。"
L["Someone did this for me in Duskhaven once, {name}. I never forgot."] = "在暮湾镇，曾有人也这样帮过我，{name}。我一直没忘。"
L["Liam would have cried 'For Gilneas!', {name}. I'll just say: for you."] = "里亚姆会高呼“为了吉尔尼斯！”，{name}。我只说：为了你。"
L["Tal'doren's druids taught me to leash the beast, {name}. It lets me do this."] = "塔尔多伦的德鲁伊教我拴住野兽，{name}。所以我才能做这个。"
L["Take this, {name}, and be careful out there. Advice from someone bitten once."] = "拿着，{name}，在外面小心点。这是被咬过一回的人给的忠告。"
L["Here, {name}. In Gilneas we'd have sent it with a jar of preserves."] = "给，{name}。在吉尔尼斯，我们还会配上一罐果酱。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd offer my coat, but it's attached."] = "拿着，{name}。本想把大衣给你，可它长在我身上。"
L["Here, {name}. Chin up, hackles down. Words to live by."] = "给，{name}。昂首挺胸，颈毛放平。至理名言。"
L["The curse binds us, {name}; Gilneas binds us tighter. Here, from one of yours."] = "诅咒把我们绑在一起，{name}；吉尔尼斯绑得更紧。拿着，自家人给的。"
L["No need to explain the ears to you, {name}, nor to thank me for this."] = "耳朵的事不用跟你解释，{name}，这个也不用谢我。"
L["Fur, fog, rain, {name}. Only a Gilnean knows all three. This helps with them."] = "皮毛、雾、雨，{name}。三样全懂的只有吉尔尼斯人。这个能帮上忙。"
L["Pack looks after pack, {name}. Always has."] = "狼群照顾狼群，{name}。向来如此。"
L["Shed this badly too, {name}? Take this; I'll knit a third worgen with the rest."] = "你也掉毛这么凶吗，{name}？拿着；剩下的毛够我织个狼人了。"
L["Two worgen, {name}, one blessing. Somewhere, a cat's having a very bad day."] = "两个狼人，{name}，一份祝福。某处有只猫要倒大霉了。"
L["Here, {name}. Works in either form; I forget which one I left home in."] = "拿着，{name}。两种形态都管用；我老忘了自己是以哪种出门的。"
L["Gilnean to Gilnean, {name}: the best-mannered wolves in Azeroth share. Here."] = "吉尔尼斯人对吉尔尼斯人，{name}：艾泽拉斯最有礼数的狼懂得分享。拿着。"
L["Pack rules, {name}: nobody wanders off, everyone gets one, no talk of fleas."] = "狼群规矩，{name}：谁也别走散，人人有份，不许提跳蚤。"
L["A pack again, {name}, someone to look after. I hadn't known how I'd missed it."] = "又有狼群了，{name}，有人可照顾了。我竟不知自己有多想念这个。"
L["Take this, {name}. I smell trouble first; it's the curse's one perk."] = "拿着，{name}。麻烦我总是先闻到；这是诅咒唯一的好处。"
L["There, {name}. If I howl, it's a battle cry. Howl back if you like."] = "好了，{name}。我要是嚎，那是战吼。想的话你也嚎回来。"
L["That'll keep you up, {name}. Lead on. I'll trot. Undignified, but quick."] = "这能让你撑住，{name}。你带路。我小跑跟着。不体面，但快。"
L["Here, {name}. If I stare at a wall, something's behind it. Or it's a wall."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是盯着墙看，那后头有东西。要么就只是墙。"
L["Years on the Greymane Wall, {name}. A line held with you, blessed? A holiday."] = "在格雷迈恩之墙守了好几年，{name}。和受了祝福的你一起守线？那是度假。"
L["Take this for the mauling, {name}. After, a proper cup of tea."] = "拿着，撕咬时用得上，{name}。完事后来杯好茶。"
L["Here, {name}, so you mend as quickly as I do. Worgen mend quickly."] = "拿着，{name}，让你跟我一样好得快。狼人恢复得快。"
L["That sees you to the rest, {name}. I'll take first watch; I hear everything."] = "这能撑你到歇脚，{name}。头班岗我来，我什么都听得见。"
L["Take this, {name}, and stay together. Being a lone wolf is overrated."] = "拿着，{name}，大家待在一起。当孤狼被高估了。"
L["Night again, {name}: my best and my worst. Giving you this is the best part."] = "又入夜了，{name}：我最好也最糟的时候。把这个给你是最好的部分。"
L["Look at that moon, {name}. Gilneas taught us not to trust it. Trust this."] = "看那月亮，{name}。吉尔尼斯教会我们别信它。信这个吧。"
L["Gilneas at night was fog and footsteps, {name}. Now the footsteps bring this."] = "夜里的吉尔尼斯只有雾和脚步声，{name}。如今脚步声给你带来这个。"
L["Curfew in Gilneas was sundown, {name}. Take this; there's a reason it was."] = "吉尔尼斯的宵禁从日落开始，{name}。拿着；那是有原因的。"
L["Something's rustling out there, {name}. Take this; stay close. I'll look."] = "外头有东西窸窸窣窣，{name}。拿着，待近点。我去看看。"
L["Past dark, {name}: ears up, nose working, manners on. Manners means this."] = "天黑了，{name}：耳朵竖起，鼻子开工，礼数到位。礼数就是这个。"
L["Morning, {name}. The rug by the fire was warm, but I got up to give you this."] = "早，{name}。炉边的毯子暖和得很，可我还是起来把这个给你。"
L["Smells like rain this morning, {name}. Here's something to keep you dry inside."] = "今早闻着要下雨，{name}。给你点东西，让你里头干爽。"
L["Up already, {name}? I've prowled since first light, waiting to give you this."] = "已经起了，{name}？我天一亮就在转悠，等着把这个给你。"
L["Morning, {name}. Tea, toast, a shave, and this. The shave takes longer now."] = "早，{name}。茶、吐司、刮胡子，再加这个。现在刮胡子费时多了。"
L["Morning, {name}. The birds woke me, so I woke the birds. You just get this."] = "早，{name}。鸟把我吵醒了，我就把鸟也吵醒了。你嘛，只给这个。"
L["Morning, {name}. The fog's lifting, as it never did in Gilneas. Take this."] = "早，{name}。雾散了，在吉尔尼斯可从没散过。带上这个。"
L["We both know the wild, {name}. Stay close to me."] = "我们都懂得荒野，{name}。待在我身边。"
L["Gilneas lost much, {name}. It never gave me a better friend."] = "吉尔尼斯失去了很多，{name}。但它从没给过我更好的朋友。"
L["Steady, {name}. You and I don't need a wall to feel at home."] = "稳住，{name}。你我不需要城墙也能找到家。"
L["Ha! Well hunted, {name}! That's the Gilnean spirit."] = "哈！猎得好，{name}！这就是吉尔尼斯精神。"
L["That's it, {name}. Not one step back. Gilneas would be proud."] = "就是这样，{name}。一步不退。吉尔尼斯会骄傲的。"
L["Brilliant, {name}. The Greymane Wall never held so well."] = "漂亮，{name}。格雷迈恩之墙都没守得这么好。"
L["Easy, {name}. The beast in me knows hurt. Rest now."] = "别急，{name}。我体内的野兽懂得痛。歇吧。"
L["Shh, {name}. I'm here. Let the fog roll by while you rest."] = "嘘，{name}。我在。你歇着，让雾慢慢散去。"
L["Stay down, {name}. I'll stand watch until you're ready."] = "躺着别动，{name}。我守着，直到你缓过来。"
L["Throm-ka, {name}! Honour is repaid."] = "Throm-ka，{name}！恩义已还。"
L["You give freely, {name}. I return the favour."] = "你慷慨相助，{name}。这个人情我还你。"
L["Orcs keep their thanks short, {name}. Thanks."] = "兽人道谢从不啰嗦，{name}。谢了。"
L["Orcs return every blow twice, {name}. The kind ones too."] = "兽人挨一下还两下，{name}。好意也一样。"
L["You helped me, I help you, {name}. That is the old way."] = "你帮我，我帮你，{name}。这是老规矩。"
L["In the old days I'd have repaid you with a boar, {name}. This keeps better."] = "放在从前，我会拿头野猪还你，{name}。这个更耐放。"
L["Owing somebody itches worse than Durotar sand, {name}. There. Itch gone."] = "欠人情比杜隆塔尔的沙子还痒，{name}。好了，不痒了。"
L["Strong stuff, {name}. I could wrestle a kodo now. So can you."] = "好东西，{name}。我现在能摔倒一头科多兽。你也行。"
L["Ambushed by kindness, {name}. No orc trains for that. Returned in full."] = "被好意伏击了，{name}。兽人可没练过这个。如数奉还。"
L["Honour is a debt, {name}, and orcs pay on the spot."] = "荣誉是一笔债，{name}，兽人当场就还。"
L["An orc remembers a kindness like a scar, {name}: fondly, and for good."] = "兽人记恩情跟记伤疤一样，{name}：好了也不忘，还挺怀念。"
L["I'd give you my axe, {name}, but we're not that close yet. Take this."] = "本想把斧子送你，{name}，可咱俩还没那么熟。拿这个吧。"
L["Thanks, {name}. My wolf growled at you. That's how he says it."] = "谢了，{name}。我的狼冲你吼了一声。那是它在道谢。"
L["I've had gifts from shamans and chieftains, {name}. None came so freely."] = "萨满和酋长都送过我礼，{name}。没有一份给得这么爽快。"
L["We once took strength from demons, {name}. Yours comes on far better terms."] = "我们从恶魔那儿拿过力量，{name}。你给的条件可好多了。"
L["The spirits saw that, {name}. They'll remember it, and so will I."] = "先祖之灵看见了，{name}。它们会记住，我也会。"
L["I'll carve that on my axe handle, {name}. Next to the notches. Thank you."] = "我会把这事刻在斧柄上，{name}。就刻在那排刻痕旁边。谢了。"
L["Kindness unasked is rare as rain in Durotar, {name}. Returned."] = "不求自来的善意，比杜隆塔尔的雨还稀罕，{name}。还你。"
L["In my clan, {name}, a gift is answered with a bigger one. Here."] = "在我们氏族，{name}，收了礼要回个更大的。给。"
L["A Frostwolf never counts what a friend gives, {name}. Only what he gives back."] = "霜狼从不计较朋友给了多少，{name}。只算自己还了多少。"
L["The camps taught us who our friends are, {name}. You're one. Here."] = "收容所让我们看清了谁是朋友，{name}。你是一个。给。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Thrall says the Horde's strength is its friends. You count."] = "谢了，{name}。萨尔说，部落的力量在于朋友。你算一个。"
L["Good. Strong. Kind. Three things I respect, {name}. Have this."] = "好。强。善。我敬重的三样，{name}。拿着。"
L["Grom would have roared his thanks, {name}. I'll spare your ears and send this."] = "格罗姆会吼着道谢，{name}。我饶了你的耳朵，送这个就好。"
L["Dabu, {name}. It is done."] = "Dabu，{name}。办妥了。"
L["Hold still, {name}. Strength for the fight ahead."] = "别动，{name}。为前方的战斗添些力量。"
L["Ask an orc for help and you get it, {name}. Ask for subtlety and you wait."] = "找兽人帮忙，{name}，马上就有。找兽人讲委婉，慢慢等吧。"
L["Help, yes. Hugging, no. Hold still, {name}."] = "帮忙，行。拥抱，不行。别动，{name}。"
L["You want {buff}? You have {buff}, {name}. Next."] = "要{buff}？给你{buff}，{name}。下一个。"
L["Don't flinch, {name}. My helping face looks exactly like my fighting face."] = "别躲，{name}。我帮忙时的脸和打架时一模一样。"
L["Short question, short answer, {name}: yes."] = "问得短，答得也短，{name}：行。"
L["Done, {name}. I was a peon once; I never refuse honest work."] = "办妥了，{name}。我当过苦工，正经活儿从不推辞。"
L["A challenge, {name}? Ah, a request. I accept either way."] = "挑战，{name}？啊，是请求。反正我都接。"
L["Yes, {name}. I was sharpening my axe, but it'll keep. It always keeps."] = "行，{name}。斧子正磨着呢，不急。磨斧不误帮忙工。"
L["In the Valley of Honor this would cost you a duel, {name}. For you, a nod."] = "在荣誉谷，这得跟你决斗一场，{name}。对你嘛，点个头就行。"
L["Now, {name}? Now. Orcs never learned the word 'later'."] = "现在？就现在，{name}。兽人不懂“待会儿”。"
L["One {buff}, {name}. Orc style: fast, direct, a bit too hard."] = "一份{buff}，{name}。兽人风格：快、直接、下手稍重。"
L["Stand still, {name}. I aim this like a throwing axe, and I rarely miss."] = "站好别动，{name}。我瞄这个跟扔飞斧一样，很少失手。"
L["Lok'tar, {name}. It means 'victory'. Today it also means 'yes'."] = "Lok'tar，{name}。意为“胜利”。今天也意为“行”。"
L["Done, {name}. If you need anything carried, hit or shouted at, ask again."] = "好了，{name}。要搬东西、揍东西、冲东西吼，再找我。"
L["You ask straight, {name}. I answer straight. Here."] = "你问得直，{name}。我答得也直。给。"
L["The shamans say the spirits help those who stand still, {name}. Stand still."] = "萨满说，灵魂只帮站着不动的人，{name}。别动。"
L["A good request, {name}: clear, brave and short. Like a good battle plan."] = "好请求，{name}：清楚、果敢、简短。就像好的作战计划。"
L["Done, {name}. Thrall says help freely. I say help quickly. Both right."] = "好了，{name}。萨尔说帮人要大方。我说帮人要快。都对。"
L["Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Take this into battle. A tavern brawl also counts."] = "Lok'tar ogar，{name}！带着它上战场！酒馆斗殴也算。"
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Take my strength and go earn your glory."] = "鲜血与雷霆，{name}！拿走我的力量，去赢得你的荣耀。"
L["Among orcs, {name}, making you stronger is how we say we like you."] = "在兽人这儿，{name}，让你变强就是在说喜欢你。"
L["An orc giving gifts unasked? Tell no one, {name}. It ruins the image."] = "兽人主动送礼？别告诉别人，{name}。有损形象。"
L["The Warchief wants us diplomatic, {name}. This is my diplomacy."] = "大酋长要我们讲外交，{name}。这就是我的外交。"
L["Take this strength, {name}, and hit something for me. Or set it on fire."] = "拿着这股力量，{name}，替我揍点什么。或者烧了它。"
L["Don't thank me, {name}. Just win, and do it loudly."] = "别谢我，{name}。赢就行，赢得响亮点。"
L["I'd make a speech, {name}, but it's mostly shouting. Just take it."] = "本想发表演讲，{name}，可基本都是吼。直接拿着吧。"
L["An orc at your back, {name}, even when I'm not there. Take this."] = "就算我不在，{name}，也有个兽人在背后挺你。拿着。"
L["'Strike first,' Grom always said, {name}. So: here, before you could ask."] = "格罗姆常说“先下手为强”，{name}。所以：给，趁你还没开口。"
L["Take it, {name}. A grunt who walks past a comrade gets a talking-to. From me."] = "拿着，{name}。步兵对战友视而不见，是要挨训的。我来训。"
L["Frostwolves share the hunt, {name}. I caught nothing today, so share this."] = "霜狼分享猎物，{name}。今天我什么都没打到，就分你这个吧。"
L["Walk the Durotar way, {name}: head up, sun on your neck, my strength in you."] = "走杜隆塔尔的路子，{name}：抬头，太阳晒后颈，身上带着我的力量。"
L["Here, {name}. The spirits favour the generous."] = "给，{name}。先祖之灵眷顾慷慨之人。"
L["Orcs give two things freely, {name}: advice and this. Skip the advice."] = "兽人有两样东西白送，{name}：建议和这个。建议就免了。"
L["The Barrens don't end, {name}. They just get more zhevra. Take this."] = "贫瘠之地没有尽头，{name}，只有越来越多的斑马。拿着。"
L["Strength for your arm, {name}. The honour, I see, you brought yourself."] = "给你的胳膊添点力气，{name}。至于荣誉，看得出你自带了。"
L["My wolf wanted you to have his bone, {name}. I talked him down to this."] = "我的狼想把它的骨头送你，{name}。我劝它换成了这个。"
L["Any grunt in Razor Hill would do the same, {name}. Most would shout first."] = "剃刀岭的哪个步兵都会这么做，{name}。大多会先吼一嗓子。"
L["For the fight ahead, {name}. There's always one. Orcs plan for it."] = "为了前方的战斗，{name}。总会有一场的。兽人早有准备。"
L["We were slaves once, {name}. Now we choose whom we help. Today, it's you."] = "我们曾是奴隶，{name}。如今帮谁由我们自己选。今天，选你。"
L["Go with this, {name}. Let them hear you coming. Or don't. Surprise works too."] = "带着这个去吧，{name}。让他们听见你来。或者别让他们听见。偷袭也行。"
L["A gift from Durotar, {name}. Like the land: rough, warm and short on shade."] = "杜隆塔尔的礼物，{name}。跟那片土地一样：粗粝、温热、缺树荫。"
L["The elements are fickle, {name}. I am not. Take this."] = "元素反复无常，{name}。我不是。拿着。"
L["Strength, {name}. Not the kind you lift. The kind you keep."] = "力量，{name}。不是举得起的那种，是撑得住的那种。"
L["Nobody crosses the Barrens alone if an orc can help it, {name}. Here."] = "有兽人在，谁也不用独自穿越贫瘠之地，{name}。给。"
L["Throm-ka, {name}! The blood of the clans runs strong in you. Stronger now."] = "索姆-卡，{name}！氏族之血在你体内奔涌。现在更猛了。"
L["An orc, {name}! Here: somebody who shouts at my volume deserves this."] = "是兽人啊，{name}！拿着：嗓门跟我一样大的，配得上这个。"
L["Frostwolf, Warsong, Blackrock, {name}: we argue like family, and share like it."] = "霜狼、战歌、黑石，{name}：我们像一家人那样吵，也像一家人那样分享。"
L["Between orcs no words are needed, {name}. Good; I'm out of them. Take this."] = "兽人之间不需要言语，{name}。正好，我也没词了。拿着。"
L["Grunt or shaman, {name}, the same stubborn blood. Here's more strength for it."] = "步兵也好萨满也罢，{name}，都是一样倔的血。再给它添点力量。"
L["Two orcs, {name}, and nobody's shouted yet. This the shamans will call an omen."] = "两个兽人，{name}，居然还没人吼。这个萨满们会说是个征兆。"
L["Our clans probably feuded once, {name}. Everybody's did. Let this settle it."] = "咱们的氏族八成结过仇，{name}。谁家都结过。就用这个了结吧。"
L["Between orcs, {name}, 'victory or death'. This should tilt it towards victory."] = "兽人之间，{name}：“不胜则死”。这个能让天平偏向胜利。"
L["Your tusks and mine have seen worse days, {name}. With this, today's better."] = "你我的獠牙都见过更糟的日子，{name}。有了这个，今天好多了。"
L["The plan, {name}: you take this, we hit it. Questions? No? Good plan."] = "计划是，{name}：你拿着这个，我们揍它。有问题吗？没有？好计划。"
L["A true warband, {name}: loud, angry, blessed, and on the same side for once."] = "真正的战团，{name}：吵闹、暴躁、受了祝福，难得全站一边。"
L["Stay with the warband, {name}. Strength in numbers, in axes, and in this."] = "跟紧战团，{name}。力量在于人多、在于斧头，也在于这个。"
L["Take this so I needn't carry you out, {name}. I would. Complaining all the way."] = "拿着，免得我把你扛出去，{name}。我会扛的。一路抱怨着扛。"
L["Fight well with this, {name}, and tonight you share our fire. And our boasting."] = "带着这个好好打，{name}，今晚就来分享我们的篝火。还有吹牛。"
L["That's courage, {name}. Nobody runs now. Walking briskly away is allowed."] = "这是勇气，{name}。现在谁也不许跑。快步走开倒是可以。"
L["Here, {name}. Now I go first. I have the thickest skull here, and I'm proud."] = "拿着，{name}。现在我打头。这里我的脑壳最硬，我很自豪。"
L["When the drums start, {name}, charge with this in you. No drums? I'll hum."] = "战鼓一响，{name}，带着这个冲锋。没鼓？我来哼。"
L["That's for your front, {name}. Watch my back; the front's what I hit."] = "这是护你前面的，{name}。你看着我后背；前面是我揍的地方。"
L["One clan today, {name}: Whoever Showed Up. Its members get one of these."] = "今天就一个氏族，{name}：来者氏族。成员每人一份。"
L["Take this, {name}. Anything big through that door is mine. Bigger, ours."] = "拿着，{name}。从那门进来的大家伙归我。更大的归咱们。"
L["Scars are stories, {name}. With this, let's all come out with short ones."] = "伤疤就是故事，{name}。有了这个，咱们都只带短故事出来。"
L["Old chieftains had war councils, {name}. We have me pointing, and this."] = "老酋长们有作战会议，{name}。我们有我指指点点，还有这个。"
L["Take this before I charge, {name}. If I charge early, it's tradition."] = "我冲锋前先拿着，{name}。我要是冲早了，那是传统。"
L["Form up, {name}, and take this! Shamans in the middle, fools at the front. Me."] = "列队，{name}，拿上这个！萨满在中间，傻子在前面。就是我。"
L["Tonight we feast, {name}. First we earn it, and this will help."] = "今晚大吃一顿，{name}。先得挣到手，这个能帮忙。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I fall, sing about it loudly in Orgrimmar. Lie a little."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我倒了，就在奥格瑞玛大声唱出来。吹一点。"
L["Strength and honour, {name}. The honour's yours; the strength I just gave you."] = "力量与荣誉，{name}。荣誉是你的；力量我刚给了你。"
L["Strong and loyal, {name}. A true companion of the Horde."] = "强壮又忠诚，{name}。部落真正的伙伴。"
L["Rest a while, {name}. Even a warrior needs a moment of peace."] = "歇一会儿，{name}。战士也需要片刻安宁。"
L["The spirits chose well when they sent you to me, {name}."] = "先祖之灵把你送到我身边，选得好，{name}。"
L["Lok'tar, {name}! You fought with honor!"] = "洛克塔，{name}！你战斗得光荣！"
L["Well fought, {name}! You'd shame half the warriors in Orgrimmar."] = "打得好，{name}！奥格瑞玛一半的战士都得惭愧。"
L["Strength and honor, {name}. That kill was yours."] = "力量与荣耀，{name}。那一击是你的。"
L["Easy, {name}. You bled for us both. Rest now."] = "别急，{name}。你为我们俩流了血。歇吧。"
L["Breathe, {name}. A true warrior rises again. Take your time."] = "呼吸，{name}。真正的战士会再站起来。慢慢来。"
L["Stay down, {name}. I'll guard you; no blade gets past me."] = "躺着，{name}。我护着你，刀刃过不了我。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It would warm my heart, if it still beat."] = "谢谢，{name}。这颗心要是还会跳，准会一暖。"
L["Such warmth, for one so cold? Returned in full, {name}."] = "给冰冷之人这般温暖？如数奉还，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd blush, but the blood stopped reaching my face."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我倒想脸红，可血早就流不到脸上了。"
L["My undying gratitude, {name}. For once, the phrase is accurate."] = "对你的感激至死不渝，{name}。我死过一回，确实没变。"
L["Most kind, {name}. You've lifted me from 'deceased' to 'mildly deceased'."] = "太好心了，{name}。你让我从“已故”升级成了“有点已故”。"
L["The last gift I got was the plague, {name}. Yours is a big improvement."] = "我上次收到的礼物是瘟疫，{name}。你这份强多了。"
L["Sylvanas says we repay every debt, {name}. She rarely means the nice ones."] = "希尔瓦娜斯说有债必还，{name}。她一般指的是血债。"
L["Repaid at once, {name}. We Forsaken never carry debts. They rot."] = "马上还你，{name}。被遗忘者从不拖欠，拖久了就成烂账。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll keep this somewhere safe. My ribcage has room."] = "谢谢，{name}。我会把它收好。我的肋骨里有空位。"
L["Kindness returned, {name}. Even the flies around me look impressed."] = "好意回赠，{name}。连我身边的苍蝇都看呆了。"
L["I'll drink to you tonight, {name}. It all leaks out, but it's the thought."] = "今晚我为你干一杯，{name}。虽然会全漏出来，但心意到了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've made my list of reasons to keep going. It's short."] = "谢谢，{name}。你上了我“撑下去的理由”清单。清单很短。"
L["Thank you, {name}. No contract, no fine print. Varimathras should take notes."] = "谢谢，{name}。没合同，没小字条款。瓦里玛萨斯该学学。"
L["Grave dirt and gratitude, {name}: all I own. You'll prefer the gratitude."] = "坟土和感激，{name}：我的全部家当。你会更喜欢感激的。"
L["I'd have Lordaeron's bells rung for you, {name}, but they only do funerals now."] = "本想为你敲响洛丹伦的钟，{name}，可如今它们只敲丧钟。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Next time I'm in Brill, I'll name a pumpkin after you."] = "谢谢，{name}。下回到布瑞尔，我挑个南瓜叫你的名字。"
L["Most of the living wouldn't have bothered, {name}. I'll resent them, not you."] = "大多数活人懒得管，{name}。我记恨他们，不记恨你。"
L["Better than anything I've pulled out of Undercity's sewers, {name}. Thanks."] = "比我从幽暗城下水道里捞出来的任何东西都好，{name}。谢了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. One tip in return: never drink what an apothecary hands you."] = "谢谢你，{name}。回赠你一句忠告：药剂师递的东西，千万别喝。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd shake your hand, but I'd like to keep mine attached."] = "谢了，{name}。想握手，又怕手留你那儿。"
L["You've done what the apothecaries never could, {name}: made me feel something."] = "药剂师办不到的，{name}，你办到了：让我有了感觉。"
L["A gift for the dead, {name}? Most people bring flowers. Then they run."] = "给死人送礼，{name}？别人都送花，然后拔腿就跑。"
L["Gratitude, {name}. Freshly exhumed, barely used."] = "谢意奉上，{name}。刚从土里刨出来，几乎没用过。"
L["That tingled, {name}. Either that was you, or something's nesting in me again."] = "有点麻，{name}。要么是你，要么又有东西在我身上做窝了。"
L["Bless you too, {name}. Not literally, please; the Light stings. Thank you."] = "也祝福你，{name}。别当真，圣光会烫人。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If anything of mine drops off, keep it. A little souvenir."] = "谢谢，{name}。我身上要是掉了什么，你留着。当个小纪念。"
L["Nicest spell cast on me since Arthas, {name}. Low bar, but you cleared it."] = "比阿尔萨斯那道法术强，{name}。门槛是低，但你过了。"
L["I'll have the apothecaries name a plague after you, {name}. A small one."] = "我会让药剂师以你命名一种瘟疫，{name}。小规模的。"
L["I'll rest easier now, {name}. Not in peace, mind. Just easier."] = "这下我能安心点了，{name}。安息就算了，安心点而已。"
L["Please don't tell the Dark Lady I was nice to somebody, {name}."] = "千万别告诉黑暗女王我对人好过，{name}。"
L["Here's {buff}, {name}. Fresh, unlike everything else about me."] = "给你{buff}，{name}。新鲜的，和我不一样。"
L["Kindness, {name}? I checked it for poison out of habit. It's clean. So is this."] = "好意啊，{name}？我习惯性验了毒，没问题。这个也干净。"
L["You've put a spring in my step, {name}. Possibly literally. Something's loose."] = "你让我走路都带弹簧了，{name}。真的，有东西松了。"
L["Death took my pulse, my looks and my sense of smell, {name}. Not my manners."] = "死亡夺走了我的脉搏、相貌和嗅觉，{name}。礼貌还在。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Somewhere in Brill, a ghoul is jealous of me right now."] = "谢啦，{name}。此刻布瑞尔有只食尸鬼正嫉妒我呢。"
L["I'd put you in my will, {name}, but it was read years ago."] = "本想把你写进遗嘱，{name}，可它几年前就宣读过了。"
L["That's going on my headstone, {name}. Under the bit that's already there."] = "这事我要刻在墓碑上，{name}。就刻在原来那段下面。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Don't mind the smell. It's not personal, it's posthumous."] = "谢谢，{name}。别介意这味道，不是针对你，是身后事。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Most people only cast on me to make me lie back down."] = "谢谢你，{name}。别人对我施法，大多是想让我躺回去。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll have Mordo stitch that in, so it can't fall out."] = "谢谢，{name}。我会让莫尔多把它缝牢，免得掉出来。"
L["Faranell will want to know how you did that, {name}. Don't tell him. Thank you."] = "法拉尼尔会想知道你是怎么做到的，{name}。别告诉他。谢谢。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. I'd offer you a seat, but mine came with a lid."] = "有心了，{name}。本想请你坐坐，可我的座位带盖子。"
L["Steadier hands than the man who sewed my arm on, {name}. Thank you."] = "手比给我缝胳膊的那位稳多了，{name}。谢谢。"
L["First time in years I've been improved without a needle, {name}. Thanks."] = "好些年没有不靠针线就变好了，{name}。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If I twitch, don't be alarmed. It means I'm pleased."] = "谢谢，{name}。我要是抽一下，别慌。说明我高兴。"
L["Gratitude, {name}, from what remains of me. Most of it. The important parts."] = "谢意，{name}，来自我剩下的部分。大部分。重要的那些。"
L["You'd make a fine apothecary, {name}. That's the worst I'll ever say of you."] = "你会是个好药剂师，{name}。这是我对你说过最坏的话。"
L["Tell nobody in Brill about this, {name}. I've a reputation for being dreadful."] = "别在布瑞尔声张，{name}。我可是出了名的吓人。"
L["Last one to look after me was a necromancer, {name}. You're much better at it."] = "上一个照料我的是个死灵法师，{name}。你比他强多了。"
L["People rarely put anything into a Forsaken, {name}. Usually it's a sword."] = "很少有人往被遗忘者身上放东西，{name}。通常是把剑。"
L["For that, {name}, I'll stop scowling a while. No promises; the face is set."] = "为这个，{name}，我暂时不板着脸了。不保证；这张脸定型了。"
L["I'd write you a note, {name}, but my writing hand's at the stitcher's."] = "想给你写张字条，{name}，可我写字的手还在裁缝那儿。"
L["Deathknell gave me a shovel and a grudge, {name}. You gave me something better."] = "丧钟镇给了我一把铲子和一肚子怨气，{name}。你给的更好。"
L["A credit to the living, {name}, thanked by the dead. Not fierce competition."] = "你是活人的骄傲，{name}，死人向你道谢。竞争不算激烈就是了。"
L["Into the ledger it goes, {name}. In ink this time, not the other stuff."] = "记进账本，{name}。这次用墨水，不用那种液体。"
L["The Dark Lady says nothing is free, {name}. She hasn't met you."] = "黑暗女王说世上没有免费的东西，{name}。她没见过你。"
L["I feel that in my bones, {name}. Mostly because they show."] = "我骨子里都感觉到了，{name}。主要是骨头露在外面。"
L["Mother said always repay a kindness, {name}. She's in Brill now. Under it."] = "母亲说受人恩惠必当回报，{name}。她现在在布瑞尔。地底下。"
L["Shadow I shrug off, {name}. Kindness gets right through. Thank you."] = "暗影从我身上滑开，{name}。善意却直透进来。谢谢。"
L["I can't feel much these days, {name}, so I'll take your word it was lovely."] = "如今我没什么感觉了，{name}，所以你说美妙，我就信。"
L["Nobody's wished me a long life in years, {name}. I've got one anyway. Thanks."] = "好些年没人祝我长寿了，{name}。反正我也死不了。谢谢。"
L["Cannibalize is for enemies, {name}. Friends get {buff}."] = "食尸是留给敌人的，{name}。朋友得到的是{buff}。"
L["The will of the Forsaken shrugs off every charm, {name}. Not yours, it seems."] = "亡灵意志能摆脱一切魅惑，{name}。看来你的除外。"
L["My jaw's wired on, {name}, so this thank-you smile is a feat of engineering."] = "我的下巴是铁丝绑着的，{name}，所以这道谢的笑可是工程奇迹。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Most of my old life went with the Plague. There's room for you."] = "谢谢，{name}。我从前的日子大半随瘟疫去了。给你留得出位置。"
L["That's put colour in my cheeks, {name}. Grey, mostly, but it's a start."] = "这让我脸上有了血色，{name}。主要是灰色，但总算有了。"
L["I'd send you flowers, {name}, but they wilt when I pick them up."] = "想送你花，{name}，可花一到我手里就枯了。"
L["The Scourge never once said thank you, {name}. So let me say it properly."] = "天灾军团从没说过一声谢谢，{name}。那就让我好好说一次。"
L["Kindness to the dead, {name}? The priests in Brill used to charge for that."] = "善待死者，{name}？布瑞尔的牧师以前可是要收钱的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Try not to die. It's overrated."] = "当然，{name}。尽量别死，死亡被高估了。"
L["You need only ask, {name}. The dead are patient."] = "开口就行，{name}。死人最有耐心。"
L["Ask the dead for a favour, {name}. We rarely have other plans."] = "有事尽管找亡者，{name}。我们一般没别的安排。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand clear; I'd hate to drop anything on you."] = "当然，{name}。站远点，我可不想有零件掉你身上。"
L["A moment, {name}. Rigor mortis is hard on the casting hand."] = "稍等，{name}。尸僵对施法的手不太友好。"
L["Nice to be asked for something, {name}, besides the way to the graveyard."] = "难得有人找我帮忙，{name}，而不是问墓地怎么走。"
L["Gladly, {name}. It takes my mind off the smell. Mine, I mean."] = "好，{name}。忙起来就闻不到那股味儿了。我身上的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still. My aim drifts when my eye does."] = "当然，{name}。别动。我眼珠一飘，准头也跟着飘。"
L["In Undercity nobody says please, {name}. Mostly they gurgle. Here you are."] = "在幽暗城没人说“请”，{name}。大多只会咕噜咕噜。给。"
L["Just {buff}, {name}? The apothecaries always want a sample too."] = "只要{buff}吗，{name}？换药剂师，还得顺手取个样。"
L["I always rise when called, {name}. Unfortunate history. Here you are."] = "随叫随起，{name}。当年诈尸落下的毛病。给。"
L["Anything for you, {name}. Within reason, and what's left of mine."] = "什么都行，{name}。在理智范围内——就我剩下那点理智。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'd say 'over my dead body', but that's been tried."] = "当然，{name}。本想说“除非从我尸体上踏过去”，可早有人踏过了。"
L["Right away, {name}. The dead don't dawdle. We shamble with purpose."] = "马上，{name}。死人从不磨蹭，我们蹒跚得很有目标。"
L["Of course, {name}. Free will is a gift. I spend mine on things like this."] = "当然，{name}。自由意志来之不易，我就花在这种事上。"
L["At once, {name}. I've had far worse requests from the Apothecarium."] = "马上，{name}。药剂师协会提过比这糟得多的要求。"
L["Of course, {name}. After a winter in the Plaguelands, this counts as a holiday."] = "当然，{name}。在瘟疫之地熬过一个冬天，这点活儿就算度假。"
L["{buff}, {name}? With the Dark Lady's compliments."] = "{buff}，{name}？黑暗女王向你致意。"
L["Of course, {name}. I don't sleep or eat, so I may as well be useful."] = "当然，{name}。我不睡也不吃，不如干点有用的。"
L["Glad to, {name}. The Scourge used my hands for worse."] = "乐意，{name}。天灾军团拿我这双手干过更糟的事。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The apothecaries taught me a steady hand. Mostly on rats."] = "当然，{name}。药剂师教会了我手要稳。主要拿老鼠练的。"
L["The Dark Lady said serve the Horde, {name}. She never said sulk about it."] = "黑暗女王说要效忠部落，{name}。她可没说要板着脸效忠。"
L["Right away, {name}. In Deathknell they woke me with far ruder requests."] = "马上，{name}。在丧钟镇，他们叫醒我时可粗鲁多了。"
L["Silverpine's worgen never ask this nicely, {name}. You're a pleasant change."] = "银松森林的狼人从不这么客气，{name}。你让人耳目一新。"
L["Of course, {name}. I've nothing on until the end of the world."] = "当然，{name}。世界末日之前我都没安排。"
L["Done, {name}. Quicker than the bat to the Sepulcher, and you keep your lunch."] = "好了，{name}。比飞往瑟伯切尔的蝙蝠还快，而且你不会吐。"
L["You had me at please, {name}. Or at 'oi, corpse'. Either works."] = "一句“请”就打动我了，{name}。或者一句“喂，死尸”。都行。"
L["Why not, {name}? It's that or stand here decomposing."] = "为什么不呢，{name}？要么帮你，要么站在这儿腐烂。"
L["Right away, {name}. I've stood here so long the moss had started to hope."] = "马上，{name}。我在这儿站得太久，青苔都开始抱希望了。"
L["With pleasure, {name}. Well. With what passes for it now."] = "乐意之至，{name}。嗯，用如今还算是乐意的那点东西。"
L["Here, {name}. I won't ask what it's for. The dead are discreet."] = "给，{name}。我不问用途。死人嘴严。"
L["Ask away, {name}. Death made me patient, and Undercity made me bored."] = "尽管开口，{name}。死亡让我有耐心，幽暗城让我很无聊。"
L["Done, {name}. Come back when it fades. I'm not going anywhere. Ever."] = "好了，{name}。消失了再来。我哪儿也不去。永远。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Better work than hauling ichor for Faranell."] = "当然，{name}。总比给法拉尼尔搬脓液强。"
L["Easiest thing I've done all week, {name}, and I dug myself out of a grave."] = "这是我这周干过最轻松的事，{name}，我可是自己从坟里刨出来的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Eternity's long; I can spare a moment of it."] = "当然，{name}。永恒很长，分你一刻不算什么。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Beats standing in the Ruins of Lordaeron looking haunted."] = "乐意，{name}。总比在洛丹伦废墟里阴森森地站着强。"
L["Ask a Forsaken, get an answer, {name}. Ask an apothecary, get a waiver."] = "问被遗忘者，得到答案，{name}。问药剂师，得到一份免责书。"
L["At your service, {name}. The Lich King never said please. You did."] = "为你效劳，{name}。巫妖王从不说请。你说了。"
L["Stay among the living a little longer, {name}."] = "在活人堆里多待一阵吧，{name}。"
L["Take this, {name}. The grave can wait."] = "拿着，{name}。坟墓可以再等等。"
L["I was a physician in Lordaeron, {name}. Old habits die harder than I did."] = "我在洛丹伦当过医生，{name}。老习惯比我还难死。"
L["No charge, {name}. The apothecaries would have made you sign something."] = "免费，{name}。换药剂师来，得先让你签个字。"
L["A gift from the grave, {name}. Don't worry, I washed it."] = "来自坟墓的礼物，{name}。放心，洗过了。"
L["I've seen where heroes end up, {name}. I live there. Take this."] = "我见过英雄们的归宿，{name}。我就住那儿。拿着。"
L["Take this, {name}. I learned the hard way you can't take it with you."] = "拿着，{name}。我用亲身经历学到：生不带来，死不带去。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only thing I own that isn't slightly damp."] = "拿着，{name}。我所有东西里，就它不潮。"
L["Hold on to yourself, {name}; this helps. The pieces are hard to find later."] = "把自己看牢，{name}；这个有帮助。零件掉了事后很难找。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Plaguelands are full of people who didn't."] = "拿着，{name}。瘟疫之地到处都是没拿的人。"
L["A small kindness, {name}. Tirisfal could use more of them."] = "一点小心意，{name}。提瑞斯法正缺这个。"
L["Tirisfal fog gets into everything, {name}. So does this, but pleasantly."] = "提瑞斯法的雾无孔不入，{name}。这个也是，不过舒服多了。"
L["Here, {name}. Kept cool for you, like everything I carry."] = "给，{name}。帮你冰镇过了，我带的东西都是冰的。"
L["I've outlived everyone I knew, {name}. I'd rather not outlive you. Take this."] = "认识的人我全熬走了，{name}。可不想再熬走你。拿着。"
L["Pardon me, {name}. I'm told I lurk. I'm trying to lurk helpfully."] = "打扰，{name}。听说我老爱鬼鬼祟祟，我尽量鬼祟得热心点。"
L["Out of my own pocket, {name}. The dead don't need much."] = "自掏腰包，{name}。死人用不了多少。"
L["I've already had the worst day there is, {name}. Let's spare you yours."] = "最糟的那一天我已经过过了，{name}。你的就免了吧。"
L["Wind's off the Plaguelands, {name}. Take this, and breathe through your mouth."] = "风从瘟疫之地吹来，{name}。拿着这个，用嘴呼吸。"
L["The crows have been watching you, {name}. Let's disappoint them."] = "乌鸦一直盯着你，{name}。咱们让它们失望一回。"
L["Here, {name}. Tirisfal grows nothing but pumpkins and grudges. This is neither."] = "给，{name}。提瑞斯法只长南瓜和怨恨。这个两样都不是。"
L["Take this, {name}. The only thing in Undercity that needn't be boiled first."] = "拿着，{name}。幽暗城里唯一不用先煮开的东西。"
L["Eternity is long, {name}, and I've spent a fair bit of it practising this."] = "永恒很漫长，{name}，我花了不少时间练这一手。"
L["For the road, {name}. Undercity-made, so do keep it away from open flame."] = "路上用，{name}。幽暗城出品，务必远离明火。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's odourless, which I'm told makes it my best feature."] = "拿着，{name}。它没味道，据说这让它成了我全身最大的优点。"
L["Forsaken are famously patient, {name}. I just couldn't wait to give you this."] = "被遗忘者出了名的有耐心，{name}。可这个我实在等不及要给你。"
L["No strings attached, {name}. I cut mine when the Lich King lost his grip."] = "白送，无牵无挂，{name}。巫妖王一松手，我的提线就剪了。"
L["Fresh from Tirisfal, {name}. Well, fresh for Tirisfal."] = "提瑞斯法新鲜直送，{name}。嗯，按提瑞斯法的标准算新鲜。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Bulwark taught me to look out for the living."] = "拿着，{name}。壁垒教会我照看活人。"
L["Passing Pyrewood, {name}? Take this. The village has a bad habit after dark."] = "路过焚木村，{name}？拿着。那村子天黑后有个坏毛病。"
L["The Scarlets would call this unholy, {name}. From me, they'd say it of bread."] = "血色十字军会说这不洁，{name}。我递的东西，面包他们也说不洁。"
L["Don't flinch, {name}. It's a spell, not a bite."] = "别躲，{name}。这是法术，不是咬你。"
L["Here, {name}. The Royal Apothecary Society had no hand in this one. Promise."] = "给，{name}。这次皇家药剂师协会没插手。保证。"
L["You look tired, {name}; from me, that's a professional opinion. So: this."] = "你看着累了，{name}；我说的可是专业意见。所以，给你这个。"
L["You looked a bit peaky, {name}. Then again, I'm a poor judge of colour."] = "你脸色有点差，{name}。不过我看颜色不太准。"
L["On the house, {name}. The house is a crypt, but it's paid off."] = "免费的，{name}。我家是座墓穴，但没欠债。"
L["Take this, {name}. Agamand Mills is full of folk who also had places to be."] = "拿着，{name}。阿加曼德磨坊里全是也曾有事要办的人。"
L["Bound for Tarren Mill, {name}? Take this. The Southshore lot throw things."] = "去塔伦米尔吗，{name}？拿着。南海镇那帮人爱扔东西。"
L["Living's a fragile hobby, {name}. Let's keep you at it."] = "活着是个脆弱的爱好，{name}。咱们让你继续下去。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd hate for us to end up neighbours."] = "拿着，{name}。我可不想咱俩做邻居。"
L["Every life I keep is one the Lich King doesn't get, {name}."] = "我保住的每条命，巫妖王都得不到，{name}。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's what we do instead of sleeping."] = "拿着，{name}。我们不睡觉，就干这个。"
L["Mind yourself, {name}, and take this. Not all Tirisfal's dead have my manners."] = "当心点，{name}，拿着这个。提瑞斯法的死人不全像我这么有礼。"
L["Stay warm, {name}. One of us ought to, and this should help."] = "暖和着点，{name}。咱俩总得有一个暖和，这个能帮忙。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Deathguard can't watch every road."] = "拿着，{name}。亡灵卫士守不住每条路。"
L["Don't mind me, {name}. Just a passing corpse doing a good turn."] = "别在意我，{name}。路过的尸体做件好事而已。"
L["It's free, {name}. The embalming afterwards is not, so do be careful."] = "这个免费，{name}。之后的防腐可不免费，所以小心点。"
L["A Forsaken's gift, {name}: cold, a little grim, and good for you."] = "被遗忘者的礼物，{name}：冰凉，有点阴森，对你有好处。"
L["Off to the Scarlet Monastery, {name}? Take this. They'll take the rest."] = "去血色修道院吗，{name}？拿着。剩下的他们会全拿走。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give you advice, but mine is mostly about digging."] = "拿着，{name}。想给你点建议，可我的建议大多是关于挖坑的。"
L["Don't mind the hand that gave you this, {name}. It's mine. Usually."] = "别在意给你这个的那只手，{name}。是我的。一般是。"
L["We Forsaken must look after each other, {name}."] = "我们被遗忘者得互相照应，{name}。"
L["Between us corpses, {name}, you're well preserved. This should keep you so."] = "咱们尸体之间说，{name}，你保存得挺好。这个让你保持下去。"
L["Lose a finger, {name}, and I've a spare. Forsaken share. Today, it's this."] = "丢了手指，{name}，我这儿有备用的。被遗忘者讲究分享。今天分这个。"
L["Is your jaw clicking too, {name}? Here; it won't help that, but it'll help."] = "你的下巴也咔咔响吗，{name}？拿着；治不了那个，但有用。"
L["A small victory for Sylvanas, {name}: one of hers, blessed. It's ours."] = "为希尔瓦娜斯赢下一场小胜，{name}：她的子民又得了祝福。这是咱们的。"
L["Brill or Deathknell, {name}? We all woke up somewhere. Now wake up to this."] = "布瑞尔还是丧钟镇，{name}？谁都在某处醒来。现在带着这个醒吧。"
L["When the Scourge calls, {name}, we won't be home. Or easy to take. Here."] = "天灾上门时，{name}，我们不会在家。也不好抓。拿着。"
L["The Bulwark holds, {name}, and so do we: held together, and held up by this."] = "壁垒守得住，{name}，我们也是：缝缝补补，现在还有这个撑着。"
L["Lordaeron raised us twice, {name}. Let me raise your spirits a third time."] = "洛丹伦让我们站起来过两回，{name}。第三回让我来提提你的精神。"
L["In Northrend, {name}, the Lich King is sulking about us. This won't help him."] = "在诺森德，{name}，巫妖王正为我们生闷气。这个可帮不了他。"
L["The Dark Lady needs us whole, {name}. This gets you near enough."] = "黑暗女王需要我们完完整整，{name}。有了这个，你差不多就完整了。"
L["You smell of Tirisfal, {name}. From us, a compliment. So is this."] = "你身上有提瑞斯法的味道，{name}。在我们这儿是夸奖。这个也是。"
L["We've forever, {name}. Take this; let's not spend it waiting for the lift."] = "我们有的是永恒，{name}。拿着；别全耗在等升降梯上。"
L["Forsaken to Forsaken, {name}: take this. The sewer shortcut is not a shortcut."] = "被遗忘者对被遗忘者，{name}：拿着。下水道捷径根本不是捷径。"
L["If the Deathguard ask, {name}, I was issuing supplies. This one's yours."] = "要是亡灵卫兵问起，{name}，就说我在发补给。这份是你的。"
L["Our kind don't get many kindnesses, {name}. Let's keep them in the family."] = "咱们这号人难得被善待，{name}。肥水不流外人田。"
L["Same grave dirt, same Dark Lady, {name}. That's family, and family gets this."] = "一样的坟土，一样的黑暗女王，{name}。这就是家人，家人有这个。"
L["Keep the faith, {name}. In each other, I mean. Here's mine, in you."] = "守住信念，{name}。我是说对彼此的信念。这是我对你的。"
L["The dead look after the dead, {name}. The living could learn a thing or two."] = "死人照顾死人，{name}。活人该学着点。"
L["We've both seen the inside of a grave, {name}. Dreadful service. Here's better."] = "咱俩都见识过坟墓里头，{name}。服务太差了。这个好些。"
L["Mordo did your stitches too, {name}? This should help them hold."] = "你也是莫尔多缝的，{name}？这个能让针脚更牢。"
L["Our time will come, {name}. We've nothing but time, so I'll spend some on you."] = "我们的时候会来的，{name}。我们有的只是时间，就花点在你身上。"
L["Recall the Lich King's voice, {name}? Mine's kinder, and it gives you this."] = "还记得巫妖王的声音吗，{name}？我的温和些，还送你这个。"
L["You kept your nose, {name}. Not all of us did. Keep the rest with this."] = "你的鼻子还在，{name}。不是人人都这么走运。剩下的就靠这个保住吧。"
L["We were all Lordaeron once, {name}. Some kept the accent. I kept the manners."] = "我们都曾是洛丹伦人，{name}。有人留了口音。我留了礼数。"
L["The living do try, {name}. Be kind to them, as I am to you. Here."] = "活人也在努力，{name}。对他们好些，就像我对你这样。拿着。"
L["Still got both eyes, {name}? Show-off. Take this anyway."] = "两只眼睛都还在，{name}？显摆。还是拿着吧。"
L["Did you call on your old family too, {name}? Mine took it badly. You get this."] = "你也去看过从前的家人吗，{name}？我家的反应可糟了。你拿这个。"
L["Take this; stay alive, {name}. Undercity's housing list is already very long."] = "拿着，活下去，{name}。幽暗城的住房排队名单已经很长了。"
L["That's for you, {name}. If I fall down, give it a minute. Old habit."] = "这是给你的，{name}。我要是倒了，等一会儿。老习惯。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll take the front. What's the worst that could happen? Again?"] = "拿着，{name}。我打头阵。最坏能怎样？再来一次？"
L["There you are, {name}. Now keep upwind of me. It's better for morale."] = "给你，{name}。现在站我上风口。对士气好。"
L["Last party I joined, {name}, I woke in a crypt. This is me improving on that."] = "上回入队，{name}，我是在墓穴里醒来的。这回我改进一下。"
L["Here, {name}. Anything that bites, point it at me. Nothing left worth eating."] = "拿着，{name}。会咬人的都冲我来。我身上没什么能吃的了。"
L["For you; heal the others first, {name}. I run on spite and embalming fluid."] = "给你的；先治别人，{name}。我靠怨气和防腐液运转。"
L["Take this, {name}. If it goes badly, don't worry. I've died before; it passes."] = "拿着，{name}。要是砸了，别担心。我死过；会过去的。"
L["Fought the Scourge from both sides, {name}. This side shares its blessings."] = "我在天灾两边都打过，{name}。这一边会分享祝福。"
L["Stay close, {name}; take this. I won't scream at the ghouls. Old neighbours."] = "待近点，{name}，拿着。我见了食尸鬼不会尖叫。老邻居了。"
L["I've walked the Plaguelands at night, {name}. With this, so can you."] = "我夜里走过瘟疫之地，{name}。有了这个，你也行。"
L["The corpse at the back blessed you, {name}. That's me. Please don't bury it."] = "后面那具尸体给你祝福了，{name}。就是我。请别埋了。"
L["Take this; stay together, {name}. Easier than putting somebody back together."] = "拿着，待在一起，{name}。总比把谁重新拼起来容易。"
L["Take this; don't wait for me, {name}. I shamble, but forever. I'll catch up."] = "拿着，别等我，{name}。我走得慢，可能走一辈子。会跟上的。"
L["Here, {name}. Keep the torches clear of me. I'm old, dry and very flammable."] = "拿着，{name}。火把离我远点。我又老又干，特别易燃。"
L["That keeps yours going, {name}. Don't check me for a pulse. It worries people."] = "这能让你的心继续跳，{name}。别摸我的脉。会吓着人。"
L["Take this, {name}; mind the green puddles. I've seen what they do. I'm it."] = "拿着，{name}；当心绿水坑。我见过它们的本事。我就是结果。"
L["Lordaeron fell with me in it, {name}. With this on you, today won't be worse."] = "洛丹伦陷落时我就在里头，{name}。你身上有了这个，今天不会更糟。"
L["Take this and stick together, {name}. The apothecaries pay well for strays."] = "拿着，待在一起，{name}。药剂师收流浪的出价很高。"
L["For you, {name}. If this ends underwater, don't mind me. Breathing's optional."] = "给你的，{name}。要是最后泡进水里，别管我。呼吸是可选项。"
L["The Dark Lady blesses no one, {name}. I've made an exception for this party."] = "黑暗女王谁也不祝福，{name}。这支队伍我破个例。"
L["When we win, {name}, drinks at the Gallows' End in Brill. This one's on me now."] = "赢了，{name}，去布瑞尔的旅店喝一杯。这个现在就算我请。"
L["That's from me, {name}, not the flies. They're with me, though."] = "这是我给的，{name}，不是苍蝇给的。不过它们跟着我。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll watch the rear. Nothing sneaks up on one who can't blink."] = "拿着，{name}。后方我来看。眨不了眼的人，谁也偷袭不了。"
L["Here, {name}. If I lose an arm in there, bring it out. I'm fond of it."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是在里头掉了条胳膊，帮我带出来。我舍不得它。"
L["That's yours, {name}. Leave the bodies to me afterwards. Waste not."] = "这是你的，{name}。完事后尸体交给我。别浪费。"
L["Take this and send them my way, {name}. I don't bleed. I come apart a little."] = "拿着，把它们引到我这儿，{name}。我不流血。只会掉点零件。"
L["Here, {name}. When they cast fear, look to me. I'll be the one not running."] = "拿着，{name}。他们放恐惧时，看我。不跑的那个就是我。"
L["Take this, {name}, and mind the abominations. Distant cousins. We don't speak."] = "拿着，{name}，当心憎恶。远房亲戚。我们不来往。"
L["That's for your legs, {name}. If I walk oddly, it's fine. It's a new leg."] = "这是给你腿脚用的，{name}。我走路怪，没事。是条新腿。"
L["Here; shout if you need more, {name}. My ears are mostly where I left them."] = "拿着；还要就喊，{name}。我的耳朵大体还在原处。"
L["Take this so we don't wipe, {name}. If we do, I know the spirit healer."] = "拿着，免得团灭，{name}。真灭了，我跟灵魂医者是熟人。"
L["Don't fret the odds, {name}. Lordaeron's army had better ones. You have this."] = "别担心胜算，{name}。洛丹伦的军队胜算更大呢。你有这个。"
L["Good party, {name}. Five of us, all blessed, and only one needs embalming."] = "好队伍，{name}。五个人都受了祝福，只有一个需要防腐。"
L["There, {name}. Now watch my back. Some of the stitching there is very old."] = "好了，{name}。现在帮我看着后背。那儿有些针脚很老了。"
L["Here, {name}. Should I fall, no hurry raising me. I could use the lie-down."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是倒了，不急着复活我。正好躺躺。"
L["The dead keep terrible hours, {name}. Nice to have someone to give this to."] = "死人作息糟透了，{name}。难得有人可以送这个。"
L["Midnight, {name}: the best hour to be up. Have this, and stay up with me."] = "午夜，{name}：醒着的最好时辰。拿着这个，陪我熬着。"
L["The living are all asleep, {name}. We Forsaken call this the quiet shift. Here."] = "活人都睡了，{name}。我们被遗忘者管这叫清静班。拿着。"
L["Late, {name}? In Undercity, this is lunchtime. Have some."] = "晚了，{name}？在幽暗城这会儿是午饭时间。来一点。"
L["The Scourge used to walk at this hour, {name}. Now it's ours, and so is this."] = "这个时辰过去是天灾横行的时候，{name}。现在归我们了，这个也是。"
L["Night, {name}. Nobody can tell I'm pale. Or that I'm kind. Take this."] = "夜里，{name}。谁也看不出我脸色发白。也看不出我心好。拿着。"
L["Dark as the Undercity, {name}. Proper lighting. Here's a little glow for you."] = "跟幽暗城一样黑，{name}。这才叫照明。给你一点微光。"
L["Fog, moonlight, mildew, {name}: Tirisfal weather. This keeps the damp out."] = "雾、月光、霉味，{name}：提瑞斯法的天气。这个能挡潮气。"
L["The banshees start singing now, {name}. Take this; they're only practising."] = "女妖们这时候开始唱了，{name}。拿着；她们只是在排练。"
L["Stars over Tirisfal, {name}: the one thing up there that never rotted. Here."] = "提瑞斯法上空的星星，{name}：天上唯一没烂掉的东西。拿着。"
L["Past midnight, {name}. The graveyards are quiet. Take this; stay out of them."] = "过了午夜，{name}。墓地都安静了。拿着这个，离墓地远点。"
L["An owl saw me and left, {name}. Sensible bird. You stayed, so this is yours."] = "一只猫头鹰看见我就飞走了，{name}。聪明的鸟。你留下了，这个归你。"
L["Moonlight suits us, {name}. It hides the stitching. This hides the rest."] = "月光衬我们，{name}。能遮住针脚。剩下的这个来遮。"
L["Don't stay up for me, {name}. I gave up sleep years ago. Take this and rest."] = "别为我熬夜，{name}。我多年前就不睡了。拿着这个，去歇着。"
L["Long night, {name}? Mine's been going since the Plague. This helps with yours."] = "长夜漫漫，{name}？我的从瘟疫起就没结束过。这个能帮你熬过你的。"
L["Night in Tirisfal, {name}. Even the bats keep their voices down. Here, quietly."] = "提瑞斯法的夜，{name}。连蝙蝠都压低了声音。悄悄拿着。"
L["The banshees call this the witching hour, {name}. Here's some witchery."] = "女妖们管这叫巫魔时刻，{name}。给你施点巫术。"
L["Morning, {name}? I've been up all night, and all of last decade. Have this."] = "天亮了，{name}？我熬了一整夜。还有整整十年。拿着。"
L["The sun's up, {name}. Take this; I'll stand in the shade. Things peel."] = "太阳出来了，{name}。拿着；我站阴凉处去。会掉皮的。"
L["Early start, {name}. I miss yawning. Have this and do one for me."] = "起得早，{name}。我想念打哈欠。拿着这个，替我打一个。"
L["Sunrise, {name}. My least favourite colour. This is my favourite gift."] = "日出了，{name}。我最不喜欢的颜色。这是我最喜欢的礼物。"
L["Dawn over Tirisfal, {name}: grey, then less grey. This adds a little colour."] = "提瑞斯法的黎明，{name}：灰，然后没那么灰。这个添点颜色。"
L["Morning, {name}. The Gallows' End porridge moved again. Have this instead."] = "早，{name}。布瑞尔旅店的粥又自己动了。还是拿这个吧。"
L["The roosters in Brill still crow, {name}. Nobody's told them. Here's a wake-up."] = "布瑞尔的公鸡还在打鸣，{name}。没人告诉它们。给你提提神。"
L["Morning, {name}. The Deathguard just turn round to change shifts. I give this."] = "早，{name}。亡灵卫兵转个身就算换班了。我呢，发这个。"
L["Morning, {name}. I don't wake up now; I stop lying down. Then I hand out this."] = "早，{name}。我现在不醒了，只是不躺了。然后发这个。"
L["Mornings were the worst of being alive, {name}. This should make yours better."] = "活着那会儿，早上最难熬，{name}。这个能让你的早上好过点。"
L["The early bird gets the worm, {name}. The early Forsaken gets you this."] = "早起的鸟儿有虫吃，{name}。早起的被遗忘者给你带来这个。"
L["Breakfast, {name}? I'll pass; my appetite went with my insides. Have this."] = "早饭，{name}？我免了；胃口跟内脏一起没了。你拿这个。"
L["Up with the sun, {name}? I'm up with everything. Take this while I am."] = "跟太阳一起起床，{name}？我跟什么都一起醒着。趁我醒着拿着。"
L["Take this before the lift, {name}. The last man who rushed it is still falling."] = "坐升降梯前先拿着，{name}。上一个心急的还在往下掉呢。"
L["Undercity has it all, {name}: a bank, an inn, and this, free. Mind the sewers."] = "幽暗城应有尽有，{name}：银行、旅店，还有这个，免费。当心下水道。"
L["Even the rats bow to the Dark Lady here, {name}. Take this before one asks."] = "在这儿连老鼠都向黑暗女王鞠躬，{name}。拿着，别等老鼠来讨。"
L["Take this; mind the canal, {name}. It's green for a reason, and it isn't moss."] = "拿着；当心水渠，{name}。它绿是有原因的，不是青苔。"
L["Undercity's lovely this time of year, {name}. It's always this time. Here."] = "幽暗城这个季节可美了，{name}。一年到头都是这个季节。拿着。"
L["We moved into Lordaeron's cellar, {name}, kept the good silver, and share this."] = "我们搬进了洛丹伦的地窖，{name}，留下了好银器，也分享这个。"
L["The Royal Quarter's that way, {name}. Take this; the banshees keep score."] = "皇家区在那边，{name}。拿着这个；女妖会打分。"
L["The bat handler swears they're friendly, {name}. Take this before you test it."] = "蝙蝠管理员发誓它们很友善，{name}。亲自验证前，先拿着这个。"
L["Magic Quarter's that way, {name}. Take this; don't drink the glowing puddles."] = "魔法区在那边，{name}。拿着这个；别喝发光的水坑。"
L["The throne room's upstairs, {name}. Nobody sits in it. Take this instead."] = "王座厅就在楼上，{name}。没人坐那儿。拿这个吧。"
L["The Apothecarium's that way, {name}. Take this; don't touch, sniff or sign."] = "药剂师协会在那边，{name}。拿着这个；别碰，别闻，别签字。"
L["Rogues' Quarter's through there, {name}. Take this; count your fingers after."] = "盗贼区从那儿进去，{name}。拿着这个；出来记得数数手指。"
L["Varimathras stands by the Dark Lady, {name}. Take this; never turn your back."] = "瓦里玛萨斯站在黑暗女王身边，{name}。拿着这个；永远别背对他。"
L["The War Quarter's that way, {name}. Here, so you arrive as cheerful as it is."] = "战争区在那边，{name}。拿着，好让你跟那儿一样欢快地到场。"
L["Trade Quarter's round the ring, {name}. It's all second-hand. This isn't."] = "商业区沿着环形走一圈，{name}。全是二手货。这个不是。"
L["Most folk greet a Forsaken with holy water, {name}. You're a welcome change."] = "见了被遗忘者，多数人先泼圣水，{name}。你真叫人耳目一新。"
L["Few stop for a Forsaken, {name}. You did, and I noticed. Thank you."] = "很少有人为被遗忘者停步，{name}。你停了，我记下了。谢谢。"
L["Warm, generous and alive, {name}. I can only match you on one. Here it is."] = "又暖、又大方、还活着，{name}。我只能比一样，给你。"
L["You came near enough to cast, {name}. Most of the living won't. Thank you."] = "你靠得够近，能施法，{name}。大多数活人可不肯。谢谢。"
L["Kind to a Forsaken, {name}? They'll talk about you in Orgrimmar."] = "善待被遗忘者，{name}？奥格瑞玛的人会议论你的。"
L["Contrary to rumour, {name}, not everything a Forsaken hands out is a plague."] = "谣言归谣言，{name}，被遗忘者送出的东西，不全是瘟疫。"
L["Forsaken can't be charmed, {name}, they say. Asking nicely works, though."] = "都说被遗忘者不受魅惑，{name}。不过好好说话还是管用的。"
L["You asked a Forsaken for help, {name}. Somewhere, a paladin just fainted."] = "你向被遗忘者求助，{name}。某处有个圣骑士刚晕过去。"
L["Take this instead of small talk, {name}. Mine tends to unsettle people."] = "拿这个代替寒暄吧，{name}。我一寒暄，别人就发毛。"
L["They say the Forsaken have no friends, {name}. I'm recruiting. Signing gift."] = "都说被遗忘者没有朋友，{name}。我正在招人。这是入伙礼。"
L["Take this, {name}. If anyone asks, the Forsaken were perfectly charming."] = "拿着，{name}。有人问起，就说被遗忘者可讨人喜欢了。"
L["Take this; stay alive, {name}. I've tried the alternative. Can't recommend it."] = "拿着，活下去，{name}。另一条路我试过。不推荐。"
L["I don't bite, {name}. I bless. Not the living, usually. You're an exception."] = "我不咬人，{name}。我祝福。活人一般不祝福。你是例外。"
L["Yes, {name}, I'm dead. No, it isn't catching. Here."] = "对，{name}，我死了。不，不传染。给。"
L["You don't mind the smell, {name}. That's why we get on."] = "你不嫌这股味儿，{name}。所以咱俩合得来。"
L["Of all the living, {name}, you're the only one I trust."] = "所有活物里，{name}，我只信你。"
L["Stay close, {name}. The dead keep poor company, but you don't."] = "靠近点，{name}。死人都是无趣的伴，你不是。"
L["Well done, {name}. Death itself stepped aside for you."] = "干得好，{name}。连死亡都给你让了路。"
L["Excellent, {name}. The Dark Lady would approve."] = "好极了，{name}。女王陛下会赞许的。"
L["Ha. Vicious, {name}. You'd make a fine Deathstalker."] = "哈。真凶，{name}。你能当个好死亡猎手。"
L["Still breathing, {name}? Good. Stay that way, for me."] = "还有气吗，{name}？好。为了我，撑住。"
L["Easy, {name}. One of us dying was enough. Rest."] = "别急，{name}。我们里死过一个就够了。歇吧。"
L["There, {name}. I've no warmth to give, but I'm here."] = "好了，{name}。我没有温度可给，但我在这儿。"
L["The Earth Mother saw your kindness, {name}. She nudged me. Quite hard."] = "大地母亲看见了你的善意，{name}。她推了我一把。挺用力的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. May the winds guide you."] = "谢谢你，{name}。愿风指引你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'm deeply moved, and it takes a lot to move a tauren."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我很感动。要让牛头人动一动，可不容易。"
L["It's a long way up to a tauren's heart, {name}. You found it."] = "牛头人的心长得老高，{name}。你还是找到了。"
L["I felt that from horn to hoof, {name}. Returned, hoof to horn."] = "从角到蹄都感受到了，{name}。回敬你，从蹄到角。"
L["A gift given is a seed planted, {name}. Here is the harvest."] = "送出的礼物是播下的种子，{name}。这是收成。"
L["That deserves a feast, {name}. The feast can wait; {buff} can't."] = "这值得摆一桌宴席，{name}。宴席可以等，{buff}不能等。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Should you ever need a wall to hide behind, I'm free."] = "谢谢你，{name}。哪天需要一堵墙躲着，我有空。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My grandmother said kindness comes back on the wind."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我祖母说，善意会随风回来。"
L["Returned faster than a wind rider, {name}, and with much less screeching."] = "比双足飞龙还快地还你，{name}，还少了一路尖叫。"
L["Returned, {name}. The quilboar never learned to give back, and look at them."] = "还你，{name}。野猪人从没学会回礼，你看看他们。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My ancestors are all nodding. It's a great deal of nodding."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我的祖先们都在点头。点得可多了。"
L["In Mulgore we return a gift before the grass under it grows back, {name}."] = "在莫高雷，收了礼要赶在底下的草长回来前回礼，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll name my next kodo calf after you. They're lovely."] = "谢谢你，{name}。下一头小科多兽就叫你的名字。它们可爱着呢。"
L["Kindness is rarer than shade in the Barrens, {name}. Here's some back."] = "善意比贫瘠之地的树荫还稀罕，{name}。还你一些。"
L["I'll carve this on a totem, {name}. Tauren carve slowly; expect it by spring."] = "我要把这事刻上图腾，{name}。牛头人刻得慢，开春见。"
L["Bloodhoof Village will hear of this at supper, {name}. Thank you."] = "血蹄村晚饭时就会听说这事，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Cairne taught us to honour every kindness, {name}, and so I do."] = "凯恩教导我们珍视每一份善意，{name}，我也一直这么做。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Hamuul says the land repays those who tend it. So do I."] = "谢谢你，{name}。哈缪尔说，大地会回报照料它的人。我也会。"
L["In Thunder Bluff we'd beat a drum for that, {name}. Imagine it. Thank you."] = "在雷霆崖，我们会为此击鼓，{name}。想象一下吧。谢谢你。"
L["The Earth Mother gives without counting, {name}. You've been listening to her."] = "大地母亲给予从不计数，{name}。你一直在聆听她。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My heart's as full as a kodo after the spring grass."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我的心满得像啃完春草的科多兽。"
L["The elders on Elder Rise would approve, {name}. Slowly, after a long talk."] = "长者高地的长老们会赞许的，{name}。慢慢地，在一番长谈之后。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If you pass through Mulgore, ask for me. The big one."] = "谢谢你，{name}。路过莫高雷就找我。最大个的那个。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand tall and be at peace. I'll handle the tall part."] = "当然，{name}。昂首站立，心平气和。高的部分交给我。"
L["Ask and it is given, {name}. The herd shares what it has."] = "有求必予，{name}。族人有福同享。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand back a pace; I do this with my whole body."] = "当然，{name}。退后一步，我施法用的是全身。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Mind the tail."] = "乐意之至，{name}。当心尾巴。"
L["The Earth Mother gives freely, {name}, and so do her largest children."] = "大地母亲慷慨给予，{name}，她个头最大的孩子们也是。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Tauren are slow to anger and quick to help."] = "乐意之至，{name}。牛头人发火慢，帮忙快。"
L["Refuse you, {name}? My ancestors would never let me hear the end of it."] = "拒绝你，{name}？祖先们会念叨我一辈子。"
L["Of course, {name}. A tauren says yes the way the plains grow grass: easily."] = "当然，{name}。牛头人说“好”，就像草原长草：毫不费力。"
L["Of course, {name}. One moment; my hands are big and the spell is small."] = "当然，{name}。稍等，我手大，法术小。"
L["After a season herding kodo, {name}, a polite request is a holiday. Here."] = "赶了一季科多兽，{name}，有人客气地请求，简直像过节。给。"
L["The Earth Mother says share, {name}. My stomach says lunch. She outranks it."] = "大地母亲说要分享，{name}。我的肚子说要吃午饭。她说了算。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand still as a totem; this won't take long."] = "当然，{name}。像图腾一样站好，很快就好。"
L["Spirits of the plains, lend me your strength. Here, {name}."] = "草原之灵啊，借我力量。给，{name}。"
L["Magatha would want a favour for it, {name}. Baine would just say yes. So: yes."] = "换玛加萨，得让你欠个人情，{name}。贝恩会直接答应。所以：好。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I've practised on kodo, and they're far less polite."] = "别动，{name}。我在科多兽身上练过，它们可没你这么有礼貌。"
L["Of course, {name}. A shu'halo never refuses a traveller. Or a second helping."] = "当然，{name}。牛头人从不拒绝旅人。也不拒绝再来一碗。"
L["Of course, {name}. The plains taught me patience; the kodo taught me to share."] = "当然，{name}。草原教会我耐心，科多兽教会我分享。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Ancestors, steady my hand. Not my hooves; they're fine."] = "乐意，{name}。先祖啊，稳住我的手。蹄子就不用了，它们挺好。"
L["Always, {name}. Cairne never refuses a friend, and he's taller than me."] = "随时，{name}。凯恩从不拒绝朋友，他可比我还高。"
L["Ask anything, {name}. A tauren has strength to spare and time to listen."] = "尽管开口，{name}。牛头人有用不完的力气，也有听你说话的时间。"
L["Take this, {name}, and walk with the Earth Mother. You can't get lost."] = "拿着，{name}，与大地母亲同行。你不会迷路的。"
L["May An'she light your path, {name}, and this go with you."] = "愿安塞照亮你的道路，{name}，也愿这个与你同行。"
L["You looked like you could use a friend, {name}. I'm a very big one."] = "你看着像需要个朋友，{name}。我是特大号的。"
L["Take this, {name}. The Earth Mother would scold me if I walked past."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我就这么走过去，大地母亲会骂我的。"
L["Tread lightly, {name}, and take this. From someone who never has."] = "脚步放轻，{name}，拿着这个。说这话的人从没轻过。"
L["The wind said you'd pass, {name}, so I had this ready. Terrible gossip."] = "风说你会路过，{name}，所以我把这个备好了。风是个大嘴巴。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd lend you my kodo too, but he's less generous than me."] = "拿着，{name}。本想把科多兽也借你，可它没我大方。"
L["The shu'halo say carry what you can for others, {name}. I can carry a lot."] = "牛头人说，能替别人扛多少就扛多少，{name}。我能扛很多。"
L["Take this, {name}. If the centaur trouble you, say Thunder Bluff sends regards."] = "拿着，{name}。半人马找你麻烦，就说雷霆崖向他们问好。"
L["Here, {name}. Plainstriders run from me for no reason at all. You needn't."] = "给，{name}。陆行鸟见我就跑，莫名其妙。你不用跑。"
L["For you, {name}. Visit Mulgore sometime. The grass is soft and nobody hurries."] = "给你，{name}。有空来莫高雷，草软软的，没人赶时间。"
L["Here, {name}. Grandmother blessed travellers and fed them. I'm out of bread."] = "给，{name}。奶奶总为旅人祝福，还管饭。我面包吃完了。"
L["The spirits asked me to mind you, {name}. I said yes before they'd finished."] = "众灵让我照看你，{name}。话没说完我就答应了。"
L["Here, {name}. Kodo share the watering hole; I can share this."] = "给，{name}。科多兽都共用水塘，我也能分你这个。"
L["Here, {name}. Tauren leave the world a little better, and a little trampled."] = "给，{name}。牛头人走过，世界会好一点，也会被踩平一点。"
L["The Earth Mother would offer you a nap, {name}. I offer this."] = "大地母亲会让你睡个午觉，{name}。我给你这个。"
L["Druids call it a blessing, hunters luck, {name}. Tauren call it manners."] = "德鲁伊叫它祝福，猎人叫它运气，{name}。牛头人叫它礼数。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a harpy screeches at you, screech back. They hate that."] = "拿着，{name}。鹰身人冲你尖叫，你就叫回去。它们最烦这个。"
L["Here, {name}. A tauren blessing: sturdy, slow to fade, smells faintly of sage."] = "给，{name}。牛头人的祝福：结实、耐久，还带点鼠尾草香。"
L["Here, {name}. The Venture Company would charge you for this. I won't."] = "给，{name}。风险投资公司会为这个收你钱。我不会。"
L["From the high mesas of Thunder Bluff, {name}, where even the wind is friendly."] = "来自雷霆崖的高台，{name}，那儿连风都友善。"
L["The ancestors watch the roads, {name}. I just help them out a little."] = "先祖守望着道路，{name}。我只是帮他们一点小忙。"
L["A gift should be heavy with meaning and light to carry, {name}. This is both."] = "礼物应当意义重、分量轻，{name}。这个两样都占。"
L["The Earth Mother made the world wide so I'd meet folk like you, {name}. Here."] = "大地母亲把世界造得这么大，就是让我遇见你这样的人，{name}。拿着。"
L["Hunt with respect and the land feeds you, {name}. That's my wisdom. Here."] = "怀着敬意狩猎，大地便会养你，{name}。这是我的智慧。给。"
L["Here, {name}. Not every tauren would share. The Grimtotem certainly wouldn't."] = "给，{name}。不是每个牛头人都肯分享。恐怖图腾就绝对不会。"
L["The Earth Mother watches over us both, {name}. Today I'll help her."] = "大地母亲看护着我们俩，{name}。今天我来帮她一把。"
L["Somebody warn the doorframes, {name}. Two of us, and now you're even sturdier."] = "谁去提醒一下门框，{name}。我们来了俩，你现在还更结实了。"
L["Plains or peaks, {name}, a shu'halo heart is a big one. Here's some of mine."] = "平原也好山巅也罢，{name}，修哈洛的心都很大。分你一点我的。"
L["Horns and helmets, {name}. Only another tauren knows the pain. This eases it."] = "角和头盔，{name}。这份痛只有牛头人懂。这个能缓一缓。"
L["Rain on fur takes a week to dry, {name}. This keeps you warm meanwhile."] = "毛淋了雨要一周才干，{name}。这期间这个能给你保暖。"
L["Between tauren, {name}: the lifts were built by somebody smaller. Here."] = "牛头人之间说，{name}：升降梯是个子小的人造的。拿着。"
L["Our ancestors watch us both, {name}. Let them see me share this with you."] = "先祖们看着我们俩，{name}。让他们看见我跟你分享这个。"
L["From Mulgore to Feralas, {name}, the herd finds itself, and looks after itself."] = "从莫高雷到菲拉斯，{name}，族群总会相聚，也会互相照应。"
L["Take this, {name}, and get behind me. There's room for the whole party."] = "拿着，{name}，站我后面。整支队伍都站得下。"
L["The herd moves together, {name}, blessed. Mind my hooves; the herd has learned."] = "族群同进同退，{name}，带着祝福。当心我的蹄子；族群都学会了。"
L["Low ceilings ahead, {name}? I'll be the first to find out. Take this."] = "前面天花板低，{name}？我会第一个知道。拿着。"
L["Here, {name}. I'm slow to anger, but I hold a grudge for the whole party."] = "拿着，{name}。我不轻易发火，但我替全队记仇。"
L["Take this, {name}. Need a wall to hide behind? I'm most of one. Come on."] = "拿着，{name}。需要堵墙躲吗？我差不多就是一堵。过来。"
L["That'll steady you, {name}. When I war stomp, everybody sit down anyway."] = "这能让你站稳，{name}。我用战争践踏时，大家还是坐下吧。"
L["Everyone fed? Everyone blessed? Good, {name}. Tauren never lead a hungry herd."] = "都吃饱了？都祝福过了？好，{name}。牛头人从不带饿肚子的族群。"
L["That'll keep you warm, {name}. Tauren wade. If it's deep, you're riding on me."] = "这能保暖，{name}。牛头人蹚水过河。水深的话你骑我身上。"
L["Take this and stay close, {name}. My ancestors walk with us, more quietly."] = "拿着，待近点，{name}。我的先祖与我们同行，安静得多。"
L["Here, {name}. If I fall, don't try to carry me. Drag me. Fondly."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是倒了，别想扛我。拖着走。温柔点。"
L["We move like a stampede, {name}, blessed together. Sorry about the flowers."] = "我们像兽群奔腾一样前进，{name}，一起受了祝福。对不住那些花了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Nobody walks alone at the rear; I'll be there, looming."] = "拿着，{name}。队尾没人落单；我会在那儿，高高耸着。"
L["There, {name}. Say when to charge. Tauren are slow to start, slower to stop."] = "好了，{name}。冲锋时说一声。牛头人起步慢，刹车更慢。"
L["Take this; nobody wander, {name}. The last who did in the Barrens still is."] = "拿着；谁都别乱走，{name}。上一个在贫瘠之地乱走的，还在走呢。"
L["Here, {name}. A herd is strongest when nobody wanders off to graze."] = "拿着，{name}。没人跑去吃草时，族群最强。"
L["Here, {name}; watch the ground. Quilboar dig traps; I find them hoof first."] = "拿着，{name}；看着地面。野猪人挖陷阱，我都是用蹄子先踩到的。"
L["Into the fight with a calm heart and this, {name}. The rage can come later."] = "带着平静的心和这个去战斗，{name}。怒火可以晚点来。"
L["May the Earth Mother keep this herd, {name}. I've done my part."] = "愿大地母亲护佑这群人，{name}。我这份已经尽了。"
L["An'she rises, {name}, and so do we, with this. Slower, in my case."] = "安塞升起了，{name}，我们也带着这个起来。我慢一点。"
L["The sun is An'she's eye, {name}. He's watching, so let's look generous."] = "太阳是安塞的眼睛，{name}。他在看着，咱们表现得慷慨点。"
L["Morning, {name}. The kodo are up, the grass is wet, and this is yours."] = "早，{name}。科多兽醒了，草上有露水，这个是你的。"
L["I've greeted the sun, the wind, two plainstriders, {name}. Now you, with this."] = "我已经跟太阳、风和两只平原陆行鸟问过好了，{name}。现在轮到你，送你这个。"
L["Dew on the grass, dew on my fur, {name}. This will dry you out from inside."] = "草上有露水，我毛上也有，{name}。这个能从里面把你烘干。"
L["Early, {name}. That mist over Mulgore? Kodo breath. Here's a cleaner one."] = "早，{name}。莫高雷上的那层雾？是科多兽的哈气。给你点干净的。"
L["Mu'sha keeps the night watch, {name}. I'll keep an eye on you too. Here."] = "穆莎守着夜，{name}。我也会看着你。拿着。"
L["The moon's out, {name}. Mu'sha sees you and approves of this. I asked."] = "月亮出来了，{name}。穆莎看着你，同意了这个。我问过了。"
L["Late, {name}. The kodo are asleep, and they snore like thunder. Take this."] = "夜深了，{name}。科多兽睡着了，打呼噜像打雷。拿着。"
L["Stars out, {name}. Each one's an ancestor. That one's winking at your blessing."] = "星星出来了，{name}。每颗都是一位先祖。那颗正冲你的祝福眨眼。"
L["Mulgore is so quiet at night you hear the grass argue, {name}. Here, quietly."] = "莫高雷的夜静得能听见草在拌嘴，{name}。悄悄拿着。"
L["Quiet now, {name}. At this hour, even my hooves tiptoe. And give gifts."] = "安静点，{name}。这个时辰连我的蹄子都踮着走。还会送礼。"
L["The Earth Mother made you well, {name}. Walk with me."] = "大地母亲把你造得真好，{name}。陪我走走。"
L["Peace, {name}. The winds of Mulgore are gentle today."] = "安宁，{name}。今天莫高雷的风很温和。"
L["You and I were meant to share this road, {name}."] = "你我注定要同走这条路，{name}。"
L["Well done, {name}! The Earth Mother watches you with pride."] = "干得好，{name}！大地母亲骄傲地看着你。"
L["Mighty, {name}. Your strength honors the ancestors."] = "威猛，{name}。你的力量为先祖增光。"
L["That was a great hunt, {name}. The plains will sing of it."] = "这是一场了不起的狩猎，{name}。草原会为它歌唱。"
L["Rest, {name}. The Earth Mother will heal what I cannot."] = "歇吧，{name}。我治不好的，大地母亲会治好。"
L["Be calm, {name}. The ancestors watch over you, and so do I."] = "冷静，{name}。先祖在看护你，我也是。"
L["Slowly, {name}. Breathe with the land. You are safe now."] = "慢慢来，{name}。随大地呼吸。你安全了。"
L["Ya too kind, {name}! This one's from me."] = "你太客气了，{name}！这个是我送的。"
L["Thanks, mon! Da spirits smile on ya, {name}."] = "谢啦，伙计！众灵在冲你笑呢，{name}。"
L["Ya gave me good mojo, {name}. Now ya get some back, extra spicy."] = "你给了我好巫毒，{name}。现在还你一份，加辣的。"
L["Death's gonna be real disappointed, {name}. Thanks, mon."] = "死神这下要失望透了，{name}。谢啦，伙计。"
L["Fine work, {name}. Almost as fine as me. Almost."] = "干得漂亮，{name}。差不多跟我一样漂亮。差不多。"
L["A troll can grow back a hand, {name}. Can't grow back honour. Here."] = "巨魔的手能再长，{name}。荣誉可长不回来。给。"
L["Ya just made a troll smile, {name}, and we got a lot of teeth."] = "你让巨魔笑了，{name}，我们的牙可多着呢。"
L["Da loa keep a tally, {name}. You're on the good side of it."] = "洛阿都记着账，{name}。你在好的那一栏。"
L["Beat me to it, {name}! Darkspear hate bein' second. Now we're even."] = "被你抢先了，{name}！暗矛最恨当第二。这下扯平了。"
L["I owe ya now, {name}, and trolls only like owin' da loa. Settled."] = "这下我欠你了，{name}，巨魔只乐意欠洛阿的。还清！"
L["I'll tell all of Sen'jin 'bout ya, {name}. Makes a change from crabs."] = "我要跟全森金村讲你的事，{name}。总比天天聊螃蟹强。"
L["My hair just stood up taller, {name}. Didn't know it could. Thanks, mon."] = "我头发又竖高了一截，{name}。原来还能更高。谢啦，伙计。"
L["The spirits say give it back, {name}. They nag, but they're right."] = "众灵说“还回去”，{name}。它们是唠叨，可说得对。"
L["Mojo for mojo, {name}: oldest trade in the jungle."] = "巫毒换巫毒，{name}：丛林里最古老的买卖。"
L["Vol'jin said repay kindness quick, {name}. He said a lot. Dat one stuck."] = "沃金说受了好处要快还，{name}。他说过很多话，这句我记住了。"
L["That deserves a dance, {name}. Lucky ya: {buff} instead."] = "这值得跳支舞，{name}。你走运：改给你{buff}。"
L["Jungle rule, {name}: what ya give comes back, often with teeth. Not this one."] = "丛林规矩，{name}：送出去的总会回来，常常还带着牙。这个不带。"
L["A gift for a troll, {name}? We never forget a kindness."] = "给巨魔送礼，{name}？我们从不忘记别人的好。"
L["Old Sen'jin said a gift is a promise, {name}. I keep mine. Here."] = "老森金说过，礼物就是承诺，{name}。我说话算数。给。"
L["Back on the Echo Isles that earned a feast, {name}. Here's the short version."] = "在回音群岛，这够摆一场宴席了，{name}。这是简装版。"
L["That one's goin' in the stories by the fire, {name}. Ya get a good part."] = "这段要写进篝火边的故事里，{name}。给你安排个好角色。"
L["Nice, {name}. Darkspear pay back quick. We got places to be. Mostly the beach."] = "不错，{name}。暗矛还得快，我们还有地方要去。主要是海滩。"
L["Stranglethorn gives nothin' for free, {name}. Nice to see somebody does."] = "荆棘谷从不白给东西，{name}。总算有人白给了。"
L["Zalazane would've kept that for himself, {name}. Good thing ya ain't him."] = "换扎拉赞恩，早自己留着了，{name}。幸好你不是他。"
L["Sure thing, {name}. Hold still; mojo hates a movin' target."] = "没问题，{name}。别动，巫毒最讨厌移动靶。"
L["No trouble, {name}. Da loa like ya."] = "小事，{name}。洛阿喜欢你。"
L["Stay away from da voodoo, {name}. Except this one. This one's fine."] = "离巫毒术远点，{name}。这个除外，这个没事。"
L["Close ya eyes, {name}. Mojo gets shy when people watch."] = "闭上眼，{name}。有人看着，巫毒会害羞。"
L["Ya don't gotta ask twice, {name}. Ya barely gotta ask once."] = "不用问两遍，{name}。一遍都差点不用问。"
L["Sure, {name}. A troll is mostly swagger. The rest is this."] = "行嘞，{name}。巨魔大半靠派头，剩下的就靠这个。"
L["Ya asked polite, {name}. Polite gets the good stuff."] = "你问得客气，{name}。客气的人拿好货。"
L["Ya came to the right troll, {name}. The wrong one's over there, fishin'."] = "你找对巨魔了，{name}。找错的那个在那边钓鱼。"
L["Yes, {name}. The loa owe me a favour, and I'm spendin' it on you."] = "行，{name}。洛阿欠我个人情，我就花在你身上了。"
L["Got a pouch full of mojo, {name}. Don't touch the other pouch."] = "我有一袋子巫毒，{name}。另一个袋子莫碰。"
L["Anything for ya, {name}. Not my hair, though. Hair is sacred."] = "为你啥都行，{name}。头发除外，头发是神圣的。"
L["Troll magic, {name}, served hot. Blow on it first."] = "巨魔魔法，{name}，热乎的。先吹吹再用。"
L["Right away, {name}. A Zandalari priest would make a week of this."] = "马上，{name}。换赞达拉祭司，这能折腾一星期。"
L["Easy one, {name}. Hard one's gettin' a raptor to sit still."] = "小意思，{name}。难的是让迅猛龙老实坐好。"
L["Troll rule, {name}: never make a friend beg or a raptor wait. Here."] = "巨魔规矩，{name}：朋友莫让求，迅猛龙莫让等。给。"
L["Don't wiggle, {name}. Last one who did got the spell and a new haircut."] = "莫乱动，{name}。上一个乱扭的，法术到手，还白送个新发型。"
L["No problem, {name}. Darkspear always got time for a friend. And a nap."] = "没问题，{name}。暗矛总有空帮朋友。也总有空打盹。"
L["Sure, {name}. Hold still, like a fisherman at Sen'jin waitin' on a bite."] = "行，{name}。别动，就像森金村等鱼咬钩的渔夫。"
L["Yes, {name}. Vol'jin says never turn away a friend, and he's usually right."] = "好，{name}。沃金说永远别拒绝朋友，他通常说得对。"
L["Sure thing, {name}. I'll hum a little. Witch doctors say it helps."] = "包在我身上，{name}。我哼两句。巫医说这样有用。"
L["Da loa watch over ya, {name}. They're real nosy that way."] = "洛阿看着你呢，{name}。它们就是这么爱管闲事。"
L["Stay sharp, {name}. Take this with ya."] = "机灵点，{name}。带上这个。"
L["Ya look like somebody who appreciate quality, {name}. Here: quality."] = "你看着像识货的人，{name}。喏：好货。"
L["Here, {name}. Walk like ya own the jungle. I do."] = "给，{name}。走路要像丛林归你管。我就这么走。"
L["Everybody need mojo, {name}. I make so much I gotta give it away."] = "人人都需要巫毒，{name}。我做得太多，只好送人。"
L["A little somethin' for ya, {name}. Don't ask where da loa got it."] = "一点小意思，{name}。莫问洛阿打哪儿弄来的。"
L["Go on, {name}. Whatever tries to eat ya now gets indigestion."] = "去吧，{name}。现在谁想吃你，准得消化不良。"
L["Ya look dangerous now, {name}. Almost as dangerous as a troll."] = "你现在看着挺危险，{name}。快赶上巨魔了。"
L["No charge, {name}. Ya don't owe the loa a thing. Probably."] = "不收钱，{name}。你不欠洛阿啥。大概吧。"
L["Raptors got bigger teeth than me, {name}. Now they got a problem."] = "迅猛龙的牙比我大，{name}。现在该它们头疼咯。"
L["Troll hospitality, {name}: ya get mojo, ya get a smile, ya don't get my fish."] = "巨魔待客之道，{name}：巫毒给你，笑脸给你，鱼不给。"
L["Walk with mojo, {name}. Everybody else is just walkin'."] = "带着巫毒走，{name}。别人那只叫走路。"
L["Free mojo, {name}! Quick, before the witch doctor finds out."] = "免费巫毒，{name}！快拿，莫让巫医发现。"
L["The loa said give this to the next good soul, {name}. That's you."] = "洛阿说把这个给下一个好心人，{name}。就是你。"
L["Here, {name}. Hakkar never shared. Look what happened to him."] = "给，{name}。哈卡从来不分享，瞧瞧他啥下场。"
L["Jungle's got two kinds of folk, {name}: ready, and lunch. You're ready."] = "丛林只有两种人，{name}：准备好的，和当午饭的。你是前一种。"
L["Easy, {name}. This one tickles. Don't laugh; it gets offended."] = "放轻松，{name}。这个有点痒。别笑，它会生气的。"
L["Take this, {name}. Darkspear never send a friend off empty-handed."] = "拿着，{name}。暗矛从不让朋友空手上路。"
L["Darkspear know what it is to need a friend far from home, {name}. Here."] = "暗矛知道离乡在外有多需要朋友，{name}。给。"
L["Watch for the Bloodscalps, {name}. Same tusks as me, worse manners. Take this."] = "当心血顶部族，{name}。獠牙跟我一样，礼数差远了。拿着。"
L["Walk easy, {name}, with this. Life's long if ya don't rush it, short if ya do."] = "带着这个慢慢走，{name}。不急，日子就长；一急，就短喽。"
L["My granny was a witch doctor, {name}. Share, she said, and look scary doin' it."] = "我奶奶是巫医，{name}。她说：要分享，分享时还要显得吓人。"
L["From Sen'jin Village, {name}. Smells a bit like fish. Works fine, though."] = "森金村出品，{name}。有点鱼腥味。不过好用。"
L["Stay loose, {name}. Tense folk trip on roots. Take this, and relax."] = "放松点，{name}。绷太紧的人会被树根绊倒。拿着，放轻松。"
L["The spirits whisper ya name, {name}. Somebody's. They said give ya this."] = "灵魂们在念你的名字，{name}。反正念了个名字。他们说给你这个。"
L["We look after our own, {name}. Always, mon."] = "自己人自己照顾，{name}。永远如此，老兄。"
L["Da rest of Azeroth stand straight, {name}. We got style. Now ya got mojo too."] = "艾泽拉斯其他人站得笔直，{name}。咱们有范儿。现在你还有了巫毒。"
L["Ya tusks look sharp, {name}. Mine too. Now the rest of ya does."] = "你的獠牙挺利，{name}。我的也是。现在你全身都利了。"
L["Every troll's family, {name}, and family gets this. Even ones owin' me gold."] = "巨魔都是一家人，{name}，一家人都有这个。连欠我金币的也有。"
L["One day we take the Echo Isles back, {name}. Till then, take this."] = "总有一天我们夺回回音群岛，{name}。在那之前，拿着这个。"
L["Two trolls, {name}. Da room just got taller, more relaxed, and blessed."] = "两个巨魔，{name}。屋子一下子更高、更松快，还受了祝福。"
L["The loa got their eyes on both of us, {name}. Let 'em see me share."] = "洛阿神都盯着我们俩呢，{name}。让他们看我分享。"
L["Troll to troll, {name}: only we know how hard it is to buy boots. Here."] = "巨魔对巨魔，{name}：买靴子有多难，只有咱们懂。拿着。"
L["Our ancestors had empires, {name}. We got each other, and this. Fair trade."] = "先祖有帝国，{name}。咱们有彼此，还有这个。公平交易。"
L["Stay close, {name}. Trolls regenerate; da rest of ya get this instead."] = "待近点，{name}。巨魔会再生；你们其他人就拿这个代替。"
L["Crew's got style, {name}. Now it's got mojo too."] = "这队人有派头，{name}。现在还有巫毒了。"
L["We go in together, {name}, blessed, and come out together. That's the plan."] = "一起进去，{name}，带着祝福，一起出来。这就是计划。"
L["Nobody fallin' today, {name}; ya got this. Death can wait for the next group."] = "今天谁都不倒，{name}；你有这个。死神等下一队吧。"
L["Take this, {name}; keep ya head down. I keep mine up. Somebody gotta look good."] = "拿着，{name}；脑袋压低。我的抬着。总得有人好看。"
L["Raptor formation, {name}: fast, loud, blessed, and nobody look back."] = "迅猛龙阵型，{name}：快、吵、有祝福，谁也不回头。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a big snake shows up, don't run. Stand behind me."] = "拿着，{name}。要是冒出条大蛇，别跑。站我后面。"
L["Need more mojo, {name}? Just shout. Not too loud; the loa are nappin'."] = "还要巫毒，{name}？喊一声。小点声，洛阿在打盹。"
L["Sen'jin will hear of this one, {name}. With this, it gets a happy endin'."] = "森金村会听说这一回的，{name}。有了这个，结局准圆满。"
L["My tusks can't be everywhere, {name}, but this can. Stay near."] = "我的獠牙顾不过来，{name}，这个顾得过来。待近点。"
L["Nobody panic, {name}. Panic is bad mojo. This here is good mojo."] = "别慌，{name}。慌张是坏巫毒。这个是好巫毒。"
L["Take this, {name}. See an idol with glowin' eyes? Don't touch it. Trust me."] = "拿着，{name}。看见眼睛发光的神像？别碰。信我。"
L["Stay loose, {name}, and take this. Fights go better when ya smilin'. Mostly."] = "放松点，{name}，拿着这个。笑着打仗更顺。多半是。"
L["Darkspear fight together or not at all, {name}, and share the mojo. Here."] = "暗矛要么一起打，要么不打，{name}，巫毒也一起分。拿着。"
L["Ready, {name}? Take this. Any Gurubashi, let me talk first. Then ya hit 'em."] = "准备好了，{name}？拿着。碰上古拉巴什，我先说话。然后你揍。"
L["Take this and watch for traps, {name}. Trolls built half the old temples."] = "拿着，当心陷阱，{name}。一半的古神庙是巨魔盖的。"
L["The loa are watchin' this group, {name}. Let's give 'em a show. Start here."] = "洛阿神在看这支队伍，{name}。给他们演一出。从这儿开始。"
L["I got ya back, {name}. Trolls got long arms for a reason."] = "我罩着你，{name}。巨魔手长，是有道理的。"
L["Night's the best time for mojo, {name}. Nobody sees where it's from."] = "夜里最适合施巫毒，{name}。没人看得见是谁给的。"
L["The jungle wakes at night, {name}. So do I. This one's fresh."] = "丛林夜里才醒，{name}。我也是。这个新鲜的。"
L["High moon, {name}, restless spirits. This keeps 'em off ya."] = "月亮高挂，{name}，灵魂躁动。这个替你挡着。"
L["Hir'eek the bat loa keeps late hours too, {name}. This is from us both."] = "蝙蝠洛阿希里克也是夜猫子，{name}。这份是我俩一起送的。"
L["This late, {name}, only trolls and trouble are up. I'm the nice one. Here."] = "这么晚了，{name}，醒着的只有巨魔和麻烦。我是好的那个。拿着。"
L["Stars out, {name}. Each one a loa, Granny said. They all saw me give ya this."] = "星星出来了，{name}。奶奶说每颗都是洛阿神。他们都看见我给你这个了。"
L["Ya be da best friend dis troll ever had, {name}."] = "你是这巨魔最好的朋友，{name}。"
L["Easy, {name}. Da loa smile on us both today."] = "别急，{name}。今天洛阿对咱俩都笑着呢。"
L["Stay close, {name}, mon. Dis jungle be ours."] = "靠近点，{name}，伙计。这片丛林是咱们的。"
L["Dat be how we do it, {name}! Ya got da spirit of da loa!"] = "就是这样，{name}！你有洛阿的灵魂！"
L["Haha! Fine huntin', {name}! Ya make me proud, mon."] = "哈哈！猎得漂亮，{name}！我为你骄傲，伙计。"
L["Ya strike like a raptor, {name}! Dey never see ya comin'."] = "你出手跟迅猛龙一样，{name}！他们根本看不见你来。"
L["Easy, {name}. Da spirits not be takin' ya today."] = "别急，{name}。今天灵魂们不会带走你。"
L["Rest, {name}. Dis troll got ya, mon. Breathe slow."] = "歇吧，{name}。有这巨魔在，伙计。慢慢呼吸。"
L["Shh, {name}. Ya be safe now. Da loa be watchin' over ya."] = "嘘，{name}。你安全了。洛阿在守护你。"
L["Such courtesy does you credit, {name}. Nearly as much as it does me."] = "如此礼数，你脸上有光，{name}。我脸上也差不多。"
L["How gracious, {name}. Allow me to return the favour."] = "真是得体，{name}。容我回敬一份。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I haven't felt this radiant since... well, this morning."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我好久没这么光彩照人了……呃，从今早起。"
L["Kind of you, {name}. We sin'dorei never turn down free magic. Ask anyone."] = "你真好，{name}。我们辛多雷从不拒绝免费的魔法。不信你问问。"
L["Exquisite, {name}. I would know; I only accept the exquisite."] = "精致，{name}。这我说了算，我只收精致的东西。"
L["Lovely, {name}. I'll be insufferable about this all day. More than usual."] = "真美，{name}。我会为这事得意一整天。比平时还得意。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It even goes with my gold trim. You have an eye."] = "谢谢你，{name}。连我的金边都配得上。你眼光真好。"
L["Returned in kind, {name}. A prettier kind, admittedly. I can't help it."] = "以礼相还，{name}。当然，还得更漂亮些。我也没办法。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Visit Silvermoon; I'll show you all of it but Murder Row."] = "谢谢你，{name}。来银月城吧，除了谋杀小径，哪儿都带你逛。"
L["Returned, {name}. Unlike Kael'thas, I give things back."] = "奉还，{name}。我可不像凯尔萨斯，拿了东西会还。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I felt that to the tips of my ears, and that's a long way."] = "谢谢你，{name}。一直暖到我耳朵尖——那可是好长一段路。"
L["Thank you, {name}. That was so kind my eyes nearly changed colour again."] = "谢谢你，{name}。太贴心了，我的眼睛差点又变色。"
L["A gift, unasked? Farstriders would call that an ambush. A lovely one, {name}."] = "不请自来的礼物？远行者会称之为伏击。很美的伏击，{name}。"
L["Better than a mana crystal, {name}, and I've given those up. Mostly. Thank you."] = "比法力水晶还好，{name}，虽然那个我戒了。基本戒了。谢谢你。"
L["Quick of you, {name}. Elves live for centuries, and you still beat me to it."] = "好快，{name}。精灵能活几百年，照样被你抢了先。"
L["Charming, {name}. The sun favours the generous, and so do I."] = "真迷人，{name}。太阳眷顾慷慨之人，我也是。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll mention you at court. Well, at a very exclusive picnic."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我会在朝堂上提起你。呃，是在一场极其高端的野餐上。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Courtesy is rare outside Silvermoon. Yours shines."] = "谢谢你，{name}。银月城外难得有礼数，你的格外耀眼。"
L["Unasked kindness, {name}! Somebody tell Rommath; he'll want to study it."] = "不求自来的善意，{name}！快告诉罗曼斯，他肯定想拿去研究。"
L["Naturally, {name}. Only the finest for you."] = "那是自然，{name}。给你的只能是最好的。"
L["For you, {name}? Of course. The sun gives freely."] = "给你吗，{name}？当然。太阳向来慷慨。"
L["Patience, {name}. Radiance can't be rushed, only admired."] = "耐心，{name}。光彩不能催，只能欣赏。"
L["Of course, {name}. {buff}, delivered with impeccable posture."] = "当然，{name}。{buff}，以无可挑剔的姿态奉上。"
L["You asked nicely, {name}. In Silvermoon that counts for everything."] = "你问得很得体，{name}。在银月城，这就是一切。"
L["One moment, {name}. I never cast anything without checking my hair."] = "稍等，{name}。不先整理头发，我从不施法。"
L["At once, {name}. Keeping someone waiting is so terribly unfashionable."] = "马上，{name}。让人久等实在太不时髦了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand back a step; my sleeves are enchanted and very wide."] = "当然，{name}。退后一步，我的袖子附了魔，还特别宽。"
L["Magisters would bill you, {name}. Blood Knights would lecture. I merely glow."] = "魔导师会给你开账单，{name}，血骑士会训话。我只负责发光。"
L["At once, {name}. If it goes well, tell everyone. If not, blame the robe."] = "马上，{name}。效果好就告诉大家。不好就怪这件法袍。"
L["At once, {name}. The dragonhawk can wait; it's used to waiting while I dress."] = "马上，{name}。龙鹰能等，我梳妆时它早等惯了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. We once took the Light from a naaru. Asking is so much nicer."] = "乐意，{name}。我们曾从纳鲁那儿硬抢圣光。开口要，体面多了。"
L["Three centuries of casting, {name}, and you're the first to say please."] = "施法三百年，{name}，你是第一个说“请”的。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Silvermoon's brooms sweep themselves, so my hands are free."] = "乐意，{name}。银月城的扫帚会自己扫地，我正好手闲。"
L["Of course, {name}. I keep my other spells for the rude."] = "当然，{name}。别的法术我留给没礼貌的人。"
L["Anar'alah belore, {name}. May the sun guide you, and light your good side."] = "Anar'alah belore，{name}。愿太阳指引你，也照亮你上镜的那半边脸。"
L["Shorel'aran, {name}. Fight with elegance, and with this."] = "秀瑞尔·阿兰，{name}。优雅地战斗，带上这个。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever happens out there is merely a setback."] = "拿着，{name}。外面发生什么，都不过是个小挫折。"
L["Everyone deserves to shine, {name}. Only a little less than me, of course."] = "人人都该闪耀，{name}。当然，得比我暗一点。"
L["The sun is with you, {name}. I simply held the door for it."] = "太阳与你同在，{name}。我只是替它开了门。"
L["Go on, {name}, take it. The Sunwell's back; we can afford to be generous."] = "拿去吧，{name}。太阳之井回来了，我们大方得起。"
L["For you, {name}: {buff}, lightly scented with Silvermoon."] = "给你，{name}：{buff}，带着一丝银月城的香气。"
L["Here, {name}. Hand-cast in Silvermoon, so do try not to scuff it."] = "给，{name}。银月城纯手工施放，千万别刮花了。"
L["A little Sunwell for you, {name}. It's been through a lot; treat it kindly."] = "送你一点太阳之井，{name}。它经历了太多，好好待它。"
L["Be prepared, {name}. We weren't, once, and now we have a scar for a road."] = "做好准备，{name}。我们曾经没准备，结果多了条叫死亡之痕的路。"
L["Here, {name}. I only give to the worthy. How convenient that you walked by."] = "给，{name}。我只送给配得上的人。真巧，你正好路过。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's been in my family for moments."] = "拿着，{name}。这是我家祖传的。传了好几秒。"
L["We sin'dorei have lost much, {name}. Never our generosity. Or our cheekbones."] = "我们辛多雷失去了很多，{name}。但慷慨还在。颧骨也在。"
L["Take this, {name}. Should a mana wyrm follow you, it's only jealous."] = "拿着，{name}。要是有法力浮龙跟着你，它只是嫉妒。"
L["Seven thousand years to perfect generosity, {name}. We started last week."] = "慷慨要练七千年才完美，{name}。我们上周才开始。"
L["Take this, {name}. It came through the Undercity orb, so it's slightly dizzy."] = "拿着，{name}。它坐幽暗城的传送宝珠过来的，有点晕。"
L["For you, {name}. It matches everything. I checked, obviously."] = "给你，{name}。百搭。我当然检查过了。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a ghoul stops you, say Silvermoon's still standing."] = "拿着，{name}。要是有食尸鬼拦你，就说银月城还屹立着。"
L["The Sunwell shines for us both, {name}. Let me share its light."] = "太阳之井为我们俩闪耀，{name}。让我分享它的光芒。"
L["Two sin'dorei, {name}. The day just got twice as elegant, and you blessed."] = "两个辛多雷，{name}。今天优雅加倍，你也受了祝福。"
L["You too, {name}? Two sin'dorei, one mirror. Take this; now you look better."] = "你也是，{name}？两个辛多雷，一面镜子。拿着；现在你更好看了。"
L["Like the phoenix, {name}, we keep rising. This helps you look good doing it."] = "如凤凰一般，{name}，我们一次次重生。这个让你重生时也风度翩翩。"
L["Between sin'dorei, {name}: yes, the Horde is loud. This, at least, is quiet."] = "辛多雷之间说，{name}：是啊，部落很吵。这个至少很安静。"
L["Sin'dorei to sin'dorei, {name}: we never speak of the green eyes. Take this."] = "辛多雷对辛多雷，{name}：绿眼睛的事绝口不提。拿着。"
L["Magister or Farstrider, {name}, the sun rises for us all. Here's some of it."] = "魔导师也好远行者也罢，{name}，太阳为我们所有人升起。分你一点。"
L["We knew Quel'Thalas before the Scourge, {name}. Here; let's earn the after."] = "我们见过天灾之前的奎尔萨拉斯，{name}。拿着；让我们挣一个更好的往后。"
L["Do keep pace, {name}; you're blessed now. We're known for arriving beautifully."] = "跟上，{name}；你现在受了祝福。我们出场向来漂亮。"
L["Stand where the light is good, {name}. With this on you, we'll look splendid."] = "站在光线好的地方，{name}。你身上有了这个，咱们都光彩照人。"
L["A party at last, {name}. I did dress for one, and I brought gifts."] = "终于组队了，{name}。我专门打扮过，还带了礼物。"
L["The sun shines on all of us, {name}. Mostly on me, but I share it. Here."] = "阳光照耀我们所有人，{name}。主要照我，但我分给你。拿着。"
L["One for you, {name}, and one for the party's image, which I've taken on myself."] = "一份给你，{name}，一份给小队形象，这事我一手包了。"
L["Here, {name}. If I fall, arrange me nicely. The rest I leave to the priest."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是倒了，把我摆得好看点。剩下的交给牧师。"
L["Take this; touch no enchanted relics, {name}. Well, I may. I've had training."] = "拿着；别碰附魔遗物，{name}。我嘛可以。我受过训练。"
L["Every expedition needs a ranger, {name}. I'm not one, but I bless well."] = "每支探险队都需要一个游侠，{name}。我不是，不过我祝福很在行。"
L["We fight together, {name}, blessed, then tell it beautifully. I'll tell it."] = "我们并肩作战，{name}，带着祝福，然后讲得漂漂亮亮。我来讲。"
L["Whoever mends us is to be thanked, {name}. Whoever blesses you, admired. Me."] = "治疗我们的人值得感谢，{name}。为你祝福的人值得赞美。就是我。"
L["Take this, {name}. If it goes badly, we blame the Scourge. It's traditional."] = "拿着，{name}。要是砸了，就怪天灾。这是传统。"
L["Mana potions are for emergencies, {name}. This is for you. I've had eleven."] = "法力药水是应急用的，{name}。这个是给你的。我今天已经应急十一回了。"
L["We walked out of the ashes once, {name}. With this, we'll walk out of anything."] = "我们曾从灰烬中走出来，{name}。有了这个，什么都走得出来。"
L["The sun has risen, {name}, and so have I. We coordinate. Here's its light."] = "太阳升起来了，{name}，我也是。我们是商量好的。给你它的光。"
L["Dawn over Quel'Thalas is lovelier, {name}, but this blessing will do. Just."] = "奎尔萨拉斯的黎明更美，{name}，不过这份祝福也行。勉强。"
L["Morning light, {name}: the most flattering hour. This makes it more so."] = "晨光，{name}：最上相的时辰。这个让它更上相。"
L["Breakfast in Eversong is fruit, tea and arcane, {name}. Skip to the arcane."] = "永歌森林的早餐是水果、茶和奥术，{name}。直接上奥术吧。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Red and gold across the sky. Here's some of it, for you."] = "黎明，{name}。满天红与金。分你一点。"
L["Morning, {name}. Only Silvermoon's guardians are up this early. And me. Here."] = "早，{name}。这么早起的只有银月城的守护者。还有我。拿着。"
L["You are a credit to Quel'Thalas, {name}. Truly."] = "你是奎尔萨拉斯的荣耀，{name}。真的。"
L["Even the Sunwell's light can't outshine you, {name}."] = "就连太阳之井的光也比不上你，{name}。"
L["Stay by me, {name}. Elegance suits us both."] = "待在我身边，{name}。优雅很适合咱俩。"
L["Splendid, {name}! Grace and fury, perfectly balanced."] = "漂亮，{name}！优雅与狂怒，完美平衡。"
L["Well done, {name}. The rangers of Silvermoon would envy you."] = "干得好，{name}。银月城的游侠都会羡慕你。"
L["Exquisite, {name}. Not a single wasted motion."] = "精妙，{name}。没有一个多余的动作。"
L["Be still, {name}. Let the sun's light find you."] = "别动，{name}。让阳光找到你。"
L["Shh, {name}. Rest now; I'll stand watch."] = "嘘，{name}。歇吧，我来站岗。"
L["Easy, {name}. We're both still here, and that's enough."] = "别急，{name}。咱俩都还在，这就够了。"
L["Your generosity is noted, {name}. In triplicate. Suramar remembers its friends."] = "你的慷慨已记录在案，{name}。一式三份。苏拉玛不忘朋友。"
L["Most gracious, {name}. Allow me to repay you in kind."] = "承蒙厚意，{name}。容我以礼相还。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome; I'm still practising that."] = "谢谢你，{name}。在屏障里待了一万年，这句我还在练。"
L["A gift with no favour owed? The court would faint. Thank you, {name}."] = "不求回报的馈赠？宫廷里的人会晕过去的。谢谢你，{name}。"
L["Returned, {name}. We keep careful accounts of kindness. And of slights."] = "已奉还，{name}。善意我们一笔笔记着。怠慢也是。"
L["I'll mention you to First Arcanist Thalyssra, {name}. Favourably, even."] = "我会向首席奥术师萨莉瑟拉提起你，{name}。甚至是说好话。"
L["Most kind, {name}. In Suramar we'd hold a banquet. Consider it held."] = "太客气了，{name}。在苏拉玛，这得办场宴会。就当办过了。"
L["I'd send a formal letter of thanks, {name}, but this seemed quicker."] = "本该正式写封感谢信，{name}，不过这样更快。"
L["In Elisande's court a gift hid a knife, {name}. Yours hides none. Thank you."] = "艾利桑德的宫廷讲究礼里藏刀，{name}。你这份只有礼。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My manasaber approves of you, and she approves of no one."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我的魔刃豹认可你，她可谁都不认可。"
L["Exquisite, {name}. Once I'd have said 'adequate'. The world has humbled me."] = "精妙，{name}。换作从前，我只会说“尚可”。世界让我谦虚了。"
L["You fed a mind that once went hungry, {name}. We never forget those who do."] = "你喂饱了一颗曾经饥饿的心智，{name}。这样的人，我们永不忘记。"
L["Centuries of court etiquette, {name}, and 'thank you' still says it best."] = "宫廷礼仪学了几百年，{name}，还是一句“谢谢”说得最好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You're invited to the next masquerade. Masks mandatory."] = "谢谢你，{name}。下次假面舞会请你来。面具必须戴。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Oculeth would open a portal to say so. I'll simply cast."] = "谢谢你，{name}。欧库勒斯会开个传送门来道谢。我就直接施法了。"
L["Of course, {name}. A little arcane polish, just for you."] = "当然，{name}。为你添点奥术光泽。"
L["A reasonable request, {name}. Granted."] = "合理的请求，{name}。准了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The short version; the long one takes a lunar cycle."] = "当然，{name}。这是简版，完整版要一整个月相周期。"
L["A request, how refreshing. The court only ever made demands. Here, {name}."] = "是请求，真新鲜。宫廷里只有命令。给，{name}。"
L["Done, {name}, and free. Elisande would have charged you a favour for it."] = "好了，{name}，免费。换成艾利桑德，得收你一个人情。"
L["There, {name}. No need to bow. A small nod would be lovely, though."] = "好了，{name}。不必鞠躬。不过点个头会很得体。"
L["Of course, {name}. I've perfected this since before most cities had walls."] = "当然，{name}。大多数城市还没城墙时，我就已练到完美了。"
L["Granted, {name}. I'd ask a favour back, but I'm trying to be less Suramar."] = "准了，{name}。本想讨个人情，可我正努力少点苏拉玛味儿。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Forgive the flourish. We can't cast plainly; we've tried."] = "当然，{name}。见谅这番花哨。我们朴素不来，试过了。"
L["At once, {name}. Elisande once stopped time. I only need a second."] = "马上，{name}。艾利桑德曾让时间停止。我只要一秒。"
L["Of course, {name}. The ley lines here are shallow, but I'll make do."] = "当然，{name}。这里的魔网很浅，不过我将就一下。"
L["Very well, {name}. Stand in the moonlight. Or by that lamp. Lamps will do."] = "好吧，{name}。站到月光下。或者那盏灯旁边。灯也行。"
L["Naturally, {name}. Suramar had a spell for everything. I remember several."] = "自然，{name}。苏拉玛凡事都有法术。我记得几个。"
L["Take this, {name}. Arcane gifts are wasted on the idle."] = "拿着，{name}。奥术的馈赠可不给闲人。"
L["A spark of Suramar's arcana for you, {name}. Use it wisely."] = "送你一星苏拉玛奥术，{name}。善加利用。"
L["I've gone without magic once, {name}. I don't recommend it. Take this."] = "我断过一次魔法，{name}。不推荐。拿着。"
L["The world outside the dome is so large, {name}. And so under-enchanted. Here."] = "屏障外的世界好大，{name}。附魔也太少了。给。"
L["Arcwine is traditional, {name}, but {buff} travels better."] = "按传统该送奥术酒，{name}，不过{buff}更方便带。"
L["Do take this, {name}. It's rude to refuse Suramar's hospitality. Very rude."] = "请收下，{name}。拒绝苏拉玛的款待很失礼。非常失礼。"
L["Here, {name}. I'm told this is how outsiders say hello. Charming custom."] = "给，{name}。听说外人就是这么打招呼的。迷人的习俗。"
L["Take this, {name}. Magic hoarded is magic spoiled, as Suramar learned."] = "拿着，{name}。魔法囤着会坏，苏拉玛吃过这个亏。"
L["Once, I'd have made you bow for this, {name}. We've all grown."] = "从前，这得让你鞠躬才给，{name}。我们都长进了。"
L["The Kirin Tor do this too, {name}, bless them. Quite nicely, for newcomers."] = "肯瑞托也会这个，{name}，难为他们了。以新手来说，还挺像样。"
L["A gift from under the dome, {name}. Kept fresh for a very, very long time."] = "来自屏障之下的礼物，{name}。保鲜了非常非常久。"
L["Enjoy this, {name}. I used to cast it on nobility. You're an improvement."] = "请享用，{name}。我以前只给贵族施放。你比他们强。"
L["I packed for the outside world like a gala, {name}. Four capes. Take this."] = "我出门收拾行李像赴晚宴，{name}。带了四件披风。这个给你。"
L["Here, {name}. Suramar work: overdesigned, overdecorated, and flawless."] = "给，{name}。苏拉玛出品：设计过度，装饰过度，完美无瑕。"
L["Here, {name}. In Suramar this came with a string quartet. Do hum something."] = "给，{name}。在苏拉玛，这个要配弦乐四重奏。你哼两句吧。"
L["Suramar's children shine together again, {name}. Let me add to your glow."] = "苏拉玛的子民又一同闪耀了，{name}。让我为你增添光彩。"
L["Shal'dorei, {name}! You packed arcwine? No? Then take this instead."] = "夜之子，{name}！带了魔法酒吗？没有？那就拿这个吧。"
L["Suramar's own, {name}. Take this; the rest of the world won't do it so well."] = "苏拉玛自家人，{name}。拿着；外面的人可没这手艺。"
L["We survived the Legion and the withering, {name}. We can spare this."] = "我们熬过了燃烧军团和枯萎，{name}。这个我们给得起。"
L["Our tailors made it out of Suramar too, {name}. Take this to go with the robes."] = "我们的裁缝也逃出了苏拉玛，{name}。拿着这个，配你的长袍。"
L["We both remember going hungry, {name}. Never again; here, take what I have."] = "我们都记得挨饿的滋味，{name}。再也不会了；拿着我有的。"
L["Out from under the dome, {name}. The sky's so big. This helps."] = "出了穹顶，{name}。天好大。这个有帮助。"
L["Two shal'dorei, {name}. The locals will think it's a gala. Gifts are expected."] = "两个夜之子，{name}。当地人会以为是场盛宴。少不了礼物。"
L["An expedition, {name}! In Suramar this blessing needed six permits."] = "远征，{name}！在苏拉玛，这份祝福得盖六个章。"
L["The dome kept us safe, {name}. Now one another must. Gladly; here."] = "穹顶曾护着我们，{name}。现在得靠彼此了。乐意之至；拿着。"
L["Arcane for everyone, {name}. The court would call it waste. I call it company."] = "人人有奥术，{name}。宫廷会说是浪费，我说这叫作伴。"
L["Take this, {name}, and follow my lead. Ten thousand years of walking in step."] = "拿着，{name}，跟我走。一万年都是踩着步子走的。"
L["In a party one shares one's magic, {name}. How novel. I rather like it."] = "组队时要分享魔法，{name}。真新奇。我挺喜欢。"
L["An outing is a masquerade, {name}: smile, keep moving, and take a gift."] = "出游就像假面舞会，{name}：微笑，别停步，收下礼物。"
L["Stay in the light of my spells, {name}. It's the most flattering in the party."] = "待在我的法术光里，{name}。全队就这光最显气色。"
L["After Elisande's court, {name}, this is a holiday. Nobody poisons the gifts."] = "比起艾利桑德的宫廷，{name}，这简直是度假。没人在礼物里下毒。"
L["Lost? Follow the one who glows, {name}. That's me. Here, now you glow too."] = "迷路了？跟着发光的那个走，{name}。就是我。来，现在你也发光了。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I start lecturing on ley lines, do interrupt. Politely."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我开始讲魔网线，打断我。客气点。"
L["I watched my people wither, {name}. I won't watch friends fade. Nobody falls."] = "我眼看族人枯萎，{name}。不会再看着朋友凋零。谁都不许倒下。"
L["Here, {name}. Tell me if I'm being grand. I lose track. It's the millennia."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是端架子，告诉我。我会忘形。几千年的毛病。"
L["Night at last, {name}. Add this glow and some lanterns: nearly Suramar."] = "终于入夜了，{name}。加上这道光和几盏灯：差不多就是苏拉玛了。"
L["Under the dome it was always night, {name}. I feel at home, and generous."] = "穹顶下永远是夜晚，{name}。我觉得像回了家，也大方起来了。"
L["The stars are out, {name}. We had better ones in Suramar. This will do too."] = "星星出来了，{name}。苏拉玛的星星更好看。这个也凑合。"
L["Nightborne, {name}, and here's the night. I'm dressed for it; now so are you."] = "夜之子，{name}，夜晚来了。我为它盛装打扮；现在你也是。"
L["At this hour, {name}, Suramar dressed for dinner. Here's your finery."] = "这个时辰，{name}，苏拉玛的人正为晚宴更衣。这是你的盛装。"
L["Daylight, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome, and it startles me. Here."] = "日光，{name}。在穹顶下待了一万年，还是会被它吓一跳。拿着。"
L["An early hour, {name}. The court never rose before noon. I'm reforming. Here."] = "好早，{name}。宫廷从不在正午前起床。我在改。拿着。"
L["Morning, {name}. The sun here is so very... unenchanted. Take this instead."] = "早，{name}。这里的太阳真是……毫无附魔。拿这个凑合吧。"
L["Morning, {name}. We warded Suramar against all but the sun. I've warded you."] = "早，{name}。我们给苏拉玛设了防护，防得住一切，除了太阳。你我已经护好了。"
L["Dawn, {name}: when the court's gossip went to bed. Here's mine, and this."] = "黎明，{name}：宫廷八卦歇下的时候。这是我的八卦，还有这个。"
L["You remind me there is more to life than arcwine, {name}."] = "你让我明白，人生不只有魔法酒，{name}。"
L["Stay with me, {name}. Suramar's beauty pales beside a friend."] = "陪着我，{name}。苏拉玛再美，也比不上朋友。"
L["How fortunate I am, {name}, to walk with one so loyal."] = "我真幸运，{name}，能和如此忠诚的你同行。"
L["Superb, {name}. Elisande's finest could not have done better."] = "出色，{name}。艾利桑德的精英也做不到更好。"
L["Well done, {name}. That was as precise as a ley line."] = "干得好，{name}。精准得像一条魔网线。"
L["Remarkable, {name}. The Nightwell would glow for you."] = "了不起，{name}。暗夜井都会为你发光。"
L["Rest, {name}. I will not let the Withered take you."] = "歇吧，{name}。我不会让枯法者带走你。"
L["Calm, {name}. Breathe slowly; the worst has passed."] = "冷静，{name}。慢慢呼吸，最糟的已经过去了。"
L["Hush, {name}. Let the stars keep you while you heal."] = "嘘，{name}。你养伤时，让星辰守着你。"
L["A favour for a favour, {name}! Pleasure doing business."] = "人情换人情，{name}！合作愉快！"
L["Thanks, {name}! Consider your account settled in full."] = "谢啦，{name}！你的账已全部结清。"
L["Aw, {name}. I'd invoice you, but I'm feeling sentimental. It'll pass."] = "哎，{name}。本该给你开发票的，可我一时心软。会好的。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I checked it for fine print. There wasn't any. Weird!"] = "谢啦，{name}！我查了附加条款，居然没有。怪了！"
L["Returned with interest, {name}. Minus the interest. Don't get used to it."] = "连本带利还你，{name}。利息免了。别习惯了。"
L["Much obliged, {name}! You've just been upgraded to preferred customer."] = "多谢，{name}！你刚升级成VIP客户了。"
L["I'd name a rocket after you, {name}, but my rockets never last long. Thanks!"] = "本想用你的名字命名火箭，{name}，可我的火箭都活不长。谢啦！"
L["I'd have charged fifty gold for that, {name}. Let's call us even."] = "这个我本该收五十金币的，{name}。就当扯平了。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Quick hands. You'd do well in Booty Bay."] = "谢啦，{name}！手真快。你在藏宝海湾准能混得开。"
L["A deal where both sides profit, {name}! I'd heard of those. Never seen one."] = "双赢的买卖，{name}！听说过，从没见过。"
L["First free gift since Kezan blew up, {name}. Returning it before I price it."] = "科赞爆炸以来头一份免费礼物，{name}。趁我还没标价，赶紧还你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I appraised it at priceless. Here's one appraised the same."] = "谢啦，{name}！我估了价：无价。回你一份，同样无价。"
L["Kindness in, kindness out, {name}. Best returns since the kaja'mite boom."] = "善意进，善意出，{name}。卡亚矿热潮以来最好的回报。"
L["Even trade, {name}? My accountant just fainted. He does that around fair deals."] = "公平交易，{name}？我的会计刚晕过去了。他一见公平买卖就晕。"
L["Thanks, {name}! I'd shake on it, but I count my fingers after. Habit, not you."] = "谢啦，{name}！本想握手，可握完我得数手指。习惯，不是针对你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Gadgetzan could use a few more like you."] = "谢啦，{name}！加基森就缺你这样的人。"
L["You got it, {name}! Time is money, friend!"] = "没问题，{name}！时间就是金钱，朋友！"
L["Deal, {name}! I'll put it on your tab. Kidding!"] = "成交，{name}！记你账上。开玩笑的！"
L["Right away, {name}! Satisfaction guaranteed or your {buff} back."] = "马上，{name}！不满意包退{buff}。"
L["{buff}, {name}! Tips optional. Encouraged. Optional."] = "{buff}，{name}！小费随意。鼓励给。随意。"
L["Fast, cheap or good, {name}? Today you get all three. Don't spread it around."] = "快、便宜、好，{name}，平常三选二。今天全给你。别声张。"
L["Sure thing, {name}! No explosions this time, I promise. Mostly promise."] = "没问题，{name}！这次不会爆炸，我保证。基本保证。"
L["For you, {name}? No charge. Put that in writing and I'll deny it."] = "给你？免费，{name}。敢写成白纸黑字，我就不认账。"
L["Sure, {name}! Quote's zero gold. Lowest I've ever quoted. It stings a little."] = "好嘞，{name}！报价零金币。我报过最低的价。心有点疼。"
L["Coming up, {name}! Full warranty included. Valid until it wears off."] = "马上来，{name}！全程保修。有效期到它消失为止。"
L["Sure, {name}! I'd tinker with it, but you look in a hurry."] = "好嘞，{name}！本想再改装改装，看你挺赶的。"
L["Easy, {name}. Steamwheedle rule: keep customers alive. They pay longer."] = "小事，{name}。热砂规矩：让顾客活着，他们付钱付得久。"
L["Gadgetzan's got the water trade, {name}. I've got this. Better margins."] = "加基森做水生意，{name}。我做这个。利润更高。"
L["Kezan standard, {name}: fast, loud, and done before you read the terms."] = "科赞标准，{name}：快，响，你还没看完条款就搞定了。"
L["On it, {name}! Goblins never keep a customer waiting. Unless it pays."] = "马上，{name}！地精从不让顾客等。除非等有钱赚。"
L["This one's on the house, {name}. Don't tell the Trade Prince."] = "这次免费，{name}。可别告诉贸易亲王。"
L["Top-shelf stuff, zero fees, {name}. Today only!"] = "顶级货色，零手续费，{name}。仅限今天！"
L["Free sample, {name}! If you like it, you know where to find me."] = "免费试用，{name}！喜欢的话，你知道上哪儿找我。"
L["Here, {name}. If anything explodes near you today, that was unrelated."] = "给，{name}。今天你附近要是有东西爆炸，跟这个无关。"
L["Goodwill's an asset, {name}. Here's some {buff} for my books."] = "商誉也是资产，{name}。这份{buff}记在我账上。"
L["Take this, {name}. Safety first! Or third. It's on the list somewhere."] = "拿着，{name}。安全第一！或者第三。反正在清单上。"
L["Cast in record time, {name}! The record's mine. I set it just now."] = "破纪录的施法速度，{name}！纪录是我的，刚刚创下的。"
L["Kaja'Cola gives you ideas, {name}. This does the rest. Take it!"] = "卡亚可乐给你灵感，{name}。剩下的交给这个。拿着！"
L["Here, {name}. Go make your fortune. I'll want a cut."] = "给，{name}。去发大财吧。记得分我一份。"
L["Zeppelin's late again, {name}, so I've time to be generous."] = "飞艇又晚点了，{name}，我正好有空大方一下。"
L["Here, {name}. Patent pending. Try it out and tell your rich friends."] = "给，{name}。专利申请中。试试看，再告诉你那些有钱的朋友。"
L["Consider this an investment, {name}. In you. I expect heroic returns."] = "就当是投资，{name}。投你。我期待英雄级的回报。"
L["Take it, {name}! My last shipment sank off Kezan, so everything's clearance."] = "拿着，{name}！上批货沉在科赞外海了，全场清仓。"
L["The Venture Company charges for this, {name}. I'm the competition. Here."] = "风险投资公司这个要收钱，{name}。我是他们的竞争对手。给。"
L["Every goblin has a soft spot, {name}. Mine's small and guarded. You found it."] = "每个地精都有软肋，{name}。我的又小又有人看守。你找到了。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only thing I own with no lien on it."] = "拿着，{name}。这是我唯一没被抵押的东西。"
L["You'll be rich someday, {name}. I can tell. Remember who gave you this."] = "你迟早会发财，{name}。我看得出来。苟富贵，勿相忘。"
L["Anything for a fellow entrepreneur, {name}!"] = "都是生意人，好说好说，{name}！"
L["Kezan's finest, together again, {name}. Here, free. Keep a hand on your purse."] = "科赞的精英又凑一块了，{name}。拿着，免费。手捂好钱袋。"
L["Fellow goblin, {name}? Then you know this is a very, very rare discount."] = "同是地精，{name}？那你该知道，这折扣非常非常罕见。"
L["Goblins look after goblins, {name}. It's cheaper than hiring guards."] = "地精照顾地精，{name}。比雇保镖便宜。"
L["Kezan's gone, {name}, but the greed made it out. Not today, though. Here."] = "科赞没了，{name}，贪心可逃出来了。不过今天不贪。拿着。"
L["Between goblins, {name}, this never happened. I have a reputation."] = "地精之间，{name}，这事从没发生过。我还要名声的。"
L["Bilgewater or Steamwheedle, {name}, we float to the top. This helps."] = "锈水也好热砂也罢，{name}，我们总能浮到上面。这个有帮助。"
L["Remember the volcano, {name}? We sold tickets. This one's free. Proud times."] = "还记得那座火山吗，{name}？我们卖过门票。这个免费。光荣岁月啊。"
L["Group rate, {name}! Everybody here gets it half off. Of free."] = "团购价，{name}！全队五折。免费的五折。"
L["Nobody dies on my contract, {name}. Here's insurance. The paperwork's awful."] = "我的合同里不许死人，{name}。这是保险。文书工作太要命了。"
L["We split the take even, {name}. This is your share. I did the maths. Trust me."] = "战利品平分，{name}。这是你那份。账我算过了。相信我。"
L["There, {name}. Everyone's stronger, and everyone owes me. Invoices later."] = "好了，{name}。人人都变强了，人人都欠我。账单随后就到。"
L["Stick together, {name}. Mercenaries cost gold; friends only cost this."] = "抱团走，{name}。雇佣兵要花金币，朋友只花这个。"
L["Everybody's covered, {name}. Not insured, mind. Covered. Different price."] = "大家都罩着了，{name}。注意，不是保险。是罩着。价钱不同。"
L["The risk report on this outing says 'no', {name}. This lowers the risk."] = "这趟出行的风险报告写着“不行”，{name}。这个能降低风险。"
L["Take this, {name}. Nobody touches the big red lever. There's always one."] = "拿着，{name}。谁都别碰那根大红拉杆。总会有那么一根。"
L["Here, {name}. If this goes south, I've got a rocket. Seats one. Working on it."] = "拿着，{name}。要是出事，我有火箭。只坐得下一个。正在改进。"
L["We're a company now, {name}. I'm treasurer. Here's your benefits package."] = "我们现在是公司了，{name}。我是财务。这是你的福利包。"
L["Stay alive, {name}. Nobody sells resurrections yet, so take this. Free."] = "活下去，{name}。还没人卖复活，所以拿着这个。免费。"
L["Take this, {name}, and stay close. I've already sold the story of this trip."] = "拿着，{name}，跟紧。这趟旅程的故事我已经卖出去了。"
L["Early bird gets the gold, {name}! Here's a freebie. Don't tell the other birds."] = "早起的鸟儿有金币，{name}！送你个赠品。别告诉别的鸟。"
L["Morning, {name}! Markets open in an hour. Until then, I'm feeling generous."] = "早，{name}！还有一小时开市。开市前，我心情大方。"
L["Up early, {name}? Smart. Time is money, and this is cheapest in the morning."] = "起得早，{name}？聪明。时间就是金钱，这个早上最便宜。"
L["Dawn, {name}. Rich goblins sleep in. I'm not rich yet, so I'm handing out this."] = "黎明，{name}。有钱的地精睡懒觉。我还没发财，所以在发这个。"
L["Fresh day, fresh ledger, {name}. You're the first entry. The good column."] = "新的一天，新的账本，{name}。你是第一笔。记在好的那栏。"
L["You're worth more than a bank vault, {name}. And you don't charge interest."] = "你比银行金库还值钱，{name}。还不收利息。"
L["Best investment I ever made, {name}. Zero upkeep. Mostly."] = "这是我最好的投资，{name}。零维护费。基本上。"
L["Stick with me, {name}. Partners split everything fifty-fifty."] = "跟着我，{name}。合伙人什么都五五分。"
L["Ka-ching! Nice work, {name}! That's a bonus for you."] = "叮当！干得好，{name}！给你发奖金。"
L["Now that's what I call a return on investment, {name}!"] = "这才叫投资回报，{name}！"
L["Boom! Great job, {name}. I'll get you a raise."] = "砰！干得漂亮，{name}。给你加薪。"
L["Whoa, easy, {name}. You're too valuable to lose."] = "哇，别急，{name}。你太值钱了，可不能丢。"
L["Hold together, {name}. I'm not filing an insurance claim on you."] = "撑住，{name}。我可不想为你去申请保险理赔。"
L["Rest up, {name}. Take all the time you need. On the house."] = "好好歇着，{name}。慢慢来。这次免费。"
L["Thank you, {name}! The caravan always repays a kindness. Usually in string."] = "谢谢你，{name}！商队向来知恩图报。通常用绳子报。"
L["How kind, {name}! You're on the caravan's good list now."] = "真好心，{name}！你上了商队的好人名单啦。"
L["Oh, I'll keep this, {name}! I keep everything. Here's one for you."] = "哦，这个我收下了，{name}！我什么都收。这个给你。"
L["Thanks, {name}! Here's yours back. Well, a new one. Hardly used."] = "谢啦，{name}！还你一个。呃，是个新的。几乎没用过。"
L["My ears just went straight up, {name}. That means I'm very pleased."] = "我的耳朵刚刚竖起来了，{name}。意思是我特别开心。"
L["By tonight's campfire, {name}, this story will have a sandworm in it. Thanks!"] = "到了今晚篝火边，{name}，这故事里准会多出一条沙虫。谢啦！"
L["I'd gift-wrap yours, {name}, but all my wrapping is somebody's old map."] = "本想给你包装一下，{name}，可我的包装纸全是别人的旧地图。"
L["The alpacas saw that, {name}. They'll tell everyone how nice you are. Thanks!"] = "羊驼都看见了，{name}。它们会告诉大家你人多好。谢啦！"
L["Thank you, {name}! I'd give you my best button, but this is better. Slightly."] = "谢谢你，{name}！本想送你我最好的纽扣，不过这个更好。稍微好一点。"
L["Ooh, a present, {name}! I'll trade you one of mine."] = "哇，礼物，{name}！我拿一样我的跟你换。"
L["Thanks, {name}! That goes in the good pouch. Not the rock pouch. The good one."] = "谢啦，{name}！这个放进好袋子。不是石头袋。是好袋子。"
L["In Vol'dun that would've cost a whole waterskin, {name}. Thank you!"] = "在沃顿，这得花一整袋水，{name}。谢谢你！"
L["Thanks, {name}! Your name goes on the wagon. Between the alpaca and the dent."] = "谢啦，{name}！你的名字要刻上马车。就在羊驼和那个凹坑中间。"
L["Kindness is the one thing the desert never buried, {name}. Thank you."] = "善意是沙漠唯一埋不住的东西，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Rakera says repay quick, {name}, before you forget which pocket it's in. Here!"] = "莱克拉说要快点回报，{name}，趁你还没忘了塞哪个兜里。给！"
L["Nobody's given me anything I didn't dig up first, {name}. Thank you!"] = "以前我的东西全是自己挖出来的，没人送过，{name}。谢谢你！"
L["Of course, {name}! Shake the sand out and hold still."] = "当然，{name}！抖掉沙子，站好别动。"
L["Coming right up, {name}! Caravan service, no waiting."] = "马上就来，{name}！商队服务，无需等待。"
L["Sure, {name}! Let me dig it out... rope, rocks, a nice rock... here it is!"] = "好呀，{name}！我翻翻……绳子、石头、好看的石头……有了！"
L["Hold on, {name}! Tail's in the way, one moment... there!"] = "等一下，{name}！尾巴挡着，稍等……好了！"
L["One {buff}, {name}! Only slightly sandy."] = "一份{buff}，{name}！只沾了一点点沙子。"
L["Ask a vulpera and you'll get something, {name}. Usually odd. Not today!"] = "找狐人帮忙总能拿到点东西，{name}。通常很怪。今天不怪！"
L["Yours, {name}! Vulpera love giving things. Almost as much as finding them."] = "给你的，{name}！狐人爱送东西。几乎跟爱捡东西一样。"
L["Here, {name}! Patched it up myself. Holds better than it looks."] = "给，{name}！我自己缝补的。比看着结实。"
L["Sure, {name}! Stand upwind. Sandstorm last week; I'm still shedding it."] = "好呀，{name}！站上风口。上周的沙暴，我现在还在掉沙。"
L["YES! Sorry, {name}, too loud? The desert's very big. You have to shout in it."] = "好！抱歉，{name}，太大声了？沙漠太大了，得用喊的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Caravan rule: nobody asks twice for water or for help."] = "当然，{name}。商队规矩：讨水和求助，都不用开口第二次。"
L["On it, {name}! Small spell, big fox, bigger ears. Wait. Other way round."] = "来了，{name}！小法术，大狐狸，更大的耳朵。等等，说反了。"
L["For you, {name}? Easy! Caravan folk never say no to a neighbour."] = "给你？简单，{name}！商队的人从不拒绝邻居。"
L["Every traveller needs something for the road, {name}. I checked: not a rock."] = "旅人上路总得带点东西，{name}。我检查过了：不是石头。"
L["Keep this, {name}. The desert is long and the water is short."] = "收好，{name}。沙漠漫长，水可不多。"
L["Found this lying around, {name}. Kidding! It's fresh. Take it!"] = "路边捡的，{name}。开玩笑的！新鲜的。拿着！"
L["Here, {name}. Best thing in my pack, and I've got a lot of pack."] = "给，{name}。我包里最好的东西。我的包可大了。"
L["In the dunes you share your shade and your spells, {name}. Here."] = "在沙丘里，阴凉和法术都要分享，{name}。给。"
L["Some {buff} for you, {name}. I'd haggle, but you look busy."] = "给你点{buff}，{name}。本想讨价还价，看你挺忙的。"
L["A gift from the whole caravan, {name}! They'll never know."] = "整个商队送你的礼物，{name}！他们永远不会知道。"
L["For the road, {name}. Roads are the best part. Roads, and snacks."] = "路上用，{name}。路是最棒的部分。路，还有零食。"
L["Here, {name}! I swapped a hat for a thing, and the thing for this. Good trade!"] = "给，{name}！我拿帽子换了个东西，又拿那东西换了这个。划算！"
L["Nobody walks past anybody in the dunes, {name}. Bad luck, and rude. Here."] = "在沙丘里，谁也不会对谁视而不见，{name}。晦气，也没礼貌。给。"
L["My nose says trouble's ahead of you, {name}. Take this. My nose is never wrong."] = "我鼻子说你前面有麻烦，{name}。拿着。我的鼻子从不出错。"
L["Too many spells in my pack, {name}. They jingle. Take one, please."] = "我包里法术太多了，{name}。叮当乱响。拿一个吧，求你了。"
L["If you find anything shiny later, {name}, you know where my ears are. Here!"] = "以后找到亮晶晶的东西，{name}，你知道我的耳朵在哪儿。给！"
L["Wait, {name}! You nearly left without this. Deserts eat people who do that."] = "等等，{name}！你差点没拿这个就走了。沙漠会吃掉这种人的。"
L["Stew's not ready yet, {name}, so this is the starter."] = "炖菜还没好，{name}，先上这个开胃菜。"
L["A fellow wanderer! The caravan is never far, {name}, nor its gifts."] = "同是旅人！商队从不远，{name}，礼物也不远。"
L["Ears up, {name}! Always nice to share a spell with a fellow fox."] = "耳朵竖起来，{name}！跟同类狐狸分享法术，总是开心的。"
L["Vulpera to vulpera, {name}: here's this. I've three spare spoons too."] = "狐人对狐人，{name}：给你这个。我还有三把备用勺子。"
L["Vol'dun raised us both, {name}. Sand in the fur, luck in the pack. Have some."] = "沃顿把我们俩都养大了，{name}。毛里有沙，包里有运气。分你一点。"
L["Ears to ears, {name}: I heard you needed this."] = "耳朵对耳朵，{name}：我听说你需要这个。"
L["Remember the caravan fires, {name}? Everybody sang badly and shared. Here."] = "还记得商队的篝火吗，{name}？大家唱得难听，可都肯分享。拿着。"
L["Vol'dun's far behind us, {name}, half of it in our fur. This I brought for you."] = "沃顿已经远了，{name}，一半还在咱们毛里。这个是我专门带给你的。"
L["Caravan rules, {name}: stick together, share water and this. Never the alpaca."] = "商队规矩，{name}：一起走，水和这个都要分。羊驼不分。"
L["Anything shiny in there, {name}, I saw it first. This shiny bit is yours."] = "里面闪闪发亮的，{name}，都是我先看见的。这块亮晶晶的归你。"
L["One for the party, {name}! A caravan's only as fast as its slowest alpaca."] = "给小队的，{name}！商队的速度取决于最慢的那只羊驼。"
L["Here, {name}. Keep your pack shut. I don't mean to take things. I give, too."] = "拿着，{name}。背包扣好。我不是故意拿东西的。我也送东西。"
L["Lost in a city, never in a cave, {name}. Caves are houses with no rent. Here."] = "在城里会迷路，在洞里从不，{name}。洞穴就是不收房租的房子。拿着。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'm small, so I'll check the tiny tunnels. You take the big."] = "拿着，{name}。我个子小，小地道我来查。大的归你们。"
L["Shout if you need more, {name}. I've probably got it. It's probably dented."] = "还要就喊，{name}。我多半有。多半还瘪了。"
L["There, {name}. I'll take the back. Nobody gets left behind in a caravan."] = "好了，{name}。我殿后。商队里没人会被落下。"
L["A caravan with no wagon, {name}! Fast, light, nowhere to nap. Here's a boost."] = "没有车的商队，{name}！又快又轻，就是没地方打盹。给你加把劲。"
L["Scouted ahead by nose, {name}: danger and old cheese. Take this first."] = "用鼻子探过前面了，{name}：有危险，还有陈年奶酪味。先拿着这个。"
L["Everybody fed? Everybody watered? Good. Now this, {name}. Caravan order."] = "都吃饱了？都喝足了？好。接下来是这个，{name}。商队规矩。"
L["We vulpera travel by night, {name}. Cool sand, sleepy scorpids, and this."] = "我们狐人夜里赶路，{name}。凉沙、犯困的蝎子，还有这个。"
L["Desert nights get cold, {name}. Here, something warm-ish."] = "沙漠的夜很冷，{name}。给，有点暖的东西。"
L["Stars out, {name}. All signposts, and I can't read them. I can give you this."] = "星星出来了，{name}。全是路标，可我看不懂。这个我倒能给你。"
L["Good hour for foxes, {name}. The ears work best when it's quiet. So does this."] = "狐狸的好时辰，{name}。四下安静时耳朵最灵。这个也是。"
L["Past dark and I'm just waking up, {name}. First thing: this, for you."] = "天黑了我才刚醒，{name}。头一件事：把这个给你。"
L["I'll curl up in my tail later, {name}. Best blanket I own. First, this."] = "待会儿我裹着尾巴睡，{name}，那是我最好的毯子。先给你这个。"
L["Every caravan needs a friend like you, {name}."] = "每支商队都需要你这样的朋友，{name}。"
L["The desert's kinder with you beside me, {name}."] = "有你在身边，沙漠都温柔了，{name}。"
L["You and me against the sands, {name}. Always."] = "你和我，一起对抗风沙，{name}。永远。"
L["Ha! Clever and quick, {name}! A true caravan guardian."] = "哈！又聪明又敏捷，{name}！真正的商队守护者。"
L["Well done, {name}! The whole caravan will hear about this."] = "干得好，{name}！整个商队都会听说这事。"
L["Sharp work, {name}! Nobody messes with our camp."] = "利落，{name}！谁也别想动咱们的营地。"
L["Easy, {name}. Curl up and rest. I'll keep watch."] = "别急，{name}。蜷起来歇着吧。我守着。"
L["There now, {name}. Every caravan stops to tend its own."] = "好了，{name}。商队总会停下来照顾自己人。"
L["Breathe, {name}. The sand can wait. You come first."] = "呼吸，{name}。风沙可以等，你最要紧。"
L["A kindness returned is a kindness doubled, {name}."] = "一份善意回赠，就是两份善意，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You have restored my balance."] = "谢谢你，{name}。你让我重获平衡。"
L["Somewhere, a Sha just went hungry. Thank you, {name}."] = "某处有只煞刚刚饿肚子了。谢谢你，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Aysa would bow, Ji would cheer. I will do both, badly."] = "谢谢，{name}。阿伊莎会鞠躬，吉会欢呼。我都来，都不像样。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I will think of you at my next meal, and the one after."] = "谢谢你，{name}。下顿饭我会想起你，下下顿也会。"
L["Chen always said: never refuse a gift. Or a drink. Thank you, {name}."] = "陈常说：礼物不可拒。酒也不可拒。谢谢你，{name}。"
L["I was about to nap, {name}, but this is better. Slightly. Thank you."] = "我正要打个盹，{name}，不过这个更好。稍微好点。谢谢你。"
L["A hozen would have thrown something, {name}. I was raised better. Thank you."] = "换作猢狲，早就扔东西过来了，{name}。我家教好。谢谢你。"
L["That was very pandaren of you, {name}. All that's missing is a dumpling."] = "你这很有熊猫人风范，{name}。就差一个饺子了。"
L["At Halfhill that earns a prize turnip, {name}. I left mine at home. Thank you."] = "这在半山能换个获奖萝卜，{name}。我的落家里了。谢谢你。"
L["Grandmother kept a jar of kindnesses, {name}. Yours goes in; this comes out."] = "奶奶有个装善意的罐子，{name}。你的放进去，这个拿出来。"
L["Thank you, {name}. In the Jade Forest my door is open, and my pantry more so."] = "谢谢你，{name}。在翡翠林，我家门常开，粮仓开得更大。"
L["You move like the Shado-Pan, {name}. I never saw that coming. Thank you."] = "你身手堪比影踪派，{name}。我压根没看见你出手。谢谢你。"
L["Like rain on a rice paddy, {name}. The paddy never says thank you. I do."] = "真是场及时雨，{name}。稻田从不道谢，我会。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Li Li would put this in her travel journal. With drawings."] = "谢谢你，{name}。李李准会把这写进旅行日记，还配插图。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The August Celestials are busy, so I thank you for all four."] = "谢谢你，{name}。至尊天神们都忙，我替四位一起谢了。"
L["Stormstout ale knocks a pandaren flat, {name}. So did that. Thank you."] = "风暴烈酒能把熊猫人放倒，{name}。你这一下也是。谢谢你。"
L["Now we are even, {name}. A pandaren never lets a kindness go cold."] = "这下扯平了，{name}。熊猫人从不让人情放凉。"
L["Of course, {name}. Patience, and it is done. Patience is the slow part."] = "当然，{name}。耐心些，这就好。慢就慢在耐心上。"
L["With pleasure, {name}. A kind deed is never wasted."] = "乐意效劳，{name}。善举从不白费。"
L["At once, {name}. Quick for a pandaren, which is not saying much."] = "马上，{name}。以熊猫人的标准算快的。这标准不高。"
L["Master Shang Xi said: help whoever asks, {name}. I listened."] = "尚喜大师说过：有求必应，{name}。我听进去了。"
L["A Tushui master would make you meditate first, {name}. I will skip that part."] = "换作土水派的大师，得先让你冥想，{name}。这步我跳过。"
L["Anything for you, {name}. Except the last dumpling. Let us not be silly."] = "什么都行，{name}。最后一个饺子除外。别开玩笑了。"
L["One {buff}, {name}, brewed strong. The recipe stays a secret."] = "一份{buff}，{name}，浓酿的。配方保密。"
L["Stand like a crane, {name}: one leg, calm face. Two legs is also fine."] = "学仙鹤站好，{name}：单腿立，神情淡定。两条腿也行。"
L["We never refuse a request, {name}. Or a second helping."] = "我们从不拒绝请求，{name}。也不拒绝添饭。"
L["The last to ask me for help, {name}, was an island-sized turtle. You're easier."] = "上个求我帮忙的，{name}，是只岛那么大的龟。你好办多了。"
L["Pandaren help like we cook, {name}: slowly, generously, and far too much of it."] = "熊猫人帮忙跟做饭一样，{name}：慢，大方，而且量太多。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Let me put down my bowl. ...There. That was the hard part."] = "当然，{name}。容我先放下碗……好了。最难的一步完成了。"
L["Yes, {name}. Grandfather said never make guests ask twice. He said it twice."] = "好，{name}。爷爷说过，别让客人开口两次。他说了两次。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I am calm, you are calm, the spell is calm. Nobody panic."] = "别动，{name}。我淡定，你淡定，法术也淡定。谁都别慌。"
L["Take this, {name}. And perhaps a cup of tea afterward?"] = "拿着，{name}。回头一起喝杯茶？"
L["Balance in all things, {name}. Take this, and go with a light heart."] = "凡事讲平衡，{name}。拿着这个，轻松上路吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. A grummle would sell it to you for a luckydo."] = "拿着，{name}。换作咕噜，会拿它跟你换个幸运符。"
L["The jinyu say the waters foretold this, {name}. They say that a lot."] = "锦鱼人说这是水预言过的，{name}。他们常这么说。"
L["The Huojin say act first. The Tushui say think first. I say: here, {name}."] = "火金派说先做再想，土水派说先想再做。我说：给，{name}。"
L["A pandaren stood up to give you this, {name}. Treasure it."] = "一个熊猫人为了给你这个站起来了，{name}。好好珍惜。"
L["Fight like a monk, {name}: calm, quick, blessed, and then a long lunch."] = "像武僧一样战斗，{name}：沉稳、迅捷、受了祝福，然后吃顿长长的午饭。"
L["Go gently with this, {name}. The turtle got where it was going, unhurried."] = "带着这个慢慢走，{name}。大龟不慌不忙，也到了要去的地方。"
L["A hug would be forward, {name}. This is next best, and less furry."] = "拥抱太冒昧了，{name}。这个是次选，毛少一点。"
L["Take this, {name}. If a fight finds you, roll away. Rolling is very underrated."] = "拿着，{name}。要是架找上你，就滚开。打滚被严重低估了。"
L["For you, {name}. It is warm, round and full of good intentions. Like me."] = "给你，{name}。热乎、圆滚、满是好意。跟我一样。"
L["Take this, {name}. My kite is stuck in a tree, so I have time for good deeds."] = "拿着，{name}。我的风筝挂树上了，正好有空做好事。"
L["I carried this from Pandaria, {name}. Also a keg. The keg is mine."] = "从潘达利亚带来的，{name}。还有一桶酒。酒归我。"
L["The virmen stole my carrots, {name}, but this they will never get. Here."] = "兔妖偷了我的胡萝卜，{name}，这个它们休想拿走。给。"
L["On the Wandering Isle, {name}, strangers get soup. This travels better."] = "在迷踪岛，{name}，陌生人能喝上一碗汤。这个更好带。"
L["Pandaren look soft, {name}. So does this, until it saves you."] = "熊猫人看着软乎，{name}。这个也是，直到它救你一命。"
L["Chi-Ji says there is always hope, {name}. I say there is always a spare. Here."] = "赤精说希望总会有的，{name}。我说备用的总会有的。给。"
L["We must share a brew when the road allows, {name}! For now, share this."] = "等路上得闲，咱们得一起喝一壶，{name}！眼下先分这个。"
L["Shen-zin Su would be proud of us, {name}, and of this. Or asleep. Hard to tell."] = "神龟沈尊会为咱们骄傲的，{name}，也会为这个骄傲。或者在睡觉。说不好。"
L["Two pandaren, {name}. An innkeeper just felt a chill. Here, it warms."] = "两个熊猫人，{name}。某个旅店老板刚打了个寒战。拿着，这个暖身。"
L["Liu Lang would approve, {name}: two of us far from home, sharing. Here."] = "刘浪会赞同的，{name}：咱俩离家很远，还互相分享。拿着。"
L["Tushui or Huojin, {name}, we both left the turtle. Here's a taste of home."] = "土水也好，火金也罢，{name}，咱们都离开了大龟。尝尝家乡的味道。"
L["Pandaren to pandaren, {name}: the brews out here are thin. This is not."] = "熊猫人对熊猫人，{name}：外头的酒太淡了。这个可不淡。"
L["We both smell of rice wine and road dust, {name}. This smells of neither. Here."] = "咱俩身上都是米酒和尘土味，{name}。这个两样都没有。拿着。"
L["Pandaren look after pandaren, {name}. Mostly by feeding them. This comes first."] = "熊猫人照顾熊猫人，{name}，主要靠喂。先上这道。"
L["A gift, a fight, then a meal, {name}. That is the correct order."] = "先送礼，再打架，然后吃饭，{name}。这才是正确顺序。"
L["Stay together, {name}, like dumplings in a steamer. Warm now, and ready."] = "待在一起，{name}，像蒸笼里的饺子。现在热乎了，准备好了。"
L["We move as one, {name}, and now blessed as one. Slowly, perhaps."] = "我们如一人般前进，{name}，现在也如一人般受了祝福。也许慢一点。"
L["Balance, {name}: one fights, one heals, one carries snacks. And one gives this."] = "平衡，{name}：一个打，一个治，一个背零食。还有一个送这个。"
L["Take this, {name}. If we fall, we fall together, and then nap. Let us not."] = "拿着，{name}。要倒一起倒，然后睡一觉。还是别了。"
L["Here, {name}. Stay behind me. I am soft, but I am very wide."] = "拿着，{name}。待我后面。我软，但我很宽。"
L["Take this, {name}. If we win, I will cook. If we lose, I will cook, but sadly."] = "拿着，{name}。赢了我下厨。输了我也下厨，就是伤心点。"
L["Breathe, {name}. In, and out. Feel that? Now hit things, calmly."] = "呼吸，{name}。吸气，呼气。感觉到了吗？现在，沉着地揍。"
L["Quickly, {name}, take this. I am in a hurry. It happens about once a decade."] = "快，{name}，拿着。我赶时间。大约十年才这么一次。"
L["A party is like a brew, {name}: odd ingredients. I've just added one more."] = "队伍就像一壶酒，{name}：配料古怪。我刚又加了一味。"
L["Here, {name}. If I fall, roll me somewhere safe. Carrying me is not an option."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是倒了，把我滚到安全的地方。扛我是不可能的。"
L["Pandaren fight like water, {name}. This flows into you: calm, then everywhere."] = "熊猫人打起来像水，{name}。这个流进你身体里：先是平静，然后无处不在。"
L["Up before the tea, {name}? Brave. Here, instead of the tea."] = "茶还没泡你就起了，{name}？勇敢。给，这个先替茶。"
L["Morning, {name}. First this, then breakfast, then more breakfast."] = "早，{name}。先这个，再早饭，然后再来点早饭。"
L["A new day, {name}, and nobody has spilled anything. Let us begin with this."] = "新的一天，{name}，还没人洒东西。就从这个开始吧。"
L["Halfhill's farmers have been up for hours, {name}. I just rose, but with this."] = "半山的农夫早起了好几个钟头，{name}。我刚起，不过带着这个。"
L["Morning mist, {name}. Just like home, until a kobold walked by. Have this."] = "晨雾，{name}。跟家乡一模一样，直到一个狗头人走过去。拿着。"
L["Good morning, {name}. My stomach woke first and ordered me to give you this."] = "早上好，{name}。我的肚子先醒的，命令我把这个给你。"
L["Past my first nap, {name}, before my second. Take this while I'm awake."] = "第一觉睡过，第二觉还没睡，{name}。趁我醒着拿着。"
L["Late, {name}. The brewmasters sleep. The brews don't, and nor does this."] = "很晚了，{name}。酒仙们睡了。酒没睡，这个也没睡。"
L["Midnight snack time, {name}. This is the appetiser."] = "夜宵时间到，{name}。这是开胃菜。"
L["Dark already, {name}? Grandfather's stories would start now. Take this first."] = "天已经黑了，{name}？爷爷的故事该开讲了。先拿着这个。"
L["The moon is round and full tonight, {name}, as I am. Here, from both of us."] = "今晚月亮又圆又满，{name}，跟我一样。拿着，我俩一起送的。"
L["Patience and friendship, {name}. You have both."] = "耐心与友谊，{name}。你两样都有。"
L["Sit with me a moment, {name}. The road will wait."] = "陪我坐一会儿，{name}。路不会跑的。"
L["Life is better with good company, {name}. And good tea."] = "有好伙伴，日子更好，{name}。再加一壶好茶。"
L["Well done, {name}! Balance and strength, together."] = "干得好，{name}！平衡与力量合一。"
L["Wonderful, {name}! That deserves a feast. Maybe two."] = "太棒了，{name}！值得一顿大餐。也许两顿。"
L["Ha! Swift as a monk's fist, {name}."] = "哈！快得像武僧的拳头，{name}。"
L["Rest, {name}. Breathe deep. Find your balance again."] = "歇吧，{name}。深呼吸。重新找回平衡。"
L["Easy, {name}. The wounds will heal; the spirit endures."] = "别急，{name}。伤会好，心志长存。"
L["Quiet now, {name}. Let the pain drift away like mist."] = "安静，{name}。让疼痛像雾一样散去。"
L["Your kindness is noted, {name}. Dragons do not forget."] = "你的好意我记下了，{name}。巨龙从不遗忘。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Returned on swift wings."] = "谢谢你，{name}。展开疾翼，即刻回赠。"
L["Wings, fire and scales, {name}, and still you thought I needed help. Touching."] = "有翅膀、有火、有鳞，{name}，你还觉得我需要帮忙。真感人。"
L["I would bow, {name}, but last time my wings cleared a table. Thank you."] = "我本想鞠躬，{name}，可上次翅膀扫翻了一桌子。谢谢你。"
L["That goes straight into my hoard, {name}. Kind deeds are the only gold I keep."] = "这个直接收进我的宝库，{name}。善行是我唯一收藏的黄金。"
L["I was made to be a weapon, {name}. I much prefer this part. Thank you."] = "我生来是被造成武器的，{name}。我更喜欢这部分。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Wrathion would have made a speech of it. I will not."] = "谢谢你，{name}。换作拉希奥，得为这事演讲一番。我就不了。"
L["Returned with a little fire in it, {name}. Only a little. I am practising."] = "回赠你，带了一点火，{name}。就一点。我在练习。"
L["A mortal gift, {name}: small, brief and kind. I am learning to like all three."] = "凡人的礼物，{name}：小、短、暖。这三样我正学着喜欢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Mortal customs are new to me. Do I pay you? No? Then this."] = "谢谢，{name}。凡人规矩我不熟。要付钱吗？不用？那给你这个。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I have scales where most have feelings. That got through."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我浑身是鳞，刀枪不入，这回却被你打动了。"
L["You're on my list of favourite mortals, {name}. It was empty until today."] = "你上了我的最爱凡人名单，{name}。今天之前它还是空的。"
L["The red in me is grateful, {name}. The black in me is suspicious. The red wins."] = "我体内的红龙在感激，{name}，黑龙在起疑。红龙赢了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Dragons are not used to receiving. I find I like it."] = "谢谢你，{name}。龙不习惯收礼。我发现我挺喜欢。"
L["A dragon's thanks comes with a roar, {name}. I will spare the neighbours."] = "龙道谢得配一声咆哮，{name}。为了邻居，就免了吧。"
L["Very well, {name}. Stand still, I would hate to singe you."] = "那好，{name}。站着别动，燎到你就不好了。"
L["Granted, {name}. A dragon keeps its word."] = "应允了，{name}。巨龙言出必行。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand clear of the tail."] = "当然，{name}。离尾巴远点。"
L["Of course, {name}. Is this still how it is done? I was asleep for a while."] = "当然，{name}。现在还兴这么做吗？我刚打了个盹。"
L["Gladly, {name}. All five dragonflights are in me, and all five say yes."] = "乐意之至，{name}。五大龙军团都在我体内，全票通过。"
L["Right away, {name}. Dragon-sized help, in a conveniently smaller form."] = "马上就来，{name}。巨龙的分量，便携的包装。"
L["Of course, {name}. Neltharion only gave orders. A request is much nicer."] = "当然，{name}。耐萨里奥只会下令，你这声“请”好听多了。"
L["Right away, {name}. Stand back a little; I am still learning how big I am."] = "马上，{name}。退后一点，我还没摸清自己有多大。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Claws are not ideal for spellwork, but I manage."] = "当然，{name}。爪子不太适合施法，但我应付得来。"
L["Of course, {name}. Dragons usually demand tribute. I'm waiving it, this once."] = "当然，{name}。龙一般要收贡品。这次给你免了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Please don't scream. Mortals often do. It's the horns."] = "当然，{name}。请别尖叫，凡人常这样。都怪这对角。"
L["My breath is fire, {name}, so we will do this the other way."] = "我一张嘴就是火，{name}，所以咱们换个方式。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Mortals so rarely ask a dragon for anything but mercy."] = "乐意，{name}。凡人求龙，向来只求饶命。"
L["A small magic, {name}, but I cast it with enormous dignity."] = "小小法术，{name}，但我施放得无比庄重。"
L["Take this, {name}. Even a dragon needs allies. Especially one this size."] = "拿着，{name}。龙也需要盟友，尤其是个头这么小的龙。"
L["A gift from the Dragon Isles, {name}. Fly well."] = "来自巨龙群岛的礼物，{name}。祝你飞得顺畅。"
L["Alexstrasza says every life is precious, {name}. I am starting with yours."] = "阿莱克丝塔萨说每条生命都珍贵，{name}。我就从你开始。"
L["I slept through ten thousand years of good deeds, {name}. Catching up now."] = "一万年的好事我都睡过去了，{name}。现在来补课。"
L["Tell them a dragon did this, {name}. It sounds far grander than it was."] = "就说是龙干的，{name}。听着可比实际气派多了。"
L["Scalecommander's orders, {name}: take this. I'm no Scalecommander, but still."] = "鳞长有令，{name}：拿着这个。我不是鳞长，你就当是吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. Ancient dragon magic, only slightly out of date."] = "拿着，{name}。远古巨龙魔法，就是稍微过了保质期。"
L["A dragon giving, {name}, not taking. I am trying something new."] = "龙向来只进不出，{name}。我今天试试新花样。"
L["In visage form I look harmless, {name}. So did Lady Prestor. I give, not take."] = "人形的我看着无害，{name}。普瑞斯托女士也是。我是给予，不是索取。"
L["A gift from above, {name}. I landed specially. It took two tries."] = "天降之礼，{name}。我专程降落，试了两次才落稳。"
L["Here, {name}. Every dragon should guard something. I have chosen you, for now."] = "给，{name}。每条龙都得守护点什么。我暂时选了你。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's from five dragonflights, so it clashes with everything."] = "拿着，{name}。五大龙军团出品，五色俱全，跟啥都撞色。"
L["I'd fly you there myself, {name}, but dracthyr carry no riders. Take this."] = "本想亲自驮你飞过去，{name}，可龙希尔不载人。拿着这个吧。"
L["Dragons gifted the world at its dawn, {name}. Mine is smaller, and later."] = "巨龙在世界初生时就赠过礼，{name}。我这份小一点，晚一点。"
L["A little essence for you, {name}. It is what I'm made of, so handle it gently."] = "给你一点精华，{name}。我就是这东西做的，轻拿轻放。"
L["Take this, {name}. It will feel warm. Most things do, after I touch them."] = "拿着，{name}。会有点热。被我碰过的东西大多如此。"
L["The Forbidden Reach is far behind us, {name}. What we learned there, I share."] = "禁忌离岛已远在身后，{name}。在那里学到的，我分享给你。"
L["Two dracthyr, {name}. Mind the wings; no room for four. Take this."] = "两个龙希尔，{name}。当心翅膀，四只可张不开。拿着。"
L["Remember when the world was new to us, {name}? This still feels new."] = "还记得世界对我们来说还很新的时候吗，{name}？这个感觉依然新鲜。"
L["In visage form nobody can tell, {name}. Between us: this suits scales best."] = "人形状态谁也看不出来，{name}。咱俩之间说：这个配鳞片最好看。"
L["Made for war, {name}, and look at us: sharing. Somebody's plans went wrong."] = "生来为战，{name}，如今却在分享。某位的算盘落空了。"
L["Visage or scales, {name}, I'd know one of us anywhere. So here is yours."] = "人形也好鳞身也罢，{name}，同族我一眼就认得。所以，这份是你的。"
L["Mortals always ask if we'll fly them, {name}. Still no. But this, yes."] = "凡人总问我们能不能载他们飞，{name}。还是不行。不过这个可以。"
L["Between dracthyr, {name}: the horns never get easier with hats. This helps."] = "龙希尔之间说，{name}：长着角，戴帽子永远别扭。这个有帮助。"
L["Take this, {name}. Then tell me when to breathe fire. And when not to."] = "拿着，{name}。然后告诉我什么时候喷火。还有什么时候别喷。"
L["I woke in a cave of strangers, {name}. Now I give gifts to company. Better."] = "我在满是陌生人的洞里醒来，{name}。现在我给同伴送礼。好多了。"
L["Neltharion made us to fight alone, {name}. We improved on him. Here."] = "奈萨里奥造我们是让我们独自作战，{name}。我们比他强。拿着。"
L["Here, {name}. Stay clear of my tail. It hasn't learned whose side it's on."] = "拿着，{name}。离我尾巴远点。它还没搞清楚自己站哪边。"
L["A flight of our own, {name}, sharing its gifts. So this is what dragons meant."] = "我们自己的龙群，{name}，互相分享恩赐。原来巨龙说的是这个。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I say 'take cover', I mean behind my wings."] = "拿着，{name}。我喊“找掩护”，意思是躲我翅膀后面。"
L["That's for you, {name}. Stand beside me, never in front. I can't aim my breath."] = "给你的，{name}。站我旁边，别站前面。我的吐息瞄不准。"
L["Take this, {name}; leave the big ones to me. Well, the ones smaller than me."] = "拿着，{name}；大家伙交给我。嗯，比我小的那些。"
L["Stay close, {name}, blessed. I can glide us all down. Up is your problem."] = "带着祝福跟紧，{name}。我能带大家滑翔下去。往上就看你了。"
L["Keep moving, {name}. A dragon in a hurry gives gifts. One waiting is just big."] = "继续走，{name}。赶路的龙会送礼。干等的龙只是个头大。"
L["Here, {name}. Now tell me the plan slowly. I was made for battles, not plans."] = "拿着，{name}。现在慢慢跟我讲计划。我是为打仗造的，不是为计划。"
L["Mortals live so briefly, {name}. This should make today a little longer."] = "凡人活得太短了，{name}。这个能让今天稍微长一点。"
L["You're a good companion, {name}. Better than most dragons."] = "你是个好伙伴，{name}。比大多数龙都强。"
L["Stay near, {name}. I'll keep you warm when the wind turns."] = "靠近点，{name}。风向变了，我给你取暖。"
L["I slept for ten thousand years, {name}, and woke to find you."] = "我沉睡了一万年，{name}，醒来便遇见了你。"
L["Excellent, {name}. You fight like a true dragonflight."] = "好极了，{name}。你战斗起来像真正的龙族军团。"
L["Impressive, {name}. Not even a black dragon could do better."] = "厉害，{name}。连黑龙都做不到更好。"
L["Well done, {name}! The Dragon Isles have a new champion."] = "干得好，{name}！巨龙群岛有了新的勇士。"
L["Easy, {name}. I've weathered storms; we'll weather this."] = "别急，{name}。风暴我都挺过来了，这次也能。"
L["Rest, {name}. I'll shield you with my wings."] = "歇吧，{name}。我用翅膀护着你。"
L["Stay calm, {name}. The flames are mine to bear, not yours."] = "冷静，{name}。火焰由我来扛，不是你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Where I come from, a kindness is tended like a root."] = "谢谢你，{name}。在我老家，善意要像树根一样细心照料。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Hagar sent me to see the goddess's work. You're her best."] = "谢谢你，{name}。哈加尔派我来看女神的造物。你是其中最好的。"
L["Kindness echoes, {name}, and I grew up in a cavern. Here it comes back to you."] = "善意会有回音，{name}，而我是在洞穴里长大的。喏，它回到你这儿了。"
L["My Legacy Stone showed who I'd stand beside, {name}. It forgot you. Thank you."] = "我的传承石让我看过将来会与谁并肩，{name}。它漏了你。谢谢你。"
L["We read lives in a root's rings, {name}. Yours just grew a kind one."] = "我们从树根的年轮读人的一生，{name}。你的又添了善良的一圈。"
L["The Shul'ka gave up everything to guard us, {name}. I can give this much."] = "舒尔卡舍弃一切守护我们，{name}。一声谢谢，我总还给得起。"
L["The world is more than Harandar, the Song said, {name}. Thanks for proving it."] = "女神的歌声说过，世界远不止哈籁恩达尔，{name}。谢谢你证明了这一点。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Orweyna said outsiders had much to teach us. I'm learning."] = "谢谢你，{name}。奥威娜说外来者有很多东西能教我们。我正在学。"
L["Our oaths forbid speaking to outsiders, {name}. I'll risk a thank you."] = "誓言不许我们跟外来者说话，{name}。冒个险，说声谢谢。"
L["My people lived up here once, {name}. Thanks to you, I can see why."] = "我的族人从前也住在地表，{name}。有你在，我懂为什么了。"
L["We're raised on dedication and humility, {name}, so I'll just say thank you."] = "我们从小被教导要勤勉、要谦逊，{name}，所以我只说声谢谢。"
L["Back home I'd dance for that, {name}. Up here people stare, so: thank you."] = "在老家的话，我会为这个跳支舞，{name}。地表的人爱盯着看，那就：谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've left me glowing like a moth back in Harandar."] = "谢谢你，{name}。你让我亮得像哈籁恩达尔的飞蛾。"
L["Har'mara is the Village of Balance, {name}. I'd hate to go home lopsided."] = "哈尔玛拉最讲平衡，{name}。我可不想歪歪斜斜地回家。"
L["If Aln'hara can hear anything where she is, {name}, I hope she heard that."] = "艾林哈籁如今无论在哪儿，{name}，只要还听得见，希望她听到了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Protect, tend and serve, my people say. This is the serving."] = "当然，{name}。守护、照料、效劳，我的族人常这么说。这就是效劳。"
L["Of course, {name}. I answered the goddess's call. Yours is far easier to hear."] = "当然，{name}。女神的召唤我都回应了，你的声音可清楚多了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Dalnir would call this a distraction. Dalnir isn't here."] = "当然，{name}。戴尼尔会说这是不务正业。戴尼尔又不在。"
L["Of course, {name}. The roots never ask for anything. It's nice to be asked."] = "当然，{name}。树根从来不开口。有人开口求我，感觉真不错。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Back home I'd have had to pretend I never saw you."] = "乐意，{name}。要是在老家，我还得假装没看见你。"
L["Of course, {name}. Mind the quills; they're friendlier than they look."] = "当然，{name}。当心那些刺，它们比看上去和善。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Don't stand still too long; in Harandar you'd sprout mushrooms."] = "乐意，{name}。别站着太久不动，在哈籁恩达尔你会长出蘑菇的。"
L["Of course, {name}. I was raised to do exactly as I was told. For once, I will."] = "当然，{name}。我从小被教导要言听计从。这回，我就听一次。"
L["No alndust in this one, {name}. Nothing will come to life and bite you."] = "这次没掺艾林之尘，{name}。不会有东西活过来咬你。"
L["Of course, {name}. Half the names up here are new to me. Yours I'll keep."] = "当然，{name}。地表一半的名字我都没听过。你的我记下了。"
L["{buff}, {name}, grown under the World Trees and picked fresh."] = "{buff}，{name}，在世界之树下长成，新鲜现摘。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hagar is handling things at home; I'll handle them up here."] = "当然，{name}。家里有哈加尔照应，地表这边归我。"
L["At my initiation I was asked who I really am, {name}. Someone who says yes."] = "成年仪式上，有人问我究竟是谁，{name}。答案是：一个会说“好”的人。"
L["Take this, {name}, from a long way below. The roots send their regards."] = "拿着，{name}，这可是从地底深处来的。树根们向你问好。"
L["Take this, {name}, and may Aln'hara be with you."] = "拿着，{name}，愿艾林哈籁与你同在。"
L["The sky has no ceiling, {name}. Anything could fall on you. Take this."] = "天上没有顶，{name}，什么都可能砸到你头上。拿着。"
L["Follow the visions, Hagar said, {name}. Today they pointed at you. Take this."] = "哈加尔说，要追随幻象，{name}。今天它们指向了你。拿着。"
L["My people would have watched you from the brush, {name}. I'd rather do this."] = "换作我的族人，只会躲在灌木丛里看着你，{name}。我宁愿这样。"
L["Harandar stayed out of the world's wars, {name}. You weren't so lucky. Here."] = "哈籁恩达尔躲过了世上的战争，{name}。你就没这么走运了。给。"
L["The Zur'ashar paint every tale worth telling, {name}. Here; make yours long."] = "值得讲的故事，祖尔阿沙都会画下来，{name}。拿着；让你的故事长长久久。"
L["Take this, {name}. The goddess's world is a garden, and gardens have thorns."] = "拿着，{name}。女神的世界是座花园，花园里有刺。"
L["We tend roots in Harandar, {name}. You look as if you could use some tending."] = "在哈籁恩达尔，我们照料树根，{name}。你看起来也需要照料一下。"
L["My ancestors grew restless and sought a purpose, {name}. I've found mine. Here."] = "我的先祖坐不住，出去寻找使命，{name}。我找到我的了。给。"
L["Har'mara lives at peace with its neighbours, {name}. This is how it begins."] = "哈尔玛拉与邻为善，{name}。就是这样开始的。"
L["The first outsiders I met were fighting off a saptor, {name}. Best take this."] = "我遇到的第一批外来者正在打一头迅叶龙，{name}。你最好拿着这个。"
L["My people have kept hope alive for ages on very little, {name}. Have some."] = "我的族人凭着微薄所有，把希望守了千百年，{name}。分你一点。"
L["I'm still learning what to say to strangers, {name}. This seemed safest."] = "我还在学怎么跟陌生人说话，{name}。这样似乎最稳妥。"
L["My people live beside a wound that never heals, {name}. Here; come back whole."] = "我的族人住在一道永不愈合的伤口旁，{name}。拿着；平安回来。"
L["Two haranir out in the world, {name}. The elders would fret. I'll help instead."] = "两个哈籁尼尔在外闯荡，{name}。长老们会担心。我来帮忙就是了。"
L["Did the Song call you up as well, {name}? It called me to give you this."] = "你也被歌声召上来的吗，{name}？它召我来把这个给你。"
L["Keep to the brush, they told us, {name}. We're both bad at it. Take this."] = "他们叫我们躲在灌木里，{name}。咱俩都做不到。拿着。"
L["Harandar's roots run under all this, {name}. Some of their strength, for you."] = "哈籁恩达尔的根就在这一切底下，{name}。分你一点它们的力量。"
L["Looking for the goddess too, {name}? Two pairs of eyes, then, and this."] = "你也在找女神吗，{name}？那就两双眼睛，再加上这个。"
L["Told to give up childish adventures, {name}? Me too. Here, for the next one."] = "也有人叫你别再瞎冒险了吧，{name}？我也是。拿着，下一回用。"
L["Nobody up here speaks Hara'ni, {name}. So I'll just say it with this."] = "地表没人懂哈籁尼语，{name}。那我就用这个来说。"
L["Outsiders ask where we're from, {name}. I point down. Here's a bit of down."] = "外人总问我们从哪儿来，{name}。我就指指下面。给你一点下面的东西。"
L["Stay close, {name}. A haranir needs something to guard, and today it's you."] = "跟紧，{name}。哈籁尼尔总得守护点什么，今天就是你了。"
L["We once mastered every beast on our mountain, {name}. With this, these won't."] = "我们曾驯服了山上所有的野兽，{name}。有了这个，这些也撑不住。"
L["Word from Harandar, {name}: the haranir join the fight. This is my part."] = "来自哈籁恩达尔的消息，{name}：哈籁尼尔加入战斗。这是我的那份。"
L["My people's oldest shame is fighting each other, {name}. Here; together, then."] = "我族最古老的耻辱是自相残杀，{name}。拿着；那就一起打。"
L["Here, {name}. Mind your step; where I'm from, the floor is mostly roots."] = "拿着，{name}。当心脚下；在我老家，地面大多是树根。"
L["Take this, {name}. If anything crawls up from below, leave it to me."] = "拿着，{name}。要是有东西从下面爬上来，交给我。"
L["Dangerous, {name}? My ancestors went into the deep with less than this."] = "危险，{name}？我的先祖带着比这还少的东西就下了深渊。"
L["Do not fear the dark, {name}. Orweyna's words, and my gift, go with you."] = "不要害怕黑暗，{name}。奥威娜的话和我的礼物与你同行。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'll take the ledges. Clawed feet were made for them."] = "拿着，{name}。崖边交给我。长爪子的脚就是干这个的。"
L["The goddess's world is worth fighting for, {name}. This bit too. Here."] = "女神的世界值得我们去战斗，{name}。这一小块也是。拿着。"
L["I've cleared weeds, mud skippers and fungi, {name}. You I'll just bless."] = "杂草、泥跳鱼、真菌我都清过，{name}。对你嘛，只给祝福。"
L["The Zur'ashar won't paint this fight, {name}. Take this; let's win it anyway."] = "祖尔阿沙不会画这一仗，{name}。拿着；照样打赢它。"
L["Easy, {name}. Back in Harandar we tend friends like roots: gently."] = "别急，{name}。在哈兰达尔，我们像照料树根一样待朋友。"
L["You're the best thing the surface has given me, {name}."] = "你是地表给我最好的礼物，{name}。"
L["Stay close, {name}. Up here the sky goes on forever."] = "靠近点，{name}。上面的天空无边无际。"
L["Well done, {name}! Aln'hara would have smiled at that."] = "干得好，{name}！奥恩哈拉会为此微笑的。"
L["Protect, tend and serve, {name}. You did all three just now."] = "守护、照料、侍奉，{name}。你刚才三样都做到了。"
L["Fierce as the Shul'ka, {name}. I'm proud of you."] = "像舒尔卡一样凶猛，{name}。我为你骄傲。"
L["Rest, {name}. Let the roots hold you while you heal."] = "歇吧，{name}。你养伤时，让树根托着你。"
L["Easy, {name}. You glow a little dimmer, but you're still here."] = "别急，{name}。你的光暗了些，可你还在。"
L["Breathe, {name}. Every root grows back stronger."] = "呼吸，{name}。每条根都会长得更壮。"
L["It is good to see one of our own, {name}. This is how we greet them."] = "见到自己人真好，{name}。我们就这样打招呼。"
L["Our people are few, {name}. That makes each of us worth this."] = "我们族人不多，{name}。所以每一个都值得这个。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Alliance looks after its own, and today that's me."] = "谢谢你，{name}。联盟会照顾自己人，今天被照顾的是我。"
L["Kindness answered, {name}. For the Alliance!"] = "好意已回报，{name}。为了联盟！"
L["Thank you, {name}. Stormwind has a statue for every hero. I'll put in a word."] = "谢谢你，{name}。暴风城为每位英雄立像。我会替你说句话。"
L["The Alliance way, {name}: you help me, I help you, a dwarf buys the drinks."] = "联盟之道，{name}：你帮我，我帮你，矮人请喝酒。"
L["Bolvar would bow, Magni would hug, {name}. I'll just return it."] = "伯瓦尔会鞠躬，麦格尼会熊抱，{name}。我回个礼就好。"
L["If the Alliance gave medals for manners, {name}, you'd need a second tabard."] = "联盟要是给礼貌发勋章，{name}，你得再添件战袍来挂。"
L["Returned in full, {name}. An ally who gives first is worth a whole garrison."] = "如数奉还，{name}。先出手的盟友，抵得上一整座要塞。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll mention you in my letter home. Mother reads them aloud."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我会在家书里提你。我娘会大声念出来。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Even the Stormwind guards would smile at that."] = "谢谢你，{name}。连暴风城卫兵见了都会笑。"
L["The Alliance at its finest, {name}: nobody asked, somebody helped. Thanks."] = "这才是联盟最好的样子，{name}：没人开口，有人帮忙。谢了。"
L["I'll tell everyone on the Deeprun Tram, {name}. It's a long tram. Thank you."] = "我要讲给矿道地铁上每个人听，{name}。地铁可长了。谢谢你。"
L["Most gallant, {name}. If I had a lion on my tabard, it would be purring."] = "真有风度，{name}。我战袍上要是有狮子，这会儿准在打呼噜。"
L["Our kings bicker, {name}, but their people get on splendidly. Thank you."] = "国王们吵来吵去，{name}，百姓倒处得挺好。谢谢你。"
L["The Alliance was forged by folk keeping their word, {name}. Here's mine."] = "联盟靠说话算话的人铸就，{name}。这是我的那份。"
L["Of course, {name}. Allies help each other. It's practically in the name."] = "当然，{name}。盟友互助，“盟”字都写在名字里了。"
L["At once, {name}. The Alliance does not leave a friend wanting."] = "马上，{name}。联盟绝不让朋友空手而归。"
L["Of course, {name}. It's in the Alliance charter. Somewhere near the back."] = "当然，{name}。联盟章程里写着呢，大概在最后几页。"
L["By order of the Alliance, {name}: one {buff}, effective at once."] = "奉联盟之命，{name}：赐{buff}一份，即刻生效。"
L["Anything for an ally, {name}. Within reason. This is well within reason."] = "为了盟友什么都行，{name}。在合理范围内。这个非常合理。"
L["Right away, {name}. SI:7 knew you would ask. I only just found out."] = "马上，{name}。军情七处早料到了，我才刚知道。"
L["Straight away, {name}. The Alliance marches on requests like yours. And bread."] = "马上，{name}。联盟靠你这样的请求行军。还有面包。"
L["Yes, {name}. From Stormwind to Ironforge, 'please' opens every gate."] = "好，{name}。从暴风城到铁炉堡，一个“请”字能开所有城门。"
L["Right away, {name}. I've worn the blue all day hoping somebody would ask."] = "马上，{name}。我穿了一整天蓝衣，就盼着有人开口。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I learned this faster than the Alliance anthem."] = "别动，{name}。这招我学得比联盟军歌还快。"
L["Of course, {name}. Armies win wars; small favours win allies. Here's one."] = "当然，{name}。大军赢得战争，小忙赢得盟友。帮你一个。"
L["For the Alliance, {name}! Stay strong out there. Stronger, now."] = "为了联盟，{name}！在外面挺住。现在更挺得住了。"
L["Onward, {name}, and take this. The Alliance is with you."] = "前进，{name}，拿上这个。联盟与你同在。"
L["Take this, {name}. Had a gnome made it, it would come with twelve levers."] = "拿着，{name}。要是侏儒做的，准得配十二根拉杆。"
L["Compliments of the Alliance, {name}. We've done these since the Second War."] = "联盟赠品，{name}。老字号，第二次战争那会儿就有了。"
L["Chin up, {name}; take this. Somewhere in Stormwind, a bard writes about you."] = "打起精神，{name}；拿着这个。暴风城某处有个吟游诗人正在写你。"
L["Every ally counts, {name}. Today, you count double."] = "每个盟友都算数，{name}。今天你算两个。"
L["Anduin would want me to share, {name}, and I'd hate to disappoint him."] = "安度因会希望我分享，{name}，我可不想让他失望。"
L["Take this, {name}. Stormwind's walls can't follow you, so this will have to."] = "拿着，{name}。暴风城的城墙跟不了你，就让这个跟着吧。"
L["Here, {name}. The gryphons get you there; this gets you back."] = "给，{name}。狮鹫送你去，这个保你回。"
L["Alliance rule, {name}: keep your word, your walls, your friends. Here, friend."] = "联盟守则，{name}：守信、守城、守朋友。给，朋友。"
L["Every ally deserves a lion at their back, {name}. I'm the nearest lion."] = "每个盟友背后都该有头雄狮，{name}。离你最近的狮子就是我。"
L["A gift from the Alliance, {name}. Signed, sealed and hand-delivered."] = "联盟的礼物，{name}。签字、盖章、专人送达。"
L["The Alliance never forgets the brave, {name}. Here; give it something to keep."] = "联盟从不忘记勇士，{name}。拿着；给它留点值得记住的。"
L["Together we stand, {name}, and share. For the Alliance!"] = "我们并肩而立，{name}，同享同担。为了联盟！"
L["Right, {name}: take this, shields up, and nobody charges before the plan does."] = "好，{name}：拿着这个，举盾，谁也别抢在计划前头冲。"
L["The finest company the Alliance ever fielded, {name}. Best equipped, too, now."] = "联盟有史以来最好的队伍，{name}。现在装备也最好了。"
L["Together, {name}, we're practically a regiment. A small, well-blessed regiment."] = "我们凑一块，{name}，差不多就是个团了。一个小小的、福泽深厚的团。"
L["That's me watching your back, {name}. The Alliance was built by people who did."] = "这是我在替你护着后背，{name}。联盟就是这样的人建起来的。"
L["Shields together, {name}, and take this. The Alliance never won in single file."] = "盾牌靠拢，{name}，拿上这个。联盟从没靠排成一列打赢过。"
L["If this goes in the history books, {name}, let it say I blessed you first."] = "要是这事写进史书，{name}，就写我先给了你祝福。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whoever carries the banner gets painted looking noble."] = "拿着，{name}。扛旗的人画像上都显得高贵。"
L["Dwarven nerve, elven patience, human stubbornness, {name}, and a gift. Recipe."] = "矮人的胆量、精灵的耐心、人类的倔强，{name}，再加一份礼物。这就是配方。"
L["Keep the lion roaring, {name}, with this in you. Softly, mind. We're sneaking."] = "让雄狮咆哮吧，{name}，带着这个。小声点。咱们在潜行。"
L["Strength and honour, {name}. And kindness, it turns out. Repaid in full."] = "力量与荣誉，{name}。原来还有善意。如数奉还。"
L["The Horde takes care of its own, {name}."] = "部落从不亏待自己人，{name}。"
L["Strength given, strength returned, {name}. That's all of Horde diplomacy."] = "借我力量，还你力量，{name}。部落的外交全在这儿了。"
L["I'd carve your name on Orgrimmar's gates, {name}, but they're full. Thanks."] = "你的名字该刻上奥格瑞玛大门，{name}，可惜满了。谢啦。"
L["A goblin would've sent you an invoice, {name}. I'm sending this instead."] = "换作地精，早给你寄账单了，{name}。我寄这个。"
L["You did not have to do that, {name}. That is why the Horde remembers it."] = "你本不必这么做，{name}。正因如此，部落记住了。"
L["In the Horde we do not say thank you twice, {name}. So: once, and meant."] = "部落的谢谢不说第二遍，{name}。所以就一遍：真心的。"
L["In the Horde a debt is carried like an axe, {name}: openly, and not for long."] = "部落的债像斧子一样扛着，{name}：明着扛，扛不久。"
L["Thanks, {name}. The gate grunts will hear of it. They'll grunt. Means respect."] = "谢了，{name}。守门步兵会听说的。他们会哼一声。那是敬意。"
L["The Horde keeps two lists, {name}: grudges and favours. Yours is the short one."] = "部落记两本账，{name}：记仇的和记恩的。你在薄的那本上。"
L["Honour says repay you, {name}. Manners say smile. I'm working on the smile."] = "荣誉让我回报你，{name}。礼貌让我微笑。微笑我还在练。"
L["That landed softer than any zeppelin I've ridden, {name}. Thank you."] = "这一下比我坐过的哪艘飞艇落地都轻，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Thanks, {name}, in Orcish, Taur-ahe, Zandali and Gutterspeak. Pick one."] = "谢了，{name}。兽人语、牛头人语、赞达拉语、亡灵语版，任选。"
L["Thrall taught the Horde honour, {name}. Nobody had to teach you. Thank you."] = "萨尔教会了部落荣誉，{name}。你却无师自通。谢谢你。"
L["You gave first, {name}. In the Horde that earns first cut of the roast. Here."] = "你先出手的，{name}。在部落，这能分到烤肉第一刀。给。"
L["The Warchief can't thank everyone himself, {name}. He's delegated it to me."] = "大酋长没法亲自谢每个人，{name}。这活儿交给我了。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. For the Horde, and for anyone who asks nicely."] = "包在我身上，{name}。为了部落，也为了每个客气开口的人。"
L["You only had to ask, {name}. The Horde answers."] = "你只管开口，{name}。部落必有回应。"
L["The Horde usually helps with axes, {name}. Today, {buff}."] = "部落平时用斧头帮忙，{name}。今天用{buff}。"
L["Done, {name}. No speeches. The Horde has plenty of those already."] = "好了，{name}。不讲话了，部落的演讲已经够多了。"
L["You asked, {name}. In Orgrimmar, that counts as a formal treaty."] = "你开口了，{name}。在奥格瑞玛，这就算正式条约了。"
L["Asking is no weakness, {name}. Refusing an ally would be."] = "开口求助不是软弱，{name}。拒绝盟友才是。"
L["No need to bang a war drum, {name}. You asked; it's done."] = "用不着敲战鼓，{name}。你开口，就办了。"
L["Of course, {name}. In the Horde, 'please' outranks everyone but the Warchief."] = "当然，{name}。在部落，“请”字的官阶仅次于大酋长。"
L["In Orgrimmar we'd have argued about it first, {name}. Tradition. Here."] = "在奥格瑞玛，咱们得先吵一架，{name}。传统。给。"
L["Consider it requisitioned, {name}. The quartermaster needn't hear about it."] = "就当是征用的，{name}。军需官那边不必知道。"
L["Done, {name}. If anyone asks, I scowled the whole time. I've a reputation."] = "好了，{name}。有人问，就说我全程黑着脸。名声要紧。"
L["Of course, {name}. Horde hospitality: rough edges, full helpings."] = "当然，{name}。部落待客之道：粗是粗了点，管饱。"
L["The Horde came together because somebody always said yes, {name}. Yes."] = "部落能聚起来，是因为总有人说“好”，{name}。好。"
L["For the Horde, {name}! Go with strength. I've just handed you some."] = "为了部落，{name}！愿力量与你同行。我刚给了你一些。"
L["Go with honour, {name}, and with this. Victory awaits."] = "带着荣誉去吧，{name}，也带上这个。胜利在等着。"
L["Take this, {name}; do something worth a song. Loud songs. The Horde likes loud."] = "拿着，{name}；去干点值得传唱的事。大声唱的那种。部落就爱热闹。"
L["Walk tall, {name}. The Horde made room for those the world turned away. Here."] = "挺直腰杆走，{name}。部落向来收留被世界抛弃的人。拿着。"
L["Take this, {name}, and a word of Horde wisdom: hit first, apologise never."] = "拿着，{name}，再送你一句部落箴言：先动手，永不道歉。"
L["Victory or death, {name}. I'd prefer victory, so take this."] = "胜利或死亡，{name}。我更想要胜利，所以拿着。"
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Here's your thunder. Go and be it."] = "鲜血与雷霆，{name}！这是你的雷霆。去吧，化身雷霆。"
L["For the Horde, {name}, and for you. The Horde's big; you're closer."] = "为了部落，{name}，也为了你。部落太大，你离得近。"
L["Here, {name}. Stronger together, they say, and I've just done my half."] = "给，{name}。都说团结更强，我这一半已经尽了。"
L["Carry this, {name}. It weighs less than a Horde banner and flies just as proud."] = "带上这个，{name}。比部落战旗轻，飘得一样威风。"
L["Here, {name}. The Horde feeds its own, arms its own, and now enchants them."] = "给，{name}。部落给自己人管饭、发武器，现在还包施法。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever's out there is about to meet the Horde."] = "拿着，{name}。外面那些东西，马上就要见识部落了。"
L["Here, {name}. Wherever you're headed, arrive looking like the Horde sent you."] = "给，{name}。不管去哪，到了都得像是部落派来的。"
L["The Crossroads never turned a traveller away, {name}. Nor do I. This is free."] = "十字路口从不拒绝旅人，{name}。我也不。这个免费。"
L["The Horde raises you tough, {name}. This is for the days tough isn't enough."] = "部落把你养得够硬，{name}。这个留给硬也不够用的日子。"
L["Take this, {name}. A Horde gift: no ribbon, no speech, no refunds."] = "拿着，{name}。部落礼物：不系丝带，不讲话，不退不换。"
L["Stand tall, {name}, with this. Taller. The Horde has tauren to keep up with."] = "站直了，{name}，带着这个。再直点。部落里还有牛头人要比呢。"
L["Our strength is each other, {name}. Here's some of mine. For the Horde!"] = "我们的力量就是彼此，{name}。分你一点我的。为了部落！"
L["Forward, {name}, and take this. The Horde advances together. Retreats... never."] = "前进，{name}，拿着这个。部落一同推进。撤退……绝不。"
L["Together we're a war band, {name}. Apart, we're just loud. Take this."] = "合起来是战团，{name}。分开只是吵。拿着。"
L["Shoulder to shoulder, {name}, and blessed. Whoever charges first buys the grog."] = "肩并肩，{name}，带着祝福。谁先冲谁请喝格罗酒。"
L["Nobody gets left behind, {name}, or left out. I've counted us twice. Here."] = "谁都不落下，{name}，也不漏下。我数了两遍。拿着。"
L["Rule of the warband, {name}: nobody eats until everybody's back, and blessed."] = "战团的规矩，{name}：大家都回来、都受了祝福，才开饭。"
L["Drums up, {name}, and take this. If we can't be quiet, we'll be terrifying."] = "战鼓举起来，{name}，拿上这个。安静不了，那就吓死他们。"
L["The Horde never won a thing alone, {name}. Take this; let's not start now."] = "部落从没单打独斗赢过，{name}。拿着；别现在开这个头。"
L["We fight like the Horde, {name}: all at once, nobody waits. So take this now."] = "我们打仗跟部落一个样，{name}：一拥而上，谁也不等。所以现在就拿着。"
L["Right, {name}. Spoils shared, blame shared, this shared. Glory to the loudest."] = "好，{name}。战利品分，锅一起背，这个也分。荣耀归嗓门最大的。"
L["Look at us, {name}, all blessed. The Warchief would be proud. From a distance."] = "看看我们，{name}，人人受了祝福。酋长会骄傲的。远远地骄傲。"
L["Tusks, horns, long ears, bare bone, {name}, all blessed. Finest warband going."] = "獠牙、犄角、长耳朵、光骨头，{name}，全都受了祝福。最棒的战团。"
L["The war stories get bigger after, {name}. With this, give them a head start."] = "战争故事事后都会越讲越大，{name}。有了这个，先给它们开个头。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Good hearts turn up on every side, and apparently here."] = "谢谢你，{name}。哪一方都有好心人，看来这儿也有。"
L["Thank you, {name}. No side, no title, just kindness. Legends start like this."] = "谢谢，{name}。无门无派，只有善意。传奇都这么开头。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness has no faction, which is handy, since I have none."] = "谢谢你，{name}。善意不分阵营，正好，我也没有阵营。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Whichever side gets you is getting a bargain."] = "谢谢你，{name}。不管哪边得到你，都是捡了大便宜。"
L["Whoever claims me in the end, {name}, I'll remember you first. Thank you."] = "不管最后我归了哪边，{name}，我都先记着你。谢谢。"
L["Strictly neutral, {name}, but gratitude doesn't count. Thank you."] = "我严守中立，{name}，但道谢不算站队。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I carry no banner, so both hands are free to return this."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我不扛旗，两只手都空着，正好回礼。"
L["The Steamwheedle stay neutral for gold, {name}. I return favours for free."] = "热砂财团为金币保持中立，{name}。我回报好意分文不取。"
L["Neither side has taught me their thanks yet, {name}, so here's the plain kind."] = "两边都还没教我怎么道谢，{name}，先来个原味的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I stand between two great banners, and still you noticed me."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我夹在两面大旗之间，你还是看见了我。"
L["Two sides at war, {name}, and us being lovely right in the middle. Thank you."] = "两边在打仗，{name}，咱们在正中间岁月静好。谢谢你。"
L["Gladly, {name}, whatever banner you fly. I don't even own a banner."] = "乐意，{name}，不管你打哪面旗。我连旗都没有。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I help everyone. It's the one thing I've decided."] = "当然，{name}。我谁都帮。这是我唯一拿定的主意。"
L["Everyone asks me which side I'm on, {name}. Much nicer to be asked for help."] = "人人都问我站哪边，{name}。被请帮忙可舒服多了。"
L["Of course, {name}. No war council to ask; just me, and I say yes."] = "当然，{name}。不用请示战争议会，我说行就行。"
L["Here you are, {name}. No oath, no colours, no fee."] = "给你，{name}。不宣誓，不站队，不收费。"
L["I can't pick a side yet, {name}, but I can pick a good cause. This is one."] = "阵营我还选不了，{name}，好事我还是会选的。这就是一件。"
L["At once, {name}. I have no side to be on, so for now I am entirely on yours."] = "马上，{name}。我没有阵营可站，所以眼下完全站你这边。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nobody pays me to take sides, so I take requests instead."] = "当然，{name}。没人雇我站队，那我就改接单。"
L["Neutral does not mean unwilling, {name}. It means I help first and argue never."] = "中立不等于不情愿，{name}。意思是先帮忙，永不争论。"
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}. Or from none, like me. Here."] = "朋友可以来自任何一方，{name}。或者像我这样哪方都不是。拿着。"
L["Soon they'll hand us tabards, {name}. Until then, we look after each other."] = "迟早会发给我们战袍，{name}。在那之前，我们互相照应。"
L["I haven't chosen a side yet, {name}, so I'm being kind to both. Take this."] = "我还没选边，{name}，所以两头都示好。拿着。"
L["A gift with no strings, {name}. I don't even have a faction to tie them to."] = "不附带任何条件，{name}。我连阵营都没有，条件往哪儿挂？"
L["Go on, {name}, with this. Two whole factions are waiting to argue over us."] = "去吧，{name}，带上这个。两大阵营都等着为我们吵一架。"
L["No quartermaster yet, {name}, so nobody's counting. Have plenty."] = "还没有军需官管账，{name}，没人数。尽管多拿。"
L["Take this, {name}. Neutral ground travels with me; you're standing on some."] = "拿着，{name}。中立地带跟着我走，你脚下就是。"
L["The Argent Dawn helps whoever needs it, {name}. I'm learning from the best."] = "银色黎明谁需要就帮谁，{name}。我在跟最好的老师学。"
L["Booty Bay's rule: no fighting on the docks, {name}. Mine: no refusing a gift."] = "藏宝海湾：码头禁止斗殴，{name}。我这儿：礼物禁止拒收。"
L["The one thing both factions agree on, {name}. They just don't know it yet."] = "两大阵营唯一的共识，{name}。只是他们自己还不知道。"
L["This goes with any tabard, {name}. I made sure by giving it no colours at all."] = "配哪件战袍都行，{name}。我特意没给它上任何颜色。"
L["For you, {name}. Neither Orgrimmar nor Stormwind sent it. It works anyway."] = "给你，{name}。奥格瑞玛没送，暴风城也没送，照样管用。"
L["Here, {name}. I belong to no nation yet, so I practise belonging to everyone."] = "给，{name}。我还不属于任何国度，就先练习属于所有人。"
L["Side by side, {name}, whatever comes. Take this."] = "并肩同行，{name}，无论遇到什么。拿着。"
L["No flag over this party, {name}, just us, and this. That's plenty."] = "这支队伍不打旗，{name}，只有我们，还有这个。够了。"
L["One day we'll pick sides, {name}. Today we share this and pick fights together."] = "总有一天要选边，{name}。今天咱们分享这个，一起找架打。"
L["Whatever side the rest of the world is on, {name}, I'm on yours. Here."] = "不管世界其他人站哪边，{name}，我站你这边。拿着。"
L["Neutral in the war, {name}, but generous to this group. Take this."] = "战争中中立，{name}，可对这支队伍很大方。拿着。"
L["They call us a neutral party, {name}. Nobody said it couldn't give gifts."] = "他们说我们是中立的一方，{name}。可没人说中立就不能送礼。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever we fight today, it's nothing personal. Thorough."] = "拿着，{name}。今天跟谁打都不是私人恩怨。就是彻底。"
L["One side in this party, {name}: ours. Smallest faction, best perks. Here."] = "这支队伍只有一方，{name}：我们。最小的阵营，最好的福利。拿着。"
L["No orders from any capital, {name}. We choose our road, and our gifts. Here."] = "不听任何都城的号令，{name}。路我们自己选，礼物也是。拿着。"
L["No war to win today, {name}, just this one fight. And you've got this for it."] = "今天没有要赢的战争，{name}，只有这一仗。为此你有了这个。"
L["One good turn deserves another, {name}."] = "投桃报李，{name}。"
L["Have some {buff} in return, {name}."] = "回赠你一份{buff}，{name}。"
L["Kindness should go both ways, {name}. Thank you."] = "好意该有来有往，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["You went first, {name}, so I'll go second and we'll call it friendship."] = "你先出手，{name}，我接着来，这就叫友谊。"
L["I'd write you a song, {name}, but {buff} is less off-key."] = "本想给你写首歌，{name}，但{buff}没那么跑调。"
L["A gift for a gift, {name}. At this rate we'll be unstoppable by supper."] = "礼尚往来，{name}。照这速度，晚饭前我们就天下无敌了。"
L["All square, {name}. Unless you'd like to make it best of three."] = "扯平了，{name}。除非你想三局两胜。"
L["You started it, {name}. I'm only finishing it."] = "你先动的手，{name}。我来收尾。"
L["That was kind, {name}. The day just got noticeably better. Here's my half."] = "真贴心，{name}。今天明显变好了。这是我那一半。"
L["I was about to do that for you, {name}. Honestly. Here's proof."] = "我正准备这么做呢，{name}。真的。证据在此。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll sleep better tonight, and I sleep in a ditch."] = "谢谢你，{name}。今晚能睡得更香了，虽然我睡在沟里。"
L["Two good things today, {name}: your kindness, and the chance to return it."] = "今天有两件好事，{name}：你的好意，还有回报它的机会。"
L["You had me in your debt for all of three seconds, {name}. There."] = "我欠了你足足三秒钟，{name}。还上了。"
L["Gratitude is best served quickly, {name}. Here it is, still warm."] = "谢意要趁热，{name}。给，还热乎着。"
L["Well, {name}, now I have to be a better person all day. Thanks for that."] = "好吧，{name}，这下我一整天都得做个更好的人了。多谢你啊。"
L["Returned with a bow, {name}. A figurative one. My back isn't what it was."] = "鞠躬回礼，{name}。比喻意义上的。我的腰不比从前了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Somebody had to go first, and I'm glad it was you."] = "谢谢你，{name}。总得有人先开头，我很高兴是你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've rescued a day I'd written off at breakfast."] = "谢谢你，{name}。这一天我早饭时就放弃了，被你救了回来。"
L["You asked, {name}, and here it is."] = "你要的来了，{name}。"
L["{buff}, coming right up, {name}."] = "{buff}马上就来，{name}。"
L["Gladly, {name}. One moment."] = "很乐意，{name}。稍等一下。"
L["Asked and answered, {name}. Next question?"] = "有问必答，{name}。下一个问题？"
L["Say the word and it's yours, {name}. You said several. Here."] = "一句话的事，{name}。你说了好几句。给。"
L["For you, {name}? Gladly. I was hoping someone would ask."] = "给你？乐意，{name}。正盼着有人开口呢。"
L["Of course, {name}. Easiest yes I'll say all day."] = "当然，{name}。今天最爽快的一次点头。"
L["Right away, {name}. Finally, a question I know the answer to."] = "马上，{name}。总算来了道我会的题。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nicely asked, gladly given."] = "当然，{name}。问得客气，给得乐意。"
L["Hold still, {name}. It works best on people who aren't fidgeting. So, nobody."] = "别动，{name}。这法术对不乱动的人最灵。可惜没人不乱动。"
L["Here you are, {name}. I'd make you wait for effect, but that seems rude."] = "给，{name}。本想吊吊你胃口，可那样太不厚道。"
L["Yes, {name}. I'd have said it sooner if you'd asked sooner."] = "行啊，{name}。你早点问，我早点答应。"
L["Say no more, {name}. Done before you finished asking."] = "不必多说，{name}。你还没问完就好了。"
L["There, {name}. Next time, don't ask; just stand near me looking hopeful."] = "好了，{name}。下次别开口，站我旁边眼巴巴看着就行。"
L["Coming up, {name}. This is the one part of my day that goes to plan."] = "马上来，{name}。今天总算有件事按计划走了。"
L["Asking nicely works, {name}. Tell everyone. The world could use the news."] = "客气真管用，{name}。去告诉大家，世道缺这种好消息。"
L["At once, {name}. Stay put, or this lands on your shadow instead."] = "这就来，{name}。别动，不然就落你影子上了。"
L["Safe travels, {name}. {buff} packs lighter than a sword."] = "一路平安，{name}。{buff}可比剑轻便多了。"
L["A small blessing for the road, {name}."] = "送你一点路上的祝福，{name}。"
L["Go well, {name}, and take this. Come back in one piece."] = "一路平安，{name}，拿着这个。完完整整地回来。"
L["No reason, {name}. It just felt like a {buff} sort of day."] = "没理由，{name}。就觉得今天适合来点{buff}。"
L["Don't mind me, {name}. Just passing, with a spare {buff}."] = "别在意，{name}。路过而已，顺手多了份{buff}。"
L["Consider it a gift, {name}. I'd wrap it, but it glows through the paper."] = "就当是礼物吧，{name}。本想包一下，可它隔着纸都在发光。"
L["Here, {name}. Pass it on when you meet someone who needs it."] = "给，{name}。遇到需要的人，就把它传下去。"
L["Whatever brings you here, {name}, this should help it go better than planned."] = "不管你来这儿为了什么，{name}，这个能让它比计划的更顺。"
L["Just being neighbourly, {name}. Very, very temporary neighbours."] = "邻里之间嘛，{name}。非常、非常临时的邻居。"
L["You looked about to do something brave, {name}. Here, for that."] = "看你像要去干件勇敢的事，{name}。给，壮壮胆。"
L["No need to stop, {name}. It works while you walk."] = "不用停下，{name}。走着也能生效。"
L["Nothing asked, nothing owed, {name}. Nothing to do but go and be splendid."] = "不求什么，也不欠什么，{name}。你只管去大放异彩。"
L["Call it a wager, {name}, that you'll do something worthwhile with it."] = "就当我押了一注，{name}，赌你能拿它干点正事。"
L["A gift from a passing stranger, {name}. The best kind, the old stories say."] = "陌路人送的礼，{name}。老故事里，这种最灵验。"
L["It's rude to pass someone without a greeting, {name}. This is mine."] = "路过不打招呼太失礼了，{name}。这就是我的招呼。"
L["Same road as me, {name}? Then take this for the journey."] = "跟我同路，{name}？那带上这个上路吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. If today goes well, remember me. If badly, I was never here."] = "拿着，{name}。今天顺利就记着我。不顺利，我就从没来过。"
L["Hold still a moment, {name}. There. Best-prepared person in sight."] = "别动，{name}。好了。放眼望去，就你准备最周全。"
L["Everyone ready? You are now, {name}."] = "都准备好了？这下你也齐活了，{name}。"
L["A little something for the party, {name}."] = "给队伍的一点小心意，{name}。"
L["Stay close, {name}. We go further together, and further still with this."] = "待近点，{name}。一起走得更远，有了这个还能更远。"
L["House rules, {name}: nobody dies, nobody sulks, everybody gets one of these."] = "家规，{name}：谁也不许死，谁也不许闹脾气，人人一份。"
L["There, {name}. Now if this goes badly, it won't be my fault."] = "好了，{name}。这下要是搞砸了，可不怪我。"
L["All set, {name}. I'd give a speech, but we'd be here all day."] = "齐活了，{name}。本想讲两句，可一讲就是一整天。"
L["Look after that, {name}. It's the only one I brought for you."] = "收好了，{name}。给你的就带了这一份。"
L["Now we look the part, {name}. Let's go and be it."] = "像模像样了，{name}。走，去名副其实。"
L["Fresh {buff} all round, {name}. The rest is luck and elbows."] = "{buff}人人有份，{name}。剩下靠运气和胳膊肘。"
L["Anyone have a plan, {name}? No? Mine was this. Wonderful. Onward."] = "谁有计划，{name}？没有？我的计划就是这个。好极了。出发。"
L["One each, {name}. Don't swap; they're fitted."] = "一人一份，{name}。别换，量身定做。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whoever starts the fight has to tell the story afterwards."] = "拿着，{name}。谁先动手，事后谁讲故事。"
L["Good friends, sharp steel, {buff}. What else is there, {name}?"] = "好友、利刃、{buff}。还缺什么呢，{name}？"
L["For you, {name}. Stay where I can see you. I can't help what I can't find."] = "给你的，{name}。待在我看得见的地方。找不着，我就帮不上。"
L["If this ends up a legend, {name}, I want a line in it: the one giving you this."] = "要是这成了传说，{name}，我要一句台词：就是把这个给你那句。"
L["Brace yourselves, {name}. This helps. And each other, if it comes to that."] = "做好准备，{name}。这个有帮助。真到那一步，就互相扶着。"
L["Chin up, {name}, and take this. Whatever's ahead has never met this lot before."] = "打起精神，{name}，拿着这个。前面不管是什么，都还没见识过我们这伙人。"
L["Here, {name}, to keep you in one piece. I'm only equipped for small repairs."] = "拿着，{name}，好让你完整无缺。我只会修修补补。"
L["Well, {name}, with this on you we look ready. Let's go before we learn more."] = "好了，{name}，你身上有了这个，咱们看着像准备好了。趁还没发现别的，走吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. If we get lost, we're exploring. Nobody scolds an explorer."] = "拿着，{name}。要是迷路了，那叫探索。没人会骂探险家。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd conjure a gift in return, but it would only be water."] = "谢谢你，{name}。想造份礼物回你，可造出来准是水。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. I'll write it up properly later. Several pages."] = "承情，{name}。回头我好好写份报告。好几页那种。"
L["Thank you, {name}. They never taught gratitude at Dalaran. I'm self-taught."] = "谢谢你，{name}。达拉然从不教怎么感恩，我是自学的。"
L["Kind of you, {name}. Everyone assumes mages need no help. We do."] = "有心了，{name}。大家都以为法师不需要帮助。我们需要。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I nearly Counterspelled that on reflex. So glad I didn't."] = "谢谢你，{name}。差点本能地法术反制你，还好忍住了。"
L["Even a frost mage would thaw at that, {name}. Thank you."] = "冰霜法师也得被你捂化了，{name}。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Noted in my spellbook, between Frost Nova and lunch."] = "谢谢，{name}。记在法术书里，冰霜新星和午饭之间。"
L["Repaid at once, {name}, before I pass a bookshop. I've lost weeks that way."] = "趁没路过书店赶紧还你，{name}。我在书店丢过好几周。"
L["Twenty years in the library, {name}, and no book said how to thank you. This."] = "在图书馆待了二十年，{name}，没有一本书教我怎么谢你。就用这个吧。"
L["Arcane theory says nothing comes free, {name}. Theory was wrong. Thank you."] = "奥术理论说凡事皆有代价，{name}。理论错了。谢谢你。"
L["Of course, {name}. And yes, I suppose you'll want water as well."] = "当然，{name}。行了，我知道，你还要水。"
L["As requested, {name}. I'll find my page again later."] = "如你所愿，{name}。书读到哪页，我回头再找。"
L["At once, {name}. Carefully, too; I've blinked into two walls today."] = "马上，{name}。我会小心，今天已经闪现撞墙两次了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Knowledge should be shared. The Kirin Tor say so, reluctantly."] = "乐意，{name}。知识该共享——肯瑞托也这么说，不情不愿地。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I'll cast it slowly. The hand movements are the best part."] = "没问题，{name}。我慢慢施，手势才是精华。"
L["Of course, {name}. Think of it as homework, and I've done it for you."] = "当然，{name}。就当是作业，我替你写完了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Antonidas taught me this. He also taught me to duck."] = "当然，{name}。安东尼达斯教的。他还教我抱头蹲下。"
L["At once, {name}. Arcane, not fire. I did check."] = "马上，{name}。奥术的，不是火。我查过了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. It's this or a lecture on ley lines, and you've been kind."] = "当然，{name}。本该先讲一课魔网，看你人好，免了。"
L["You asked a mage, {name}. The spell is instant; the explanation is not."] = "你问的是法师，{name}。法术是瞬发的，解释可不是。"
L["I've cast this a thousand times, {name}. Nine hundred and ninety went well."] = "这法术我放过一千次，{name}。其中九百九十次很顺利。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand still. Fidgeters have been known to end up woolly."] = "当然，{name}。站好。乱动的人，据说都长出了羊毛。"
L["Here, {name}. I had a spare thought and nowhere to put it."] = "给，{name}。我多了个念头，正好没地方放。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd add bread, but conjured bread tastes of nothing."] = "拿着，{name}。本想加个面包，可造出来的面包没味儿。"
L["{buff} for you, {name}. No charge, unlike the portals."] = "{buff}免费送，{name}。传送门可不免费。"
L["Here, {name}. Most folk I point at turn into sheep. Today's your lucky day."] = "给，{name}。被我指着的人大多会变成羊。今天你走运。"
L["Nothing on fire, nothing frozen, {name}. I'm branching out."] = "不点火，不冰冻，{name}。我在拓展业务。"
L["For you, {name}. I was practising, and you happened to be the nearest head."] = "给你，{name}。我在练习，你刚好是离我最近的那颗脑袋。"
L["Here, {name}. Freshly cast, and hardly crackling at all."] = "给，{name}。刚施放的，几乎不噼啪作响了。"
L["Kings once hired Dalaran for this, {name}. You get it for nothing."] = "国王们曾花重金请达拉然做这个，{name}。你白拿。"
L["Take this, {name}. It wears off, unlike my last experiment."] = "拿着，{name}。会消退的，不像我上个实验。"
L["For you, {name}: everything I learned in Dalaran, minus the essays."] = "给你，{name}：我在达拉然学到的一切，论文除外。"
L["Here, {name}. Arcane magic is best shared, before it gets ideas of its own."] = "给，{name}。奥术要趁早分享，免得它自己有了主意。"
L["Evocation takes an age, {name}, so I spend my mana where it counts. Here."] = "唤醒要好半天，{name}，所以法力值得花在刀刃上。给。"
L["Here, {name}. A mage who walks past without helping is just a very tall hat."] = "给，{name}。见人不帮的法师，不过是一顶很高的帽子。"
L["Now that you're clever, {name}, stand between me and the angry things."] = "既然你变聪明了，{name}，就站到我和那些暴躁家伙中间。"
L["Take this, {name}. For the record, I only blink away when it's tactical."] = "拿着，{name}。郑重声明：我只在战术需要时才闪现。"
L["This first, {name}. Water's on me after; please don't ask for it mid-fight."] = "先拿着这个，{name}。水回头我请；打着打着别找我要。"
L["Minds sharpened, {name}. I'll handle the fire, the frost and the panicking."] = "脑子都磨快了，{name}。火、冰和惊慌失措，都交给我。"
L["Here, {name}. If I say 'Frost Nova', run. If I say 'run', also run."] = "拿着，{name}。我喊“冰霜新星”，就跑。我喊“跑”，也跑。"
L["Take this, {name}. Pyroblast takes a while; interrupt it and it's personal."] = "拿着，{name}。炎爆术读条长；谁打断，我跟谁没完。"
L["Yours, {name}. If I ice-block, I'm not frozen with fear. It's on purpose."] = "你的，{name}。我开寒冰屏障不是吓僵了。是故意的。"
L["This now, {name}; portals home after. Getting there alive is on all of us."] = "现在先拿这个，{name}；回城传送门之后再开。活着到那儿得靠大家。"
L["Take this, {name}. Anything you'd rather not fight, point at. Wool by teatime."] = "拿着，{name}。不想打的就指给我。下午茶前就变成羊毛。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll drop a Blizzard on them. Watch, but from outside it."] = "拿着，{name}。我要往它们头上砸暴风雪。看可以，站外面看。"
L["Take this, {name}. Keep them off me, and I'll keep them on fire."] = "拿着，{name}。你挡住它们别靠近我，我就让它们一直着火。"
L["That's for you, {name}. If I go quiet, it's Evocation, not sulking. Usually."] = "给你的，{name}。我要是不吭声，是在唤醒，不是生闷气。一般是。"
L["Take this, {name}. If it goes badly, I've a teleport home. I'd never use it."] = "拿着，{name}。要是砸了，我有传送回家。我绝不会用的。"
L["How thoughtful, {name}. The Light keeps accounts; I settle mine early."] = "真体贴，{name}。圣光会记账，我提前结清。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll put in a good word with the Light. It owes me several."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我会在圣光面前替你美言。它欠我好几个人情。"
L["Thank you, {name}. A small miracle, and I didn't even have to pray for it."] = "谢谢你，{name}。一个小奇迹，我都没祈祷就来了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My faith in people is restored. It was only resting."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我对人性的信心恢复了。它只是在打盹。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You're in tonight's prayers. Near the top."] = "谢谢你，{name}。今晚祷告有你，排得很靠前。"
L["Healers are rarely on this end of it, {name}. I'd forgotten how nice it is."] = "治疗很少被人照顾，{name}。我都忘了这滋味多好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. You've saved me a prayer, and I'm always one short."] = "谢谢你，{name}。帮我省了次祷告，我老是差一次。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd give a sermon on generosity, but you've just given it."] = "谢谢你，{name}。本想讲讲慷慨，你这是身教胜于言传。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll light a candle for you. Two. I'm feeling reckless."] = "谢谢你，{name}。为你点根蜡烛。两根。豁出去了。"
L["Even my shadowy side is smiling, {name}. It has no face, so take my word."] = "连我的暗影面都在笑，{name}。它没脸，你信我就好。"
L["Of course, {name}. The Light keeps no hours, and neither, sadly, do I."] = "当然，{name}。圣光全天候营业，可惜我也是。"
L["Straight away, {name}. Most prayers take longer; you've found a shortcut."] = "马上，{name}。一般的祈祷要久得多，你找到捷径了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. The Light shines on those who ask. I just aim it."] = "当然，{name}。圣光照耀祈求者，我只负责瞄准。"
L["With pleasure, {name}. Faith moves mountains; I'm starting smaller."] = "乐意效劳，{name}。信仰能移山，我先挪个小的。"
L["Of course, {name}. Confessions are extra, and I'd rather not hear them."] = "当然，{name}。告解另算，而且我不太想听。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nobody who asks goes without. The Light's rule, and mine."] = "当然，{name}。开口的人不会落空。这是圣光的规矩，也是我的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. A warm glow means the Light. A cold one, tell me at once."] = "当然，{name}。暖光是圣光。要是冷光，立刻告诉我。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'll pray it lasts. I'm told I have an in."] = "当然，{name}。祈祷它持久。听说我上头有人。"
L["Certainly, {name}. I heal, I smite, I do funerals. This is the cheerful bit."] = "当然，{name}。治疗、惩击、葬礼我都干，这是最开心的。"
L["Bless you, {name}. No, you didn't sneeze; I'm simply thorough."] = "祝福送到，{name}。打喷嚏的话，是我在念叨你。"
L["Here, {name}. Think of it as a prayer that arrived early."] = "给，{name}。就当是提前应验的祷告吧。"
L["The Light asked me to pass this along, {name}. I'm paraphrasing."] = "圣光托我转交这个，{name}。以上为大意。"
L["Take this, {name}. It saves us both an awkward resurrection later."] = "拿着，{name}。免得待会儿还得尴尬地复活你。"
L["Freely given, {name}. Faith costs nothing. The robes, sadly, did."] = "白送的，{name}。信仰不要钱，可惜这身长袍要。"
L["Here, {name}. Think of me as a small, walking temple. No steps to climb."] = "给，{name}。把我当座会走的小神殿，不用爬台阶。"
L["A blessing for a stranger, {name}. The Light insists there's no such thing."] = "给陌生人的祝福，{name}。圣光坚持说，没有陌生人。"
L["Take this, {name}. No collection plate follows. Look: empty hands."] = "拿着，{name}。后面没有募捐盘。看：两手空空。"
L["Here, {name}. I'd preach, but you look like somebody with somewhere to be."] = "给，{name}。本想布道，可你看着像赶时间的人。"
L["Small mercies are my speciality, {name}. Here's one."] = "小小的慈悲是我的专长，{name}。给你一份。"
L["Here, {name}. I'd float over properly, but levitating in public draws a crowd."] = "给，{name}。本想飘过来，可当众漂浮太招人围观。"
L["Your turn, {name}. Now, I beg you all: make my job boring."] = "轮到你了，{name}。拜托各位：让我闲得无聊吧。"
L["Everyone near me, {name}; the Light has a limited range. You're in it now."] = "都靠近我，{name}；圣光是有范围的。你现在在里面了。"
L["There, {name}. If anyone falls, I'll be very disappointed, then fix it."] = "好了，{name}。谁倒了我会很失望，再把他拉起来。"
L["Done, {name}. I'll be at the back, praying loudly."] = "好了，{name}。我在后排，大声祈祷。"
L["Here, {name}. If I scream, it's a spell and everything runs. Don't join in."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是尖叫，那是法术，所有东西都会跑。别跟着叫。"
L["That's for you, {name}. If I Fade, I haven't gone. I'm just very uninteresting."] = "给你的，{name}。我用渐隐术不是走了，只是变得特别不起眼。"
L["This one's on me, {name}. Shields come later, one each. Pace yourselves."] = "这个我请，{name}。护盾回头一人一个。悠着点。"
L["Take this, {name}. Let's all come back from this the usual way: walking."] = "拿着，{name}。咱们都照老样子回来：走着回来。"
L["That's me keeping you alive, {name}. You keep me from saying 'I told you so'."] = "这就是我保你活命，{name}。你别逼我说“我早说过”。"
L["I prayed over this group, {name}. The Light said 'good luck'. I'll take it."] = "我为这队人祈祷过，{name}。圣光说“祝好运”。行吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd offer you berries, but I ate them all."] = "谢谢你，{name}。本想请你吃浆果，可我全吃光了。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Like rain in a dry season."] = "谢了，{name}。像旱季里的一场雨。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. My cat form wants to bring you a rabbit. I've said no."] = "多谢，{name}。我的猎豹形态想叼只兔子送你，被我拦下了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll plant a tree in your honour. Give it a century."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我为你种棵树，一百年后来看。"
L["Thank you, {name}. May your road stay green and your water sweet."] = "谢谢你，{name}。愿你的路常青，你的水甘甜。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. I felt that right down to my roots."] = "有心了，{name}。一直暖到我的根里。"
L["Nature returns everything eventually, {name}. I'm quicker. Thank you."] = "自然终将归还一切，{name}。我比较快。谢谢。"
L["Barkskin keeps most things out, {name}. Kindness got straight through. Thanks."] = "树皮术挡得住大多数东西，{name}。善意直接穿透了。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. As a bear this would be a hug. Be glad I'm in this shape."] = "谢谢你，{name}。熊形态的话，这就是个熊抱。还好不是。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Give me a moment to remember which shape has hands."] = "当然，{name}。等我想想哪个形态有手。"
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still, like an oak. Oaks are wonderful at it."] = "当然，{name}。站着别动，像棵橡树。橡树最擅长这个了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. The wild shares everything. Well, not the bears."] = "乐意之至，{name}。自然万物共享。呃，熊除外。"
L["Right away, {name}. The wild's had a good season; it can spare this."] = "马上，{name}。荒野今年收成好，匀得出这个。"
L["Of course, {name}. Nature doesn't take requests, but I do."] = "当然，{name}。大自然不接单，我接。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Ask a tree and you'll wait a year. Ask a druid and it's now."] = "乐意，{name}。求棵树得等一年，找德鲁伊马上就有。"
L["Of course, {name}. The balance tips a little your way. Don't tell the balance."] = "当然，{name}。平衡稍微往你这边偏一点。别告诉平衡。"
L["I'd have run over, {name}, but as a cheetah, and you'd have screamed. Here."] = "本想跑过来，{name}，可得用猎豹形态，你会尖叫的。给。"
L["Of course, {name}. The wild is kind to all who ask. Midges excepted."] = "当然，{name}。荒野善待所有求助者。蚊子除外。"
L["Fresh from the Emerald Dream, {name}. Sorry if I yawn."] = "刚从翡翠梦境出来，{name}。打哈欠请见谅。"
L["Take this, {name}. Nature provides, and I'm its errand runner today."] = "拿着，{name}。大自然供货，今天我负责跑腿。"
L["The wild calls you friend now, {name}. Handy, since most of it has teeth."] = "荒野现在当你是朋友了，{name}。挺好，它们大多长着牙。"
L["I'd have picked you flowers, {name}, but this keeps better."] = "本想给你摘花，{name}，可这个放得更久。"
L["Here, {name}. Cenarius would want you to have it. I'm nearly sure."] = "给，{name}。塞纳留斯会希望你拿着。我基本确定。"
L["Here, {name}. For cold nights, sharp claws and long roads."] = "给，{name}。应对寒夜、利爪和长路。"
L["Take this, {name}. The wild has been watching you, and it's decided you'll do."] = "拿着，{name}。荒野观察你好久了，决定认你了。"
L["There, {name}. Walk lightly, and the forest will walk with you."] = "好了，{name}。脚步放轻，森林会与你同行。"
L["For you, {name}. The Moonglade sends its regards. It sends very few."] = "给你，{name}。月光林地向你问好。它很少问候谁。"
L["Nature is cruel, lovely and damp, {name}. This helps with two of those."] = "自然残酷、美丽又潮湿，{name}。这能帮你应付两样。"
L["I tie strangers up in roots most days, {name}. This is the nicer part."] = "平时我用根须缠陌生人，{name}。这算温柔的一面。"
L["Ready, {name}? Take this. Now, whatever happens, nobody startle the bear."] = "准备好了，{name}？拿着。不管发生什么，谁都别吓着熊。"
L["There, {name}. I'll be the cat, the bear or, if we must swim, the seal."] = "好了，{name}。我能当猫、当熊，要游泳就当海豹。"
L["Take this, {name}. I've one rebirth in me. Please, nobody make me choose."] = "拿着，{name}。我只有一次复生。拜托别让我选。"
L["Close ranks, {name}, and take this. The forest is watching, and rooting for us."] = "靠拢，{name}，拿着这个。森林在看着，也在为我们扎根加油。"
L["Here, {name}. I'll heal or I'll maul. Tell me which before it's urgent."] = "拿着，{name}。我要么治疗要么撕咬。趁还不急，告诉我选哪个。"
L["This is free, {name}. My one Innervate goes to the most desperate. No acting."] = "这个免费，{name}。我唯一的激活给最绝望的人。别装。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I start glowing and hooting, that's moonkin. Serious."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我开始发光还咕咕叫，那是枭兽形态。很严肃的。"
L["For you, {name}. If it gets crowded, I'll call a Hurricane. Hold your hats."] = "给你的，{name}。人一多我就召飓风。抓紧帽子。"
L["We move like a herd, {name}, all blessed. Mixed herd. One is sometimes a bear."] = "我们像兽群一样走，{name}，个个受了祝福。混编兽群。有一个时不时变熊。"
L["Kindness, {name}? My favourite virtue. Just ahead of polishing."] = "善意吗，{name}？我最爱的美德，擦盔甲排第二。"
L["For that, {name}, my best blessing. Not the second best. The best."] = "冲这个，{name}，送你最好的祝福。不是次好，最好。"
L["Virtue rewarded on the spot, {name}! I do love it when that happens."] = "善有善报，当场兑现，{name}！我就爱看这个。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My oath says to repay kindness. I'd do it anyway."] = "谢谢你，{name}。誓言要我知恩图报，不过没它我也会。"
L["I'll judge you favourably, {name}. I judge most things harshly. Thank you."] = "对你，我从轻审判，{name}。别的我一般都从重。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My aura just brightened. It does that when I'm touched."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我的光环刚刚亮了。我一感动它就亮。"
L["A kindness, {name}! I'll have it engraved on my shield, beside the dents."] = "一份善意，{name}！我要刻在盾牌上，就在凹痕旁边。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. My warhorse sends thanks as well. He's more reserved."] = "承情，{name}。我的战马也向你致谢。它比较内敛。"
L["I swore to protect the good, {name}. You've just gone to the top of the list."] = "我发誓守护善良之人，{name}。你刚刚排到了名单第一。"
L["By the Light, {name}, of course! I've been hoping somebody would ask."] = "以圣光之名，{name}，当然！我一直盼着有人开口呢。"
L["You have my blessing, {name}, in every sense."] = "我祝福你，{name}，各种意义上的。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Kneel if you like. I won't insist. I'll be delighted."] = "当然，{name}。想跪就跪吧。我不强求。但我会很高兴。"
L["Gladly, {name}. I never run short of blessings. Mana, now and then."] = "乐意之至，{name}。祝福我从来不缺，法力值偶尔缺。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still. My aim is righteous; my gauntlets are clumsy."] = "当然，{name}。别动。我心正，只是手甲笨。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Helping is the oath. Shining while I do it is a bonus."] = "乐意，{name}。帮人是誓言，边帮边发光是附赠。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand fast, chin up, and look deserving. There. You do."] = "当然，{name}。站稳，抬头，显得受之无愧。嗯，你是。"
L["Of course, {name}. You'd be amazed how rarely anyone asks the tin can for help."] = "当然，{name}。你想不到，很少有人找铁罐头帮忙。"
L["Of course, {name}. A moment while I pick the blessing. I do have favourites."] = "当然，{name}。稍等，我挑个祝福。我也有偏爱的。"
L["The Light asks nothing in return, {name}. I, however, accept thanks."] = "圣光不求回报，{name}。不过我收谢谢。"
L["Go with the Light, {name}. I'll be right behind you, clanking."] = "与圣光同行，{name}。我就跟在你后面，叮叮当当。"
L["The blessing's free, {name}. You've been spared the sermon. This time."] = "祝福免费，{name}。布道就免了。这次先免了。"
L["There, {name}. It won't last forever, so be heroic while it does."] = "好了，{name}。它不会永远有效，趁着还在，英勇点。"
L["Stand tall, {name}. The Light walks with you, and it has excellent posture."] = "挺直腰板，{name}。圣光与你同行，它的站姿可标准了。"
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give you my hammer too, but it's very attached to me."] = "拿着，{name}。本想连锤子也给你，可它离不开我。"
L["Blessings are for handing out, {name}. Hoarding them is frowned upon. By me."] = "祝福就是用来送的，{name}。囤着会被人瞪。被我瞪。"
L["Justice for the wicked, blessings for the rest, {name}. You're the rest."] = "恶人得审判，其余人得祝福，{name}。你是其余人。"
L["Take this, {name}. My libram says to share. It says a lot; this bit I like."] = "拿着，{name}。圣契说要分享。它说的多了，这句我爱听。"
L["Chivalry isn't dead, {name}. It's in heavy armour, and it brought you this."] = "骑士精神没死，{name}。它穿着重甲，给你带来了这个。"
L["Wear it with pride, {name}. Pride's a sin, but only in large amounts."] = "骄傲地戴着吧，{name}。骄傲是罪，但少量无妨。"
L["You're blessed, {name}. Keep behind my shield and we'll do fine."] = "祝福好了，{name}。躲在我盾后面，我们会没事的。"
L["Stand fast, {name}, blessed. We have the Light, and I have a very large hammer."] = "站稳，{name}，你已受了祝福。我们有圣光，我还有把很大的锤子。"
L["One blessing each, {name}. The Light is generous, but it insists on turns."] = "每人一个祝福，{name}。圣光很慷慨，但要排队。"
L["Splendid, {name}, you're blessed. Don't look at me. I'm rather bright today."] = "好极了，{name}，你已受祝福。别看我。我今天亮得很。"
L["That's my blessing, {name}. Stay inside my aura too. It's warmer than it looks."] = "这是我的祝福，{name}。也待在我的光环里。比看起来暖和。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I stun something, hit it while it's thinking things over."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是把什么击晕了，趁它还在发愣就揍。"
L["Blessed, {name}. The glowing ground is mine too; stand in it. It bites them."] = "祝福好了，{name}。发光的地面也是我的；站上去。只咬它们。"
L["Take this blessing, {name}. I judge them, you sentence them. Efficient court."] = "收下这份祝福，{name}。我审判它们，你来判刑。高效的法庭。"
L["Blessed, {name}. If I shout 'for the Light', it means charge. Or pray. Or both."] = "祝福好了，{name}。我喊“为了圣光”，就是冲锋。或者祈祷。或者都要。"
L["Armour polished, hammer blessed, {name}, and now you too. My horse is sulking."] = "盔甲擦亮了，锤子祝福过了，{name}，现在你也是。我的马在闹别扭。"
L["That's your blessing, {name}. Mine is Righteous Fury. Let them come to me."] = "这是你的祝福，{name}。我的是正义之怒。让它们冲我来。"
L["How kind, {name}. My imp says thank you too. He's lying, but I'm not."] = "真好心，{name}。我的小鬼也说谢谢。它撒谎，我没有。"
L["Thank you, {name}. It's been ages since anyone gave me something uncursed."] = "谢谢你，{name}。好久没人送我不带诅咒的东西了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll repay you with something I didn't find in a crypt."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我会回赠一件不是从墓穴里翻出来的东西。"
L["Most gracious, {name}. I've asked the voidwalker to stop looming at you."] = "承蒙厚意，{name}。我已经叫虚空行者别再杵在你身后了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Most folk cross the road when they see me."] = "谢谢你，{name}。大多数人见了我都绕道走。"
L["No blood, no bargain, no binding, {name}? What a strange way to trade. Thanks."] = "不要血、不讲价、不立约，{name}？好怪的交易。谢了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Should anything haunt you, send it my way."] = "谢谢你，{name}。要是有什么缠上你，打发到我这儿来。"
L["How thoughtful, {name}. Everything I'm given, I return. Except souls. Here."] = "真体贴，{name}。别人给我的，我都会还。灵魂除外。给。"
L["Of course, {name}. No soul required. This time."] = "当然，{name}。不用灵魂。这次不用。"
L["You asked a warlock for help, {name}. Bold. I like you already."] = "找术士帮忙，{name}？胆子不小，我已经喜欢你了。"
L["Of course, {name}. The imp offered to help, and I said no, for all our sakes."] = "当然，{name}。小鬼说要帮忙，为了大家好，我拒绝了。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Of all my spells, this is the one I can do at parties."] = "当然，{name}。我所有法术里，就这个能在聚会上表演。"
L["Gladly, {name}. A good deed on my record; the Shadow Council would be appalled."] = "乐意，{name}。档案上添一件好事，暗影议会要吓坏了。"
L["Of course, {name}. Please don't read the book I'm holding. For your own sake."] = "当然，{name}。别看我手里这本书。为你好。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Feel watched? That's only the Eye of Kilrogg. Hold still."] = "当然，{name}。觉得有人盯着？只是基尔罗格之眼。别动。"
L["Of course, {name}. I only curse people who don't ask nicely. You're quite safe."] = "当然，{name}。我只诅咒说话不客气的人。你很安全。"
L["Yes, {name}, it's the one without screaming. Hold still."] = "放心，{name}，是不带尖叫的那个。别动。"
L["Of course, {name}. Going somewhere wet? I won't ask. Warlocks never ask."] = "当然，{name}。要去有水的地方？我不问。术士从不问。"
L["Here, {name}. Don't ask where it came from. Really, don't."] = "给，{name}。别问是从哪儿来的。真的，别问。"
L["Fall in a lake someday, {name}, and you'll think of me fondly."] = "哪天掉进湖里，{name}，你会怀念我的。"
L["Breathe easy, {name}. I'd hate to lose you to anything as dull as water."] = "尽管呼吸，{name}。败给水这么无聊的东西，太可惜了。"
L["Here, {name}. You'll want a soulstone too, but that's a bigger conversation."] = "给，{name}。你还会想要灵魂石，不过那得另外谈。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only spell of mine the priests approve of."] = "拿着，{name}。这是我唯一获得牧师认可的法术。"
L["Take this, {name}. My mother still thinks I'm a mage. Let's keep it that way."] = "拿着，{name}。我妈还以为我是法师。别告诉她。"
L["Here, {name}. It isn't green, it doesn't whisper, and it won't follow you home."] = "给，{name}。不是绿的，不会低语，也不会跟你回家。"
L["Here, {name}. Dark magic, used for good. Do tell my old tutor; he'll hate it."] = "给，{name}。黑魔法，用来行善。告诉我导师，他会气死。"
L["Here, {name}. I keep the darker spells for people who've earned them."] = "给，{name}。更黑暗的法术，我留给自找的人。"
L["Here, {name}. I'm not all curses and fear. Mostly, but not all."] = "给，{name}。我不全是诅咒和恐惧。只是大半。"
L["My grimoire has a chapter on kindness, {name}. It's short, but I've read it."] = "我的魔典有一章讲善良，{name}。很短，但我读过。"
L["Everyone ready, {name}? Souls intact? Take this; let's keep it that way."] = "都准备好了吗，{name}？灵魂都完整？拿着；保持下去。"
L["Take this and stay close, {name}. The voidwalker takes hits; I take the credit."] = "拿着，待近点，{name}。虚空行者挨打，功劳归我。"
L["Swim all you like, {name}. If anyone drifts off, I'll summon them back."] = "尽管游，{name}。谁漂远了，我就把他召唤回来。"
L["Do pet the felhunter, {name}. Just take your spells off first."] = "尽管摸地狱猎犬，{name}。先把法术摘了就行。"
L["For you, {name}. If I fear something, don't chase it. It comes back angrier."] = "给你的，{name}。我恐惧了什么，别去追。它会更火大地回来。"
L["I trade blood for mana, {name}, and mana for this. It looks worse than it is."] = "我拿血换法力，{name}，再拿法力换这个。看着吓人，其实还好。"
L["This now, {name}; healthstones after. For a crisis, mind, not as a snack."] = "先拿这个，{name}；治疗石回头再给。危急时用，别当零嘴。"
L["Take this, {name}, and keep clear when I cast Hellfire. I burn too. Tragic."] = "拿着，{name}，我放地狱烈焰时离远点。我自己也烧。悲剧。"
L["That's from me, {name}, not the imp. He's on fire, and ours. Don't douse him."] = "这是我给的，{name}，不是小鬼给的。它着着火，是自己人。别浇灭它。"
L["Take this, {name}. If something green falls from the sky, that's mine. Cheer."] = "拿着，{name}。天上要是掉下绿色的东西，那是我的。欢呼吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}! Sorry, was that loud? I only have the one volume."] = "谢谢你，{name}！抱歉，太大声了？我只有这一个音量。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. No spells to give back, but I do a very sincere shout."] = "多谢，{name}。我没法术可还，但我能吼得非常真诚。"
L["Thanks, {name}. Now I'm twice as angry. In the good way."] = "谢啦，{name}。现在我怒气翻倍了。好的那种。"
L["Thanks, {name}. You've earned a place right behind me. Safest spot there is."] = "谢啦，{name}。你赢得了我身后的位置，全场最安全。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness makes me soft. Luckily I've plenty of armour."] = "谢谢你，{name}。善意让我心软。还好我盔甲够厚。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My armourer thanks you too. I paid for his house."] = "谢谢，{name}。铁匠也谢你。他家房子是我出钱盖的。"
L["Thanks, {name}. I'd bandage something for you, but you look annoyingly fine."] = "谢啦，{name}。想给你包扎点什么，可你完好得气人。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I switched to my grateful stance for that. It's rarely used."] = "谢谢你，{name}。为此我切到了感恩姿态。很少用的。"
L["You've given me magic, {name}. No idea where to keep it. I'll wear it. Thanks."] = "你给了我魔法，{name}。不知放哪儿，就穿身上吧。谢谢。"
L["Owing folk makes me restless, {name}, and restless makes me charge things."] = "欠人情让我坐不住，{name}，坐不住我就想冲锋。"
L["You want a shout, {name}? I was going to shout anyway."] = "要我吼一嗓子，{name}？反正我本来就要吼。"
L["Of course, {name}. A fighter who asks for courage already has some."] = "当然，{name}。敢开口要勇气的斗士，本就有几分勇气。"
L["Right away, {name}. Square your shoulders. There, that's half of it."] = "马上，{name}。挺起肩膀。好，这就成了一半。"
L["Happily, {name}! Go hit something for me."] = "乐意，{name}！替我去揍点什么。"
L["Right, {name}. Deep breath. Not you. Me."] = "好，{name}。我深呼吸，你不用。"
L["Happy to, {name}. First request today that didn't involve lifting something."] = "乐意，{name}。今天头一个不用我扛东西的请求。"
L["Coming up, {name}. Plant your feet. This one has a kick to it."] = "来了，{name}。站稳了，这个劲儿大。"
L["Of course, {name}. Most folk only ask me to stop. This is a nice change."] = "当然，{name}。平时大家只求我住嘴。今天换换口味。"
L["Of course, {name}. Took me years to learn. Years of yelling at trees, mostly."] = "当然，{name}。我学了好多年。主要是对着树吼了好多年。"
L["Consider yourself shouted at, {name}. Affectionately."] = "你已经被我吼过了，{name}。深情地吼。"
L["No incense, no prayers, {name}. Just me, shouting encouragingly."] = "不烧香，不祈祷，{name}。就我在这儿，鼓励地吼。"
L["Chin up, {name}, and take this! If anything bothers you, I'll charge it."] = "打起精神，{name}，拿着！谁惹你，我就冲过去。"
L["There, {name}! Anything that doesn't feel braver now wasn't listening."] = "好了，{name}！谁现在还不觉得更勇敢，那是没在听。"
L["Here, {name}, some courage. Spend it freely; I've plenty more."] = "给，{name}，一点勇气。尽管用，我多的是。"
L["Here, {name}. Something sharper than a whetstone: morale."] = "给，{name}。比磨刀石还利的东西：士气。"
L["Take this, {name}. Warriors don't carry spells, so we carry each other."] = "拿着，{name}。战士不带法术，所以我们互相扛着。"
L["Here, {name}. You look about to walk into something big. Walk in harder."] = "给，{name}。看你要去闯大事。那就闯得更猛点。"
L["Here, {name}. No magic in it. Just a warrior believing in you, very firmly."] = "给，{name}。没有魔法，只是一个战士坚定地相信你。"
L["Take this, {name}. It's loud, it's free, and I mean it."] = "拿着，{name}。嗓门大，不要钱，而且我是真心的。"
L["Here, {name}. Tell whatever you fight that a warrior vouched for you."] = "给，{name}。跟你的对手说，有个战士给你作保。"
L["That one was for you, {name}. The next one's for whatever's in your way."] = "这一吼是给你的，{name}。下一吼给挡你路的东西。"
L["Listen up, {name}! That's it. That was the whole speech."] = "都听好了，{name}！完了。演讲就这些。"
L["Take this, {name}. Where's the danger? Never mind, I'll find it. Face first."] = "拿着，{name}。危险在哪？算了，我去找。脸先上。"
L["Right, {name}! Take this. I go first, shout loudest; nobody touches the healer."] = "好，{name}！拿着。我打头，我嗓门最大；谁也别碰治疗。"
L["Everybody angrier? Good. Onward, {name}, and mind my backswing."] = "都更火大了？很好。前进，{name}，小心我回抡。"
L["Here, {name}. I need hitting before I'm useful. Don't panic when it happens."] = "拿着，{name}。我得先挨揍才派得上用场。到时候别慌。"
L["This first, {name}. Bandages are in my pack too; I tied the knots. Very secure."] = "先拿这个，{name}。背包里也有绷带；结是我打的。特别牢。"
L["Right, {name}: take this. I take hits, you take credit, we split the repairs."] = "好，{name}：拿着。我挨打，你领功，修理费平摊。"
L["For you, {name}. If I go red and quiet, that's Berserker Rage. Loud is fine."] = "给你的，{name}。我要是脸红了还不出声，那是狂暴之怒。吵吵嚷嚷就没事。"
L["Take this, {name}. My shield's seen worse than this. So has my face. Onward."] = "拿着，{name}。我的盾见过更糟的。我的脸也是。走。"
L["The living rarely lend me much, {name}. I'll be prompt, in case it catches on."] = "活人很少借我东西，{name}。我会尽快还上，说不定能带起风气。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I owe you one fight at your side, on a day of your choosing."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我欠你一场并肩作战，日子由你来挑。"
L["The skulls came with the armour, {name}. The gratitude is all my own."] = "骷髅是盔甲自带的，{name}。感激可全是我自己的。"
L["My one healing spell only mends the dead, {name}. Do stay healthy. Thank you."] = "我唯一的治疗法术只治得了死人，{name}。你可千万保重。谢谢你。"
L["Your kindness is safe with me, {name}. Very little else is. Thank you."] = "你的好意放我这儿很安全，{name}。别的东西可就难说了。谢谢你。"
L["I've stood at the runeforge all night for less than that, {name}. Thank you."] = "为了比这还少的回报，我熔铸过整夜的符文，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["The Ebon Blade answers courtesy in kind, {name}, and insults with the blade."] = "黑锋骑士团以礼还礼，{name}，以刃还辱。"
L["Tonight's watch will pass quicker for that, {name}, and I keep a great many."] = "有了这个，今晚守夜会过得快些，{name}。我守的夜可多了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Ride with me a while, if your horse will stand next to mine."] = "谢谢你，{name}。陪我骑一段吧，要是你的马敢挨着我的马走。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll have the dead salute you. Badly, but with feeling."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我让亡者向你敬礼。敬得歪歪扭扭，但饱含真情。"
L["Very well, {name}. Stand fast; the horn is loud, and the cold follows it."] = "好吧，{name}。站稳了，号角很响，寒气随后就到。"
L["Of course, {name}. Most of what I do is quick or final. This is the quick kind."] = "当然，{name}。我做事要么快，要么一了百了。这回是快的那种。"
L["You have my horn and my word, {name}. One is louder; the other lasts longer."] = "号角和承诺都给你，{name}。一个更响，一个更长久。"
L["Of course, {name}. Mind the runeblade. It doesn't know you yet."] = "当然，{name}。当心符文剑，它还不认识你。"
L["Gladly, {name}. I'd far rather sound a horn for a friend than a dirge."] = "乐意，{name}。比起吹挽歌，我更愿意为朋友吹号角。"
L["At once, {name}. A knight who makes an ally wait isn't worth their runes."] = "马上，{name}。让盟友干等的骑士，配不上身上的符文。"
L["Yes, {name}. Step into view; this helm was made for glaring, not for looking."] = "好，{name}。站到我眼前来，这头盔是造来瞪人的，不是用来看东西的。"
L["The Ebon Blade serves the living now, {name}. Even the impatient ones."] = "黑锋骑士团如今为生者效力，{name}。急性子也算。"
L["Of course, {name}. Pay no mind to the frost on your boots. It brushes off."] = "当然，{name}。靴子上结了霜别在意，拍拍就掉。"
L["The paladins at Light's Hope ask far more stiffly, {name}. They still get it."] = "圣光之愿礼拜堂的圣骑士求人可比你生硬多了，{name}。照样有份。"
L["Hear that, {name}? Winter, on your side for once."] = "听到了吗，{name}？寒冬难得站在你这边。"
L["The horn sounds for you, {name}. It used to sound only for the Scourge."] = "号角为你而鸣，{name}。它从前只为天灾军团吹响。"
L["Take this, {name}, and advice from a death knight: never fight fair, nor alone."] = "拿着，{name}，再听死亡骑士一句：别讲公平，也别单打独斗。"
L["Acherus floats over the Plaguelands, {name}. It's good to come down and help."] = "阿彻鲁斯悬在瘟疫之地上空，{name}。偶尔下来帮帮忙挺好。"
L["The road's dark, {name}; I'm usually the darkest thing on it. Take this along."] = "路很黑，{name}；我通常是路上最黑的东西。带上这个。"
L["You looked a little short of an army, {name}. A horn is the next best thing."] = "看你身边缺支军队，{name}。先拿号角顶上。"
L["Here, {name}. My ghoul wanted to say hello. I've spared you that."] = "给，{name}。我的食尸鬼想跟你打招呼，我替你免了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Cold, loud and well meant, like most of my order."] = "拿着，{name}。又冷又响，但出于好意，就像我们骑士团的多数人。"
L["Whatever waits out there, {name}, I've likely killed its cousin. Take this."] = "外面不管等着什么，{name}，我多半杀过它表亲。拿着。"
L["Take this and keep moving, {name}. Trouble tends to follow death knights about."] = "拿着，接着走，{name}。麻烦总爱跟着死亡骑士。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I raise an army, be civil. They didn't ask to be here."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是召唤大军，客气点。它们也不想来。"
L["That's for you, {name}. Walk where I walk; the frost holds us up over any lake."] = "给你的，{name}。踩着我的脚印走；冰霜能托着我们走过任何湖。"
L["For you, {name}. If I look hurt, let me hit something. That's how I mend."] = "给你的，{name}。我看着受伤了，就让我揍点什么。我是这么回血的。"
L["Take this, {name}. My ghoul goes in first. He won't mind. Long past minding."] = "拿着，{name}。我的食尸鬼先上。它不在乎。早就不在乎了。"
L["Here, {name}, to keep up. The dead don't tire, and I forget the living do."] = "拿着，{name}，好跟上。死人不会累，我老忘了活人会。"
L["Take this and don't fall, {name}. I can bring you back, but it's unsettling."] = "拿着，别倒下，{name}。我能把你拉回来，但那滋味瘆人。"
L["That's for you, {name}. Leave the fevers to me; they spread on their own."] = "给你的，{name}。疫病交给我；它们自己会传开。"
L["The horn has sounded, {name}. Whatever heard it knows we're coming."] = "号角已经吹响，{name}。听见的东西都知道我们要来了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever we kill today stays dead. I'll see to it myself."] = "拿着，{name}。今天杀的，都别想再起来。我亲自盯着。"
L["Take this, pick a target, {name}, and I'll pick it too. Shorter arguments."] = "拿着，挑个目标，{name}，我也挑它。省得吵。"
L["Take a gift with both hands, my master said, {name}. And return it with both."] = "师父说，收礼要双手接，{name}。还礼也要双手奉上。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I feel light enough to run up a waterfall. I may try."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我身轻得能跑上瀑布。说不定真去试试。"
L["I meditated on generosity for years, {name}. You skipped to the end. Thank you."] = "我参悟慷慨之道好多年，{name}。你直接跳到了结尾。谢谢你。"
L["I came out into the world to find good people, {name}. That's one. Thank you."] = "我出山闯荡，就是为了寻找好人，{name}。找到一个了。谢谢你。"
L["The masters at the Peak of Serenity would bow to that, {name}. So do I."] = "晴日峰的大师们见了也会鞠躬，{name}。我也一样。"
L["Kindly done, {name}. The next brigand who jumps me gets one kick fewer."] = "真是好心，{name}。下一个来偷袭我的强盗，可以少挨一脚。"
L["A kindness is like a strike, {name}: it's all in the timing. Yours was perfect."] = "善意就像出拳，{name}：关键在时机。你这一下恰到好处。"
L["Thank you, {name}. These hands were trained to strike. Today they get to give."] = "谢谢你，{name}。这双手是练来出击的，今天也能用来回礼。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Answered the monk's way: no wasted motion, no wasted words."] = "谢谢你，{name}。武僧式回礼：不多一招，不多一字。"
L["Gratitude makes even a monk clumsy, {name}. Forgive the elbows. Thank you."] = "一感激，武僧也会笨手笨脚，{name}。手肘撞到你别介意。谢谢你。"
L["Of course, {name}. My master took a year to teach me this. I'll take a moment."] = "当然，{name}。师父花了一年教我，我只要一会儿。"
L["One of the old legacies, {name}, handed down to me and now to you."] = "这是古老的传承之一，{name}，传到我手上，如今传给你。"
L["Nothing calms the mind like being useful, {name}. You've done me a favour."] = "没什么比派上用场更能静心，{name}。是你帮了我。"
L["Of course, {name}. My hands know this one by heart. I just tell them who."] = "当然，{name}。这招我的手熟得很，我只需告诉它给谁。"
L["At once, {name}. The fist is for foes; the open palm is for friends."] = "马上，{name}。拳头留给敌人，掌心留给朋友。"
L["Of course, {name}, one moment. Mid-form; bad luck to stop on the left foot."] = "当然，{name}，稍等。我正打着套路；停在左脚上不吉利。"
L["Gladly, {name}. I was only standing still to see what it felt like."] = "乐意，{name}。我站着不动，只是想体会一下静止的滋味。"
L["At once, {name}. If you blinked, you missed it. That's fine; it's on you now."] = "马上，{name}。眨个眼就错过了。没关系，已经在你身上了。"
L["Of course, {name}. It costs me a breath and a moment, and I've plenty of both."] = "当然，{name}。不过费我一口气、一会儿工夫，这两样我多的是。"
L["Of course, {name}. Ask me every day, if you like. Monks love a routine."] = "当然，{name}。你愿意的话天天来找我。武僧最爱日课。"
L["I passed you twice on my morning run, {name}. The third time, I stopped. Here."] = "晨跑时我从你身边过了两次，{name}。第三次，我停下了。给。"
L["Your stance says long day, {name}. Monks notice. Take this."] = "看你的架势就知道今天很漫长，{name}。武僧看得出来。拿着。"
L["A monk gives before being asked, {name}. It saves us both the bowing."] = "武僧不等人开口就给，{name}。省得我们俩鞠来鞠去。"
L["Take this, {name}. My master said one kind act before every meal. I'm hungry."] = "拿着，{name}。师父说每顿饭前先行一善。我饿了。"
L["Kindness is the hardest stance to hold, {name}. I'm practising. Here."] = "善意是最难站稳的架势，{name}。我正在练。给。"
L["I practised patience by not giving you this, {name}. I lasted three heartbeats."] = "我想练耐心，忍着不给你这个，{name}。只撑了三下心跳。"
L["Take this, {name}, and be gentle out there. Unless a hozen starts it."] = "拿着，{name}，在外面温和点。除非猢狲先动手。"
L["A calm mind finds the road, {name}. This should keep you steady on it."] = "心静自能找到路，{name}。这能让你走得更稳。"
L["The Last Emperor left Pandaria a legacy, {name}. I'm leaving you a small one."] = "末代皇帝少昊给潘达利亚留下了传承，{name}。我给你留一份小的。"
L["For you, {name}. No lesson attached. My masters would be appalled."] = "给你的，{name}。不附带任何教诲。师父们知道了得吓坏。"
L["For your feet, {name}. Stay light on them; a heavy step is an easy target."] = "给你脚下用的，{name}。脚步放轻；步子沉就是好靶子。"
L["Take this, {name}. If they surround us, I'll spin. Stand back; I'm not tidy."] = "拿着，{name}。要是被围了，我就转起来。退后；我转得可不讲究。"
L["Fight from your centre, {name}. If you can't find yours, borrow mine."] = "从丹田发力，{name}。找不到你的，就借我的。"
L["Take this, {name}. If one freezes mid-swing, that's me. Leave it till last."] = "拿着，{name}。要是有个挥到一半定住了，那是我干的。留到最后。"
L["That's for you, {name}. You go high, I'll go low. Nobody guards both at once."] = "给你的，{name}。你打上，我打下。没人能同时护住两处。"
L["Ready, {name}? Take this. Loose shoulders, soft knees, firm intentions."] = "准备好了，{name}？拿着。肩放松，膝放软，心意要坚。"
L["Take this, {name}. Any weapon I take off them stays taken. They held it badly."] = "拿着，{name}。我缴的兵器就不还了。他们握得太差。"
L["Here, {name}. Leave the runners to me. Nothing outruns a monk with a grudge."] = "拿着，{name}。逃跑的交给我。记了仇的武僧谁也甩不掉。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I end a fight with one touch, don't ask. It took years."] = "拿着，{name}。要是我一碰就结束战斗，别问。练了好些年。"
L["This steadies the temper, {name}. Anger opens a door, and the Sha walk in."] = "这能稳住脾气，{name}。怒火一开门，煞就进来了。"
L["That was well cast, {name}. I would know. Thank you."] = "施得漂亮，{name}。这方面我是行家。谢谢你。"
L["I have studied fire, time and the Dream, {name}. You still surprised me."] = "火焰、时间、翡翠梦境，我都钻研过，{name}。你还是让我意外了。"
L["Dragons give big gifts slowly, {name}. Yours was small and quick. I prefer it."] = "巨龙送大礼总是慢吞吞的，{name}。你的又小又快，我更喜欢。"
L["I'll dip a wing to you when I next fly over, {name}. Watch for it."] = "下回从你头顶飞过，我会压压翅膀向你致意，{name}。留意着。"
L["I've known dragons with worse manners, {name}, and some of them were Aspects."] = "我认识的龙里，比你没礼貌的多了，{name}，有几位还是守护巨龙。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I answer in kind, with magic older than your kingdoms."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我也回你一份，用比你们的王国还古老的魔法。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'm delighted. You can tell by the faint smoke."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我很开心，看这缕轻烟就知道。"
L["Generous, {name}, and not a trace of showing off. I must learn that part."] = "真慷慨，{name}，还一点都不炫耀。这点我得学学。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Returned at once. My aim is perfect; my patience is not."] = "谢谢你，{name}。马上回礼。我准头完美，耐心可不怎么样。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I shall cite you, should I ever write a treatise on manners."] = "谢谢你，{name}。哪天我写礼仪专著，一定引用你。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Help from a dragon once took a quest. Things have improved."] = "乐意，{name}。从前求龙相助，得先历经一番冒险。现在方便多了。"
L["Hold still, {name}. Or hover, if you are able. No? Standing will do."] = "别动，{name}。能悬空的话就悬着。不会？那站着也行。"
L["Watch closely, {name}. My casting is said to be a joy to watch. Mostly by me."] = "看仔细了，{name}。据说我施法赏心悦目。主要是我自己说的。"
L["It would be my pleasure, {name}. Truly. I don't say 'truly' lightly."] = "这是我的荣幸，{name}。真的。我可不轻易说“真的”。"
L["Of course, {name}. Magic this old ought to be spent kindly, and you qualify."] = "当然，{name}。这么古老的魔法，就该用在好人身上，你够格。"
L["Of course, {name}. Ask again tomorrow; I'll have improved it overnight."] = "当然，{name}。明天再来，我会连夜把它改进。"
L["You need only ask, {name}. I am curious how it will look on you."] = "开口就行，{name}。我也好奇它在你身上是什么样子。"
L["Certainly, {name}. Think of something calm. Not dragons."] = "没问题，{name}。想点平静的东西。别想龙。"
L["On the Forbidden Reach we practised on rocks, {name}. You are an improvement."] = "在禁忌离岛，我们拿石头练习，{name}。你可强多了。"
L["Of course, {name}. You're standing exactly where I'd have put you. Well done."] = "当然，{name}。你站的正是我想让你站的位置。很好。"
L["Take this, {name}. I meant to explain the spell first. Too late now."] = "拿着，{name}。本想先给你讲讲这法术的。现在晚了。"
L["For you, {name}. Unasked, unearned and entirely deserved. Draconic logic."] = "给你，{name}。不用开口，不用挣，完全应得。龙族逻辑。"
L["I spotted you from afar, {name}. Evokers have sharp eyes and little restraint."] = "老远就看见你了，{name}。唤魔师眼尖，又管不住手。"
L["Evokers study for years to cast this well, {name}. You need only stand there."] = "唤魔师要苦学多年才施得好这个，{name}。你只需站着。"
L["You'll be glad of this soon, {name}. Don't ask how I know. Bronze business."] = "你很快就会庆幸有它，{name}。别问我怎么知道的。青铜龙的事。"
L["I could be flying right now, {name}, and instead I'm helping you. Do take note."] = "我本可以在天上飞的，{name}，结果却在帮你。记着点。"
L["Here, {name}. Old magic, new caster. We're both doing rather well."] = "给，{name}。古老的魔法，年轻的施法者。我们俩都干得不错。"
L["Not my grandest spell, {name}, but the one I'd most like to be known for."] = "这不是我最宏大的法术，{name}，却是我最想以之闻名的那个。"
L["I have read about heroes, {name}. You look like the early chapters. Take this."] = "我读过英雄的故事，{name}。你看着像开头那几章。拿着。"
L["Magic can't stay up in the sky, {name}. Sooner or later it lands on somebody."] = "魔法不能一直挂在天上，{name}。迟早会落到谁身上。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I seize you and fly, it is a rescue, not an abduction."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是抓起你就飞，那是营救，不是绑架。"
L["That's for you, {name}. I fight from a little way back. The view is better."] = "给你的，{name}。我在稍远处战斗。视野更好。"
L["Take this, {name}, and leave their spellcasters to me. Their technique offends."] = "拿着，{name}，他们的施法者交给我。那手法让我看不下去。"
L["Hold the line, {name}, with this. I'll be the bright thing over your shoulder."] = "带着这个守住阵线，{name}。我会是你肩头上那道亮光。"
L["Take this, {name}. Dragons fight in three dimensions; enemies rarely look up."] = "拿着，{name}。龙是三维作战的；敌人很少抬头看。"
L["I've made you all a little more than you were, {name}. The rest is up to you."] = "我让你们每个人都比原来强了一点，{name}。剩下的看你们自己。"
L["Here, {name}. If I take a long breath, do not startle me. It is still growing."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是在长长吸气，别吓我。还在蓄着。"
L["Fight well with this, {name}. I am taking notes on how mortals do it. Loudly."] = "带着这个好好打，{name}。我在记凡人是怎么打的。目前看来：很吵。"
L["Time is on our side, {name}. I have checked with it, and borrowed some for you."] = "时间站在我们这边，{name}。我跟它确认过，还替你借了一点。"
L["Take this, {name}, and try to keep up. Not showing off; flying is just quicker."] = "拿着，{name}，尽量跟上。不是炫耀；飞就是快。"
L["Rain, fire and a rockslide this week, {name}. That was the first gentle thing."] = "这礼拜又是雨、又是火、又是山崩，{name}。这是头一件温柔的事。"
L["The fifth element is spirit, {name}, and yours is a generous one. Thank you."] = "第五元素是灵魂，{name}，而你的灵魂很慷慨。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The rain can wash everything off me today but that."] = "谢谢你，{name}。今天雨水能冲掉我身上的一切，唯独这个不行。"
L["Earth is patient and fire is not, {name}. My thanks takes after fire."] = "大地沉得住气，火焰可不行，{name}。我的谢意随火，等不及了。"
L["Most days I speak for the elements, {name}. Today's thanks are my own."] = "平时我替元素说话，{name}。今天的谢意是我自己的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The elements answer need, not rank. So, it seems, do you."] = "谢谢你，{name}。元素只回应需要，不看身份。看来你也一样。"
L["The Earthen Ring mends the world a crack at a time, {name}. You've mended one."] = "大地之环一道一道地修补世界的裂痕，{name}。你补好了一道。"
L["Water carves canyons by never giving up, {name}. I'll repay you the same way."] = "水能凿出峡谷，靠的是永不放弃，{name}。我也会这样报答你。"
L["Lightning is quick, {name}, but never thoughtful. You were both. Thank you."] = "闪电很快，{name}，却从不体贴。你两样都占了。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The ground felt steadier under me for that."] = "谢谢你，{name}。脚下的大地都踏实了些。"
L["Of course, {name}. I'll ask the sky. It rarely says no to me."] = "当然，{name}。我去问问天空，它很少拒绝我。"
L["Feet on the earth, eyes on the sky, {name}. What you asked for, they give."] = "脚踏大地，眼望苍天，{name}。你求的，它们给了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Thunder takes a moment to arrive. I don't."] = "乐意，{name}。雷声总要慢一拍，我不会。"
L["Gladly, {name}. A shaman who won't share the storm has no business calling it."] = "乐意，{name}。不肯分享风暴的萨满，没资格召唤它。"
L["Of course, {name}. Lightning can be gentle. It just prefers not to be."] = "当然，{name}。闪电也可以很温柔，只是它不爱这样。"
L["Of course, {name}. Let me apologise to the wind for borrowing it. There."] = "当然，{name}。容我先跟风道个歉，借它一用。好了。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Calling the wind is easy. Steering it is the trick."] = "乐意，{name}。唤风容易，驾风难。"
L["We serve the elements and they serve the world, {name}. You're in it."] = "我们侍奉元素，元素护佑世界，{name}。你也在这世界里。"
L["Gladly, {name}. Mind your hair; the air gets lively."] = "乐意，{name}。当心头发，空气要活跃起来了。"
L["Of course, {name}. You'll smell of rain for an hour. Everyone I help does."] = "当然，{name}。你身上会有一个钟头的雨水味。我帮过的人都这样。"
L["The sky has a little fury to spare, {name}. Take some."] = "天空还有些怒气用不完，{name}。分你一点。"
L["Take this, {name}. The storm doesn't know you yet, but I've introduced you."] = "拿着，{name}。风暴还不认识你，不过我已经替你引荐了。"
L["A storm at your back for once, {name}, instead of in your face."] = "难得一回，风暴在背后推你，{name}，而不是迎面扑来。"
L["Here, {name}. I don't hand storms to just anyone. You've the shoulders for it."] = "给，{name}。风暴我可不随便给人。你的肩膀扛得住。"
L["Rain for the crops, storm for the fight, {name}. You look more like a fight."] = "雨水给庄稼，风暴给战斗，{name}。你看着更像要去战斗。"
L["Here, {name}. If you hear thunder later, it isn't weather. It's encouragement."] = "给，{name}。待会儿要是听到雷声，那不是天气，是在给你打气。"
L["From four elements and one shaman, {name}. The shaman did the walking."] = "四大元素加一个萨满送的，{name}。跑腿的是萨满。"
L["Walk well with this, {name}. The earth holds up everybody, but it likes you."] = "带着这个好好走，{name}。大地托着所有人，但它喜欢你。"
L["I'd give you fair weather, {name}, but the sky only lends me the stormy kind."] = "我倒想送你个好天气，{name}，可天空只肯借我暴风雨。"
L["Here, {name}. Thank the next clean stream you drink from. It's listening."] = "给，{name}。下次喝到清澈的溪水，记得道声谢。它在听。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I fall, wait. The spirits sometimes send me back."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是倒了，等等。灵魂有时会把我送回来。"
L["Earth below, sky above, {name}, us between, and this on you. Keep that order."] = "地在下，天在上，{name}，我们在中间，你身上还有这个。就这样别乱。"
L["Take this, {name}. If I call up an elemental, be polite. They hold grudges."] = "拿着，{name}。我要是召出元素，客气点。它们记仇。"
L["That's for you, {name}. Let them bunch together. Lightning loves a crowd."] = "给你的，{name}。让它们扎堆。闪电最爱人多。"
L["This is a taste, {name}. When I call the storm into your blood, you'll know it."] = "这只是尝个鲜，{name}。等我把风暴唤进你的血里，你就知道了。"
L["The wind picked our side today, {name}, and asked me to give you this."] = "今天风站在我们这边，{name}，它让我把这个给你。"
L["The elements favour the polite, {name}, and gave you this. Thank the rain."] = "元素偏爱有礼貌的人，{name}，所以给了你这个。谢谢雨吧。"
L["Take this, {name}. We're a small storm. Small storms still knock down fences."] = "拿着，{name}。我们是场小风暴。小风暴也能吹倒篱笆。"
L["That's from me, {name}, not the totems. Don't kick them. The fire one sulks."] = "这是我给的，{name}，不是图腾给的。别踢它们。火焰图腾会闹脾气。"
L["Take this, {name}. A river in the way? Don't go round. I'll have us walk on it."] = "拿着，{name}。有河挡路？别绕。我让大家在水上走。"
L["A sharper mind for you, {name}. Mine cost me an eyebrow in Dalaran."] = "送你个灵光脑子，{name}。我那个在达拉然赔了条眉毛。"
L["A clearer head for you, {name}. What you fill it with is your own affair."] = "给你个清爽的脑子，{name}。往里装什么，你自己定。"
L["Thoughts humming, {name}? Normal. If they hum back, come and find me."] = "脑子里嗡嗡响，{name}？正常。要是它回你话，来找我。"
L["A little arcane for your thoughts, {name}. Keep the change."] = "给你的思绪添点奥术，{name}。不用找了。"
L["Brilliance, bottled, {name}. The Kirin Tor would charge you for the bottle."] = "瓶装的聪明才智，{name}。换肯瑞托，连瓶子都得收钱。"
L["Sharper wits, {name}. Spend them on spells, locks or riddles; I won't judge."] = "脑子更灵了，{name}。用在法术、开锁还是猜谜上，我都不管。"
L["On loan from the Violet Citadel, {name}. Late returns are fined in sheep."] = "紫罗兰城堡借你的，{name}。逾期不还，罚你变羊。"
L["Clever enough to spot the trap now, {name}. Avoiding it is a separate spell."] = "聪明到能识破陷阱了，{name}。躲开它是另一个法术。"
L["There, {name}. Wiser already: look, you're standing further from me."] = "好了，{name}。已经变聪明了：瞧，你离我站远了。"
L["The one spell of mine that's never set anything alight, {name}. Enjoy."] = "我唯一没点着过东西的法术，{name}。请享用。"
L["A gnome's instructions make sense now, {name}. Still don't follow them."] = "侏儒的说明书你现在能看懂了，{name}。但千万别照做。"
L["Fortitude, {name}: a priest's polite way of saying 'stand in front'."] = "真言术：韧，{name}——“你站前面”的委婉说法。"
L["Every bit of stamina is one less panicked prayer from me, {name}."] = "你每多一点耐力，我就少一次慌张的祷告，{name}。"
L["Tougher already, {name}. Please don't take that as a dare."] = "已经更抗揍了，{name}。拜托别把这当成挑战。"
L["There are other Power Words, {name}. 'Shield', and in emergencies, 'Run'."] = "真言术不止这一个，{name}：还有“盾”，急了还有“跑”。"
L["Sturdier now, {name}. Falls, bears and bad decisions all hurt a bit less."] = "更结实了，{name}。摔跤、熊和馊主意，都没那么疼了。"
L["{buff}, {name}. Three words where 'be tougher' would do."] = "{buff}，{name}。说人话就是：抗揍点。"
L["A little more of you to go round, {name}. Spend it slowly."] = "血条又长了一截，{name}。省着点花。"
L["Harder to knock down now, {name}. The ground will miss you."] = "现在你更难被打倒了，{name}。地面会想你的。"
L["Stubbornness, really, {name}. Dwarves are born with it; the rest of us pray."] = "说白了就是倔，{name}。矮人天生就有，我们只能靠祈祷。"
L["The only armour that never needs repairing, {name}. The smiths hate it."] = "唯一不用修理的护甲，{name}。铁匠恨死它了。"
L["Consider your spirits lifted, {name}. Divinely, as it happens."] = "精神为之一振，{name}。还是神圣牌的。"
L["Like a good night's sleep, {name}, without all the lying down."] = "就像睡了个好觉，{name}，只是不用躺下。"
L["A second helping of spirit, {name}. The Light always insists on seconds."] = "再添一份精神，{name}。圣光跟长辈一样，总劝你再来一碗。"
L["Keep your spirit where it is, {name}. Loose ones wander off."] = "灵魂好好待在身上，{name}。松了会跑丢的。"
L["Cheer up, {name}. That's not advice this time; it's a spell."] = "打起精神来，{name}。这回不是劝你，是法术。"
L["Recover faster, {name}, from long fights and longer walks."] = "恢复更快，{name}：无论是长仗，还是更长的路。"
L["A deep breath's worth of calm, {name}, without having to take one."] = "相当于深呼吸一次，{name}，但不用你亲自吸。"
L["The Light's own second wind, {name}. Don't waste it on arguments."] = "圣光给你续了口气，{name}。别拿去跟人吵架。"
L["Proof against shadow, {name}. I know its tricks; I've borrowed a few."] = "防暗影了，{name}。它那些把戏我懂，我借用过几招。"
L["Should the Void call, {name}, you can now pretend you're out."] = "虚空要是打来，{name}，你现在可以装作不在家。"
L["For when the dark gets personal, {name}. It usually does."] = "以防黑暗针对你，{name}。它向来爱针对人。"
L["The shadows will have to knock first now, {name}."] = "现在暗影得先敲门了，{name}。"
L["The dark still bites, {name}, but now it has to chew."] = "黑暗照样会咬，{name}，只是现在得嚼上好一阵了。"
L["A lining against the dark, {name}. Like a cloak, only on the inside."] = "防黑暗的内衬，{name}。像斗篷，只不过穿在里面。"
L["Curses slide right off you now, {name}. The cultists will take it personally."] = "诅咒沾不上你了，{name}。邪教徒会觉得被针对了。"
L["Priests study the Shadow to guard against it, {name}. Mostly."] = "牧师钻研暗影，是为了防范它，{name}。大多数是。"
L["For crypts, cults and Scholomance, {name}. The dark gets chatty in all three."] = "去墓穴、邪教窝和通灵学院用的，{name}。那三处的黑暗都是话痨。"
L["It won't keep off gloom, {name}. For that you want company. Here I am."] = "它挡不住郁闷，{name}。那得靠人陪。我这不就来了。"
L["Marked by the wild, {name}. The deer will tip their antlers as you pass."] = "印上野性了，{name}。你经过时，鹿都会向你点角致意。"
L["You may smell faintly of moss, {name}. That's how you know it's working."] = "你身上可能有淡淡的苔藓味，{name}。说明生效了。"
L["Mark of the Wild, {name}. The wolves will still bite, but they'll feel bad."] = "野性印记，{name}。狼还是会咬，但会心怀愧疚。"
L["The wild's own seal of approval, {name}. The squirrels were consulted."] = "荒野官方认证，{name}。松鼠们也投过票了。"
L["A little of the wild in you now, {name}. Resist the urge to howl."] = "你身上有点野性了，{name}。忍住别嚎。"
L["Hide, claw and a thick coat, {name}. The wild packs light but thorough."] = "皮糙、爪利、毛厚，{name}。荒野出行，轻装但齐全。"
L["Cenarius signs every one of these, {name}. Well, a tree does, on his behalf."] = "每一份都有塞纳留斯的签名，{name}。好吧，是棵树代签的。"
L["The forest's own armour, {name}. It doesn't clank, and it smells of rain."] = "森林亲制的护甲，{name}。不叮当响，还带着雨的味道。"
L["A tougher hide in seconds, {name}. The oaks took centuries and are furious."] = "几秒就长出厚皮，{name}。橡树熬了几百年，气坏了。"
L["It's a loan from the wild, {name}. Try not to bring it back chewed."] = "荒野借你的，{name}。还的时候别带着牙印。"
L["Anything that bites you now gets a mouthful, {name}."] = "现在谁咬你，{name}，谁就满嘴刺。"
L["Let the boar charge, {name}. It'll leave with regrets and splinters."] = "让野猪冲吧，{name}。它会带着悔恨和一身木刺离开。"
L["Like a rose, {name}: lovely to look at, a mistake to grab."] = "你成带刺的玫瑰了，{name}：好看，碰不得。"
L["Thorns, {name}. I grew them myself, so do be polite to them."] = "荆棘，{name}。我亲手种的，对它们客气点。"
L["A hedge you can wear, {name}. Neatly trimmed; I'm not a barbarian."] = "能穿的树篱，{name}。修剪整齐了，我又不是野蛮人。"
L["Nature never turns the other cheek, {name}. It grows spikes on it."] = "大自然不讲以德报怨，{name}。只讲以刺报怨。"
L["Raptors learn slowly, {name}. This teaches them one bite at a time."] = "迅猛龙学得慢，{name}。这个教它们：咬一口，长一智。"
L["Prickly on the outside, {name}. What's inside is your own business."] = "外头带刺，{name}。里头软不软，你自己知道。"
L["Mind your cloak, {name}. Wool and brambles never did get along."] = "当心你的斗篷，{name}。羊毛和荆棘向来不对付。"
L["Blessing of Kings, {name}. No crown, no throne, no taxes owed."] = "王者祝福，{name}。没王冠，没王座，还免税。"
L["Long may you reign, {name}. For the next while, anyway."] = "吾王万岁，{name}。好吧，至少这一阵。"
L["A little more of everything, {name}. Kings never did settle for less."] = "样样都多一点，{name}。国王向来不肯将就。"
L["A king's blessing, {name}. Worn by better heads than mine, and some worse."] = "王者的祝福，{name}。戴过的脑袋有比我强的，也有差的。"
L["Every strength a little higher, {name}. Kings like to hedge their bets."] = "各项能力都高一点，{name}。国王喜欢多手准备。"
L["Crown not included, {name}. Everything else is, a little."] = "王冠不含在内，{name}。其他的都含一点。"
L["All of you, only more so, {name}. Wear it well."] = "你还是你，只是样样更出色，{name}。好好享用。"
L["A blessing fit for royalty, {name}. You'll have to do your own waving."] = "王室级别的祝福，{name}。挥手致意得你自己来。"
L["Stronger, cleverer, hardier, {name}. Kings had advisers for that; you have me."] = "更强、更聪明、更耐打，{name}。国王靠谋臣，你靠我。"
L["Royal treatment, {name}, minus the courtiers and the poisoned wine."] = "王室待遇，{name}，只是没有朝臣，也没有毒酒。"
L["Might doesn't make right, {name}, but it does help the argument."] = "拳头大不代表有理，{name}，但说话更响。"
L["A firmer swing for you, {name}. The Light loves a good follow-through."] = "挥得更有力了，{name}。圣光就爱看漂亮的收招。"
L["Stronger arms, {name}. Kindly point them at something that deserves it."] = "胳膊更有劲了，{name}。麻烦对准该挨揍的东西。"
L["Blessing of Might, {name}. It'll surprise you. It'll surprise them far more."] = "力量祝福，{name}。你会吓一跳，它们会吓得更厉害。"
L["Swing away, {name}. The Light will take the credit if it goes well."] = "尽管挥，{name}。打得好，功劳算圣光的。"
L["Hit harder, {name}. Them, I mean. Not me. Never the paladin."] = "打狠点，{name}。我说打它们。圣骑士打不得。"
L["More weight behind every swing, {name}. The Light calls it conviction."] = "每一挥都更有分量，{name}。圣光管这叫信念。"
L["Doors, crates and ogres will all give way easier now, {name}."] = "门、箱子和食人魔，现在都更容易让路了，{name}。"
L["Your weapon will feel lighter, {name}. It isn't. You're just holier."] = "武器会感觉轻了，{name}。其实没轻，是你更神圣了。"
L["The Light's own elbow grease, {name}. Put it somewhere useful."] = "圣光亲自出力，{name}。使在该使的地方。"
L["Wisdom for you, {name}. I kept a little back for myself. Very little."] = "给你智慧，{name}。我给自己留了一点。很少一点。"
L["Wisdom for your mana, {name}. The other kind still comes from bad decisions."] = "这份智慧管法力值，{name}。另一种，还得吃一堑长一智。"
L["Your mana creeps back on its own now, {name}, like a cat that's forgiven you."] = "法力值现在会自己慢慢回来，{name}，像只原谅了你的猫。"
L["Fewer sips between fights, {name}. The innkeepers will be heartbroken."] = "战斗间少喝几口水，{name}。旅店老板要伤心了。"
L["Drink less, cast more, {name}. The Light's own budget advice."] = "少喝水，多施法，{name}。圣光牌理财建议。"
L["Blessing of Wisdom, {name}: the one blessing that pays for itself."] = "智慧祝福，{name}：唯一能自己回本的祝福。"
L["A steadier well to draw from, {name}. Draw deep."] = "一口更不易枯的井，{name}。尽情汲取。"
L["Wisdom usually comes with age, {name}. This comes with a paladin. Quicker."] = "智慧通常随年纪来，{name}。这份随圣骑士来，快多了。"
L["May you know when to fight and when to sit down, {name}."] = "愿你知道何时该战，何时该坐下，{name}。"
L["A wise blessing for a wise choice, {name}: keeping a paladin around."] = "明智的祝福，配明智的选择，{name}：身边留个圣骑士。"
L["A blessing of quiet, {name}. Monsters will forget whose fault it was."] = "一份安静的祝福，{name}。怪物会忘了是谁惹的祸。"
L["Blessing of Salvation, {name}. You are now somebody else's problem."] = "拯救祝福，{name}。你现在是别人的麻烦了。"
L["Saved, {name}. Not your soul, mind. Just your hide."] = "得救了，{name}。灵魂不管，只保皮肉。"
L["Hit hard, {name}. If anything turns round, look innocent. The Light will."] = "狠狠打，{name}。有东西回头就装无辜。圣光也会装。"
L["The monsters will find you forgettable now, {name}. Today, that's a compliment."] = "现在怪物会觉得你毫无存在感，{name}。今天这是夸你。"
L["Go on, hit it, {name}. It'll blame whoever's wearing the most plate."] = "放心打，{name}。它只会去找板甲最厚的那位算账。"
L["The art of being in the fight, {name}, and out of the argument."] = "输出有你，仇恨没你，{name}。这是门艺术。"
L["The Light's kindest alibi, {name}. Use it often."] = "圣光最贴心的不在场证明，{name}。尽管常用。"
L["The Light will find you easier now, {name}. Try not to squint."] = "圣光现在更容易找到你了，{name}。尽量别眯眼。"
L["Holy Light lands harder on you now, {name}. Please don't make me prove it."] = "圣光术现在对你更有效了，{name}。拜托别逼我验证。"
L["You'll heal easier, {name}. The Light appreciates a willing patient."] = "你更好治了，{name}。圣光就喜欢配合的病人。"
L["Blessing of Light, {name}. Saving you is simpler now. Not that you'll need it."] = "光明祝福，{name}。现在救你更省事了。当然，你用不着。"
L["The Light knows the way to you now, {name}. Let's keep its visits social."] = "圣光现在认得去你那儿的路了，{name}。希望它只是来串门。"
L["A blessing that makes my job easier, {name}. Generous and lazy all at once."] = "一份让我省事的祝福，{name}。又大方又偷懒，两全其美。"
L["Holy Light fits you better now, {name}, like a well-cut tabard."] = "圣光术现在更合你身了，{name}，像件剪裁得体的战袍。"
L["Mending you just got cheaper, {name}. Not that I'd ever send a bill."] = "现在治你更省了，{name}。虽说我从不开账单。"
L["Block a blow now, {name}, and the Light hits back for you. It's petty."] = "现在你格挡一下，{name}，圣光就替你还手。它挺记仇的。"
L["Every blow lands softer now, {name}. Complaints go to the Light."] = "每一击都轻了，{name}。有意见请找圣光投诉。"
L["All the shelter of a temple, {name}, and none of the roof repairs."] = "有神殿的庇护，{name}，却不用修屋顶。"
L["Claim sanctuary, {name}. It's easier when you bring your own."] = "申请庇护吧，{name}。自带庇护所方便多了。"
L["Every blow is a little less rude now, {name}. The Light teaches manners."] = "每一击都客气了点，{name}。圣光教它们懂礼貌。"
L["Nobody can evict you from this sanctuary, {name}. I checked the deeds."] = "这庇护所谁也赶不走你，{name}。房契我查过了。"
L["An ogre's club lands like a pillow now, {name}. A heavy, angry pillow."] = "食人魔的棒子现在跟枕头似的，{name}。又沉又生气的枕头。"
L["Instructions, {name}: hit things harder. There is no page two."] = "说明书，{name}：使劲打。没有第二页。"
L["Your sword arm is sorted, {name}. For the rest of you, see a priest."] = "持剑的胳膊搞定了，{name}。其他部位请找牧师。"
L["Battle Shout, {name}. Not a spell, really. A strongly worded suggestion."] = "战斗怒吼，{name}。其实不算法术，算是措辞强硬的建议。"
L["RAAAGH! That one was for you, {name}. Everyone else just overheard."] = "吼啊啊啊！这声是给你的，{name}。别人只是顺便听到。"
L["Priests pray, mages study, {name}. I clear my throat, and you stand taller."] = "牧师祈祷，法师读书，{name}。我清清嗓子，你就站得更直。"
L["Words matter, {name}. Mostly the loud ones. That one was for you."] = "话语有分量，{name}。尤其是大声的。刚才那声是给你的。"
L["The shout lasts a few minutes, {name}. The ringing in your ears, rather longer."] = "怒吼持续几分钟，{name}。耳鸣可就久多了。"
L["There were words in that shout once, {name}. They slowed it down."] = "这声吼里原本有词，{name}。嫌拖慢速度，删了。"
L["A little breath from the damned, {name}. They weren't using it."] = "从亡魂那儿匀来一口气，{name}。反正他们用不着。"
L["Unending Breath, {name}. The fish will have so many questions."] = "无尽呼吸，{name}。鱼会有一肚子问题。"
L["Stay down as long as you like, {name}. The air's on me."] = "想在水下待多久都行，{name}。空气算我的。"
L["Swim deep, {name}. If a murloc asks, you're only visiting."] = "往深处游吧，{name}。鱼人问起，就说串门。"
L["Air from a place where air isn't strictly air, {name}. Breathe it anyway."] = "从一个空气不太算空气的地方弄来的，{name}。照吸不误。"
L["The Vile Reef awaits, {name}. Breathe easy down there; I've seen to it."] = "邪恶海礁在等你，{name}。在下面尽管喘气；我已经安排好了。"
L["Dropped something in a lake, {name}? Now's your chance."] = "有东西掉湖里了，{name}？现在正好去捞。"
L["No gills, {name}. I read the small print; gills were extra."] = "没有鳃，{name}。条款小字我看了，鳃得加钱。"
L["An order, {name}: stay standing. Your bones heard it, even if you didn't."] = "命令，{name}：给我站着。你没听见，你的骨头也听见了。"
L["Grit is a habit, {name}. I've lent you a few years of mine."] = "坚韧是一种习惯，{name}。我把攒了几年的借你。"
L["I command, you endure, {name}. The shortest chain of command in any army."] = "我下令，你挺住，{name}。全军最短的指挥链。"
L["Officers order from the back, {name}. I shout from the front, so you hold on."] = "军官在后面发号施令，{name}。我在前面吼，好让你撑住。"
L["A good shout can hold a line together, {name}. A line of one is easy."] = "一声好吼能稳住整条防线，{name}。一个人的防线更不在话下。"
L["I learned this drilling recruits, {name}. They hated me, and they all lived."] = "这是我操练新兵时学的，{name}。他们恨我，但全都活下来了。"
L["One shout's for hitting, {name}. This one's for being hit and not minding."] = "有一种吼是为了打人，{name}。这一种是让你挨打也不在乎。"
L["Most fights go to whoever lasts longest, {name}. Today, that's you."] = "大多数战斗，谁撑得最久谁赢，{name}。今天就是你。"
L["This horn once sounded for a worse master, {name}. It much prefers you."] = "这号角曾为更坏的主子吹响，{name}。它更喜欢你。"
L["I can't runeforge your weapon, {name}, but the horn comes close."] = "我没法给你的武器熔铸符文，{name}，但这号角也差不远。"
L["All Northrend's cold in a single note, {name}. Swing while it's still ringing."] = "诺森德的严寒全在这一个音里，{name}。趁余音未散，挥起武器。"
L["I'd play something cheerful, {name}, but this horn only knows the one note."] = "我倒想吹点欢快的，{name}，可这号角只会一个音。"
L["Winter took me once, {name}. Now it comes when I call, and it comes for you."] = "寒冬曾带走过我，{name}。如今我一唤它就来，为你而来。"
L["The Ebon Blade charges when this sounds, {name}. Today you charge with us."] = "号声一响，黑锋骑士团便冲锋，{name}。今天你和我们一起冲。"
L["Cold enough to wake the dead, {name}. I would know. It'll wake you up, too."] = "冷得能把死人冻醒，{name}。我最清楚。也能让你清醒。"
L["No warm words from me, {name}. Cold ones carry further, and carry strength."] = "我不说暖心话，{name}。冷话传得更远，还带着力量。"
L["Shaohao cast out his doubt and fear, {name}. What he kept, I pass to you."] = "少昊驱散了自己的疑与惧，{name}。他留下的，我传给你。"
L["Shoulders down and jaw loose, {name}. Now it can settle in properly."] = "沉肩，松下巴，{name}。这样它才能好好安顿下来。"
L["An open palm for friends, {name}. The fist is kept for everyone else."] = "张开的手掌给朋友，{name}。拳头留给其他所有人。"
L["I swept temple steps for a year to learn this, {name}. The steps stayed dusty."] = "为学这个，我扫了一年寺庙台阶，{name}。台阶还是灰扑扑的。"
L["Strength, grace and a clear head, {name}: the emperors' gifts. Now yours."] = "力量、优雅、清醒的头脑，{name}：皇帝们的恩赐。如今归你。"
L["A gift from a land that hid in the mists, {name}. Use it out in the open."] = "这份礼物来自曾藏身迷雾的国度，{name}。在光天化日下用吧。"
L["Harmony is hard to find, {name}. Hold on to this bit of it."] = "和谐难寻，{name}。这一点点，你可要抓牢。"
L["Nothing in it you didn't have already, {name}. I've only woken it up."] = "这里面没有你原本没有的东西，{name}。我只是把它唤醒了。"
L["Strength is better shown than talked about, {name}. So I'll say no more."] = "力量重在展现，不在嘴上，{name}。所以我不多说了。"
L["Strike where the guard is thin, {name}. The Tiger's eyes will show you where."] = "往防守薄弱处打，{name}。白虎的眼睛会告诉你在哪。"
L["Xuen never strikes by halves, {name}. Now neither do you."] = "雪怒出手从不留余力，{name}。如今你也是。"
L["You don't get the stripes, {name}. Only the nerve that goes with them."] = "虎纹不归你，{name}。只给你配得上虎纹的胆量。"
L["I trained in Kun-Lai's snow for this, {name}. Your feet stay warm, at least."] = "为这个我在昆莱山的雪里苦练过，{name}。至少你的脚是暖的。"
L["The Tiger's blessing isn't gentle, {name}, but it's on your side."] = "白虎的祝福可不温柔，{name}，但它站在你这边。"
L["Fierce, not angry, {name}. Xuen taught me the difference. Now it's yours."] = "要凶猛，不要愤怒，{name}。雪怒教会我分辨。现在交给你。"
L["Wait, watch, then pounce, {name}. With the tiger's gift, you'll need one try."] = "等待，观察，然后扑上去，{name}。有了白虎之赐，一击就够。"
L["Dark Intent, {name}. A grim name for a kind act. Warlocks name things badly."] = "黑暗意图，{name}。好心办的事，起了个阴森的名字。术士就是不会起名。"
L["Thank the demon who taught me this, {name}. On second thoughts, don't."] = "去谢谢教我这招的恶魔吧，{name}。算了，还是别了。"
L["You'll feel no different, {name}. Your enemies will. That's rather the point."] = "你不会觉得有什么不同，{name}。你的敌人会。这才是重点。"
L["A little fel, well filtered, {name}. You'll barely smell the sulphur."] = "一点邪能，过滤得很干净，{name}。几乎闻不到硫磺味。"
L["A spark of the Nether rides with you now, {name}. I've trained it to sit."] = "一点扭曲虚空的火花跟着你了，{name}。我教过它坐好。"
L["Don't feel guilty about the power, {name}. I've done the guilty part already."] = "别为这份力量内疚，{name}。内疚的部分我已经包了。"
L["Darkness suits you, {name}. I mean that kindly."] = "黑暗很衬你，{name}。我是好意。"
L["I'd wish you luck, {name}, but warlocks prefer to arrange it."] = "本想祝你好运，{name}，不过术士更喜欢亲手安排好运。"
L["The sky lends you its temper, {name}. Strike once, and the storm follows it in."] = "天空把它的脾气借给你，{name}。你出手一次，风暴就跟着补一下。"
L["The earth keeps you steady, {name}. Now the sky wants a turn."] = "大地让你站稳，{name}。现在轮到天空出力了。"
L["The storm rides with you now, {name}. Do warn it before you go indoors."] = "风暴现在跟着你走了，{name}。进屋前记得提醒它。"
L["If your hair stands on end, {name}, that's the storm agreeing with me."] = "要是你头发竖起来了，{name}，那是风暴在附和我。"
L["I asked the sky to stand behind you, {name}. It's very tall and easily annoyed."] = "我请天空站在你身后，{name}。它个子很高，脾气很急。"
L["Lightning never strikes twice, they say, {name}. Mine just struck you. Fury."] = "都说闪电不会两次劈中同一处，{name}。我的刚劈中你。怒意满满。"
L["I listen to the wind, {name}. Today it asked me to bless you. Done."] = "我听风说话，{name}。今天它让我祝福你。办好了。"
L["Thunder in your arms, {name}. Let the next fool who blocks your way hear it."] = "雷霆在你臂中，{name}。让下一个挡路的蠢货听听。"
L["A few borrowed moments from the bronze, {name}. Nozdormu keeps careful count."] = "从青铜龙那儿借来的片刻时光，{name}。诺兹多姆可都记着账呢。"
L["Time won't wait for you, {name}, but for the next while it'll dawdle."] = "时间不等人，{name}，但接下来一阵子它会磨磨蹭蹭。"
L["Not all help arrives in time, {name}. This kind brings its own."] = "不是所有援手都来得及时，{name}。这份自带时间。"
L["Should you need to slip away, {name}, time will cover for you."] = "你要是需要脱身，{name}，时间会替你打掩护。"
L["Bronze magic, {name}. You'll arrive a breath before you're needed."] = "青铜龙的魔法，{name}。你总能在被需要的前一刻赶到。"
L["Time is a river, {name}. I've found you a quicker current."] = "时间是条河，{name}。我给你找了股更急的水流。"
L["Time heals all wounds, {name}. I'd rather it helped you dodge them."] = "时间能治愈一切伤口，{name}。我宁可它帮你躲开。"
L["The bronze say I learned this tomorrow, {name}. I've stopped arguing with them."] = "青铜龙说我是明天学会这个的，{name}。我已经懒得跟他们争了。"
L["My spare magic is yours now, {name}. Every spell I overcharge spills your way."] = "我多余的魔力归你了，{name}。每次施法溢出的，都流到你那儿。"
L["Only one of you gets this, {name}. I chose. Try to look modest about it."] = "这个只能给一个人，{name}。我选了你。尽量显得谦虚点。"
L["I'd give you my patience as well, {name}, but I've barely enough for me."] = "我本想连耐心也给你，{name}，可我自己都不够用。"
L["We're linked for the hour, {name}. Don't worry, it only runs one way."] = "这一小时我们连在一起，{name}。放心，只是单向的。"
L["I've seen how hard you work, {name}. Let me carry a little of it."] = "我看得到你多辛苦，{name}。让我分担一点。"
L["My magic runs hot, {name}. By the time it reaches you, it's cooled nicely."] = "我的魔力很烫，{name}。流到你那儿时，刚好凉下来。"
L["Cast freely, {name}. Your mana is partly my concern now."] = "尽管施法，{name}。你的法力现在有我一份操心。"
L["If you run dry, {name}, it means I've been idle. Do say so."] = "你要是枯竭了，{name}，那就是我偷懒了。尽管说。"
L["The earth stands between you and harm now, {name}. Every blow mends you."] = "大地挡在你和伤害之间了，{name}。每次受击都会治愈你。"
L["Stone has your back, {name}. Each hit they land patches you up a little."] = "磐石护着你，{name}。挨一下打，就回一点血。"
L["The spirits of earth owed me a favour, {name}. I've spent it on you."] = "大地之灵欠我个人情，{name}。我用在你身上了。"
L["Hold the line, {name}. The ground itself is holding you."] = "守住阵线，{name}。大地本身在托着你。"
L["You take the hits, {name}, and the stone takes them personally."] = "你来挨打，{name}，磐石会替你记仇。"
L["Charge in, {name}. What they break, the earth puts back."] = "冲上去，{name}。他们打碎的，大地来补。"
L["You're my Beacon, {name}. Every heal I give the others shines on you too."] = "你就是我的道标，{name}。我治疗别人时，你也沾光。"
L["The Light will find you wherever you stand, {name}. I've made sure of it."] = "无论你站哪儿，圣光都找得到你，{name}。我保证。"
L["Stand tall, {name}. When I mend the others, you get the echo."] = "站稳了，{name}。我治疗别人时，你也有回响。"
L["A lighthouse for the whole group, {name}. Try not to stand in the dark."] = "你是全队的灯塔，{name}。别站在黑暗里。"
L["Wherever I heal, {name}, a little of it reaches you."] = "我治疗到哪儿，{name}，都有一点会传到你身上。"
L["I swear it, {name}: while this oath holds, my Light finds you first."] = "我发誓，{name}：誓言不破，圣光先找你。"
L["An oath sworn to you alone, {name}. Don't make me regret it."] = "这誓言只为你立，{name}。别让我后悔。"
L["My word is yours for a while, {name}. Paladins keep their word."] = "我的诺言暂时归你，{name}。圣骑士言出必行。"
L["I've sworn to keep you standing, {name}. I take oaths seriously."] = "我发过誓要护你周全，{name}。我很看重誓言。"
L["A little of you, a little of me, {name}. Nature loves a fair trade."] = "你分我一点，我分你一点，{name}。自然喜欢公平交易。"
L["We're bound for the hour, {name}. Borrow my gifts; I'll borrow yours."] = "我们结伴一小时，{name}。借我你的本事，我借你我的。"
L["Every living thing leans on another, {name}. Today we lean on each other."] = "万物相依，{name}。今天我们互相依靠。"
L["Lend me a trick, {name}, and I'll lend you one of mine."] = "借我一招，{name}，我也借你一招。"
L["The Dream calls this a partnership, {name}. I call it common sense."] = "梦境称之为伙伴，{name}。我称之为常识。"
L["Scales off my own back, {name}. Let them hit you and see what happens."] = "我背上的龙鳞，{name}。让他们来打，看会怎样。"
L["Wear these, {name}. Anything that bites you will regret its teeth."] = "穿上这个，{name}。咬你的东西会后悔长了牙。"
L["Dragonscale armour, freshly shed, {name}. It bites back."] = "刚蜕下的龙鳞甲，{name}。会咬回去哦。"
L["These scales burst when struck, {name}. Do let them strike."] = "这些龙鳞挨打就爆，{name}。尽管让他们打。"
L["A dragon's hide for an hour, {name}. Stand in front and enjoy it."] = "龙皮借你一小时，{name}。站前面好好享受。"
L["Run at the front of the pack, {name}. The wolf spirit makes them all chase you."] = "{name}，冲在最前面，狼灵会让它们全追着你。"
L["Lead the hunt, {name}. Every beast in here will want your throat, not ours."] = "{name}，带头狩猎吧，野兽只想咬你的喉咙。"
L["The alpha's spirit is yours now, {name}. Howl, and they'll all turn your way."] = "头狼之灵归你了，{name}。一声嚎叫，它们全朝你来。"
L["First through the door, {name}. The pack follows, and so does everything else."] = "{name}先进门，狼群跟上，别的东西也会跟上。"
L["My second Beacon, {name}. Whatever I give the others, you share in it too."] = "我的第二道道标，{name}。我给的治疗你也有份。"
L["Two lights to steer by tonight, {name}, and you're one of them."] = "今晚有两盏灯指路，{name}，你是其中一盏。"
L["The Light has room for two, {name}. Keep shining over there."] = "圣光容得下两人，{name}。在那边继续发光吧。"
L["Faith marks you as well, {name}. My heals will find both of you."] = "信仰也标记了你，{name}。我的治疗会找到你们俩。"
L["We're bonded for the hour, {name}. When I mend myself, you mend too."] = "我们暂时结为一体，{name}。我疗伤，你也恢复。"
L["Roots in the same soil, {name}. What heals one of us helps the other."] = "根扎同一片土，{name}。治好一个，另一个也受益。"
L["A bond of the grove, {name}. Look after yourself and you look after me."] = "林间的羁绊，{name}。照顾好自己就是照顾我。"
L["Nature pairs us up for a while, {name}. Try not to make me regret it."] = "自然让我们暂时搭档，{name}，别让我后悔。"
L["Now you'll see what creeps up on us, {name}. Try not to scream."] = "现在你能看见谁在偷偷靠近了，{name}。别叫出声。"
L["A warlock's sight, {name}, lent for a while. Some shadows stare back."] = "借你一会儿术士的眼睛，{name}。有些暗影会回瞪你。"
L["Eyes open, {name}. Whatever hides near us is about to be found."] = "睁大眼睛，{name}。藏在附近的东西要现形了。"
L["Folk will think we're duelling, {name}. Thanks for the {gift}."] = "别人要以为我们在决斗了，{name}。谢谢你的{gift}。"
L["{gift} for {buff}. No auctioneer's cut, {name}."] = "{gift}换{buff}，{name}，拍卖行不抽成。"
L["Beaten to it, {name}! Your {gift} was quicker than my manners."] = "被你抢先了，{name}！你的{gift}比我的礼数还快。"
L["{gift} in, {buff} out. Finest economy in all Azeroth."] = "{gift}进，{buff}出。艾泽拉斯最健康的经济。"
L["{gift}, for me? All I have is this, {name}, but it's heartfelt."] = "{gift}，给我的？我只有这个，{name}，但是真心的。"
L["Your {gift} fits perfectly, {name}. Did you measure me?"] = "你的{gift}太合身了，{name}。你量过我尺寸？"
L["A treaty in spells, {name}: {gift} for {buff}."] = "法术条约，{name}：{gift}换{buff}。"
L["{gift}! I feel taller already. Have some {buff}."] = "{gift}！我感觉都长高了。回你点{buff}。"
L["I was about to ask for {gift}, {name}. You read my mind."] = "我正想要{gift}呢，{name}。你会读心吗？"
L["Your {gift} still fizzes, {name}. Here's some fizz back."] = "你的{gift}还在冒泡，{name}。回你点泡泡。"
L["Such a kind {gift}, {name}. I'll tell the whole inn. Twice."] = "{gift}真贴心，{name}。全旅店都得听我讲两遍。"
L["You cast {gift} first, {name}? My mother would despair of me."] = "你先给了我{gift}，{name}？我娘准骂我没礼数。"
L["I'll remember your {gift} fondly, {name}. Until it wears off."] = "我会深情铭记你的{gift}，{name}。直到它消失。"
L["{gift} for {buff}, free. Somewhere, a goblin weeps."] = "{gift}换{buff}，免费。某处有个地精在哭。"
L["Your {gift}, my {buff}. We'll be unbearable now."] = "你的{gift}，我的{buff}。这下要飘了。"
L["Thanks for the {gift}, {name}. I'll earn it before it fades."] = "谢谢你的{gift}，{name}。它消失前我会对得起它。"
L["For {gift} I'd hand you both moons, {name}. This'll have to do."] = "为{gift}，两个月亮都摘给你，{name}。先拿这个吧。"
L["You brought {gift}, I brought {buff}. Now it's a party."] = "你带{gift}，我带{buff}。派对开始。"
L["{gift} means 'good luck'. {buff} means 'you too'."] = "{gift}是说“祝好运”，{buff}是说“你也是”。"
L["Your {gift} came first; my {buff} tries twice as hard."] = "你的{gift}先到，我的{buff}加倍卖力。"
L["If anyone asks, {buff} came before {gift}. Deal?"] = "有人问起，就说{buff}在{gift}之前。成交？"
L["{gift} made my day; {buff} should make your hour."] = "{gift}让我乐了一整天，{buff}够你乐一个钟头。"
L["Saved my {buff} for someone worthy. Then came {gift}."] = "{buff}本想留给配得上的人。然后{gift}就来了。"
L["Your {gift} went to my head; my {buff} goes to yours."] = "你的{gift}让我上头，我的{buff}换你上头。"
L["{gift} on me, {buff} on you. We wear each other's work."] = "我身披{gift}，你身披{buff}，互为裁缝。"
L["{gift} and {buff} fade. Kindness lasts. Well, longer."] = "{gift}和{buff}会消失，情谊长存。好吧，存得久一点。"
L["You shared {gift}; I share {buff}. Ale's next."] = "你分我{gift}，我分你{buff}。下回轮到麦酒。"
L["{gift} caught me empty-handed. Not any more: {buff}."] = "{gift}来时我两手空空。现在不了：{buff}。"
L["{gift}, best thing all day. {buff}, my bid for second."] = "{gift}，今天最棒的事。{buff}，争个第二。"
L["{gift} deserves a statue. I'm no sculptor, so: {buff}."] = "{gift}值得立座雕像。我不会雕，就回{buff}吧。"
L["{gift} for {buff}? Keep this up and we'll draw a queue."] = "{gift}换{buff}？再这样下去要排起长队了。"
L["{gift} was kind. {buff} is kind back, and competitive."] = "{gift}是好意，{buff}是回礼——还带点较劲。"
L["{gift} came like good news. {buff}, by return post."] = "{gift}如喜报传来，{buff}火速回信。"
L["{gift}, meet {buff}. Do get along, you two."] = "{gift}，这位是{buff}。你俩好好相处。"
L["Trade you {buff} for {gift}? Ah, you've already paid."] = "拿{buff}换你的{gift}？啊，你已经付过了。"
L["{gift} and {buff}. The inn will say we rehearsed."] = "{gift}配{buff}。旅店的人会说我们彩排过。"
L["{gift}! I just had three clever thoughts, {name}. This was one."] = "{gift}！我刚冒出三个好点子，{name}。这是其一。"
L["With {gift}, {name}, I finally understand my own notes. Thanks."] = "有了{gift}，{name}，我终于看懂自己笔记了。谢谢。"
L["Cleverer already, {name}. Clever enough to know I owe you one. Here."] = "已经变聪明了，{name}。聪明到知道欠你一个人情。给。"
L["Your {gift} found me the word for this, {name}: 'thanks'."] = "你的{gift}帮我找到了那个词，{name}：“谢谢”。"
L["{gift}! I understood a goblin contract, {name}. I'm appalled."] = "{gift}！我居然看懂了地精的合同，{name}。吓坏我了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My thoughts are lining up politely."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我的思绪都规规矩矩排好队了。"
L["I'll use your {gift} for more than arguing, {name}. Probably."] = "你的{gift}我不光拿来吵架，{name}。大概吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My next spell gets three extra syllables, just to show off."] = "谢谢你，{name}。下个法术我多念三个字，就为显摆。"
L["{gift}, {name}? I'll stand at the front for once. Briefly."] = "{gift}，{name}？那我就站前排一回。一小会儿。"
L["Knees, elbows and pride, {name}: all fortified. Thank you."] = "膝盖、肘子和自尊，{name}：全加固了。谢谢。"
L["Hit me now, {name}. Actually, don't. But thank you; I'd survive it."] = "来打我吧，{name}。算了，别打。但谢谢你，我扛得住。"
L["Nigh unbreakable now, {name}. Let's never test the 'nigh'. Thank you."] = "现在几乎打不坏了，{name}。“几乎”二字咱就别验证了。谢谢。"
L["{gift}! My healer owes you a letter, {name}. I owe you this."] = "{gift}！我的治疗欠你一封感谢信，{name}。我欠你这个。"
L["Every bruise I don't get today, {name}, I owe to your {gift}."] = "今天每块没挨上的淤青，{name}，都得归功于你的{gift}。"
L["I could lose an argument with an ogre now and live, {name}. Thank you."] = "现在跟食人魔吵输了我都能活，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I feel like a castle wall. A grateful one."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我感觉自己像堵城墙。一堵知恩的城墙。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The next boar to charge me is in for a long afternoon."] = "谢谢你，{name}。下一头冲我来的野猪，有个漫长的下午要熬了。"
L["{gift}! I feel ten years younger, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我感觉年轻了十岁，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["I feel twice as calm and half as grumpy, {name}. Thank you."] = "我平静了一倍，暴躁少了一半，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Your {gift} nearly made me sing, {name}. Take this. It's kinder."] = "你的{gift}差点让我唱起来，{name}。收下这个吧，比我唱歌仁慈。"
L["{gift}, {name}? I've forgiven three people already. Thank you."] = "{gift}，{name}？我已经原谅三个人了。谢谢你。"
L["I was on fumes, {name}. Your {gift} was a hot meal and a hearth."] = "我本来快油尽灯枯了，{name}。你的{gift}就是热饭加炉火。"
L["I've stopped counting mana between fights, {name}. Thank you."] = "打完架不用再数法力值了，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["My spirit's topped up, {name}, and the rest of me is grateful too."] = "我的精神加满了，{name}，其余部分也很感激。"
L["Shadow-proof, thanks to you, {name}. The whispers are furious."] = "多亏你，我能防暗影了，{name}。那些低语气坏了。"
L["Nothing dark gets in now, {name}. Here's something bright going the other way."] = "黑暗进不来了，{name}。回你一点亮的。"
L["{gift}! Shadowfang Keep can keep its shadows, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！影牙城堡的影子，让它自己留着吧，{name}。谢谢。"
L["The next shadow bolt's in for a letdown, {name}. Thank you."] = "下一发暗影箭要大失所望了，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["On your {gift} I'll brave Duskwood tonight, {name}. Or tomorrow."] = "有你的{gift}，我今晚就闯暮色森林，{name}。要不明天。"
L["{gift}! A squirrel just nodded at me, {name}. Here's yours."] = "{gift}！松鼠刚冲我点头，{name}。这是你的。"
L["Tougher hide, sharper senses, {name}. I may have to fight the urge to forage."] = "皮更厚，感官更灵，{name}。我得忍住别去刨食了。"
L["I feel all wild and leafy, {name}. Thank you. Sorry if I shed bark."] = "枝繁叶茂，野性十足，{name}。谢谢，掉了树皮莫怪。"
L["Thicker skin from your {gift}, {name}. Arrows and insults both."] = "有了你的{gift}，我皮厚了，{name}。箭和挖苦都扎不进。"
L["{gift}! A bird tried to nest on me, {name}. Thanks, I think."] = "{gift}！有只鸟想在我身上筑巢，{name}。谢谢……吧。"
L["Thanks for the {gift}, {name}. The woods feel like home now."] = "谢谢你的{gift}，{name}。现在树林都像家了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I've an urge to stand in the rain and grow. I'll resist."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我好想站在雨里长个儿。忍住了。"
L["Every bramble in the Barrens will think twice now, {name}. Thank you."] = "贫瘠之地的荆棘现在都得掂量掂量了，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Rain, cold and wolves: let them all try."] = "谢谢你，{name}。风雨、严寒、狼群：尽管来。"
L["{gift}, {name}! Nobody's hugging me today. Have this instead."] = "{gift}，{name}！今天没人抱我了，送你这个吧。"
L["Prickly now, thanks to you, {name}. More than usual, I mean."] = "多亏你，我浑身是刺了，{name}。比平时还扎人。"
L["Your {gift}, {name}! Let the next kobold try for my candle."] = "你的{gift}，{name}！下个狗头人敢碰我的蜡烛试试。"
L["{gift}! I'm a thicket with opinions now, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我现在是一丛有主见的灌木了，{name}。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The next thing that bites me will need a moment to reflect."] = "谢谢你，{name}。下个咬我的，得边挨反伤边反省。"
L["{gift} from you, {name}? I'll try not to found a dynasty."] = "你给的{gift}，{name}？我尽量不开创个王朝。"
L["A little better at everything, {name}. Is this how kings feel? No wonder."] = "样样都强了一点，{name}。当国王就是这感觉？难怪。"
L["Your {gift}! My first decree, {name}: thank you."] = "你的{gift}！朕的第一道圣旨，{name}：谢谢你。"
L["{gift} on a commoner, {name}? I'll try to look regal."] = "{gift}给我这平头百姓，{name}？我尽量装得有王者风范。"
L["With your {gift} I could rule a small kingdom, {name}. Westfall."] = "有了你的{gift}，我能统治个小王国了，{name}。西部荒野那种。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every bit of me is grateful, and they rarely agree."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我浑身上下都在感激，它们难得意见一致。"
L["Stronger arms already, {name}. I'll try not to hug anyone. Thank you."] = "胳膊已经有劲了，{name}。我尽量不抱任何人。谢谢你。"
L["With {gift} I could lift a kodo, {name}. I won't, but thank you."] = "有了{gift}能举科多兽，{name}。不举，但谢谢你。"
L["Your {gift} has my arms very confident, {name}. Thank you."] = "你的{gift}让我胳膊自信爆棚，{name}。谢谢。"
L["{gift}! Opened a jar I've fought since Stranglethorn, {name}."] = "{gift}！从荆棘谷拧到现在的罐子，终于开了，{name}。"
L["Thank you, {name}. My next swing is dedicated to you. So is the dent."] = "谢谢你，{name}。下一击献给你。砸出的坑也是。"
L["{gift} from you, {name}, and my first wise act is this."] = "收了{gift}，{name}，头一件明智事就是这个。"
L["Wiser already, {name}. Wise enough to know a kindness when I see one."] = "已经更睿智了，{name}。睿智到一眼认出好意。"
L["My mana thanks you for {gift}, {name}. It's the shy one of us."] = "我的法力值谢谢你的{gift}，{name}。它比较害羞，我代它说。"
L["Your {gift} refills me faster than I spend, {name}. Nearly."] = "你的{gift}回得比我花得还快，{name}。差不多吧。"
L["Your {gift}, {name}: mana back, and an urge to give advice."] = "你的{gift}，{name}：法力回来了，还特想给人出主意。"
L["{gift}! The monsters forgot me at once, {name}. I won't."] = "{gift}！怪物全忘了我，{name}。我忘不了你。"
L["Nothing wants to fight me now, {name}. It's lovely. Thank you."] = "现在谁都不想跟我打了，{name}。真美好。谢谢你。"
L["{gift}! Nothing's glared at me in minutes, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！好几分钟没被东西瞪了，{name}。谢谢。"
L["{gift}! A mouse at a dragon's feast, {name}: unseen, well fed."] = "{gift}！龙宴上的老鼠，{name}：没人看见，吃得饱饱。"
L["Thanks to {gift} I'm just a rumour in a fight, {name}."] = "多亏{gift}，战场上只剩我的传说，{name}。"
L["The Light finds me easier now, {name}. I'll try to deserve it."] = "圣光更容易找到我了，{name}。我会努力配得上它。"
L["Easier to heal now, {name}. Whoever patches me up thanks you too."] = "我更好治了，{name}。给我包扎的人也谢谢你。"
L["With your {gift}, {name}, mending feels like coming home."] = "有了你的{gift}，{name}，被治疗就像回家。"
L["{gift}! The Light and I are on first-name terms now, {name}."] = "{gift}！我跟圣光现在称兄道弟了，{name}。"
L["With {gift} the Light hears me first, {name}. No need to shout."] = "有了{gift}，圣光先听见我，{name}。不用喊了。"
L["Blows land softer on me now, {name}. My bruises thank you, and so do I."] = "现在挨揍都轻了，{name}。我的淤青谢谢你，我也谢谢你。"
L["Every hit gentler, thanks to you, {name}. I'll make sure they notice."] = "多亏你，每一击都温柔了，{name}。我会让它们知道的。"
L["Your {gift} softens every blow, {name}. I'm upholstered."] = "你的{gift}让每一击都软了，{name}。我都包上软垫了。"
L["{gift}! Now the Light takes every hit personally, {name}."] = "{gift}！现在我挨的每一下，圣光都记仇，{name}。"
L["With your {gift} I'm half fortress, half chapel, {name}."] = "有了你的{gift}，我一半是堡垒，一半是礼拜堂，{name}。"
L["You shouted at me, {name}, and I've never felt so encouraged. Here."] = "你冲我吼了，{name}，我从没这么受鼓舞过。给。"
L["My ears are ringing, {name}, and my arms feel twice as strong. Thank you!"] = "我耳朵嗡嗡响，{name}，胳膊力气翻倍。谢谢你！"
L["{gift}, {name}! I felt that in my teeth. In a good way."] = "{gift}，{name}！震得我牙都麻了。好的那种。"
L["I'll answer your {gift} quietly, {name}. Somebody should."] = "我就小声回应你的{gift}吧，{name}。总得有人小声点。"
L["Your {gift} nearly had me charging a wall, {name}. Here, calmly."] = "你的{gift}差点让我冲去撞墙，{name}。给，冷静地回你。"
L["All Azeroth heard your {gift}, {name}. Thank you for my share."] = "全艾泽拉斯都听见了你的{gift}，{name}。谢谢你分我一份。"
L["That shout put iron in my spine, {name}. Thank you."] = "那一吼让我腰杆都硬了，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["I didn't catch the words, {name}, but my arms did. Thank you!"] = "你吼的啥我没听清，{name}，但胳膊听懂了。谢谢！"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll hit the next thing twice as hard and blame you."] = "谢谢你，{name}。下个倒霉蛋我加倍使劲揍，然后赖你。"
L["I can breathe underwater, {name}! I may never need to, but thank you."] = "我能在水下呼吸了，{name}！可能永远用不上，但谢谢你。"
L["Lungs like a murloc, thanks to you, {name}. I'll try not to gurgle."] = "多亏你，肺活量堪比鱼人，{name}。我尽量不咕噜。"
L["With {gift} I'll raid every sunken wreck, {name}. Half's yours."] = "有了{gift}，每艘沉船我都去搜一遍，{name}。分你一半。"
L["I won't ask where {gift} gets its air, {name}. Just: thanks."] = "{gift}的空气哪来的，我不问，{name}。只说：谢谢。"
L["With {gift} I'll cross Lordamere Lake, {name}. Underneath."] = "有了{gift}，我要横渡洛丹米尔湖，{name}。从湖底。"
L["If I fall, {name}, I'll be back to thank you properly."] = "要是我倒下了，{name}，我会回来好好谢你。"
L["A spare life in my pocket, {name}. I'll try not to spend it. Thank you."] = "兜里多了一条备用的命，{name}。我尽量不用它。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Death can knock now; I've a key to the back door."] = "谢谢，{name}。死神尽管敲门，我有后门钥匙。"
L["Dying's only a delay with your {gift}, {name}. Thank you."] = "有你的{gift}，死亡只是耽搁一下，{name}。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If the worst happens, I'll get up and say it twice."] = "谢谢，{name}。万一出事，我爬起来再谢你一遍。"
L["Let the next thing roar at me, {name}. I'm not running this time. Thank you."] = "下一个尽管冲我吼吧，{name}。这次我不跑了。谢谢。"
L["{gift}! One fright, already dealt with, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！一场惊吓，提前搞定，{name}。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The next scream I hear won't be mine."] = "谢谢，{name}。下一声尖叫不会是我的。"
L["No running in circles for me, {name}. Not the first time, anyway. Thank you."] = "不用再绕圈乱跑了，{name}。至少第一次不会。谢谢。"
L["Brave on credit, thanks to you, {name}. I'll spend it wisely."] = "赊来的勇气，多亏你，{name}。我会省着花。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Lakes, rivers, puddles: all floors now."] = "谢谢，{name}。湖、河、水坑，现在全是地板。"
L["{gift}! The short way across it is, {name}. Dry boots and all."] = "{gift}！那就直接走过去吧，{name}。靴子都不湿。"
L["Walking on water, {name}. Folk will start a religion. Thank you."] = "在水上行走，{name}。迟早有人要立个教派。谢谢。"
L["The murlocs will be furious, {name}. Thank you for the shortcut."] = "鱼人要气疯了，{name}。谢谢你的捷径。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll be across before it fades. Probably."] = "谢谢，{name}。我会在它消失前走到对岸。大概吧。"
L["{gift}! Whatever hid round here, {name}, hides no more."] = "{gift}！这附近藏着的东西，{name}，再也藏不住了。"
L["I can see what's hiding now, {name}. Some of it should stay hidden. Thanks."] = "现在我能看见藏起来的东西了，{name}。有些还是藏着好。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every lurker around just lost their only trick."] = "谢谢，{name}。附近潜伏的家伙刚刚丢了唯一的本事。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Now I can see what your imp gets up to."] = "谢谢，{name}。现在我能看见你的小鬼在干什么了。"
L["My eyes see more than my wits can handle, {name}. Thank you."] = "我的眼睛看到的，比我的脑子能接受的还多，{name}。谢谢。"
L["I'll be the last one standing, {name}, just to hear you shout again."] = "我会撑到最后一个，{name}，就为了再听你吼一次。"
L["You ordered me to live, {name}. I mean to follow it to the letter. Thanks."] = "你命令我活下去，{name}。我会一字不差地执行。谢啦。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every sinew I have just closed ranks."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我浑身的筋骨都列队站好了。"
L["Never been shouted into good health before, {name}. Thank you."] = "头一回被人吼得身强体壮，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Yes, Sergeant {name}! Your shout brings out the recruit in me. Thank you."] = "是，{name}中士！你一吼，我就变回新兵了。谢谢你。"
L["{gift}! That voice could turn a stampede, {name}. Thanks."] = "{gift}！这嗓门能喝住受惊的兽群，{name}。谢啦。"
L["That horn froze my breath and fired my arms, {name}. Thank you."] = "那号角冻住了我的呼吸，点燃了我的双臂，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Most folk hear that horn from the wrong end of a battle, {name}. Thank you."] = "多数人听到这号角时，都站在战场错的一边，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["I heard your horn and swung harder, {name}. Nobody had to tell me twice."] = "听到你的号角，我挥得更狠了，{name}。用不着说第二遍。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll be humming that note for the rest of the day."] = "谢谢你，{name}。这个音我得哼一整天了。"
L["Thanks to you, {name}, I'll never grumble about winter again."] = "多亏了你，{name}，我再也不抱怨冬天了。"
L["{gift}! I won't ask what the horn's made of, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我不问这号角是用什么做的，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["An emperor's legacy, {name}. I'll try to leave it no worse than I found it."] = "皇帝的传承，{name}。我会尽量不让它在我手上变差。"
L["Like a month of training before breakfast, {name}. Thank you."] = "像早饭前练了一个月的功，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I feel calm enough to brew tea in a thunderstorm."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我现在心静到能在雷雨里泡茶。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I bowed without thinking. Is that part of it?"] = "谢谢你，{name}。我不自觉就鞠了个躬。这也是附带的吗？"
L["{gift}! Pandaria's finest, {name}. Don't tell the brewmasters."] = "{gift}！潘达利亚的极品，{name}。别告诉酒仙们。"
L["Stronger, quicker and steadier at once, {name}. My teachers never managed that."] = "一下子更强、更快、更稳，{name}。我的老师们都没做到过。"
L["{gift}, {name}! Even my mistakes will look deliberate now."] = "{gift}，{name}！现在连我的失误都像是故意的了。"
L["I feel a tiger pacing in my chest, {name}. It wants to hunt. Thank you."] = "我觉得胸中有只老虎在踱步，{name}。它想去狩猎。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll be very polite to cats from now on."] = "谢谢你，{name}。从今以后我对猫会很客气。"
L["I could out-stare a tiger now, {name}. Not Xuen. A small one."] = "我现在能跟老虎对视不眨眼，{name}。不是雪怒，是小只的。"
L["Every strike I throw now has claws in it, {name}. Thank you."] = "我现在每一击都带着爪子，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["I'd thank Xuen as well, {name}, but he answers thanks with a sparring match."] = "我也想谢谢雪怒，{name}，可他回应感谢的方式是找你切磋。"
L["{gift}! I feel sharper and slightly sinister, {name}. Thanks."] = "{gift}！我觉得自己更敏锐了，还有点阴险，{name}。谢啦。"
L["Dark but generous, {name}, like a good stout. Thank you."] = "色深而醇厚，{name}，像一杯好黑啤。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. If I start cackling in a fight, you'll know why."] = "谢谢你，{name}。要是我打着打着开始怪笑，你知道原因。"
L["Bound to a warlock for the hour, {name}. My family would faint. Thank you."] = "这一小时跟术士连在一起，{name}。我家人知道了会晕倒。谢谢你。"
L["Like borrowing a sharp knife from a stranger in an alley, {name}. Thanks."] = "就像在小巷里从陌生人手上借了把快刀，{name}。谢啦。"
L["More dangerous today and worse sleep tonight, {name}. A fair trade. Thanks."] = "今天我更危险，今晚睡得更差，{name}。公平交易。谢啦。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Now I know why shamans always look so windswept."] = "谢谢你，{name}。现在我知道萨满为什么总是一副被风吹乱的样子了。"
L["{gift}! Swift as the wind, {name}, and as hard to argue with."] = "{gift}！快如疾风，{name}，也跟风一样没法讲理。"
L["Your {gift} has me crackling, {name}. Shake hands carefully."] = "你的{gift}让我浑身噼啪作响，{name}。握手要小心。"
L["My weapon keeps hitting things twice, {name}. Thank you, and thank the storm."] = "我的武器老是一下打两次，{name}。谢谢你，也谢谢风暴。"
L["The sky's on my side now, {name}. I'll try not to stand on any hilltops."] = "天空站在我这边了，{name}。我尽量不站在山顶上。"
L["I'm half thunderstorm now, {name}. Thank you, and sorry about the rain."] = "我现在一半是雷暴了，{name}。谢谢你，下雨的事抱歉。"
L["{gift}! A step ahead of everything, {name}, myself included."] = "{gift}！凡事都快一步，{name}，连我自己都被甩在后面。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll be out of trouble before trouble notices."] = "谢谢你，{name}。麻烦还没发现我，我就已经脱身了。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I can feel the sands shifting in my favour."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我能感觉到时光之沙正往我这边流。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Even my running away will look dignified now."] = "谢谢你，{name}。现在连我逃跑都显得很体面。"
L["Haven't I thanked you already, {name}? Time's gone odd. Thanks again."] = "我是不是已经谢过你了，{name}？时间有点乱。再谢一次。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Nozdormu won't miss the moments; he has all of them."] = "谢谢你，{name}。诺兹多姆不会在意少了这几刻，所有时光都是他的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Your magic and mine get on surprisingly well."] = "谢谢你，{name}。你的魔法和我的意外地合得来。"
L["Of everyone here, {name}, you chose me? I'm flattered and refreshed."] = "这么多人里，{name}，你选了我？我受宠若惊，还神清气爽。"
L["{gift}! I'll be the last one here to run dry, {name}. Thank you."] = "{gift}！我会是这里最后一个耗尽的，{name}。谢谢你。"
L["I could cast till sundown now, {name}. Please keep breathing fire."] = "我现在能施法到日落，{name}。请继续喷火吧。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Everyone I help today owes you a little too."] = "谢谢你，{name}。今天我帮的每个人，也都欠你一点。"
L["Your leftovers beat my best, {name}. Most humbling. Thank you."] = "你剩下的都比我最好的强，{name}。真叫人惭愧。谢谢你。"
L["Thank you, {name}. With the earth at my back, I'll stand anything."] = "谢谢，{name}。有大地撑腰，我什么都扛得住。"
L["{gift}! Let them hit me now, {name}. I'll only get better."] = "{gift}！让他们来打吧，{name}。我只会越打越好。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll try to deserve every pebble."] = "谢谢，{name}。我会对得起每一颗石子。"
L["A Beacon, for me? I'll shine where the hits land, {name}. Thank you."] = "给我的道标？我会在挨打处发光，{name}。谢谢。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Every heal of yours has my address on it now."] = "谢谢，{name}。你的每次治疗现在都写着我的地址。"
L["{gift}! I'll lead, {name}, and your Light can follow."] = "{gift}！我带路，{name}，你的圣光跟上。"
L["An oath, sworn to me? Thank you, {name}. I'll try to be worth keeping."] = "向我立的誓？谢谢，{name}。我会值得你守护。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll stand in front; you keep your word."] = "谢谢，{name}。我站前面，你守诺言。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll take good care of your trick, and you of mine."] = "谢谢，{name}。我会好好用你的绝活，你也照看我的。"
L["{gift}! We're a matched pair now, {name}. Let's not waste it."] = "{gift}！我们成一对了，{name}。别浪费。"
L["Your own scales, {name}? I'll wear them proudly. Thank you."] = "你自己的龙鳞，{name}？我会自豪地穿上。谢谢。"
L["{gift}! Let them swing at me now, {name}. They'll regret it."] = "{gift}！让他们来打我吧，{name}。他们会后悔的。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll lead the pack and keep their eyes on me."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我来带队，让它们都盯着我。"
L["{gift}! Let them all come for me now, {name}. I am the alpha."] = "{gift}！都冲我来吧，{name}。我是头狼。"
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll try to be a light worth following."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我会做一盏值得追随的光。"
L["{gift}! Two lights on me now, {name}. I will keep mine lit."] = "{gift}！两盏灯在我身上，{name}。我的会亮着。"
L["Thank you, {name}. Whatever I mend in myself, I'll send your way."] = "谢谢你，{name}。我自愈的部分都分你一份。"
L["{gift}! Bonded, then, {name}. I'll take good care of us both."] = "{gift}！结为一体了，{name}。我会照顾好我们俩。"
L["We have to stop meeting like this, {name}. Actually, no. Here's another one."] = "我们不能老这么碰面了，{name}。其实，能。再给你一个。"
L["Again, {name}? Splendid. I've been practising since last time."] = "又见面了，{name}？太好了。上次之后我一直在练。"
L["You again, {name}? Another one for you, then. People will say we're friends."] = "又是你，{name}？那就再给你一个。别人要说咱们是朋友了。"
L["Same face, same spell, {name}. I do love a tradition."] = "老面孔，老法术，{name}。我就爱这传统。"
L["Another round, {name}? I'm keeping score, and we're both winning."] = "再来一轮，{name}？我在记分，我们俩都赢着呢。"
L["Ah, {name}! My favourite repeat customer."] = "啊，{name}！我最喜欢的回头客。"
L["Our paths keep crossing, {name}, and I keep having one of these for you."] = "我们的路老是交汇，{name}，而我总有一个这个给你。"
L["Once more, {name}. Do stop me if you've heard this one."] = "再来一次，{name}。这段听过的话，打断我。"
L["I kept some aside, {name}, in case you came back. Good instinct, mine."] = "我给你留了一份，{name}，就怕你回来。看来我直觉不错。"
L["Back already, {name}? The day's improving. Here, same as last time."] = "这就回来了，{name}？今天越来越好了。给，跟上次一样。"
L["Again, {name}? At this rate I'll learn your middle name. Have another."] = "又来，{name}？照这样我都要记住你的中间名了。再来一个。"
L["Once is kindness, twice is a habit, {name}. I've never broken a habit yet."] = "一次是好意，两次是习惯，{name}。我还从没改掉过哪个习惯。"
L["An encore, {name}, for my most faithful audience."] = "再来一曲，{name}，献给我最忠实的观众。"
L["One more of these, {name}, and we'll have to draw up a guild charter."] = "再来一回，{name}，咱俩就得填公会登记表了。"
L["I'll remember your face now, {name}, and I'm terrible with faces. Here."] = "现在我记住你的脸了，{name}，我可是最不会记脸的。拿着。"
L["Us again, {name}. The world must be short of people to bless. Here."] = "又是咱俩，{name}。世上可祝福的人大概不够用了。拿着。"
L["Last time went so well, {name}, I've changed nothing."] = "上回太顺利了，{name}，我啥都没改。"
L["Good to see someone I know, {name}. Rarer than you'd think. Have this."] = "见到熟人真好，{name}。比你想的要少见。拿着。"
L["Oh, it's you, {name}. Good. I hate giving these to strangers."] = "哦，是你啊，{name}。那就好，我最不爱给陌生人这个。"
L["{name}, at this point we should just share a reagent pouch."] = "{name}，到这份上，咱们干脆合用一个施法材料袋吧。"
L["Same time tomorrow, {name}? I'll bring {buff}. You bring you."] = "明天老时间，{name}？我带{buff}，你带上你自己。"
L["I've lost count of these, {name}, and I've decided that's a compliment."] = "这个我都数不清给过多少回了，{name}，我决定当它是夸奖。"
L["Keep this up, {name}, and the bards will write a dull song about our favours."] = "再这样下去，{name}，吟游诗人要为咱们的互帮互助写首无聊的歌了。"
L["I could do this one in my sleep by now, {name}. I may have."] = "这活儿我睡着都能干，{name}。可能真干过。"
L["The usual, {name}? Of course the usual."] = "老样子，{name}？当然是老样子。"
L["We should have a secret handshake by now, {name}. Until then, this."] = "咱们早该有个秘密握手了，{name}。在那之前，先用这个。"
L["By now, {name}, I think we've built a small economy between us."] = "到现在，{name}，我俩之间都有个小经济体了。"
L["Old friends by now, {name}. Old acquaintances, at least, with this habit."] = "都是老朋友了，{name}。至少是有这个习惯的老相识。"
L["Let the record show: {name} and I, undefeated at being prepared."] = "记录在案：{name}和我，论有备无患，从无败绩。"
L["My spellbook opens to your page on its own now, {name}."] = "我的法术书现在自己就翻到你那页了，{name}。"
L["If you stopped turning up, {name}, who would I give these to? The guards?"] = "你要是不来了，{name}，这些我给谁去？给卫兵吗？"
L["We keep this up, {name}, and one of us owes the other a drink."] = "再这么下去，{name}，咱俩总有一个得请对方喝一杯。"
L["We're a local landmark now, {name}: the pair who bless each other. Here."] = "咱们都成本地地标了，{name}：互相祝福的那一对。拿着。"
L["Regular as the tides, {name}, and twice as welcome. As is this."] = "准时得像潮汐，{name}，还加倍受欢迎。这个也是。"
L["I'd trust you with my last potion, {name}. For now, take this."] = "我最后一瓶药水都敢托付给你，{name}。眼下先拿着这个。"
L["Next time we share a fire, {name}. This time, take this."] = "下次一起烤火，{name}。这次先拿着这个。"
L["I'd miss this if it stopped, {name}. So let's not stop."] = "要是停了我会想念的，{name}。那就别停。"
L["There's nobody I'd rather keep blessing, {name}."] = "没有谁比你更让我愿意一再祝福了，{name}。"
L["You always turn up at the right moment, {name}, and I'm always ready. Here."] = "你总在对的时候出现，{name}，我也总备着。拿着。"
L["Safe walls, warm beds, and now {buff}. You're spoiled, {name}."] = "墙高床暖，还有{buff}。你被宠坏了，{name}。"
L["The guards have it covered, {name}, but I like to be thorough."] = "卫兵们都守着呢，{name}，但我喜欢做全套。"
L["Careful, {name}. Look this capable in town and folk will ask you favours."] = "当心，{name}。在城里看着这么能干，会有人找你帮忙的。"
L["Not a monster for miles, {name}. Still, take this. One never knows the cooking."] = "方圆几里没有怪物，{name}。还是拿着吧。厨子的手艺可说不准。"
L["For the crowds, {name}. In town, they're the real danger."] = "防人群的，{name}。城里最危险的就是人群。"
L["Rest easy, {name}. I'll count that my good deed and go find a pint."] = "安心休息吧，{name}。今天的好事做完了，我找酒喝去。"
L["Even in town, {name}, a dragon has been known to drop in. Better safe."] = "就算在城里，{name}，也有龙突然造访过。小心为上。"
L["Best do it in here, {name}. Out there, nobody stands still long enough."] = "最好在这儿弄，{name}。出了城，谁都不肯站着别动。"
L["Mind the pickpockets, {name}. This is the one thing on you they can't lift."] = "小心扒手，{name}。你身上就这个他们偷不走。"
L["City rules, {name}: no blades drawn, no spells thrown. This one's allowed."] = "城里规矩，{name}：不许拔刀，不许施法。这个例外。"
L["Nothing to fight here but stray cats, {name}. Take this anyway."] = "这儿除了野猫没什么好打的，{name}。还是拿着吧。"
L["For the walk to the bank, {name}. It's always further than it looks."] = "去银行的路上用，{name}。那段路总比看着远。"
L["Enjoy a warm hearth while you can, {name}, and take this for the road."] = "能享受暖炉就多享受，{name}，路上带着这个。"
L["The watch has the walls, {name}. I'll see to you."] = "城墙有守卫看着，{name}。你归我照应。"
L["For the stairs, {name}. Whoever built this place never met a short way up."] = "爬楼梯用的，{name}。修这地方的人压根不知道啥叫近路。"
L["Everything else in town has a price, {name}. This slipped past the merchants."] = "城里啥都要钱，{name}。就这个，商人漏掉了。"
L["Buy nothing from anyone who calls you 'friend', {name}. Except me. It's free."] = "谁管你叫“朋友”，就别买他的东西，{name}。我除外。这个免费。"
L["Out here everything wants to eat you, {name}. Now it'll need a bigger fork."] = "野外什么都想吃你，{name}。现在它们得换把更大的叉子了。"
L["No guards for miles, {name}, and the boars know it. Take this."] = "几里内没卫兵，{name}，野猪心里有数。拿着。"
L["Nobody out here but us and the wildlife, {name}. With this, we're tougher."] = "这儿就我们和野兽，{name}。有了这个，我们更扛揍。"
L["If a bear asks, {name}, you were like this when I found you."] = "熊要是问起，{name}，就说我发现你时你就这样。"
L["The wolves have been eyeing you, {name}. This should give them pause."] = "狼一直在盯着你，{name}。这下它们该掂量掂量了。"
L["Wild country, {name}. Best not to meet it armed with good intentions alone."] = "荒郊野外，{name}。光靠一片好心可不够。"
L["Map, canteen, {buff}. Now you can get lost properly, {name}."] = "地图、水壶、{buff}。这下能好好迷路了，{name}。"
L["Camp's a long way off, {name}. Consider this a roof you can carry."] = "营地还远着呢，{name}。就当这是个随身带的屋顶。"
L["Out past the last farm, {name}, you're on your own. Nearly."] = "过了最后一座农场，{name}，就只能靠你自己了。差不多吧。"
L["Nearest inn's a day's walk, {name}; the nearest teeth, closer. Take this."] = "最近的旅店要走一天，{name}；最近的獠牙更近。拿着。"
L["Two hills and a swamp to the next town, {name}. Here; the swamp has opinions."] = "到下个镇要翻两座山过一片沼泽，{name}。拿着；沼泽有自己的想法。"
L["Take this; camp carefully, {name}. Every nice clearing has an owner with claws."] = "拿着；扎营小心点，{name}。每片好空地都有个带爪子的主人。"
L["Fresh air, open sky, {name}, and this. Enjoy it while nothing's chasing you."] = "新鲜空气，开阔天空，{name}，还有这个。趁没东西追你，好好享受。"
L["Something's following you, {name}. Probably a boar. This is in case it isn't."] = "有东西在跟着你，{name}。多半是野猪。这个防万一不是。"
L["Take this and stay on the road, {name}. The road has guards. Some of the time."] = "拿着，别离开大路，{name}。大路上有卫兵。有时候有。"
L["Rain's coming, {name}, and so are the wolves. One of those I can help with."] = "要下雨了，狼也要来了，{name}。雨我可管不了。"
L["A villain in here rehearses a speech, {name}. Take this, then let's interrupt."] = "这里头有个反派在排练台词，{name}。拿着，然后咱们去打断他。"
L["Whatever waits at the end of this place, {name}, this will make it regret it."] = "不管这地方尽头等着什么，{name}，这个都会让它后悔。"
L["Nobody leaves here alive, they say, {name}. Take this; let's prove them wrong."] = "都说没人能活着离开这里，{name}。拿着；咱们证明他们错了。"
L["Our host had years to prepare, {name}. We have {buff}."] = "东道主备战多年，{name}。我们有{buff}。"
L["Nobody builds a dungeon with a back door, {name}. Take this instead."] = "没人给地下城修后门，{name}。拿这个将就吧。"
L["Dark halls, old traps, worse tempers. At least you're ready, {name}."] = "暗厅、老陷阱、更坏的脾气。好在你有准备，{name}。"
L["Better I hand you this now, {name}, than a eulogy later."] = "现在给你这个，{name}，总比以后念悼词强。"
L["There's treasure in here, {name}, and something large sat on it. This first."] = "这里有宝藏，{name}，还有个大家伙坐在上面。先拿着这个。"
L["If a door slams shut behind us, {name}, that's tradition. Take this first."] = "身后的门要是砰地关上，{name}，那是老传统。先拿着这个。"
L["Take this, {name}, and mind the patrols. They walk the same loop and resent it."] = "拿着，{name}，当心巡逻的。它们总走同一圈，憋着一肚子气。"
L["Whoever built this place spent it all on skulls, {name}. Here's a little light."] = "造这地方的人把钱全花在骷髅上了，{name}。给你一点光。"
L["The last lot through here were never seen again, {name}. They lacked this."] = "上一队进来的再也没出去，{name}。他们就缺这个。"
L["Take this, {name}; check the ceiling. In places like this, something drops in."] = "拿着，{name}；看看天花板。这种地方总会有东西掉下来。"
L["Take this, {name}. If we meet a talking skull, let me do the talking."] = "拿着，{name}。要是遇到会说话的骷髅，让我来说。"
L["Here, {name}. If the walls start whispering, don't answer. It encourages them."] = "拿着，{name}。墙要是开始低语，别回话。会助长它们。"
L["Touch nothing that glows, pull nothing that clicks, {name}. Wear this."] = "发光的别碰，咔哒响的别拉，{name}。把这个穿上。"
L["Take this and stick together in here, {name}. Echoes carry, and so do grudges."] = "拿着，在里面别走散，{name}。回声传得远，仇怨也是。"
L["Flags, towers, graveyards, {name}. Whatever we're fighting over, take this."] = "旗子、塔楼、墓地，{name}。不管这次抢的是什么，拿着这个。"
L["Win or lose, {name}, nobody will say you went in unprepared."] = "输赢不论，{name}，没人能说你毫无准备。"
L["The graveyard's just over there, {name}. Take this; let's both not visit it."] = "墓地就在那边，{name}。拿着；咱俩都别去。"
L["Honour's on the line, {name}. So is the flag. Here's something for both."] = "荣誉攸关，{name}。旗子也是。给你点两样都用得上的。"
L["Take this and stay with the group, {name}. Lone heroes make short songs."] = "拿着，跟紧队伍，{name}。独行英雄的歌都很短。"
L["Our banner looks better with you under it, {name}, and blessed. Stand tall."] = "有你在旗下，我们的旗更好看，{name}，你还受了祝福。站直了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Keep your head down and your colours up."] = "拿着，{name}。脑袋压低，旗帜举高。"
L["Hold the line with this, {name}. The songs are about the ones who stood."] = "带着这个守住阵线，{name}。歌谣唱的都是坚守的人。"
L["Take this and come back in one piece, {name}. That's all I ask."] = "拿着，完完整整地回来，{name}。我只求这个。"
L["Drums are for courage, {name}. This is for everything else."] = "战鼓管勇气，{name}。其余的归这个管。"
L["Some fight for glory, {name}. I fight for whoever's beside me, and bless them."] = "有人为荣耀而战，{name}。我为身边的人而战，还为他们祝福。"
L["Take this, {name}. Fight for the banner, come back for the singing. It's awful."] = "拿着，{name}。为旗而战，回来听歌。唱得很难听。"
L["Early bird, {name}? Here's something better than a worm."] = "早起的鸟儿有虫吃，{name}。给你个比虫强的。"
L["Good morning, {name}. Consider this your first cup of something strong."] = "早上好，{name}。就当这是你今天的第一杯浓茶。"
L["Early start, {name}. The day hasn't gone wrong yet, and this should keep it so."] = "起得早，{name}。今天还没出岔子，这个能让它继续顺利。"
L["Not even lunch yet, {name}, and you're already better prepared than I am."] = "还没到午饭时间，{name}，你就比我准备得更充分了。"
L["Morning, {name}. The monsters are still yawning. Take this before they stop."] = "早，{name}。怪物们还在打哈欠。趁它们没醒透，拿着这个。"
L["A fresh day and a fresh {buff}, {name}. Let's not waste either."] = "崭新的一天，崭新的{buff}，{name}。哪个都别浪费。"
L["Up with the sun, {name}? Show-off. Here; the sun doesn't get one."] = "跟太阳一起起床，{name}？显摆。给，太阳可没这个。"
L["Rise and shine, {name}. This is the shine; breakfast can wait."] = "起床发光吧，{name}。这就是光；早饭可以等等。"
L["Everything's golden and nobody's shouted yet, {name}. Add this to it."] = "一片金灿灿，还没人吼过，{name}。再添上这个。"
L["Too early for heroics, {name}? Nonsense. Here; heroics go best before lunch."] = "太早了不适合逞英雄，{name}？胡说。拿着；英雄事迹午饭前最好办。"
L["The birds are singing, {name}. They haven't seen what's out there. Take this."] = "鸟在唱歌，{name}。它们还没见识外头有什么。拿着。"
L["First good deed of the day, {name}. It's all downhill from here."] = "今天第一件好事，{name}。接下来就一路下坡了。"
L["Still yawning, {name}? This works faster than tea."] = "还在打哈欠，{name}？这个比茶提神还快。"
L["Early, {name}. The dawn patrol thinks we're mad, handing out blessings now."] = "好早，{name}。黎明巡逻队觉得我们疯了，这么早就发祝福。"
L["Out this late, {name}? The night is hungrier than the day. Take this."] = "这么晚还在外面，{name}？黑夜比白天更饿。拿着。"
L["Past bedtime, {name}. The sensible folk are asleep, so you get this."] = "过了睡觉的点了，{name}。明理的人都睡了，所以这个归你。"
L["Can't sleep either, {name}? Then let me be useful. Here."] = "你也睡不着，{name}？那让我派点用场。拿着。"
L["Mind the dark, {name}, and take this. Not everything out there is as friendly."] = "当心黑暗，{name}，拿着这个。外头可不全这么友善。"
L["It's late, {name}. This should keep you going till the sun remembers us."] = "夜深了，{name}。这个够你撑到太阳想起我们。"
L["Only the owls and us awake, {name}, and the owls get no {buff}."] = "夜猫子只剩咱们和猫头鹰，{name}。猫头鹰没{buff}。"
L["The inns have locked up, {name}. This is the only thing still being served."] = "旅店都打烊了，{name}。就我这儿还营业。"
L["It's the hour for ghost stories, {name}. Take this, in case one is true."] = "正是讲鬼故事的时辰，{name}。拿着，万一哪个是真的呢。"
L["Candles low, stars high, {name}. A good hour for small kindnesses."] = "烛光低，星光高，{name}。正适合做点小小的好事。"
L["Quiet hour, {name}. Every creak sounds like an ambush. This helps with that."] = "安静的时辰，{name}。每声吱呀都像伏兵。这个能帮上忙。"
L["This late, {name}, even the guards talk to themselves. I'd rather bless you."] = "这么晚了，{name}，连卫兵都在自言自语。我宁可给你祝福。"
L["This is the hour things climb out of graves, {name}. Take this; walk briskly."] = "这个时辰，坟里会爬出东西来，{name}。拿着，走快点。"
L["Tomorrow you'll wonder why you stayed up, {name}. This is one good reason."] = "明天你会纳闷自己为啥熬夜，{name}。这就是个好理由。"
L["Takes one to know one, {name}. Takes one to do it properly, too."] = "同行最懂同行，{name}。同行做得也最地道。"
L["From one of our trade to another, {name}. No need to check my work."] = "同行送同行，{name}。不用检查我的活儿。"
L["Professional courtesy, {name}. We don't charge each other."] = "行规，{name}：同行不收钱。"
L["Two of a kind, {name}. We could write the manual. This is chapter one."] = "同道中人，{name}。咱俩能写本手册了。这就是第一章。"
L["Don't look so surprised, {name}. Same trainer, I expect. Same blessing too."] = "别这么惊讶，{name}。大概是同一个训练师教的。祝福也一样。"
L["I'd critique your technique, {name}, but mine looks the same. Here."] = "我想挑你手法的毛病，{name}，可我的一模一样。拿着。"
L["Don't tell the others, {name}: ours is the finest calling. Proof: this."] = "别告诉别人，{name}：咱们这行最好。证据就是这个。"
L["Look at us, {name}. Two experts, making this look easy. It isn't, is it?"] = "看看咱俩，{name}。两个行家把这事做得像很简单。其实不简单吧？"
L["Between colleagues, {name}: I don't know how half of it works. This half, I do."] = "同行之间说，{name}：一半我都不知道怎么回事。这一半我知道。"
L["We walked the same road to get here, {name}. Take this for the next stretch."] = "我们走的是同一条路，{name}。拿着这个走下一段。"
L["If anyone asks, {name}, we trained each other. Starting with this."] = "要是有人问，{name}，就说咱俩互相教的。从这个开始。"
L["Calling to calling, {name}. We should compare notes. Here's mine."] = "同行对同行，{name}。咱们该交流交流心得。这是我的。"
L["Colleague, {name}. We look after our own."] = "同行，{name}。我们照顾自己人。"
L["Good to see the old craft in steady hands, {name}. Steadier with this."] = "看到老手艺在稳当的手里真好，{name}。有了这个更稳。"
L["I'd shout some encouragement, {name}, but you do that far better. Here instead."] = "我想给你喊几声鼓劲，{name}，可你喊得比我好多了。给你这个吧。"
L["Charge in as usual, {name}. I'll simply feel better about it now."] = "照常冲锋吧，{name}。现在我心里踏实点了。"
L["For the one who goes in first, {name}. Somebody has to, and it's never me."] = "给第一个冲进去的人，{name}。总得有人冲，反正不会是我。"
L["You take the hits so the rest of us don't, {name}. It's the least I can do."] = "你替我们挨打，{name}。这是我起码能做的。"
L["Take this, {name}, and charge. I'll be right behind you."] = "拿着，{name}，冲吧。我紧跟在后面。"
L["For the one who fixes every problem by hitting it, {name}. It usually works."] = "给什么问题都靠一顿揍解决的人，{name}。通常还真灵。"
L["I'd shake your hand, {name}, but both are holding something sharp. Take this."] = "想跟你握个手，{name}，可你两只手都拿着利器。拿着这个吧。"
L["A little help for a lot of armour, {name}. I hope it fits under there."] = "一身重甲，一点心意，{name}。希望塞得进盔甲里。"
L["You'll charge something enormous soon, {name}. I'm just helping it lose."] = "你马上又要冲锋个大家伙，{name}。我只是帮它输得快点。"
L["Save your Light for later, {name}. This one's from me."] = "你的圣光先留着，{name}。这个是我给的。"
L["You bless everyone else all day, {name}. Here's one going the other way."] = "你整天给别人祝福，{name}。这次反过来。"
L["The Light already favours you, {name}. Here's a little more of it."] = "圣光早已眷顾你，{name}。再给你添一点。"
L["Even the Light's own champion needs a hand now and then, {name}."] = "就算是圣光的勇士，{name}，偶尔也需要搭把手。"
L["I'd ask for a blessing back, {name}, but then we'd be here all day."] = "想让你回个祝福，{name}，可那样就得耗一整天了。"
L["For the one who carries a hammer and a conscience, {name}. Heavy load."] = "给扛着锤子又背着良心的人，{name}。担子不轻啊。"
L["Don't thank the Light for this one, {name}. This was me."] = "这次别谢圣光，{name}。是我给的。"
L["No need to kneel, {name}. I know it's a habit. Take this standing."] = "不用跪，{name}。我知道这是习惯。站着拿吧。"
L["One for you, {name}, and a pat on the head for your companion."] = "这个给你，{name}，再摸摸你伙伴的头。"
L["You watch everyone's back from range, {name}. I've got yours."] = "你在远处照看大家，{name}。你的后背归我。"
L["Hunter's Mark for them, {buff} for you, {name}. Much nicer."] = "猎人印记归它们，{buff}归你，{name}。好多了。"
L["Take this and aim true, {name}. If it charges anyway, run to the rest of us."] = "拿着，瞄准了，{name}。它要是照样冲过来，就往我们这边跑。"
L["Keen eye, steady hand, {name}. Here's something for the long hunt."] = "眼尖手稳，{name}。给你点东西，留着漫长的狩猎用。"
L["Nothing for the pet this time, {name}. It's already had three of my sandwiches."] = "这次宠物没份，{name}。它已经吃了我三个三明治。"
L["I'd have brought arrows, {name}, but I never know which kind you like."] = "本想给你带箭，{name}，可我总搞不清你爱用哪种。"
L["You can track anything, {name}, but you never saw this one coming."] = "你什么都追踪得到，{name}，这个却没料到吧。"
L["Quick hands, quiet feet, {name}. Here's luck to go with them."] = "手快，脚轻，{name}。再给你配点运气。"
L["Quick, {name}, before you vanish again."] = "快，{name}，趁你还没再次消失。"
L["Poison on the blades, {buff} on you. Very thorough, {name}."] = "刀上抹毒，身上有{buff}。真周全，{name}。"
L["I'd slip it in your pocket, {name}, but you'd notice. You always notice."] = "本想偷偷塞你口袋里，{name}，可你会发现的。你总能发现。"
L["For the one who opens every locked box, {name}. This one comes unlocked."] = "给能撬开所有锁箱的人，{name}。这份不上锁。"
L["Nobody sees you coming, {name}. Now it's even worse news when they do."] = "没人看得见你来，{name}。现在等他们看见，就更惨了。"
L["Take this, {name}. Very discreet. It even walks quietly."] = "拿着，{name}。很低调，走路都没声儿。"
L["I'd have wrapped it, {name}, but you'd only pick the knot."] = "本想给你包起来，{name}，反正你也会把结撬开。"
L["Keep this one, {name}. You don't even have to steal it."] = "这个收下，{name}。连偷都不用偷。"
L["For once, {name}, somebody's looking after the priest."] = "难得一回，{name}，有人照顾牧师了。"
L["Save your prayers for the rest of us, {name}. This one's already answered."] = "祷告留给别人吧，{name}。这次的已经应验了。"
L["Light or Shadow, {name}, I don't ask which. This suits both."] = "圣光还是暗影，{name}，我不问。两边都合适。"
L["Sit down after this fight, {name}. That's an order. Take this, from a patient."] = "这仗打完就坐下歇着，{name}。这是命令。拿着，病人送的。"
L["You keep us all standing, {name}. Here's a little of it coming back."] = "你让我们都站得住，{name}。这里还你一点。"
L["You've knelt beside all of us, {name}. Stand tall a minute, and take this."] = "你在我们每个人身边跪过，{name}。站直一会儿，拿着这个。"
L["Something that needed no prayer, {name}. You've said plenty of those today."] = "这个不用祷告，{name}。你今天祷告得够多了。"
L["No voice in your head comes with this one, {name}. Refreshing, isn't it?"] = "这个不附带脑内声音，{name}。挺清爽的，对吧？"
L["The Ebon Blade asks no favours, {name}. I'm giving one anyway."] = "黑锋骑士团不求人情，{name}。我偏要送一个。"
L["A little warmth, {name}. I know you don't feel the cold. It's the thought."] = "一点温暖，{name}。我知道你不怕冷，心意到了就好。"
L["You came back from the dead, {name}. The least I can do is help you stay back."] = "你从死亡中归来，{name}。我起码能帮你别再回去。"
L["Runes, plague and frost, {name}. Take this too; it completes the set."] = "符文、瘟疫和冰霜，{name}。再加上这个，凑齐一套。"
L["A skeletal horse and a sword that talks back, {name}. Here's something normal."] = "骷髅马，还有会顶嘴的剑，{name}。给你点正常的东西。"
L["No need to drag me over on a chain, {name}. I was coming anyway. With this."] = "不用拿链子拽我过去，{name}。我本来就要过来。带着这个。"
L["Welcome back to the land of the living, {name}. Its general direction. Here."] = "欢迎回到活人的世界，{name}。大致方向吧。拿着。"
L["The elements look after you, {name}, but they don't make house calls."] = "元素们照看着你，{name}，但它们不上门服务。"
L["Tell the spirits I said hello, {name}, and showed them this."] = "替我向灵魂们问好，{name}，再给他们看看这个。"
L["Plant a totem in my honour, {name}, for this. A small one. I'm modest."] = "为这个替我插根图腾吧，{name}。小的就行。我很谦虚。"
L["Earth, fire, water, air and me, {name}. Admittedly the least of the five."] = "土、火、水、风，加上我，{name}。我承认是五个里最弱的。"
L["Totems up already, {name}? Then this goes with them."] = "图腾都插好了，{name}？那这个也配上。"
L["The wind would have brought you this, {name}, but it's flighty. I'm reliable."] = "风本可以给你捎来，{name}，可它说变就变。我不会。"
L["You speak for the land, {name}. I hope this makes it speak kindly of me."] = "你替大地发声，{name}。希望有了这个，它会说我好话。"
L["The spirits said you'd earned this, {name}. I didn't ask; they volunteered."] = "众灵说这是你应得的，{name}。我没问，它们自己说的。"
L["A gift for a mage, {name}. Hard to find one you can't conjure."] = "送法师的礼物，{name}。很难找到一样你变不出来的。"
L["You solve most problems with sheep, {name}. This covers the rest."] = "大多数问题你用变羊解决，{name}。剩下的交给这个。"
L["You could teleport out of any trouble, {name}. This is for the trouble first."] = "什么麻烦你都能传送走，{name}。这个管传送之前的那段。"
L["For the clever one, {name}. Please don't thank me by making me a sheep."] = "送给聪明人，{name}。拜托别把我变成羊来道谢。"
L["Blink wherever you like, {name}. This comes too."] = "想闪到哪儿都行，{name}。这个跟着你。"
L["Stand a little back from the fire you're about to start, {name}. Here."] = "待会儿放火时站远点，{name}。给你这个。"
L["You keep us all fed and watered, {name}. Your turn to be looked after."] = "你管大家吃喝，{name}。这回轮到你被照顾了。"
L["Portal fees are steep, {name}. Call this a down payment on my next one."] = "传送门可不便宜，{name}。这个就当下一次的定金。"
L["Entirely demon-free, {name}. I checked."] = "不含恶魔，{name}。查过了。"
L["Your imp may be jealous, {name}. Tell it there's plenty to go round."] = "你的小鬼可能会吃醋，{name}。告诉它人人有份。"
L["No contract, no fine print, {name}. Just a gift."] = "无契约，无条款，{name}。就是份礼物。"
L["For the one who hands out healthstones, {name}. Nobody ever thanks you."] = "给那个发治疗石的人，{name}。从来没人谢过你。"
L["Here, {name}. Summon the rest of us later and we'll call it even."] = "给，{name}。待会儿把我们都拉过来，就算扯平。"
L["Your voidwalker can stop hovering, {name}. I mean well."] = "让你的虚空行者别在旁边飘了，{name}。我是好意。"
L["Your felhunter eats magic, {name}. Keep it off this one; it's for you."] = "你的地狱猎犬吃魔法，{name}。别让它碰这个，这是给你的。"
L["For the one who reads what nobody else dares, {name}."] = "送给敢读别人不敢读之书的人，{name}。"
L["Carrying a bag of souls all day, {name}? Your shoulders must need this."] = "整天背着一袋灵魂，{name}？你的肩膀肯定需要这个。"
L["Roll wherever you like, {name}. This rolls with you."] = "想滚到哪儿都行，{name}。这个跟着你滚。"
L["Brew first or fight first, {name}? Either way, take this."] = "先喝酒还是先打架，{name}？总之拿着。"
L["Inner peace for you, {name}, and outer peace too, as long as this lasts."] = "给你内心的平静，{name}，只要它还在，外面也平静。"
L["Chi flows better with a little help, {name}. Or so a monk once told me."] = "真气有人帮一把，流得更顺，{name}。某位武僧说的。"
L["Kick, flip, roll, {name}. I'll just stand here and do this bit."] = "踢、翻、滚，{name}。我就站这儿负责这一小部分。"
L["Teach me to flip without spilling my drink, {name}, and we're even."] = "教我翻跟头还不洒酒，{name}，咱们就扯平。"
L["Tea, meditation and this, {name}. The three pillars of a good day."] = "喝茶、冥想，再加这个，{name}。美好一天的三大支柱。"
L["Tell the bear this is for them too, {name}."] = "告诉熊，这个也是给它的，{name}。"
L["Hold still, {name}. I've never once managed to catch you as a cheetah."] = "别动，{name}。你变成猎豹时我一次都没追上过。"
L["Nature looks after you already, {name}. Today she sent me to help."] = "大自然已经在照顾你了，{name}。今天她派我来帮忙。"
L["Whatever shape you're in next, {name}, this goes with you."] = "不管下个形态是什么，{name}，它都跟着你。"
L["For the forest's friend, {name}. Give my regards to the trees."] = "给森林之友，{name}。替我向树木问好。"
L["Cenarion work is never done, {name}. Here's a little help."] = "塞纳里奥的工作永远做不完，{name}。帮你一点。"
L["I'd give it to the cat, {name}, but the cat would pretend not to care."] = "本想给那只猫，{name}，可猫会装作不在乎。"
L["Take this, {name}. Say hello to your moonkin form; it always looks so startled."] = "拿着，{name}。替我向你的枭兽形态问好；它总是一副受惊的样子。"
L["You were not prepared, {name}. Now you are."] = "自寻死路？现在不是了，{name}。"
L["Years in a Warden's cell, {name}. You've earned a small kindness."] = "在守望者的牢房里关了那么多年，{name}。你值得一点善意。"
L["You gave up so much to fight the Legion, {name}. Here's a little back."] = "为了对抗燃烧军团，你付出了太多，{name}。还你一点。"
L["For the one who leaps first, {name}. Do land somewhere friendly."] = "给第一个跳下去的人，{name}。记得落在友善的地方。"
L["Fel and fury, {name}, and now a little kindness. It'll balance out."] = "邪能与怒火，{name}，现在再加点善意。正好平衡一下。"
L["I'd ask if you saw this coming, {name}, but you see everything."] = "本想问你料到没，{name}，可你蒙着眼都能看见一切。"
L["You can see souls, {name}. Mine's the one being generous."] = "你看得见灵魂，{name}。正大方着的那个就是我的。"
L["Illidan never let anyone help him, {name}. You're wiser than your teacher."] = "伊利丹从不让人帮忙，{name}。你这是青出于蓝。"
L["A demon inside and a Legion outside, {name}. Here's one thing on your side."] = "内有恶魔，外有军团，{name}。这个站你这边。"
L["For you, {name}. Please don't breathe on it."] = "给你，{name}。拜托别对着它吐息。"
L["A little help for a dragon, {name}. I'll be telling my grandchildren."] = "帮了龙一把，{name}。这事我要讲给孙子听。"
L["The Aspects sent you out into the world, {name}. I'm making it friendlier."] = "守护巨龙派你来到这世上，{name}。我让它变得友善一点。"
L["Take to the skies after this, {name}. I'll wave from down here."] = "拿了这个就飞上天吧，{name}。我在地上朝你挥手。"
L["A dragon on our side, {name}. I've never felt safer being generous."] = "有条龙站在我们这边，{name}。慷慨从没这么安全过。"
L["A gift for a dragon, {name}. Normally folk bring gold and hope to leave again."] = "给龙送礼，{name}。一般人都是带着金子来，只求能活着走。"
L["For the one who could fly me to the next town, {name}. Not asking. Hinting."] = "给能驮我飞到下个镇子的你，{name}。不是请求，是暗示。"
L["I've met a few dragons, {name}. You're the first I didn't run from. Here."] = "我见过几条龙，{name}。你是第一个我没逃开的。拿着。"
L["For the world's youngest ancient, {name}."] = "送给世上最年轻的上古生灵，{name}。"
L["{buff} for a mage, {name}. Like lending a library a book."] = "给法师上{buff}，{name}，纯属班门弄斧。"
L["Mage to mage, {name}: I won't ask you for water if you won't. Take this."] = "法师对法师，{name}：你不找我要水，我也不找你要。拿着这个。"
L["Two mages, {name}. We can portal anywhere and still be late. Take this."] = "两个法师，{name}。哪儿都能开传送门，还是会迟到。拿着。"
L["A mage for a mage, {name}. Our old masters would approve."] = "法师送法师，{name}。我们的老导师会点头的。"
L["A mage enchanting a mage, {name}. We'll both pretend we needed it."] = "法师给法师加持，{name}。咱俩都假装需要吧。"
L["We'd never admit which spells we still read off the page, {name}. Not this one."] = "哪些法术还得照着书念，咱俩谁都不会承认，{name}。这个不用。"
L["One mage is a scholar, {name}. Two is an argument. Here's my opening point."] = "一个法师是学者，{name}，两个就是辩论。这是我的开场论点。"
L["We both know this spell by heart, {name}. Humour me."] = "这法术咱俩都烂熟于心，{name}。就依我一回。"
L["More mana for you, {name}. Try not to spend it all on one fireball."] = "给你更多法力值，{name}。别一个火球全花光。"
L["Priest to priest, {name}: who blesses the blessers? Today, me."] = "牧师对牧师，{name}：谁来祝福祝福者？今天我来。"
L["Between us, {name}, we'll pretend the warriors listen. Take this."] = "咱俩之间，{name}，就假装战士们会听吧。拿着。"
L["A priest looking after a priest, {name}. It feels almost forbidden."] = "牧师照顾牧师，{name}。感觉像是犯了什么禁忌。"
L["Two priests, {name}. Twice the praying, half the panic. Here's my share."] = "两个牧师，{name}。祈祷加倍，慌乱减半。这是我那份。"
L["If it all goes wrong, {name}, we two are the last ones standing. Take this."] = "要是全砸了，{name}，最后站着的就是咱俩。拿着。"
L["Rest your prayers a while, {name}. Mine can keep watch."] = "你的祷告先歇会儿，{name}。我的来守着。"
L["I'd preach to you, {name}, but you've heard it. You've probably given it. Here."] = "我想给你布道，{name}，可你早听过了。八成你还讲过。拿着。"
L["Same vows and same sore knees, {name}. Here's something for yours."] = "同样的誓言，同样的膝盖疼，{name}。给你的膝盖补补。"
L["If I fall, {name}, you know the words. If you fall, so do I. Here, so neither."] = "我倒了，{name}，你会念那段话。你倒了，我也会。拿着，谁都别倒。"
L["Two druids, {name}. The Cenarion Circle would call this a quorum. Take this."] = "两个德鲁伊，{name}。塞纳里奥议会会说这够法定人数了。拿着。"
L["Druid to druid, {name}: bear or cat, you'll have this, and leaves in your hair."] = "德鲁伊对德鲁伊，{name}：熊也好猫也罢，你都有这个，头发里还有叶子。"
L["From one shapeshifter to another, {name}: this one fits every shape."] = "变形者送变形者，{name}：这个每种形态都合身。"
L["No handshake, {name}. Two druids, neither the right shape. Take this instead."] = "免了握手，{name}。两个德鲁伊，谁的形态都不对。拿这个吧。"
L["Between us, {name}, we've a shape for every problem, and this for the rest."] = "咱俩加起来，{name}，每个问题都有对应的形态，剩下的交给这个。"
L["Fellow druid, {name}? The trees told me you were coming, so I had this ready."] = "德鲁伊同行，{name}？树告诉我你要来，所以我把这个准备好了。"
L["Take this, {name}. If you see me as a cat later, pretend you don't know me."] = "拿着，{name}。待会儿要是看见我是只猫，就装不认识。"
L["Paladin to paladin, {name}: heavy hammer, light heart, and this blessing."] = "圣骑士对圣骑士，{name}：锤子要沉，心要轻，还有这份祝福。"
L["A blessing for a paladin, {name}. Now we're both insufferably radiant."] = "给圣骑士的祝福，{name}。这下咱俩都亮得让人受不了。"
L["Two paladins, {name}. Somewhere, a priest is relieved. Take this."] = "两个圣骑士，{name}。某处的牧师松了口气。拿着。"
L["One of us should be humble about this, {name}. Neither of us will be."] = "我们俩总得有一个谦虚点，{name}。可谁都不会。"
L["Same oath, different polish, {name}. Yours is shinier. Take this to match."] = "同样的誓言，不同的光泽，{name}。你的更亮。拿着这个配一配。"
L["Between us, {name}, we could light a cathedral. This lights you, for a start."] = "咱俩能照亮一座大教堂，{name}。先用这个把你照亮。"
L["Two suits of plate, {name}. Nobody hears us sneak up. Take this anyway."] = "两套板甲，{name}。谁也听不见我们偷偷摸过去。还是拿着吧。"
L["Your libram and mine agree on this one, {name}. Rare, that."] = "你的圣契和我的在这事上意见一致，{name}。难得。"
L["Warlock to warlock, {name}: take this, and keep your imp away from mine."] = "术士对术士，{name}：拿着，让你的小鬼离我的远点。"
L["Fellow warlock, {name}? Then you'll know this one's harmless."] = "同为术士，{name}？那你该知道这个无害。"
L["Two warlocks, {name}. Let's not compare soul shards in public. Take this."] = "两个术士，{name}。别当众比灵魂碎片。拿着。"
L["Between us, {name}, the demons do all the work. This bit I do myself."] = "私下说，{name}，活儿都是恶魔干的。这下我亲自来。"
L["Another warlock, {name}. Let's be polite; I've seen what you summon. Here."] = "又一个术士，{name}。客气点；我见过你召唤的东西。拿着。"
L["A spell from one warlock to another, {name}. Check it for curses. I would."] = "术士送术士的法术，{name}。查查有没有诅咒，换我也会查。"
L["Fellow warlock, {name}. The only one who won't ask where this came from."] = "同为术士，{name}。只有你不会问这是哪儿来的。"
L["Two warlocks, one kind deed, {name}. The Burning Legion must be livid."] = "两个术士，一件好事，{name}。燃烧军团肯定气炸了。"
L["I'd summon you a drink, {name}, but you know how summoning goes. Have this."] = "想给你召唤杯酒，{name}，可你知道召唤是什么下场。拿这个吧。"
L["Two warriors, {name}. Somewhere, a healer just sighed. Take this."] = "两个战士，{name}。某处的治疗刚叹了口气。拿着。"
L["Warrior to warrior, {name}: first into the fight buys the drinks. I'm buying."] = "战士对战士，{name}：先冲进去的请喝酒。这轮我请。"
L["Shout for shout, {name}. We'll deafen the whole place together."] = "吼对吼，{name}。咱们一起把这儿的人都震聋。"
L["No plan, {name}? Perfect. Take this; we'll get along."] = "没计划，{name}？完美。拿着；咱俩合得来。"
L["Warriors, {name}: the only folk who think shouting is a spell. We're right."] = "只有咱们战士觉得吼一嗓子就算法术，{name}。咱们没错。"
L["Warrior to warrior, {name}: take this. Shield up, temper hot."] = "战士对战士，{name}：拿着。盾举高，火气旺。"
L["You know this one, {name}. You've probably shouted it at me already."] = "这招你熟，{name}。说不定已经冲我吼过了。"
L["Our trainer would be proud, {name}. He'd shout it, but he'd be proud."] = "训练师会为咱俩骄傲的，{name}。用吼的，但确实骄傲。"
L["Fellow warrior? Then you know the blacksmith's name too, {name}. Here."] = "也是战士？那你也知道铁匠叫什么吧，{name}。拿着。"
L["We both served the Scourge, {name}. I won't ask what you did. Just take this."] = "我们都为天灾效过力，{name}。我不问你干过什么。拿着就是。"
L["Two death knights, {name}. We've died twice between us. Take this; stop there."] = "两个死亡骑士，{name}。咱俩加起来死过两回。拿着；到此为止。"
L["Between us, {name}, we can drop the echoing voice. Just take this."] = "咱俩之间，{name}，不用那种回音腔了。拿着就行。"
L["Mograine would approve of this, {name}. Grimly; he approves of all grimly."] = "莫格莱尼会赞许这个的，{name}。冷着脸赞许；他赞许什么都冷着脸。"
L["Two horns and one winter, {name}. Mine sounds today; yours can have tomorrow."] = "两支号角，一个寒冬，{name}。今天吹我的，明天归你。"
L["The living keep their distance from us, {name}. I won't. Here."] = "活人都跟我们保持距离，{name}。我不会。拿着。"
L["We both broke free at Light's Hope, {name}. Every gift since is our own choice."] = "我们都在圣光之愿挣脱了束缚，{name}。从那以后每份礼物都是我们自己的选择。"
L["Do you still dream, {name}? I only ask our own kind. Take this either way."] = "你还做梦吗，{name}？我只问同类。不管怎样，拿着。"
L["Walk with me after dark, {name}. With eyes like ours, and this, no lantern."] = "天黑后跟我走走，{name}。凭咱们这双眼，再加上这个，不用灯笼。"
L["Fellow monk, {name}? Take this; we'll spar later and both pretend we held back."] = "武僧同行，{name}？拿着；回头切磋，咱俩都装作留了手。"
L["Two monks and one teapot, {name}. Whoever pours is the humbler, so I'll pour."] = "两个武僧一把茶壶，{name}。倒茶的更谦逊，所以我来倒。"
L["Compare masters, {name}? Mine was the hardest. Everyone's was. Here."] = "比比师父，{name}？我的最严。谁的都最严。拿着。"
L["Take this, {name}. Meditate with me later. If one of us snores, the other did."] = "拿着，{name}。回头一起打坐。谁打呼噜就是另一个。"
L["Monk to monk, {name}: I won't tell you to breathe. I'll just give you this."] = "武僧对武僧，{name}：我不叫你呼吸。我就给你这个。"
L["Two monks, {name}. Xuen sees a contest, Yu'lon a lesson. I see a friend. Here."] = "两个武僧，{name}。雪怒看到较量，玉珑看到功课。我看到朋友。拿着。"
L["Why is every monastery on a mountaintop, {name}? Take this for the climb."] = "为什么每座寺院都在山顶上，{name}？拿着，爬山用。"
L["Take this, {name}; do the forms with me at dawn. Two monks in step is music."] = "拿着，{name}；黎明时跟我一起打套路。两个武僧步调一致，就是音乐。"
L["Strangers ask you for wisdom, {name}? I give them this. And say eat something."] = "陌生人也找你讨智慧吗，{name}？我给他们这个。再叫他们吃点东西。"
L["Some followed Sarkareth into the dark, {name}. We chose the sky, and this."] = "有人追随萨卡雷斯坠入黑暗，{name}。我们选了天空，还有这个。"
L["Shall we speak Draconic, {name}? The mortals will think this is a quarrel."] = "咱们说龙语吧，{name}？凡人会以为这是在吵架。"
L["Not even the Aspects knew what to make of us, {name}. I do. Here."] = "连守护巨龙都不知道拿我们怎么办，{name}。我知道。拿着。"
L["Do you hold a spell a moment too long, {name}, to feel it gather? I just did."] = "你也会多憋一会儿法术吗，{name}，好感受它蓄起来？我刚这么干了。"
L["Our people are still choosing their customs, {name}. I'd like this one kept."] = "我们的族人还在挑选自己的习俗，{name}。我希望这一条能留下来。"
L["Valdrakken was built for grown dragons, {name}. Take this; we'll feel taller."] = "瓦德拉肯是为成年巨龙建的，{name}。拿着；咱们会觉得自己高一点。"
L["Our magic hums when two of us stand close, {name}. Listen. That's this one."] = "咱们两个靠近时魔力会嗡嗡作响，{name}。听。就是这个。"
L["Scalecommanders drilled us both, {name}. Shouts still straighten my back. Here."] = "鳞长们操练过我们俩，{name}。一听吼声我还会挺直腰。拿着。"
L["Whichever side you took, {name}, we were kin before there were sides. Here."] = "不管你选了哪边，{name}，在分边之前我们就是同族。拿着。"
L["Heard the earth grumble just now, {name}? It was giving you this. Good."] = "刚才听见大地嘟囔了吗，{name}？它在给你这个。好。"
L["Race you to the next town as wolves, {name}? Take this first. No lightning."] = "化狼赛跑到下一个镇，{name}？先拿着这个。不许用闪电。"
L["My ancestors and yours have met by now, {name}. They'd want you to have this."] = "你我的先祖想必早见过面了，{name}。他们会希望你拿着这个。"
L["Two shamans, one sky, {name}. I asked first, so this storm is mine to give."] = "两个萨满，一片天空，{name}。我先开口的，所以这场风暴由我来送。"
L["Folk stare when we talk to rocks, {name}. Let them. The rocks gave you this."] = "我们跟石头说话时别人老盯着看，{name}。随他们。石头给了你这个。"
L["Between two shamans, {name}, a storm is just a conversation. Here's my half."] = "两个萨满之间，{name}，风暴不过是场对话。这是我的那一半。"
L["The elements could go quiet any day, {name}. Today they answered: this."] = "元素随时可能沉默，{name}。今天它们回应了：就是这个。"
L["Ever tried to stop listening, {name}? I did. Everything got louder. Here."] = "你试过不去听吗，{name}？我试过。一切都更吵了。拿着。"
L["People want storms stopped or started, {name}. I ask the sky; it gave you this."] = "人们想让风暴停或起，{name}。我去问天空；它给了你这个。"
L["No mana to fill, {name}. It'll just stand about being clever, like me."] = "没法力值可补，{name}。它就站那儿显得很聪明，跟我一样。"
L["My spell on a warrior, {name}. Call it a small experiment."] = "我的法术用在战士身上，{name}。就当是个小实验。"
L["I only know the one spell for friends, {name}. Rage or mana, you're getting it."] = "对朋友我只会这一个法术，{name}。怒气还是法力，照给不误。"
L["Your rage doesn't need this, {name}, but I'd feel rude walking past you."] = "你的怒气用不上这个，{name}，可我路过不给就太失礼了。"
L["No mana, I know, {name}. A sharp mind never hurt a sharp blade."] = "我知道你没有法力，{name}。脑子灵光，对利刃也没坏处。"
L["It's meant for mana, {name}. You'll find a use. Rogues always find a use."] = "这本是补法力的，{name}。你总能派上用场，潜行者总能。"
L["Not your kind of magic, {name}. Call it a very clever lockpick."] = "不是你那路魔法，{name}。就当是把很聪明的开锁器。"
L["Aye, {name}, ye only had to ask. Hold still now!"] = "好嘞，{name}，开口就成。站着别动！"
L["Here, {name}, a wee somethin' to keep ye on yer feet."] = "喏，{name}，一点小意思，保你站得稳稳当当！"
L["My thanks, {name}. Allow me to return the kindness."] = "多谢，{name}。请容我回报这份好意。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand fast a moment."] = "当然，{name}。原地稍候片刻。"
L["The road ahead is long, {name}. Take this with you."] = "前路漫长，{name}。带上这个吧。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Your kindness is returned."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。你的好意，我来回报。"
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Walk softly beneath the stars."] = "Elune-adore，{name}。愿你在星光下轻步而行。"
L["The Light rewards kindness, {name}, and so shall I."] = "圣光会回报善意，{name}，我也会。"
L["Of course, {name}. May the Naaru guide your steps."] = "当然，{name}。愿纳鲁指引你的脚步。"
L["The Light is with you, {name}. Go in peace."] = "圣光与你同在，{name}。平安前行吧。"
L["Much obliged, {name}. Gilneas never forgets a kindness."] = "多谢，{name}。吉尔尼斯永不忘恩。"
L["Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Take this into battle."] = "Lok'tar ogar，{name}！带着它上战场！"
L["The Earth Mother sees your kindness, {name}. I return it."] = "大地母亲看见了你的善意，{name}。我来回报。"
L["Of course, {name}. Stand tall and be at peace."] = "当然，{name}。昂首站立，心平气和。"
L["Walk with the Earth Mother, {name}."] = "与大地母亲同行吧，{name}。"
L["Ya be too kind, {name}! Dis one be from me."] = "你太客气咯，{name}！这个嘛，算我的。"
L["Sure ting, {name}. Hold still now."] = "小事一桩，{name}。别乱动咯。"
L["Da loa be watchin' over ya, {name}."] = "洛阿在守护着你，{name}。"
L["Such courtesy does you credit, {name}. Anar'alah belore."] = "礼数周全，难能可贵，{name}。Anar'alah belore。"
L["Anar'alah belore, {name}. May the sun guide you."] = "Anar'alah belore，{name}。愿太阳指引你。"
L["Your generosity is noted, {name}. Suramar remembers its friends."] = "你的慷慨我记住了，{name}。苏拉玛不忘朋友。"
L["Thank you, {name}! The caravan always repays a kindness."] = "谢谢你，{name}！商队向来知恩图报。"
L["Every traveller needs something for the road, {name}."] = "旅人上路总得带点东西，{name}。"
L["Of course, {name}. Patience, and it is done."] = "当然，{name}。耐心些，这就好。"
L["Take this, {name}. Even a dragon needs allies."] = "拿着，{name}。就算是龙也需要盟友。"
L["Thank you, {name}. The Alliance looks after its own."] = "谢谢你，{name}。联盟会照顾自己人。"
L["Of course, {name}. Allies help each other."] = "当然，{name}。盟友就该互相帮助。"
L["For the Alliance, {name}! Stay strong out there."] = "为了联盟，{name}！在外面挺住！"
L["Strength and honour, {name}. Your kindness is repaid."] = "力量与荣誉，{name}。这份好意，我还了。"
L["Consider it done, {name}. For the Horde."] = "包在我身上，{name}。为了部落。"
L["For the Horde, {name}! Go with strength."] = "为了部落，{name}！愿力量与你同行！"
L["Thank you, {name}. Good hearts are found everywhere."] = "谢谢你，{name}。好心人哪里都有。"
L["Gladly, {name}, whatever banner you fly."] = "乐意之至，{name}，不论你打着哪面旗帜。"
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}."] = "朋友可以来自任何一方，{name}。"
L["Safe travels, {name}. Take some {buff} with you."] = "一路平安，{name}。带上些{buff}吧。"
L["Off ye go, {name}, steady as the mountain."] = "去吧，{name}，稳如大山！"
L["Stand behind me, {name}. Aye, I know. Crouch a bit."] = "站我后头，{name}。嗯，我知道。你蹲低点儿。"
L["Right, {name}: I take the front, ye take the loot, and we argue after."] = "说好了，{name}：我打头阵，你捡战利品，完事再吵。"
L["If I start singin', {name}, the fight's gone well. Or very badly."] = "要是我唱起歌来，{name}，就是仗打得顺。或者糟透了。"
L["Fair winds and following seas, {name}."] = "愿你一帆风顺、海不扬波，{name}。"
L["Arathor's children stand together, {name}."] = "阿拉索的子孙同进同退，{name}。"
L["Keep close, {name}. Humans have always won by outnumbering things."] = "跟紧点，{name}。人类向来靠人多取胜。"
L["Stay in formation, {name}. We haven't got one, but stay in it anyway."] = "保持阵型，{name}。咱们没有阵型，但也给我保持住。"
L["I'll draw up a plan, {name}, and then we can all ignore it together."] = "我来定个计划，{name}，然后大家一起无视它。"
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Walk softly; the trees are light sleepers."] = "Elune-adore，{name}。脚步轻些，树睡得浅。"
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Elune keeps her children close."] = "Ishnu-alah，{name}。艾露恩从不远离她的孩子。"
L["Quick one, {name}? By kaldorei reckoning we'll be done before we start."] = "速战速决，{name}？按卡多雷的算法，还没开始就结束了。"
L["I'll be the one you can't see, {name}. That's not a mistake; that's the plan."] = "你看不见的那个就是我，{name}。这不是失误，是计划。"
L["Elune watches the whole party, {name}. I'm just the one who waves at her."] = "艾露恩看着整个小队，{name}。我只是那个冲她挥手的。"
L["The moon's up, {name}. For a kaldorei, this is the middle of the morning."] = "月亮出来了，{name}。对卡多雷来说，这才刚到上午。"
L["Morning, {name}. My people slept through these for millennia. I'm adapting."] = "早，{name}。我族睡过了几千年的早晨，我正在适应。"
L["Walk carefully in the dark places, {name}."] = "行走在黑暗之地要当心，{name}。"
L["Stay close, {name}. The whispers are much quieter in company."] = "跟紧点，{name}。有人作伴，低语会安静很多。"
L["If the shadows start giving orders, {name}, ignore them. I usually do."] = "要是暗影开始发号施令，{name}，别理它们。我一般都不理。"
L["Keep an eye on my shadow, {name}. It wanders off when there's a fight."] = "帮我看着我的影子，{name}。一打架它就乱跑。"
L["Night suits the ren'dorei, {name}. We match the decor."] = "夜晚衬虚空精灵，{name}。我们跟夜色是一套的。"
L["For Gnomeregan, {name}! Always nice to talk to somebody at eye level."] = "为了诺莫瑞根，{name}！能平视着聊天真好。"
L["I've run the numbers, {name}: with you here, we win. I rounded up."] = "我算过了，{name}：有你在，我们赢定了。四舍五入一下。"
L["If I shout 'duck', {name}, don't look for a duck. That went badly last time."] = "我喊“快闪”，{name}，是让你躲，不是跳舞。上回可惨了。"
L["Morning, {name}! Up since three. The toaster needed a new engine."] = "早，{name}！我三点就起了，烤面包机得换个新引擎。"
L["Stay near, {name}. I lost a world once; I'm keeping hold of this party."] = "靠近点，{name}。我丢过一个世界，这支小队我可要抓牢。"
L["Twenty-five thousand years on the run, {name}. Walking with friends is nicer."] = "逃了两万五千年，{name}。还是和朋友一起走更好。"
L["The naaru would call this a fellowship, {name}. I call it good luck."] = "纳鲁会称之为同道之谊，{name}。我叫它好运气。"
L["Keep your wits about you, {name}. Something is always hunting."] = "保持警惕，{name}。总有东西在狩猎。"
L["The curse binds us, {name}, but Gilneas binds us tighter."] = "诅咒缚住我们，{name}，吉尔尼斯缚得更紧。"
L["Pack rules, {name}: nobody wanders off, and nobody mentions the fleas."] = "狼群规矩，{name}：谁也别乱跑，谁也别提跳蚤。"
L["A pack again, {name}. I hadn't known how much I'd missed one."] = "又有狼群了，{name}。我都不知道自己有多想念。"
L["I'll catch the scent of trouble first, {name}. It's the one perk of the curse."] = "麻烦的味道我先闻到，{name}。这是诅咒唯一的好处。"
L["Night again, {name}. I'm at my best and my worst. This is the best part."] = "又入夜了，{name}。夜里我最好也最糟。这会儿是最好。"
L["Morning, {name}. I'd have been up sooner, but the rug by the fire was so warm."] = "早，{name}。本该早起的，可炉火边的地毯太暖和了。"
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Go and earn your glory."] = "鲜血与雷霆，{name}！去挣你的荣耀吧！"
L["Throm-ka, {name}! The blood of the clans runs strong in you."] = "Throm-ka，{name}！氏族之血在你身上奔涌！"
L["The plan, {name}: we hit it. Questions? No? Good plan."] = "计划，{name}：揍它。有问题吗？没有？好计划。"
L["A true warband, {name}. Loud, angry, and all on the same side for once."] = "真正的战团，{name}。又吵又凶，而且难得都站在一边。"
L["Stay with the warband, {name}. Strength in numbers. And in axes."] = "跟紧战团，{name}。人多力量大。斧子多力量更大。"
L["Stay alive, {name}. Undercity's housing list is already very long."] = "好好活着，{name}。幽暗城分房的队已经排很长了。"
L["If I fall down, {name}, give it a minute. Old habit."] = "要是我倒下了，{name}，等一会儿。老毛病了。"
L["I'll take the front, {name}. What's the worst that could happen? Again?"] = "我打头阵，{name}。最坏能怎样？再死一次？"
L["The dead keep terrible hours, {name}. Nice to have company for once."] = "死人作息很糟，{name}。难得有人作陪。"
L["Morning already, {name}? I've been up all night. And all of last decade."] = "已经早上了，{name}？我通宵没睡。上个十年也是。"
L["Walk with the Earth Mother, {name}. She's everywhere, so you can't get lost."] = "与大地母亲同行吧，{name}。她无处不在，所以你迷不了路。"
L["May An'she light your path, {name}."] = "愿安舍照亮你的道路，{name}。"
L["The Earth Mother watches over us both, {name}."] = "大地母亲守护着我们俩，{name}。"
L["Get behind me, {name}. There's room back there for the whole party."] = "躲我后面，{name}。那儿够整支小队待的。"
L["The herd moves together, {name}. Mind my hooves; the herd has learned to."] = "族群同进同退，{name}。当心我的蹄子，族群都学会了。"
L["An'she rises, {name}, and so do we. Slower, in my case."] = "安舍升起，{name}，我们也起身。我慢一点。"
L["Mu'sha keeps the night watch, {name}. I'll tell her to keep an eye on you."] = "穆莎守着夜，{name}。我会让她多照看你。"
L["Stay close, {name}. Trolls regenerate; da rest of ya gotta be careful."] = "跟紧点，{name}。巨魔能再生，你们其他人可得小心。"
L["We go in together, {name}, we come out together. That's the plan, mon."] = "一起进去，{name}，一起出来。计划就这样，老兄。"
L["Shorel'aran, {name}. Fight with elegance."] = "Shorel'aran，{name}。战斗也要优雅。"
L["The Sunwell shines for us both, {name}."] = "太阳之井为你我闪耀，{name}。"
L["Do keep pace, {name}. We have a reputation for arriving beautifully."] = "跟上步调，{name}。我们向来以登场优美著称。"
L["Stand where the light is good, {name}. If we must fight, we'll look splendid."] = "站到光线好的地方，{name}。既然要打，就打得漂亮。"
L["A party at last, {name}. I did dress for one."] = "终于组队了，{name}。我可是按派对打扮的。"
L["The sun has risen, {name}, and so have I. We coordinate."] = "太阳升起了，{name}，我也起了。我们步调一致。"
L["Suramar's children shine together again, {name}."] = "苏拉玛的子民再次一同闪耀，{name}。"
L["An expedition, {name}! In Suramar this needed six permits and a masquerade."] = "远征，{name}！在苏拉玛，这得批六张许可证，再办一场假面舞会。"
L["The dome kept us safe, {name}. Now we must make do with one another. Gladly."] = "屏障曾保我们平安，{name}。现在只能靠彼此了。乐意之至。"
L["Night at last, {name}. Add a few thousand lanterns and it's nearly Suramar."] = "终于入夜了，{name}。再挂几千盏灯，就差不多是苏拉玛了。"
L["Daylight, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome, and it still startles me."] = "天亮了，{name}。在屏障下待了一万年，我还是会被吓一跳。"
L["Nobody dies on my contract, {name}. The paperwork's a nightmare."] = "我的合同期内谁都不许死，{name}。文书工作是场噩梦。"
L["We split the take even, {name}. I'll do the maths. Trust me."] = "收获平分，{name}。账我来算。相信我。"
L["A fellow wanderer! The caravan is never far, {name}."] = "同为流浪者！商队从不走远，{name}。"
L["Caravan rules, {name}: stay together, share the water, nobody sells the alpaca."] = "商队规矩，{name}：不掉队，水同喝，谁也不许卖羊驼。"
L["Anything shiny in there, {name}, I saw it first. Caravan law."] = "里面有亮晶晶的，{name}，都是我先看到的。商队法规。"
L["We vulpera travel by night, {name}. Cool sand, sleepy scorpids."] = "我们狐人夜里赶路，{name}。沙子凉，蝎子困。"
L["Balance in all things, {name}. Now go with a light heart."] = "凡事求平衡，{name}。放宽心上路吧。"
L["We must share a brew when the road allows, {name}!"] = "得空了一定要一起喝一壶，{name}！"
L["A fight, then a meal, {name}. That is the correct order. Never the reverse."] = "先打架，再吃饭，{name}。顺序是这样的。绝不能反过来。"
L["Stay together, {name}, like dumplings in a steamer. Warm, and ready."] = "抱团，{name}，像蒸笼里的包子。热乎，随时出笼。"
L["We move as one, {name}. Slowly, perhaps, but as one."] = "我们同进同退，{name}。也许慢了点，但同进同退。"
L["Past my first nap, {name}, and before my second. Quickly, while I'm awake."] = "第一个盹睡完了，第二个还没开始，{name}。趁我醒着，快。"
L["The Forbidden Reach feels far behind us now, {name}."] = "禁忌离岛如今已远在身后了，{name}。"
L["Tell me when to breathe fire, {name}. And, please, when not to."] = "该喷火时叫我，{name}。不该喷时，更要叫我。"
L["I woke in a cave full of strangers, {name}. This is far better company."] = "我在一洞陌生人中醒来，{name}。这群伙伴可强多了。"
L["Neltharion made us to fight alone, {name}. We have improved on him."] = "耐萨里奥造我们来单打独斗，{name}。咱们青出于蓝。"
L["Hagar sent me to see the goddess's work, {name}. You're some of her best."] = "哈加尔派我来看看女神的造物，{name}。你算得上她的得意之作。"
L["Two haranir out in the world, {name}. No wonder the elders are up in arms."] = "两个哈籁尼尔在外头闯荡，{name}。难怪长老们炸了锅。"
L["We once mastered every beast on our mountain, {name}. These won't take long."] = "我们曾驯服过山上所有的野兽，{name}。这些用不了多久。"
L["Word from Harandar, {name}: the haranir are ready to join the fight."] = "哈籁恩达尔传来消息，{name}：哈籁尼尔准备好参战了。"
L["It is good to see one of our own, {name}."] = "能见到自己人真好，{name}。"
L["Stormwind has a statue for every hero, {name}. I'm putting in a word for yours."] = "暴风城英雄人人有雕像，{name}。你那座我去申请。"
L["Onward, {name}. The Alliance is with you."] = "前进吧，{name}。联盟与你同在。"
L["Together we stand, {name}. For the Alliance!"] = "团结一心，{name}。为了联盟！"
L["Right, {name}: shields up, heads down, and nobody charges before the plan does."] = "听好，{name}：举盾，低头，计划没冲之前谁都不许冲。"
L["The finest company the Alliance ever fielded, {name}. Or at least the nearest."] = "联盟史上最精锐的队伍，{name}。至少是离得最近的一支。"
L["Go with honour, {name}. Victory awaits."] = "带着荣誉前行，{name}。胜利在等着你。"
L["Go and do something worth a song, {name}. Loud songs. The Horde likes loud."] = "去干点值得传唱的事吧，{name}。要大声唱的，部落就爱热闹。"
L["Walk tall, {name}. The Horde always made room for those the world turned away."] = "昂首前行，{name}。被世界拒之门外的人，部落总会留个位置。"
L["Our strength is each other, {name}. For the Horde!"] = "我们的力量来自彼此，{name}。为了部落！"
L["Forward, {name}. The Horde advances together. Retreats... never, officially."] = "前进，{name}。部落共同进军。撤退嘛……官方说法是从不。"
L["Together we're a war band, {name}. Apart, we're just loud."] = "聚在一起是战团，{name}。分开了，就只是吵。"
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}. Or, like me, from none in particular."] = "朋友可以来自任何一方，{name}。也可以像我这样，哪边都不是。"
L["Side by side, {name}, whatever comes."] = "并肩同行，{name}，无论前路如何。"
L["No flag over this party, {name}, just us. That's plenty."] = "这队不打旗号，{name}，只有我们。够了。"
L["One day we'll pick sides, {name}. Today we pick fights, together."] = "总有一天要站队，{name}。今天先组队，一起打架。"
L["Your stance says you've had a long day, {name}. Monks notice these things."] = "看你的站姿，{name}，今天累坏了吧。武僧看得出来。"
L["We have to stop meeting like this, {name}. Actually, no, we don't."] = "我们不能再这样见面了，{name}。其实，也不是不行。"
L["Somewhere in here a villain is rehearsing a speech, {name}. Let's interrupt."] = "这里面有个反派正在排练台词，{name}。咱们去打断他。"
L["Bwonsamdi gonna be real disappointed, {name}. Thanks, mon."] = "邦桑迪要大失所望咯，{name}。谢啦，伙计。"
L["Sure ting, {name}. Hold still; da mojo don't like a movin' target."] = "小事一桩，{name}。别乱动，巫毒不喜欢移动靶。"
L["No worries, {name}. Da loa got ya covered."] = "别担心，{name}。洛阿罩着你。"
L["Stay away from da voodoo, {name}. ...Except dis voodoo. Dis one fine."] = "离巫毒远点，{name}。……除了这个巫毒。这个没事。"
L["Da loa be watchin' over ya, {name}. Dey real nosy like dat."] = "洛阿在看着你，{name}。它们就是这么爱管闲事。"
L["Stay sharp out dere, {name}. Take dis wit' ya."] = "在外头机灵点，{name}。这个带上。"
L["Take dis, {name}. Walk like ya own da jungle. I do."] = "拿着，{name}。走路要像丛林归你管。我就是。"
L["Hey, {name}! Always good to see family, mon."] = "嘿，{name}！见到自家人总是开心，老兄。"
L["Dis crew got style, {name}. Now it got mojo too."] = "这帮人有范儿，{name}。现在还有巫毒了。"
L["We go in together, {name}, we come out together. Dat be da whole plan, mon."] = "一起进去，{name}，一起出来。整个计划就这样，伙计。"
L["Night be da best time for mojo, {name}. Nobody see where it come from."] = "夜里最适合耍巫毒，{name}。没人看得见打哪儿来的。"
L["We split the loot even, {name}. I'll do the maths. Trust me."] = "战利品平分，{name}。账我来算。信我。"
L["Magni turned to diamond fer the cause, {name}. This is the cheaper option."] = "麦格尼为了大业变成了钻石，{name}。这个是平价版。"
L["Returning a favour:"] = "还人情："
L["Answering a request:"] = "回应请求："
L["In your group:"] = "你的队友："
L["Offering unasked:"] = "主动推荐："
L["Returning a favour of %s:"] = "还人情（%s）："
L["Meeting somebody a third time:"] = "第三次遇到同一个人："
L["(nothing -- speech off, or no usable lines)"] = "（无——发言已关闭，或没有可用的台词）"
L["In character"] = "入戏"
L["an in-character line"] = "一句入戏台词"
L["Could I have {buff} when you have a moment, {name}? Thank you."] = "{name}，方便的时候能给我加个{buff}吗？谢谢。"
L["{name}, may I ask you for {buff}, please?"] = "{name}，可以麻烦你给我加个{buff}吗？"
L["Hello {name}, would you mind casting {buff} on me? Thanks!"] = "你好，{name}，能帮我加个{buff}吗？多谢！"
L["My own words"] = "我自己的话"
L["{name}, might I trouble you for {buff}? You have my thanks."] = "{name}，可否赐我{buff}？多谢。"
L["A moment of your craft, {name}? {buff} would serve me well."] = "{name}，借你妙手一用，{buff}于我大有裨益。"
L["{name}, if you can spare it, {buff} would be most welcome."] = "{name}，若有余力，{buff}再好不过。"
L["Well met, {name}. Could you grant me {buff} before I go?"] = "幸会，{name}。临行前可否赐我{buff}？"
L["I would be in your debt for {buff}, {name}."] = "若得{buff}，{name}，我必铭记此情。"
L["{name}, the road ahead is long. Would you lend me {buff}?"] = "{name}，前路漫长，可否借我{buff}？"
L["ask for %s"] = "请求%s"
L["Could give you a buff you are missing. A press asks them for it, politely."] = "对方可以给你缺少的增益。按一下就会礼貌地向对方请求。"
