L["welcomes %s to the family."] = "欢迎%s加入大家庭。"
L["holds %s close after days apart."] = "在分别数日后紧紧抱住%s。"
L["kneels by %s and asks forgiveness for the last fight."] = "跪在%s身旁，为上一场战斗请求原谅。"
