L["%d of %d milestones earned. The hall of fame opens when you have earned them all: your name can then be listed among the Gentlefolk of Good Manners, here and on the addon's GitHub page. A screenshot of your certificate, which the favour ledger shows from then on, will be the proof."] = "已达成%d/%d个里程碑。全部达成后，名人堂即向你开放：届时你的名字可以列入“彬彬有礼的绅士淑女”，显示在这里和插件的 GitHub 页面上。从那时起人情账本会显示你的证书，证书的截图就是凭证。"
L["Every milestone is yours. If you would like your name listed among the Gentlefolk of Good Manners, here and on the addon's GitHub page:\n1. Open your certificate with the button below.\n2. Take a screenshot of it with the game's Print Screen key. It is saved in the game's Screenshots folder.\n3. Post the screenshot and the code below with the \"Hall of fame\" form: |cffffd100github.com/fpsacha/Manners|r.\nThe screenshot is the proof. It is an invitation and nothing more: nothing of value is asked for it."] = "所有里程碑都已达成。如果你愿意让自己的名字列入“彬彬有礼的绅士淑女”，显示在这里和插件的 GitHub 页面上：\n1. 用下面的按钮打开你的证书。\n2. 用游戏的 Print Screen 键给它截图。截图保存在游戏的 Screenshots 文件夹中。\n3. 用“Hall of fame”表单提交截图和下面的代码：|cffffd100github.com/fpsacha/Manners|r。\n截图就是凭证。这只是一份邀请，不需要任何有价值的回报。"
L["Every milestone is yours. Manners could not make a code for this character's name, so there is none to copy. If you would like your name listed among the Gentlefolk of Good Manners, say so on the addon's GitHub page: |cffffd100github.com/fpsacha/Manners|r."] = "所有里程碑都已达成。Manners 无法为这个角色的名字生成代码，因此没有可复制的代码。如果你愿意让自己的名字列入“彬彬有礼的绅士淑女”，请在插件的 GitHub 页面上说明：|cffffd100github.com/fpsacha/Manners|r。"
L["You are listed among the Gentlefolk of Good Manners. Thank you for your manners."] = "你已列入“彬彬有礼的绅士淑女”。感谢你的礼貌。"
