L["4. Say thanks (optional)"] = "4. 道谢（可选）"
L["When I buff someone"] = "我给人加增益时"
L["|cffffd100Snoozed %s.|r In a fight the prompt stays as the fight found it, and follows the snooze once the fight ends."] = "|cffffd100免打扰%s。|r战斗中提示框会保持战斗开始时的样子，战斗结束后再按免打扰处理。"
L["|cffffd100Snoozed %s.|r The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged, casting nothing, until you lock it."] = "|cffffd100免打扰%s。|r提示框已解锁，所以在你锁定它之前，它会留在屏幕上供你拖动，但不会施法。"
L["|cffffd100Snoozed %s.|r No prompt until then, though who buffs you is still noticed."] = "|cffffd100免打扰%s。|r在此之前不显示提示框，但仍会记下谁给你加了增益。"
L["Hide the prompt for a while without turning Manners off."] = "暂时隐藏提示框，而不必关闭Manners。"
L["Snooze %s"] = "免打扰%s"
L["Who buffed you, whether you returned it, and who you buffed first."] = "谁给你加了增益、你是否还了人情，以及你主动给谁加了增益。"
L["Tell me when I reach a milestone"] = "达成里程碑时告诉我"
L["A dozen or so marks of good manners, earned by what your ledger records: listed on the ledger's Milestones tab, with a toast and one line in your chat window when you earn one or a new title."] = "十来座礼数的里程碑，凭账本记下的事迹达成：列在账本的里程碑标签页里，达成一座或获得新头衔时会有一条浮窗提示和聊天窗口里的一行文字。"
L["Off: no toast, no tab, no line for a milestone, and nothing is counted. A new title keeps its one line in chat. What you have earned is kept for when you switch it back on."] = "关闭后：里程碑没有浮窗提示，没有标签页，没有聊天文字，也不再计数。新头衔仍会在聊天窗口里有一行文字。已达成的会保留，等你重新开启。"
L["A small plate on screen for a few seconds when you earn a milestone or a title. Never in a fight, never over the prompt, and at most one a minute; a click sends it away."] = "达成里程碑或获得头衔时，屏幕上会出现几秒钟的小牌匾。战斗中不显示，不会盖住提示框，每分钟最多一条；点击即可关闭。"
L["Play the sound"] = "播放音效"
L["The fanfare that goes with the toast."] = "伴随浮窗提示的号角声。"
L["Show my certificate"] = "显示我的证书"
L["Opens the favour ledger on its Milestones tab, with your certificate beside it."] = "打开人情账本的里程碑标签页，你的证书显示在旁边。"
L["Click in the box, press Ctrl+A to select it all, then Ctrl+C to copy (Cmd on a Mac)."] = "点击文本框，按Ctrl+A全选，再按Ctrl+C复制（Mac上用Cmd）。"
L["Minimap and chat window"] = "小地图和聊天窗口"
L["Show minimap button"] = "显示小地图按钮"
L["Manners stays in the addon compartment under the minimap either way."] = "无论是否显示按钮，Manners都会保留在小地图下方的插件菜单中。"
L["Without it, open these settings with %s or Options > AddOns."] = "不显示按钮时，可输入%s，或通过选项 > 插件打开这些设置。"
L["A line when somebody buffs you, when a favour is counted as repaid, and when a click fails, is skipped, or leaves somebody owed."] = "有人给你加增益时、某份人情算作已还时，以及点击失败、被跳过或点击后仍欠着人情时，各显示一行。"
L["Only you see these; they show whether a buff was missed or someone could not be reached."] = "这些消息只有你能看到；它们会说明是否漏掉了增益，或是否有人不在范围内。"
L["Not even the few lines Manners keeps when the switch above is off: a title earned, the game refusing somebody, a skip in a fight, something it could not write. What you type after /manners is still answered."] = "连上面的开关关闭后 Manners 仍会保留的那几行也不说：获得的称号、游戏拒绝某人、战斗中的跳过、无法写入的内容。你在 /manners 之后输入的命令仍会得到回应。"
L["Simple view"] = "简单视图"
L["Shows only the settings most players change. Nothing is switched off by hiding it, and search still finds every setting."] = "只显示大多数玩家会更改的设置。隐藏并不会关闭任何设置，搜索仍能找到每一项设置。"
L["The short list: 1 more setting on this page is in the full view. Search finds it too."] = "精简列表：本页还有1项设置在完整视图中。搜索也能找到它。"
L["The short list: %d more settings on this page are in the full view. Search finds them all."] = "精简列表：本页还有%d项设置在完整视图中。搜索能找到全部。"
L["Show everything"] = "显示全部"
L["Shows every setting on every page. The switch under the search box brings the short list back."] = "显示每一页的每一项设置。搜索框下方的开关可以回到精简列表。"
L["New: a simple view that shows only the settings most players change. Everything stays as you set it."] = "新功能：简单视图，只显示大多数玩家会更改的设置。你设好的一切都保持不变。"
L["Try the simple view"] = "试试简单视图"
L["Keeps every setting on screen. The switch under the search box turns the simple view on later."] = "保持显示所有设置。以后可以用搜索框下方的开关开启简单视图。"
L["Show the welcome again"] = "再次显示欢迎信息"
L["Says again in your chat window what Manners does and the one thing it needs from you."] = "在聊天窗口再次说明Manners的作用，以及它需要你做的那一件事。"
L["Automatic (whatever they are missing)"] = "自动（缺什么就推荐什么）"
L["%s |cff808080(not learned)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（未学会）|r"
L["%s |cff808080(mana users only)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（仅限法力职业）|r"
L["%s |cff808080(your group only)|r"] = "%s|cff808080（仅限你的队伍）|r"
L["This character has nothing it can cast on another player."] = "这个角色没有可以对其他玩家施放的法术。"
L["You have not learned any of these yet, so nobody will be offered anything."] = "这些法术你一个都还没学会，所以不会给任何人推荐任何增益。"
L["Automatic never offers %s -- nobody standing in a city wants it -- so nobody will be offered anything."] = "“自动”从不推荐%s——站在城里的人没有谁需要它——所以不会给任何人推荐任何增益。"
L["Pick it in Buff to offer if you want it given out anyway."] = "如果仍想推荐它，请在“推荐的增益”中选择它。"
L["Every spell you have learned is switched off, so nothing is offered until you switch one back on or learn one of the others."] = "你已学会的法术全都关闭了，所以在你重新开启其中一个或学会其他法术之前，不会推荐任何增益。"
L["Every spell below is switched off, so the prompt will never appear."] = "下面的所有法术都已关闭，所以提示框永远不会出现。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. |cffffd100Always offer|r does not check what they carry, so it can replace one of yours."] = "你的祝福会互相替换，所以“自动”只给%s中第一个适合对方的。|cffffd100总是推荐|r不会查看对方身上有什么，所以可能替换掉你之前给的祝福。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. Where the game hides which blessing somebody carries, it can replace one of yours."] = "你的祝福会互相替换，所以“自动”只给%s中第一个适合对方的。如果游戏不显示某人带着哪个祝福，就可能替换掉你之前给的祝福。"
L["Your blessings replace one another, so Automatic gives only the first of %s that suits them. Anybody already carrying one of yours is left alone."] = "你的祝福会互相替换，所以“自动”只给%s中第一个适合对方的。身上已有你某个祝福的人会被放过。"
L["Automatic may offer, in this order: %s. Each person gets the first one they are missing."] = "“自动”可能按以下顺序推荐：%s。每个人会得到自己缺少的第一个。"
L["When the game hides what someone has, it tries the next one each time."] = "如果游戏不显示某人身上有什么，每次会改试下一个。"
L["Only |cffffffff%s|r is offered, to everybody, whatever else they are missing. The per-spell switches come back with Automatic."] = "只会推荐|cffffffff%s|r，对所有人都是如此，不管对方还缺少什么。切回“自动”后，各法术的开关会重新起作用。"
L["You picked %s in Buff to offer, but have not learned it, so nothing is offered."] = "你在“推荐的增益”中选择了%s，但还没有学会，所以不会推荐任何增益。"
L["Learn it or set Buff to offer back to Automatic."] = "请学会它，或把“推荐的增益”改回“自动”。"
L["Untick to never offer this buff."] = "取消勾选即永不推荐此增益。"
L["Off until you tick it. Tick to offer this buff."] = "勾选前保持关闭。勾选即推荐此增益。"
L["Offer %s to everybody near me"] = "向我身边的所有人提供%s"
L["On: it is offered to your group and to passers-by, as it was before 1.11.19. Off: it is kept for returning a favour and for somebody who asks you for it by name in chat."] = "开启：像 1.11.19 之前一样，向你的小队和路人提供。关闭：只用于回报人情，以及在聊天中点名请求的人。"
L["Offer %s to passers-by too"] = "也向路人提供%s"
L["Off: it is offered to the members of your party or raid only. On: passers-by missing it are offered it as well, and so is a passer-by who asks you for it in chat. Passers-by must be ticked above for it to reach them unasked."] = "关闭：只向你的小队或团队成员提供。开启：也向缺少它的路人提供，在聊天中向你索要的路人同样如此。要让它不经请求就提供给路人，上方的路人必须已勾选。"
L["Offer %s to"] = "%s 提供给"
L["Who is offered it."] = "提示给谁。"
L["Tanks only: in your group, only its tanks; nobody outside it. In a group you are reminded of yours only while you tank."] = "仅坦克：队伍里只提示其中的坦克，队伍之外不提示任何人。在队伍中，只有你担任坦克时才会提醒你自己的。"
L["Tanks, and anyone outside my group: your group's tanks, and passers-by and people who buffed you as usual."] = "坦克，以及队伍之外的任何人：提示队伍里的坦克，路人和给你加过增益的人照常提示。"
L["Tanks and me: the tanks, and you whatever your role (Myself must be on)."] = "坦克和我：提示坦克，你自己无论什么职责都会提示（必须开启“我自己”）。"
L["Only me: nobody else; you are still reminded when yours is down (Myself must be on)."] = "仅自己：不提示其他人；你自己的增益消失时仍会提醒你（必须开启“我自己”）。"
L["Somebody who asks you for it in chat always gets it."] = "在聊天里向你求助的人总会得到提示。"
L["Everyone"] = "所有人"
L["Tanks only"] = "仅坦克"
L["Tanks and me"] = "坦克和我"
L["Tanks, and anyone outside my group"] = "坦克，以及队伍之外的任何人"
L["Only me"] = "仅自己"
L["Not on me in a dungeon or raid"] = "在地下城和团队副本中不用于我自己"
L["On: in a dungeon or a raid you are not reminded of your own, whatever Offer to says and whatever your role; the rest of your group is offered it as Offer to says. Out in the world, and in a battleground or an arena, you are reminded as before."] = "开启：在地下城或团队副本中，无论“提供给”如何设置、无论你的职责是什么，都不会提醒你给自己施放；队伍里的其他人仍按“提供给”的设置推荐。在野外、战场和竞技场中，照常提醒你。"
L["Automatic (only while I'm the tank)"] = "自动（仅在我是坦克时）"
L["Automatic"] = "自动"
L["Automatic (%s, the one you had up last)"] = "自动（%s，你上次用的那个）"
L["Automatic (%s, in a dungeon or raid)"] = "自动（%s，在地下城或团队副本中）"
L["Automatic (%s, outside dungeons and raids)"] = "自动（%s，在地下城和团队副本以外）"
L["Automatic (%s, the best you can use now)"] = "自动（%s，你现在能用的最好的）"
L["Automatic (%s, until you have put one up)"] = "自动（%s，在你用过其中一个之前）"
L["Reminds you to drink a flask when none is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. Off until you turn it on."] = "当你身上没有合剂而背包里有时，提醒你饮用合剂，优先使用你能用的最好的。默认关闭，开启后生效。"
L["Reminds you to drink a guardian elixir when no guardian elixir or flask is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. A flask fills both elixir slots. Off until you turn it on."] = "当你身上没有守护药剂或合剂而背包里有守护药剂时，提醒你饮用，优先使用你能用的最好的。合剂会占满两个药剂栏位。默认关闭，开启后生效。"
L["Reminds you to drink a battle elixir when no battle elixir or flask is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. A flask fills both elixir slots. Off until you turn it on."] = "当你身上没有战斗药剂或合剂而背包里有战斗药剂时，提醒你饮用，优先使用你能用的最好的。合剂会占满两个药剂栏位。默认关闭，开启后生效。"
L["A scroll counts as a battle or a guardian elixir, as its own tooltip says."] = "卷轴按其自身的鼠标提示算作战斗药剂或守护药剂。"
L["Reminds you to drink an elixir when none is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. Off until you turn it on."] = "当你身上没有药剂而背包里有时，提醒你饮用药剂，优先使用你能用的最好的。默认关闭，开启后生效。"
L["Reminds you to use one on yourself when none of it is on you and one is in your bags, the best you can use first. Off until you turn it on."] = "当你身上没有该效果而背包里有时，提醒你对自己使用一个，优先使用你能用的最好的。默认关闭，开启后生效。"
L["Not while a class buff of the same stat is on you."] = "身上已有同属性的职业增益时不提示。"
L["Automatic reminds you only while your group role is tank; Always reminds you whenever it is not up."] = "“自动”只在你的队伍职责为坦克时提醒你；“总是”会在它不在身上时随时提醒你。"
L["Reminds you when no ward is on you. Automatic takes the one you had up last, else the first you know. Outside a fight only: from the pull until the fight ends Manners offers no ward, so in a fight you recast it yourself. Off until you turn it on."] = "当你身上没有任何结界时提醒你。自动会选择你上次使用的，否则选择你学会的第一个。仅在战斗外：从开怪到战斗结束，Manners 不会提供任何结界，所以战斗中需要你自己重新施放。在你开启之前保持关闭。"
L["Reminds you when nothing is on the weapon in your %s and one of these in your bags fits it. Automatic takes the kind you had on that hand last, at the best rank your level allows, else the first you can use; pick one by name to keep to it."] = "你的%s武器上没有任何附魔、且背包中有适用的物品时提醒你。“自动”会选这只手上次用的那一种，用你的等级能用的最高等级，否则选你现在能用的第一个；按名字选一个即可一直用它。"
L["Reminds you when nothing is on the weapon in your %s and one of these in your bags fits it. Automatic takes the best you can use now: by your level, weapon and Fishing, an oil by your group role or talents, a warlock's stone by your talents; pick one by name to keep to it."] = "你的%s武器上没有任何附魔、且背包中有适用的物品时提醒你。“自动”会选你现在能用的最好的：按你的等级、武器和钓鱼技能，油按你的队伍职责或天赋，术士的石头按你的天赋；按名字选一个即可一直用它。"
L["Reminds you when no imbue is on the weapon or shield in your off hand. Automatic takes the first of these you know."] = "副手武器或盾牌上没有任何附魔时提醒你。“自动”选择你已学会的第一个。"
L["Reminds you when no imbue is on the weapon in your main hand. Automatic takes the first of these you know."] = "主手武器上没有任何附魔时提醒你。“自动”选择你已学会的第一个。"
L["Reminds you when no imbue is on the weapon in your main hand. Automatic takes the first of these you know, Windfury ahead of the rest."] = "主手武器上没有任何附魔时提醒你。“自动”选择你已学会的第一个，风怒优先。"
L["Reminds you to make a stone when none is in your bags or on the weapon in your main hand and a Soul Shard is in your bags. Once it is made, Firestone or Spellstone offers to put it on. Automatic makes the kind your talents favour, else the kind you used last. Off until you turn it on."] = "背包里和主手武器上都没有石头、而背包里有灵魂碎片时，提醒你制造一块。制造好后，“火焰石或法术石”会提醒你把它用到武器上。“自动”制造你的天赋偏向的那种，否则制造你上次用的那种。在你开启前保持关闭。"
L["Reminds you when nothing is on the weapon in your main hand and a scroll in your bags fits it. Automatic takes the best you can use now: one of the school your talents favour, then your level and weapon; pick one by name to keep to it."] = "主手武器上没有任何附魔、且背包中有适用的卷轴时提醒你。“自动”会选你现在能用的最好的：先选你的天赋偏向的系别，再按你的等级和武器；按名字选一个即可一直用它。"
L["Reminds you when no familiar is with you and a scroll for one is in your bags. Automatic takes the best your level allows."] = "身边没有魔宠、且背包中有魔宠卷轴时提醒你。“自动”会选你的等级能用的最好的。"
L["Reminds you when none of these is up. Automatic takes the one you had up last; pick one to always be reminded of that one."] = "这些都不在身上时提醒你。“自动”会选你上次用的那个；选定一个则始终提醒那一个。"
L["Reminds you when it is not up. With Demonic Pact, %s has a switch of its own below and is reminded of too."] = "它不在身上时提醒你。有恶魔契约时，%s在下方有自己的开关，也会提醒。"
L["Until you have had one up: %s in a dungeon or raid, %s elsewhere."] = "在你用过其中一个之前：在地下城或团队副本中为%s，在其他地方为%s。"
L["Don't remind me"] = "不提醒我"
L["Always"] = "总是"
L["Reminds you to eat when Well Fed is not on you and food that gives it is in your bags. Off until you turn it on. A food you keep for something else, a fishing food say, can be ticked under %s."] = "身上没有“进食充分”、背包里有能提供它的食物时，提醒你进食。在你开启之前保持关闭。留作他用的食物（比如钓鱼食物）可以在“%s”中勾选。"
L["Never remind me about"] = "永不提醒的法术"
L["Keeps a companion pet out: Manners brings one out of your pet journal itself, with no press. Never in a fight, a dungeon, a raid, a battleground, an arena or a pet battle, nor while you are mounted, stealthed or flying, and a pet you put away stays away until you bring one out. Off until you turn it on."] = "让一只小宠物始终在外：Manners 会自己从你的宠物手册中召唤一只，无需按键。战斗中、地下城、团队副本、战场、竞技场或宠物对战中从不召唤，骑乘、潜行或飞行时也不会；你解散的宠物在你自己召唤之前不会回来。在你开启之前保持关闭。"
L["Keeps a companion pet out. Manners brings one out of your pet journal itself, with no press; a pet you use from your bags each time comes up on the prompt. Never in a fight, a dungeon, a raid, a battleground or an arena, nor while you are mounted, stealthed or flying, and a pet you put away stays away until you bring one out. Off until you turn it on."] = "让一只小宠物始终在外。Manners 会自己从你的宠物手册中召唤一只，无需按键；每次都要从背包中使用的宠物会出现在提示上。战斗中、地下城、团队副本、战场或竞技场中从不召唤，骑乘、潜行或飞行时也不会；你解散的宠物在你自己召唤之前不会回来。在你开启之前保持关闭。"
L["Reminds you to bring out your companion pet when none is out and one is in your bags. Never in a fight, a dungeon, a raid, a battleground or an arena, nor while you are mounted, stealthed or flying, and a pet you put away stays away until you bring one out. Off until you turn it on."] = "当没有宠物在外且背包中有一只时，提醒你召唤小宠物。战斗中、地下城、团队副本、战场或竞技场中从不提醒，骑乘、潜行或飞行时也不会；你解散的宠物在你自己召唤之前不会回来。在你开启之前保持关闭。"
L["Reminds you to lay down your Cozy Sleeping Bag when Well-Rested is not on you and the bag is in your bags. Not at the level cap, where there is no experience to gain. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上没有“精神饱满”、背包里有“舒适的睡袋”时，提醒你铺开睡袋。达到等级上限时不提醒，那时已没有经验可以获得。在你开启之前保持关闭。"
L["Reminds you when it is not on you, outside a fight only: from the pull until the fight ends Manners does not offer it, so in a fight you recast it yourself. Off until you turn it on."] = "当它不在你身上时提醒你，仅在战斗外：从开怪到战斗结束，Manners 不会提供它，所以战斗中需要你自己重新施放。在你开启之前保持关闭。"
L["Reminds you when it is not on you, whoever cast it. Off until you turn it on."] = "身上没有时提醒你，无论是谁施放的。开启前保持关闭。"
L["Reminds you when it is not up, once you have had it up yourself."] = "你自己开启过一次之后，它未开启时提醒你。"
L["Reminds you while you are swimming and it is not on you, whoever cast it. Never on dry land."] = "游泳时身上没有就提醒你，无论是谁施放的。在陆地上从不提醒。"
L["Reminds you when you are not in it, and never while you are in another form."] = "当你不在该形态时提醒你，处于其他形态时从不提醒。"
L["Reminds you when it is not up and a demon is out. With Demonic Pact it stands beside Demonic Sacrifice, which is reminded of first: the sacrifice takes the demon Soul Link needs."] = "它不在身上且有恶魔在场时提醒你。有恶魔契约时，它与恶魔牺牲并存，恶魔牺牲先提醒：牺牲会献出灵魂链接所需的恶魔。"
L["Reminds you when it is not up."] = "它不在身上时提醒你。"
L["Ticked spells are left out of Automatic and never offered, even one you picked above. The others of their kind still are."] = "勾选的法术不会被“自动”选中，也不会被提醒，即使是你在上面指定的法术。同类的其他法术仍会提醒。"
L["Elixirs to keep up"] = "要同时保持的药剂"
L["Tick the elixirs you want on you at once: Manners reminds you of each ticked one that is in your bags and not on you, one at a time. With none ticked, any one elixir on you will do, the best you can use first."] = "勾选你想同时保持的药剂：Manners会逐个提醒你每个已勾选、在背包里但不在你身上的药剂。一个都不勾选时，身上有任意一种药剂即可，优先使用你能用的最好的。"
L["Offer your resurrection for somebody of your party or raid who is dead and within reach, ahead of everything else. Never in a fight, never for somebody who has released their spirit, and not while another resurrection is already on its way to them."] = "为你小队或团队中已死亡且在范围内的人推荐你的复活法术，排在其他一切之前。战斗中绝不推荐，已释放灵魂的人绝不推荐，已有其他复活正在施放时也不推荐。"
L["Dead passers-by too"] = "也包括死亡的路人"
L["Also offer it for a dead player outside your group whom you could help: your target, your focus or whoever is under your cursor."] = "也为队伍之外、你可以帮助的死亡玩家推荐：你的目标、焦点或鼠标指向的玩家。"
L["Asking for buffs"] = "请求增益"
L["When somebody in your group, or right beside you, could cast a buff you would want and do not have, the prompt can offer to ask them. A press says one short polite line to them and casts nothing. It comes last of everything on the prompt; never in a fight, a battleground or an arena; one ask a person for each buff in ten minutes, and one ask in all in two minutes. Nobody on your never-offer list or your ignore list is asked."] = "当你的队伍里或身边有人能施放你想要却没有的增益时，提示框可以推荐你向对方请求。按一下会对对方说一句简短的客气话，不施放任何法术。它排在提示框上所有内容之后；战斗中、战场和竞技场中绝不请求；同一个人的同一个增益十分钟内只请求一次，总共两分钟内只请求一次。不会向永不推荐名单或屏蔽列表中的人请求。"
L["Ask in"] = "请求方式"
L["A whisper reaches only the person you ask. /say is heard by everybody near you."] = "密语只有被请求的人能看到。/say会被你身边的所有人听到。"
L["A whisper to them"] = "密语对方"
L["/say, aloud"] = "/say，公开说"
L["What the ask says"] = "请求时说什么"
L["{name} is their name and {buff} the spell. With the In character set chosen on %s, a line in character is said instead."] = "{name}是对方的名字，{buff}是法术。在%s中选择了入戏套组时，会改说一句入戏的台词。"
L["What the ask says, in your own words, even with the In character set on. {name} is their name and {buff} the spell; leave {name} out and no name is said. One line. Left empty, the first line above is said."] = "请求说的话，用你自己的措辞，即使开启了“入戏”也一样。{name} 是对方的名字，{buff} 是法术；不写 {name} 就不会说出名字。一行。留空时，说上面的第一句。"
L["Off: nobody is asked while you are in a city or an inn."] = "关闭：你在城市或旅店中时，不会向任何人发出请求。"
L["Cures"] = "驱散"
L["Cure my party and raid"] = "为我的小队和团队驱散"
L["Out of combat, offer to take a poison, a disease, a curse or a harmful spell off someone in your party or raid, with the spell your class has for it. A cure comes before a buff for the same person, and after a favour you owe."] = "脱离战斗时，推荐用你职业对应的法术，为小队或团队中的成员移除毒药、疾病、诅咒或有害法术。对同一个人，驱散排在增益之前、你欠下的人情之后。"
L["Cure passers-by"] = "为路人驱散"
L["The same for players near you who are not in your group, seen through nameplates, your target, focus and mouseover."] = "对你附近、不在你队伍中的玩家也是如此，通过姓名板、你的目标、焦点和鼠标指向发现他们。"
L["Out of combat, offer to take a poison, a disease, a curse or a harmful spell off yourself, with the spell your class has for it. It comes before your own buffs."] = "脱离战斗时，推荐用你职业对应的法术，移除你自己身上的毒药、疾病、诅咒或有害法术。排在你自己的增益之前。"
L["Only when it has at least this long left"] = "仅当剩余时间至少这么长时"
L["In seconds."] = "单位：秒。"
L["A poison, disease, curse or spell about to run out on its own is left alone. One with no timer is never offered."] = "即将自行结束的毒药、疾病、诅咒或法术不作处理。没有持续时间的效果从不推荐。"
L["Show a cure button in a fight when somebody needs it"] = "有人需要时在战斗中显示驱散按钮"
L["A button of its own beside the prompt, with its own key. It shows when somebody near you has a poison, disease, curse or harmful magic your class can remove, and says who. A press cures whoever is under your mouse, else your target, else you; Shift casts your second cure. Where the game hides debuffs in a fight it stays hidden, but its key still works. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框旁边一个单独的按钮，有自己的快捷键。当你附近有人带着你的职业能移除的毒药、疾病、诅咒或有害魔法时显示，并告诉你是谁。按下会驱散鼠标下的玩家，否则驱散你的目标，再否则驱散你自己；按住Shift施放第二个驱散法术。在游戏于战斗中隐藏减益效果的地方，它保持隐藏，但快捷键仍然有效。战斗中所做的更改从下一场战斗起生效。"
L["A button of its own beside the prompt, with its own key. It shows when somebody near you has a poison, disease, curse or harmful magic your class can remove, and says who. A press cures your target when it is a friend, else you; Shift casts your second cure. Where the game hides debuffs in a fight it stays hidden, but its key still works. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框旁边一个单独的按钮，有自己的快捷键。当你附近有人带着你的职业能移除的毒药、疾病、诅咒或有害魔法时显示，并告诉你是谁。按下会在目标是友方时驱散目标，否则驱散你自己；按住Shift施放第二个驱散法术。在游戏于战斗中隐藏减益效果的地方，它保持隐藏，但快捷键仍然有效。战斗中所做的更改从下一场战斗起生效。"
L["Everything for my pet"] = "为我的宠物做的一切"
L["Off, Manners leaves your pet to you: no care, no moments, no hints and no Mend Pet button in a fight. Each switch below keeps its own setting for when this is on again."] = "关闭后，Manners 把宠物交还给你：没有照料、没有片刻、没有提示，战斗中也没有治疗宠物按钮。下面每个开关都会保留自己的设置，等这里重新开启时再用。"
L["Call my pet when none is out"] = "没有宠物时召唤宠物"
L["Offers Call Pet when no pet is with you. Not in a fight, not while mounted, not in a city unless your own buffs are offered there, and not after you dismissed it yourself."] = "身边没有宠物时提供召唤宠物。不会在战斗中、骑乘时、城市里（除非你的自身增益在城市里也会提供）提供，你自己解散宠物后也不会提供。"
L["Revive my pet when it is dead"] = "宠物死亡时复活宠物"
L["Offers Revive Pet when your pet has died."] = "宠物死亡时提供复活宠物。"
L["Feed my pet when it is not happy"] = "宠物不快乐时喂养宠物"
L["Offers Feed Pet with a food it eats from your bags while it is not happy, and nothing once it is. Food that makes you Well Fed is kept for you."] = "宠物不快乐时，用背包里它吃的食物提供喂养宠物；快乐后就不再提供。能让你进食充分的食物会留给你自己。"
L["Mend my pet when it is hurt after a fight"] = "战斗后宠物受伤时治疗宠物"
L["Offers Mend Pet when your pet is badly hurt and the fight is over."] = "宠物重伤且战斗结束后提供治疗宠物。"
L["Show a Mend Pet button in a fight when my pet is badly hurt"] = "宠物重伤时在战斗中显示治疗宠物按钮"
L["A button of its own beside the prompt, with its own key. It shows while your pet is under half health, in reach, and Mend Pet is ready. Where the game hides your pet's health in a fight, it shows only with Show the fight buttons set to All fight; its key works either way. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框旁边一个单独的按钮，有自己的快捷键。当宠物生命值低于一半、在施法范围内且治疗宠物可用时显示。在游戏于战斗中隐藏宠物生命值的地方，只有“显示战斗按钮”设为“整场战斗”时才会显示；快捷键两种情况下都有效。战斗中所做的更改从下一场战斗起生效。"
L["Tell me at a vendor when my pet is low on food"] = "在商人处提醒我宠物的食物不足"
L["At a vendor who sells a food your pet eats, a line in chat when your bags hold fewer than five meals for your pet. Once a vendor each session. Manners never buys anything."] = "在出售宠物可吃食物的商人处，当你背包里的宠物食物少于五份时，在聊天窗口说一行。每次登录每位商人一次。Manners 从不购买任何东西。"
L["Remind me about Growl in groups and alone"] = "在队伍中和独自时提醒我低吼"
L["A line in chat when Growl is on autocast in a dungeon or raid with a tank in your group (once a zone), or off while you are alone in the open world (once a session). Manners never changes it for you. Off by default: the game does not always say who the tank is."] = "在地下城或团队副本里，队伍中有坦克而低吼处于自动施放时（每个区域一次），或在开放世界独自一人而低吼关闭时（每次登录一次），在聊天窗口说一行。Manners 从不替你更改。默认关闭：游戏并不总能说明谁是坦克。"
L["Tell me when my pet has training points to spend"] = "宠物有训练点数可用时告诉我"
L["A line in chat when your pet has training points left unspent: once a session, and again when there are more, at most once in fifteen minutes."] = "宠物还有未使用的训练点数时，在聊天窗口说一行：每次登录一次，点数增加时再说一次，最多每十五分钟一次。"
L["Bond with my pet"] = "与宠物建立羁绊"
L["Now and then, after a hard fight, a revive, at login or on a quiet road, offers a moment with your pet: an emote for it, and a line from your people when In character is on and lines go in /say. Never in a fight; letting it pass costs nothing."] = "不时在一场苦战后、复活后、登录时或安静的路上，提供与宠物相处的片刻：对它做一个表情动作，并在开启入戏且台词走/say时说一句你种族的话。战斗中绝不会出现；错过也没关系。"
L["How often moments come"] = "片刻出现的频率"
L["The least time between two moments with your pet: an hour, twenty minutes or ten. Before one on a quiet road: half an hour, a quarter of an hour or ten minutes."] = "与宠物两次片刻之间的最短间隔：一小时、二十分钟或十分钟。在安静的路上出现片刻之前：半小时、一刻钟或十分钟。"
L["Rarely"] = "很少"
L["Sometimes"] = "有时"
L["Often"] = "经常"
L["After a hard fight or a boss: well done"] = "在一场苦战或首领战之后：干得好"
L["After a fight your pet barely lived through: comfort"] = "在宠物勉强撑过的战斗之后：安慰"
L["After a revive: welcome back"] = "复活之后：欢迎回来"
L["After a revive, when your pet fell in a fight: say sorry"] = "复活之后，如果宠物是在战斗中倒下的：道歉"
L["Takes turns with welcome back when both are on; never both at once."] = "两者都开启时轮流出现，绝不同时出现。"
L["At login: hello"] = "登录时：问好"
L["After a night at an inn: good morning"] = "在旅店过夜之后：早安"
L["With a line in chat at login that your pet slept by the fire."] = "登录时在聊天窗口说一行，告诉你宠物在炉火边睡过。"
L["On a quiet road: a pat"] = "在安静的路上：抚摸"
L["On a quiet road: a game of fetch"] = "在安静的路上：扔木棍玩耍"
L["Takes turns with the pat when both are on."] = "两者都开启时与抚摸轮流出现。"
L["When you sit down to eat: share your meal"] = "当你坐下吃饭时：分享你的饭菜"
L["While your pet is not happy and a food your pet eats is in your bags: offered once your meal is over, so a press never stands you up."] = "当宠物不开心且背包里有宠物可吃的食物时：在你吃完之后提供，所以点击绝不会让你站起来。"
L["A newly tamed pet: welcome to the family"] = "刚驯服的宠物：欢迎加入大家庭"
L["Right after Tame Beast. If the name is still the kind's (Wolf, Cat), the prompt suggests choosing one."] = "紧接在驯服野兽之后。如果名字仍是种类名（狼、猫），提示框会建议取个名字。"
L["Back after three days or more apart"] = "分别三天或更久之后回来"
L["When your pet saved you: thanks"] = "当宠物救了你：感谢"
L["After a fight you ended alive below a fifth of your health, with your pet out from start to end."] = "在你以不到五分之一的生命值存活下来的战斗之后，且宠物从头到尾都在场。"
L["When your pet grows: a level, or more loyalty"] = "当宠物成长：升级或更加忠诚"
L["When your pet gains a level"] = "当宠物升级时"
L["Your days together: 7, 30, 100 and 365"] = "你们在一起的日子：7、30、100 和 365 天"
L["My pet answers"] = "我的宠物做出回应"
L["After the gesture, how your pet answers, by kind: a wolf wags, an owl hoots."] = "在动作之后，宠物按种类做出回应：狼摇尾巴，猫头鹰咕咕叫。"
L["Say a line to my pet"] = "对我的宠物说一句话"
L["With In character on and lines going in /say, a line from your people to your pet with each moment."] = "开启入戏且台词走/说时，每次片刻都会由你的种族对宠物说一句话。"
L["Remember fights, pats and meals, with a line at milestones"] = "记住战斗、抚摸和饭菜，并在里程碑时说一行"
L["What Manners counts of each pet by name, and a line in chat at a milestone. Off, nothing is counted and nothing is said."] = "Manners 按名字统计每只宠物的记录，并在里程碑时在聊天窗口说一行。关闭后，不统计也不说。"
L["No pet remembered yet."] = "还没有记住任何宠物。"
L["A blessing for each class"] = "每个职业一种祝福"
L["Pick a class, then the blessing its players are offered first. Somebody who already wears it from another paladin, or who cannot be given it, gets what the order above would have chosen; anybody wearing one of yours is left alone."] = "先选一个职业，再选优先提供给该职业玩家的祝福。已经从其他圣骑士那里获得该祝福或无法获得它的人，会得到上方顺序本会选择的祝福；已有你的祝福的人不会被打扰。"
L["No class has a blessing of its own yet."] = "还没有职业设置自己的祝福。"
L["Chosen: %s."] = "已选：%s。"
L["Offer nothing in dungeons and raids"] = "地下城和团队副本中不推荐任何增益"
L["Offer nothing in dungeons, raids and battlegrounds"] = "地下城、团队副本和战场中不推荐任何增益"
L["Manners offers each person the first of these they can use, and leaves alone anybody who already wears one of yours."] = "Manners会给每个人推荐其中第一个可用的增益，身上已有你某个增益的人会被放过。"
L["Manners offers each person the first of these they are missing."] = "Manners会给每个人推荐其中第一个缺少的增益。"
L["Your own order is in use."] = "正在使用你自己的顺序。"
L["Following Automatic's order, with %s first."] = "按“自动”的顺序，%s优先。"
L["Following Automatic's order."] = "按“自动”的顺序。"
L["Only give mana buffs to players with mana"] = "只给有法力的玩家加法力增益"
L["Only give %s to players with mana"] = "只给有法力的玩家加%s"
L["%s: the game does not say how many you carry."] = "%s：游戏不显示你带了多少。"
L["%s: %d in your bags"] = "%s：背包中有%d个"
L["%s: none needed -- the game lets you cast without it."] = "%s：无需携带——游戏允许你在没有它的情况下施放。"
L["You have not learned a group version of your buffs yet."] = "你还没有学会任何增益的群体版本。"
L["What to cast"] = "施放什么"
L["Buff to offer"] = "推荐的增益"
L["You offer %s."] = "你推荐的是%s。"
L["%s first"] = "%s优先"
L["Offer %s to everybody before any other blessing. Somebody who already carries it from another paladin, or who cannot be given it, gets the blessing Automatic would have chosen instead; anybody carrying one of yours is left alone."] = "先向所有人推荐%s，然后才轮到其他祝福。已从其他圣骑士处获得该祝福、或无法获得该祝福的人，会改为获得“自动”本会选择的祝福；身上已有你某个祝福的人会被放过。"
L["Skip players another paladin has blessed"] = "跳过已被其他圣骑士祝福的玩家"
L["On: somebody who already carries any blessing from another paladin is not offered one of yours, even one they lack. Somebody who asks you for a blessing by name is still offered it."] = "开启：身上已有其他圣骑士任何祝福的人，不会再被提示你的祝福，即使是他们缺少的那种。点名向你要祝福的人仍会被提示。"
L["Don't offer %s to mages, warlocks and priests"] = "不向法师、术士和牧师提供%s"
L["On: they are never offered it, however the blessing would be chosen, since it does nothing for them. Their other blessings are still offered and refreshed. Somebody who asks you for it by name is still given it."] = "开启：无论祝福如何选择，都不会向他们提供，因为它对他们毫无用处。他们的其他祝福仍会提供和刷新。点名向你索要的人仍会得到。"
L["Offer Kings last to someone with a Fish Bowl's Boosted Stats"] = "对带有鱼缸强化属性的人，最后才提供王者祝福"
L["Sitting by a Fish Bowl gives Boosted Stats, 8% to all stats, and Blessing of Kings replaces it. On: somebody wearing it is offered your other blessings first, and Kings only when nothing else of yours is missing for them."] = "坐在鱼缸旁会获得强化属性（全属性提高8%），而王者祝福会替换它。开启后：带着它的人会先被提供你的其他祝福，只有在你的其他祝福都不缺时才提供王者祝福。"
L["Never offer them Kings while it lasts"] = "强化属性持续期间，绝不对其提供王者祝福"
L["On: somebody wearing a Fish Bowl's Boosted Stats is not offered Blessing of Kings at all while it lasts, even with nothing else of yours missing. Somebody who asks you for Kings by name is still given it."] = "开启后：带着鱼缸强化属性的人，在它持续期间完全不会被提供王者祝福，即使你的其他祝福都不缺。点名向你要王者祝福的人仍然会得到它。"
L["Leave a campsite's Boosted Stamina, Intellect or Spirit alone"] = "不去动营地的强化耐力、智力或精神"
L["Resting at a campsite gives Boosted Stamina, Intellect or Spirit. Manners already leaves it alone when it gives as much as yours would. On: nobody wearing it, you included, is offered the buff it would replace, even a stronger one."] = "在营地休息会获得强化耐力、智力或精神。当它和你的效果一样强时，Manners 本来就不会覆盖它。开启：任何带着它的人（包括你）都不会被提供会取代它的增益，即使你的更强。"
L["%s is not offered to players without mana, such as warriors and rogues."] = "不会向战士和潜行者等没有法力值的玩家推荐%s。"
L["%s are not offered to players without mana, such as warriors and rogues."] = "不会向战士和潜行者等没有法力值的玩家推荐%s。"
L["Buff order"] = "增益顺序"
L["Move up"] = "上移"
L["Move down"] = "下移"
L["Back to Automatic"] = "切回自动"
L["Blessing for that class"] = "该职业的祝福"
L["Automatic leaves this class to the order above."] = "“自动”会让该职业按上方顺序处理。"
L["Clear every class's blessing"] = "清除所有职业的祝福"
L["Nothing is ticked here, so the prompt will never appear."] = "这里什么都没勾选，所以提示框永远不会出现。"
L["People who buff me"] = "给我加增益的人"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you. Yours reaches only your own party (in a raid, your subgroup), so someone outside it is offered once they join."] = "任何人给你加增益，都会推荐你回加。你的增益只作用于你自己的小队（团队中则是你所在的小队），所以小队之外的人要等加入后才会被推荐。"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you. Yours reaches only your group, so someone outside it is offered once they join."] = "任何人给你加增益，都会推荐你回加。你的增益只作用于你的队伍，所以队伍之外的人要等加入后才会被推荐。"
L["Offer a buff back to anyone who buffs you, in your group or not."] = "任何人给你加增益，都会推荐你回加，无论对方是否在你的队伍中。"
L["My party and raid"] = "我的小队和团队"
L["My group's pets too"] = "也包括我队伍的宠物"
L["Also offer your buffs to the pets of the people in your party or raid: a hunter's beast, a warlock's demon. A pet is targeted by its name, so one with a name of its own is reached most surely."] = "也为你小队或团队中玩家的宠物推荐增益：猎人的野兽、术士的恶魔。宠物是按名字选中的，因此有自己独特名字的宠物最容易准确选中。"
L["When somebody else of your class in your party or raid uses Manners too, the group is split between you, so you are not both sent to buff the same person. A favour owed, a request, your target and your focus are never held back, and anybody still missing the buff after 45 seconds is offered anyway."] = "当你的小队或团队中还有同职业的玩家也在使用Manners时，队伍会在你们之间分配，避免两人被推荐去给同一个人加增益。欠下的人情、对方的请求、你的目标和焦点不受此限制；45秒后仍缺少增益的人，照样会推荐给你。"
L["Passers-by: players near me who are not in my group"] = "路人：我附近、不在我队伍中的玩家"
L["Seen through nameplates, your target, focus and mouseover."] = "通过姓名板、你的目标、焦点和鼠标指向发现他们。"
L["What you can offer goes only to members of your group, so there is nothing for passers-by."] = "你能提供的增益只会给队伍成员，所以不会推荐给路人。"
L["Everything you can offer is cast on yourself and reaches only your party, so there is nothing for passers-by."] = "你能推荐的增益都是对自己施放、只作用于你的小队，所以没有什么能给路人。"
L["Everything you can offer is cast on yourself and reaches your party and raid around you, so there is nothing for passers-by."] = "你能推荐的增益都是对自己施放、作用于你周围的小队和团队，所以没有什么能给路人。"
L["Passers-by within"] = "路人距离"
L["Only passers-by are measured, and only roughly: the game gives no exact distance."] = "只测量路人的距离，而且只是粗略测量：游戏不提供精确距离。"
L["Out in the world, passers-by are left alone; your group and people who buff you are offered anywhere."] = "在野外不推荐路人；你的队伍和给你加增益的人在任何地方都会被推荐。"
L["On: nothing is offered to anybody while you are in a city or an inn: not passers-by, not your group, not a favour you owe. Somebody you target or focus is still offered. Your own buffs have a switch of their own: %s."] = "开启：你在城市或旅店中时，不向任何人提示：路人、你的队伍、你欠的人情都不例外。你选为目标或焦点的人仍会被提示。你自己的增益有单独的开关：%s。"
L["Where"] = "适用地点"
L["A city is a capital, such as Stormwind or Orgrimmar; an inn is anywhere else you rest. When the game will not say which map you are on, both count."] = "城市指主城，例如暴风城或奥格瑞玛；旅店指其他你可以休息的地方。当游戏不告诉你身处哪张地图时，两者都算。"
L["Cities and inns"] = "城市和旅店"
L["Cities only"] = "仅城市"
L["Inns only"] = "仅旅店"
L["On: inside a dungeon or a raid, nothing is offered to anybody: not your group, not a favour you owe. Somebody you target or focus is still offered, and your own buffs are not held back. A battleground or an arena goes by its own switch, %s, which ticking this one unticks."] = "开启：在地下城或团队副本中，不向任何人提供任何东西：你的队伍、你欠下的人情都一样。你选为目标或关注目标的人仍会被提示，你自己的增益也不受影响。战场和竞技场由它们自己的选项%s决定；勾选本选项时会取消勾选那个选项。"
L["Hold back short buffs in cities and inns"] = "在城市和旅店中不提供持续时间短的增益"
L["On: while you are in a city or an inn, buffs that last only a few minutes (Thorns, say) are not offered, since they run out before you reach anywhere they matter; longer ones, such as Mark of the Wild, still are. Somebody who asks for a buff by name, and somebody you target or focus, is still offered it."] = "开启：你在城市或旅店中时，只持续几分钟的增益（例如荆棘术）不会被提供，因为它们在派上用场前就消失了；更长的增益（如野性印记）仍会提供。按名字请求增益的人，以及你选为目标或焦点的人，仍会被提供。"
L["A buff counts as short up to"] = "增益算作短的上限"
L["In minutes."] = "单位：分钟。"
L["Buffs that last up to this long are held back in a city or an inn."] = "持续时间不超过此时长的增益会在城市和旅店中被保留不提供。"
L["On: the switches above hold back everybody, even somebody you target or focus. Off: somebody you target or focus is still offered."] = "开启：上面的开关会拦下所有人，连你选为目标或焦点的人也不例外。关闭：你选为目标或焦点的人仍会被提示。"
L["In a battleground or an arena with %s off, %s holds back somebody you target or focus too."] = "在战场或竞技场中，%s关闭时，%s也会把你的目标或关注目标排除在外。"
L["For a minute, offer your buff to someone who asks for it (\"fort pls\"); off by default because chat is guesswork."] = "有人向你要增益时（如“fort pls”），在一分钟内向其推荐你的增益；默认关闭，因为从聊天内容判断只能靠猜。"
L["Water and food, when they ask"] = "有人要时提供水和食物"
L["Somebody who asks for water or food (\"water pls\", \"mage food\") is offered it. With none in your bags the first press conjures it; the next targets them and opens a trade with it in the window. Accepting the trade stays yours. Never in a fight."] = "有人要水或食物时（“water pls”、“mage food”）向其推荐。背包里没有时，第一次按键先造出来；下一次按键选中对方并发起交易，物品已放进交易窗口。接受交易仍由你自己来。战斗中绝不提供。"
L["Portals, when my group asks"] = "队友要时提供传送门"
L["A member of your party or raid who asks for a portal by its city (\"port to Orgrimmar pls\", \"portal uc?\") is offered it, when you have learned it and carry what it costs. The press targets nobody and casts the portal. Never in a fight."] = "你的小队或团队成员按城市名要传送门时（“port to Orgrimmar pls”、“portal uc?”），只要你已学会并带着所需材料，就向其推荐。按键不选中任何人，直接施放传送门。战斗中绝不提供。"
L["Healthstones, when they ask"] = "有人要时提供治疗石"
L["A member of your party or raid who asks for a healthstone (\"hs pls\") is offered a Soulwell: the press targets nobody and casts it. Never in a fight."] = "你的小队或团队成员要治疗石时（“hs pls”）推荐灵魂之井：按键不选中任何人，直接施放。战斗中绝不提供。"
L["Somebody who asks for a healthstone (\"hs pls\") is offered one. With none in your bags the first press creates it; the next targets them and opens a trade with it in the window. Accepting the trade stays yours. Never in a fight."] = "有人要治疗石时（“hs pls”）向其推荐。背包里没有时，第一次按键先制造出来；下一次按键选中对方并发起交易，治疗石已放进交易窗口。接受交易仍由你自己来。战斗中绝不提供。"
L["Summons, when my group asks"] = "队友要时提供召唤"
L["A member of your party or raid who asks for a summon (\"summon pls\") is offered it: the press targets them and casts Ritual of Summoning, and leaves them targeted for the summoning. Never in a fight."] = "你的小队或团队成员要召唤时（“summon pls”）向其推荐：按键选中对方，施放召唤仪式，并保持选中以便召唤。战斗中绝不提供。"
L["Offer your own buffs to you when one is not up: the ones below. They are cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "当你自己的增益不在身上时推荐给你：即下面这些。它们会直接对你施放，然后恢复你原来的目标，也不说任何话。"
L["Offer your own buffs to you too, when one is not up: the ones below, and the buff you give others. They are cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "当你自己的增益不在身上时，也推荐给你：即下面这些，以及你给别人加的增益。它们会直接对你施放，然后恢复你原来的目标，也不说任何话。"
L["Offer your own buff to you too, when you are missing it or, with top-ups on, it is running low. It is cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "当你缺少自己的增益时（或开启补加后快到期时），也推荐给你。它会直接对你施放，然后恢复你原来的目标，也不说任何话。"
L["Off: your own buffs are not offered while you are in a city or an inn."] = "关闭：你在城市或旅店中时，不提示你自己的增益。"
L["Consumables only in dungeons and raids"] = "仅在地下城和团队副本中提示消耗品"
L["On: the reminder for an oil or a stone for your weapon, for food, and for a flask, an elixir or a scroll comes up only in a dungeon or a raid, not out in the world. Poisons and fishing lures are not held back."] = "开启：武器用的油或磨刀石、食物，以及合剂、药剂或卷轴的提醒只会在地下城或团队副本中出现，野外不会。毒药和鱼饵不受影响。"
L["My food, stones and oils after everybody else"] = "我的食物、磨刀石和油放在所有人之后"
L["On: your own food, weapon stones and oils, flasks, elixirs and scrolls wait until nobody else needs a buff from you. In a busy place you buff other people first and keep your own for later."] = "开启：你自己的食物、武器磨刀石和油、合剂、药剂和卷轴会等到没有其他人需要你的增益时再提示。在热闹的地方先为别人施放增益，把自己的留到以后。"
L["Which pet"] = "召唤哪只宠物"
L["The pet Manners brings out of your pet journal: the one you had out last, a random favourite, any pet, or one of your pets by name. With none out last, a favourite; with no favourites, any pet."] = "Manners 从你的宠物手册中召唤的宠物：你上次召唤的那只、随机一只偏好宠物、任意宠物，或按名字选定的一只宠物。没有上次召唤的，则为偏好宠物；没有偏好宠物，则为任意宠物。"
L["The one I had out last"] = "我上次召唤的那只"
L["A random favourite"] = "随机偏好宠物"
L["Any pet"] = "任意宠物"
L["Which food"] = "选用哪种食物"
L["Which food Manners reminds you to eat when you have several in your bags. The best one you can eat is what it did before. The weakest first uses up your cheaper food. Or pick one of the foods in your bags by name. A food you tick under Never remind me about is never picked."] = "背包里有多种食物时，Manners 提醒你吃哪一种。能吃的最好的食物与之前一样。先吃最弱的会先用掉便宜的食物。也可以按名字从背包里的食物中选一种。在“永不提醒”中勾选的食物永远不会被选用。"
L["The best one I can eat"] = "我能吃的最好的"
L["The weakest first"] = "最弱的优先"
L["Put consumables on a button of their own"] = "把消耗品放到单独的按钮上"
L["Food, flasks, elixirs, scrolls and your weapon's oils, stones and poisons come up on a small button of their own instead of on the prompt. Unlock the prompt to drag it where you want it; its key is set just below, and a right-click skips that item for now. It is never shown in a fight."] = "食物、合剂、药剂、卷轴以及武器的油、磨刀石和毒药会出现在一个单独的小按钮上，而不是提示框里。解锁提示框即可把它拖到想要的位置；它的按键就在下方设置，右键可暂时跳过该物品。战斗中从不显示。"
L["Key for the consumables button"] = "消耗品按钮的快捷键"
L["%s was bound to %s; it now uses the consumables button."] = "%s 原先绑定到 %s；现在它用于消耗品按钮。"
L["Remind me of my shout when I'm alone"] = "独自一人时提醒我战斗怒吼"
L["Off: a shout is only offered to your group. On: with nobody in your group, Battle Shout is offered to you too when it is missing or running low. In a group the group's own offer covers you."] = "关闭：怒吼只会提供给你的队伍。开启：队伍中没有其他人时，战斗怒吼缺失或即将结束也会提供给你。在队伍中时，队伍的提示已经覆盖你。"
L["Dampen Magic only when I'm alone"] = "仅在我独自一人时使用魔法抑制"
L["On: Dampen Magic is not offered while you are in a party or raid, where it would cut the healing you get."] = "开启：在小队或团队中时不提示魔法抑制，因为它会减少你受到的治疗。"
L["Amplify Magic only when I'm alone"] = "仅在我独自一人时使用魔法增效"
L["On: Amplify Magic is not offered while you are in a party or raid."] = "开启：在小队或团队中时不提示魔法增效。"
L["Weapon imbues before the shield"] = "武器附魔优先于护盾"
L["On: your weapon imbues come up ahead of your shield, so a shield you cannot cast for want of mana does not keep your imbue waiting behind it."] = "开启：武器附魔排在护盾之前，这样法力不足无法施放护盾时，不会耽误你的附魔。"
L["Remind me before Well-Rested runs out"] = "在“精神饱满”结束前提醒我"
L["On: the sleeping bag comes up again when Well-Rested has five minutes left, so you can lie down in it and renew it before it runs out. Off: only once it has gone."] = "开启：“精神饱满”还剩五分钟时再次提醒睡袋，让你在它结束前躺下续上。关闭：只在它消失后提醒。"
L["Off: no scroll is ever offered to you, and the switches for scrolls leave this list. Turned back on, each scroll is as you left it."] = "关闭：永远不会向你推荐任何卷轴，卷轴的开关也会从这个列表中消失。重新开启后，每个卷轴都保持你之前的设置。"
L["My group and raid"] = "我的队伍和团队"
L["Use group buffs"] = "使用群体增益"
L["When this many need it"] = "需要的人数达到"
L["Raid groups I buff"] = "我加增益的团队小队"
L["In a raid, only these groups are offered your buff; people who buff you or ask are offered anyway."] = "在团队中，只向这些小队推荐你的增益；给你加增益或向你要增益的人照样会被推荐。"
L["What you offer is cast on yourself and reaches only your own group of a raid, so the other groups' ticks change nothing."] = "你推荐的增益对自己施放，在团队中只作用于你自己的小队，所以其他小队的勾选不起作用。"
L["What you offer is cast on yourself and reaches every group of the raid around you: these ticks only choose whose missing buff brings the prompt up."] = "你推荐的增益对自己施放，作用于你周围团队的每个小队：这些勾选只决定谁缺少增益时弹出提示框。"
L["Who comes first"] = "谁优先"
L["My target first"] = "我的目标优先"
L["Your target goes ahead of everyone when the game can see they lack the buff."] = "当游戏能看到你的目标缺少该增益时，你的目标排在所有人前面。"
L["Greyed out while |cffffd100Always offer|r is chosen on %s: nothing is read then."] = "在“%s”中选择|cffffd100总是推荐|r时此项变灰：那时不会读取任何信息。"
L["Friends and guildmates first"] = "好友和公会成员优先"
L["Only changes the order; nobody is added or left out."] = "只改变先后顺序；不会增加或排除任何人。"
L["My group first at a ready check"] = "就位确认时我的队伍优先"
L["From a ready check until the pull, group members missing your buff go first."] = "从就位确认到开怪，缺少你增益的队友优先。"
L["Group members just revived first"] = "刚复活的队友优先"
L["For two minutes after someone is brought back, they go first if they lack your buff."] = "有人复活后的两分钟内，如果他缺少你的增益，就会优先。"
L["Skip players below level"] = "跳过低于此等级的玩家"
L["Someone known only by name is offered anyway."] = "只知道名字的人照样会被推荐。"
L["1: nobody is skipped for their level."] = "1：不会因等级而跳过任何人。"
L["Skip players out of range"] = "跳过超出范围的玩家"
L["If the game cannot tell the range they are still offered."] = "如果游戏无法判断距离，仍会推荐对方。"
L["Skip players flagged for PvP"] = "跳过处于PvP状态的玩家"
L["Buffing somebody flagged for PvP flags you too. Ignored while you are flagged yourself, as in a battleground, but not while your own flag is running out."] = "给处于PvP状态的人加增益，你也会进入PvP状态。你自己处于PvP状态时（例如在战场中）此选项不生效，但在你自己的PvP状态即将结束时仍然生效。"
L["Skip players in a fight"] = "跳过战斗中的玩家"
L["Buffing somebody in a fight pulls you into it, and what they are fighting may turn on you. They are offered again once the fight is over. Your target and focus are still offered."] = "给战斗中的人施加增益会把你也卷入战斗，他正在对付的敌人可能转而攻击你。战斗结束后会再次为其提供。你的目标和焦点仍会提供。"
L["Skip players of my class, who can buff themselves"] = "跳过我的同职业玩家，他们可以自己施放增益"
L["Somebody of your class can give themselves your buff, so they are left out -- unless they are too low a level for the rank you cast, and then they still get yours. People who buffed you, asked or you targeted are always offered."] = "同职业的玩家能自己给自己加你的增益，所以会被跳过——除非对方等级太低，用不了你施放的那个等级，这时仍会得到你的增益。给你加过增益、向你要过增益或被你选中的人总会被推荐。"
L["Skip these guilds"] = "跳过这些公会"
L["One guild per line."] = "每行一个公会。"
L["People in these guilds are not offered anything, in your group or as passers-by. Type a guild's name as it shows under a player, with or without the < >. Somebody who buffed you or asked, and your target and focus, are still offered. |cffffd100Show their guild under the name|r (%s) shows whose guild it is."] = "这些公会的成员不会被提供任何增益，无论在你的队伍里还是作为路人。请按玩家名字下方显示的样子输入公会名，带不带 < > 都可以。给过你增益或向你索要的人，以及你的目标和关注目标，仍会被提供。|cffffd100在名字下显示公会|r（%s）可以看到对方的公会。"
L["Players OlympusMute mutes, by name or by a word in their guild's name, are not offered anything: in your group, as passers-by or when they ask, and are never asked for a buff. Somebody who buffed you is still offered the favour back, and your target and focus are still offered. Its lists are read as they stand and never changed; while its muting is switched off, nobody is skipped."] = "OlympusMute 按名字或公会名中的词屏蔽的玩家，不会被推荐任何东西：队伍里、路人或他们开口求助时都一样，也不会向他们求增益。给你上过增益的人仍会得到回礼推荐，你的目标和焦点也仍会被推荐。它的名单只读取、绝不修改；它的屏蔽功能关闭时，不会跳过任何人。"
L["Classes I buff as passers-by"] = "作为路人时我加增益的职业"
L["Passers-by of a class you untick are not offered your buff. Your group, people who buff you or ask, and your target and focus are offered anyway."] = "取消勾选的职业的路人不会被提供你的增益。你的队伍、给你加增益或向你请求的人，以及你的目标和关注目标仍会被提供。"
L["Nobody is on the list. Shift-right-click the prompt to add the person it shows, or type a name below."] = "名单上还没有人。Shift+右键点击提示框可加入它显示的人，或在下方输入名字。"
L["One person is on the list. They are never offered anything as a passer-by or as a member of your group."] = "名单上有1个人。无论作为路人还是你的队友，都不会给他推荐任何增益。"
L["%d people are on the list. They are never offered anything as passers-by or as members of your group."] = "名单上有%d个人。无论作为路人还是你的队友，都不会给他们推荐任何增益。"
L["Somebody on it who buffs you is still offered the favour back. Shift-right-click them on the prompt to let that favour go."] = "名单上的人给你加增益时，仍会推荐你还人情。在提示框上Shift+右键点击他们即可勾销这份人情。"
L["Add a name"] = "添加名字"
L["Type it as the prompt shows it and press Enter."] = "按提示框上显示的写法输入，然后按回车键。"
L["Pick a name"] = "选择名字"
L["Remove from list"] = "移出名单"
L["Clear the list"] = "清空名单"
L["Take everybody off the never-offer list?"] = "将所有人移出永不推荐名单？"
L["Offer held-back buffs again"] = "重新推荐暂停的增益"
L["A buff the game refused on somebody (A more powerful spell is already active, too low a level, or refused twice running with nothing changed) is not offered to them for ten minutes. This offers every such buff again now."] = "游戏拒绝对某人施放的增益（已经有一个更强大的法术在发挥作用、等级太低，或在没有任何变化的情况下连续两次被拒绝）会在十分钟内不再推荐给对方。此按钮立即重新推荐所有此类增益。"
L["Mana Shield, Fire Ward and Frost Ward are reminded outside a fight only: from the pull until the fight ends Manners offers none of them, so in a fight you recast them yourself. Each lasts a minute or less."] = "法力护盾、防护火焰结界和防护冰霜结界仅在战斗外提醒：从开怪到战斗结束，Manners 不会提供它们，所以战斗中需要你自己重新施放。每个最多持续一分钟。"
L["A buff of yours Manners does not know: type its name as your spellbook shows it, or its spell id, and press Enter. It must be one this character knows, not passive and not cast on an enemy. Manners then reminds you of it as it does your other buffs, outside a fight, and in cities and inns only with Also in cities and inns. Up to ten, kept for this character."] = "一个 Manners 不认识的自己的增益：输入它在法术书中显示的名称或法术 ID，然后按回车。它必须是这个角色已学会、非被动、且不是对敌人施放的法术。之后 Manners 会像对待你的其他增益一样提醒你，战斗之外才提醒，在城市和旅店中则只有开启“也在城市和旅店中”时才提醒。最多十个，保存在这个角色上。"
L["Add a spell"] = "添加法术"
L["Its name as your spellbook shows it, or its spell id. Press Enter to add it."] = "它在法术书中显示的名称，或它的法术 ID。按回车添加。"
L["Remove %s"] = "移除%s"
L["Stop reminding you of it and take it off the list. You can add it again."] = "不再提醒你，并将它从列表中移除。你可以再次添加。"
L["Other people already buffed"] = "已有增益的其他玩家"
L["Already buffed"] = "已有增益"
L["When they already have my buff"] = "对方已有我的增益时"
L["Your own buffs are offered when none is up; with Offer a top-up when it runs low, also when one is running out (never an aura or an aspect)."] = "你自己的增益一个都不在身上时会被推荐；选择“快到期时推荐补加”后，快到期时也会推荐（光环和守护除外）。"
L["Someone who buffed you is offered a buff back unless they already have it with time to spare; Diagnostics shows which buffs Manners can see on others."] = "给你加过增益的人会被推荐回加，除非对方已有该增益且剩余时间充裕；“诊断”标签页会显示Manners能在别人身上看到哪些增益。"
L["Someone who buffed you is always offered a buff back; Diagnostics shows which buffs Manners can see on others."] = "给你加过增益的人总会被推荐回加；“诊断”标签页会显示Manners能在别人身上看到哪些增益。"
L["Skip them (default)"] = "跳过（默认）"
L["Offer a top-up when it runs low"] = "快到期时推荐补加"
L["Always offer (costs a lot of mana)"] = "总是推荐（耗费大量法力值）"
L["Top up at most this early"] = "最多提前这么久补加"
L["Manners tops a buff up shortly before it ends: about a tenth of its length, so a minute before for a ten-minute buff and five minutes for an hour. This is the most it will ever take."] = "Manners 会在增益快结束时补上：大约是持续时间的十分之一，所以十分钟的增益提前一分钟，一小时的提前五分钟。这是它最多会提前的时间。"
L["Someone whose time left cannot be read is not offered a top-up, unless they buffed you."] = "无法读取剩余时间的人不会被推荐补加，除非对方给你加过增益。"
L["Earlier in a raid or dungeon"] = "团队或地下城中提前更多"
L["A fight and the drinking after it take minutes, so in a raid or a dungeon a top-up is offered this many times as early. Your own buffs are offered half as early again, and people outside your group only in the last half minute."] = "一场战斗和战后的喝水要花上几分钟，所以在团队或地下城中，补加会提前这么多倍提供。你自己的增益会再提前一半提供，队伍之外的人只在最后半分钟提供。"
L["Topping up early"] = "提前补充"
L["Top up my own buffs before they run out"] = "在我自己的增益结束前补加"
L["Your own buffs, and the ones you put on yourself, are offered again shortly before they end, whatever When they already have my buff says for other people."] = "你自己的增益，以及你加在自己身上的增益，会在结束前不久再次提供，不论“对方已有我的增益时”对其他人怎么设置。"
L["Remind me this long before mine run out"] = "在我的增益结束前这么久提醒我"
L["At 0, Manners works it out from how long the buff lasts: a little over a tenth of it, twice that in a dungeon or raid. Set a time to be reminded exactly that long before your own buffs end, in a dungeon or raid too (0.5 is half a minute). Never more than half the buff's length."] = "设为 0 时，Manners 按增益的持续时间来算：略多于十分之一，在地下城或团队中是两倍。设一个时间，就会在你自己的增益结束前正好提前这么久提醒你，地下城或团队中也一样（0.5 是半分钟）。最多不超过增益时长的一半。"
L["0: worked out from how long each buff lasts."] = "0：根据每个增益的持续时间自动计算。"
L["Everyone you offer to is offered again and again, even with a fresh buff."] = "你推荐的每个人都会被反复推荐，即使对方的增益刚刚加上。"
L["%s does nothing in this mode."] = "此模式下%s无效。"
L["Don't offer when the game hides their buffs"] = "游戏隐藏其增益时不提供"
L["In a fight, and sometimes just after, the game hides other players' buffs: Manners cannot tell then whether they already have yours, and offers it marked \"unverified\". Tick this to never offer it then. Someone who buffed you or asked for a buff is still offered."] = "战斗中（有时在战斗刚结束时），游戏会隐藏其他玩家的增益：这时Manners无法判断对方是否已有你的增益，会标记为“未确认”后推荐。勾选后，这种情况一律不推荐。给你加过增益或向你要过增益的人仍会被推荐。"
L["In battlegrounds and arenas"] = "战场和竞技场中"
L["On: in a battleground or an arena your team is offered your buffs: freely while the gates are still shut, group casts first, and after that only while you are out of combat and only somebody within reach. Off: nobody else is offered anything there but somebody you target or focus. This switch decides there, whatever %s says. Your own buffs are not held back either way: what you fight with comes first after a death, food and the like after."] = "开启：在战场或竞技场中向你的队友推荐你的增益：大门尚未开启时不受限制，群体版优先；之后只在你脱离战斗时推荐，且只限施法范围内的人。关闭：在那里不向其他任何人推荐任何增益，你选为目标或关注目标的人除外。在那里由本选项决定，无论%s如何设置。你自己的增益无论如何都不受影响：死亡之后，先提示战斗用的增益，食物之类排在后面。"
L["Off: nothing is said when you buff somebody in a battleground or an arena, whatever %s is set to. On: your line is said there as it is anywhere else."] = "关闭：在战场或竞技场中给别人加增益时什么都不说，无论%s如何设置。开启：在那里和在其他地方一样说出你的台词。"
L["On: the /thank and the whispered thank-you, where you have them switched on, also go to somebody of your own team who buffs you in a battleground or an arena, never in a fight. Off: nobody is thanked there."] = "开启：如果你开启了 /thank 和密语道谢，它们也会发给在战场或竞技场中给你加增益的己方队友，战斗中不会发送。关闭：在那里不向任何人道谢。"
L["On: in a battleground or an arena the reminders that %s holds back come up as they do in a dungeon. Off: they wait there, as they do out in the world. With that switch off this one changes nothing: they come up everywhere."] = "开启：在战场或竞技场中，被%s暂缓的提示会像在地下城中一样出现。关闭：它们在那里暂不提示，和在野外一样。如果那个选项已关闭，本选项不会改变任何事：它们在任何地方都会出现。"
L["Hold back"] = "暂缓推荐"
L["Casting would dismount you; it is always hidden while dead, on a flight path or in a vehicle."] = "施法会让你下坐骑；死亡、乘坐飞行路线或在载具中时，提示框总是隐藏。"
L["In percent of your mana."] = "单位：法力值的百分比。"
L["Below this, only your own buff and people who buffed you or asked are offered."] = "低于此值时，只推荐你自己的增益，以及给你加过增益或向你要过增益的人。"
L["Below this, only people who buffed you or asked are offered."] = "低于此值时，只推荐给你加过增益或向你要过增益的人。"
L["Below this, only your own buff is offered."] = "低于此值时，只推荐你自己的增益。"
L["Below this, nothing is offered."] = "低于此值时，什么都不推荐。"
L["While saving mana, still offer"] = "节省法力时仍然推荐"
L["Who is still offered while you are under the floor. Someone who buffed you and is held back stays owed, and is offered once your mana is back."] = "法力值低于下限时仍然推荐谁。给你加过增益却被暂缓的人仍记为待还，法力值恢复后再推荐。"
L["People who buffed me or asked"] = "给我加过增益或要过增益的人"
L["Only my own buff"] = "只有我自己的增益"
L["Nothing"] = "无"
L["Off: buffs are offered at any mana."] = "关闭：无论法力值多少都会推荐增益。"
L["Below %d%% only favours, requests and your own buff are offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "低于%d%%时只推荐还人情、响应请求和你自己的增益；法力值回到%d%%时恢复推荐其他人。"
L["Below %d%% only favours and requests are offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "低于%d%%时只推荐还人情和响应请求；法力值回到%d%%时恢复推荐其他人。"
L["Below %d%% only your own buff is offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "低于%d%%时只推荐你自己的增益；法力值回到%d%%时恢复推荐其他人。"
L["Below %d%% nothing is offered; it all comes back at %d%%."] = "低于%d%%时什么都不推荐；法力值回到%d%%时全部恢复。"
L["Azeroth (general)"] = "艾泽拉斯（通用）"
L["loaded the %s lines."] = "已载入“%s”台词组。"
L["In combat: changes here apply once the fight ends."] = "战斗中：这里的更改在战斗结束后生效。"
L["Thanks and speech"] = "道谢和发言"
L["Everyone near you sees it; never in combat or inside a dungeon or a raid, in a battleground or an arena only for your own team, and at most once per person every five minutes."] = "附近的人都能看到；战斗中不会使用，地下城和团队副本内也不会使用，战场和竞技场中只对己方队伍使用，每人每5分钟最多一次。"
L["Emote to use"] = "使用的表情"
L["Or one of these, at random"] = "或随机使用其中之一"
L["Each thank-you uses the emote above or one of the ones ticked here, picked at random, so it is not the same every time."] = "每次致谢使用上面的表情或此处勾选的表情之一，随机选择，这样就不会每次都一样。"
L["Wait a moment before thanking"] = "道谢前稍等片刻"
L["The /thank and the whispered thank-you go out a second or three after the buff lands, so they seem less automatic. If they have gone out of sight by then, or a fight has started, nothing is sent."] = "/thank 和密语道谢会在增益落下后一到三秒再发出，显得不那么自动。如果到那时对方已离开视野，或战斗已经开始，就什么都不发送。"
L["Ask me before thanking"] = "道谢前先询问我"
L["Nothing goes out by itself: when somebody buffs you, the prompt offers to thank them, and your thank emote and whispered thank-you go only when you press it (a click, or the prompt's key). Left alone, the offer goes away after twenty seconds, and a fight drops it. A favour you owe or a buff your group needs comes first."] = "不会自动发出任何内容：有人给你加增益时，提示框会提出道谢，你的道谢表情和密语道谢只在你按下提示框时（点击或提示框的按键）才会发出。不理会的话，二十秒后提议消失，进入战斗也会取消。你欠的人情或队伍需要的增益优先。"
L["Don't thank anybody while I'm in a party or a raid"] = "我在小队或团队中时，不向任何人道谢"
L["While you are in a party or a raid, no /thank and no whispered thank-you go out, to group members or anybody else. In a battleground or an arena, Thank people there decides instead."] = "你在小队或团队中时，不会发出 /thank，也不会发出悄悄话道谢，无论对队友还是其他任何人。在战场和竞技场中，改由“在那里也道谢”决定。"
L["Whisper a thank-you to people I can't buff back"] = "向我无法回赠增益的人密语道谢"
L["A line from the In character set, fitting your race and class, whispered to somebody who buffs you when nothing of yours goes back to them. Never in combat, a dungeon or a raid, in a battleground or an arena only to your own team, and at most once per person every five minutes."] = "从“入戏”台词中挑一句符合你种族和职业的话，在有人给你加增益而你没有可回赠时密语给对方。战斗中、地下城和团队副本中不会发送，战场和竞技场中只发给己方队伍，每人每五分钟最多一次。"
L["With friendly nameplates off the game often will not say who buffed you. Then your thank emote goes out with nobody targeted, and on clients that name them in the combat log the whispered thank-you goes by name. Never while you have somebody targeted, never for somebody who may be in your group, and once per buff every five minutes."] = "友方姓名板关闭时，游戏常常不会告诉你是谁给你加了增益。此时你的道谢表情会在不选中任何人的情况下发出；在战斗记录中会显示其名字的客户端上，密语道谢会按名字发送。你选中某人时绝不发送，对可能在你队伍中的人绝不发送，每个增益每五分钟最多一次。"
L["Say a line when I buff someone"] = "我给人加增益时说一句台词"
L["Where to say it"] = "在哪里说"
L["Whisper them sends it only to the person you buff."] = "“密语对方”只发给你加增益的那个人。"
L["Say"] = "说"
L["Whisper them"] = "密语对方"
L["Emote"] = "表情"
L["Party"] = "小队"
L["Raid"] = "团队"
L["Yell"] = "大喊"
L["Only when I buff someone back"] = "仅在我回加增益时"
L["Off, you also speak when you buff someone first."] = "关闭时，你主动给人加增益时也会说。"
L["While you are in a party, no line goes out when you buff, to anybody. The buff is still offered and cast."] = "你在小队中时，加增益不会对任何人说台词。增益照常推荐和施放。"
L["While you are in a raid, no line goes out when you buff, to anybody. The buff is still offered and cast."] = "你在团队中时，加增益不会对任何人说台词。增益照常推荐和施放。"
L["First name only"] = "只叫名字"
L["{name} says only the first word of a name: Petra Stonewell is called Petra. A one-word name is said whole, and a whisper still goes to the whole name."] = "{name} 只说名字的第一个词：Petra Stonewell 会被叫作 Petra。只有一个词的名字照原样说出，密语仍然发给完整的名字。"
L["Turn on friendly nameplates so Manners can tell when strangers are in range to hear you."] = "开启友方姓名板，Manners才能判断陌生人是否近到能听见你说话。"
L["Tick Say a line to choose what you say."] = "勾选“说一句台词”后即可选择要说的话。"
L["Lines"] = "台词"
L["Line set"] = "台词组"
L["Replaces the lines below."] = "替换下方的台词。"
L["Replace everything in the box below with the %s lines?"] = "用“%s”台词组替换下方文本框中的全部内容？"
L["One line is picked at random. Placeholders: {name} their name, {buff} the spell."] = "每次随机挑选一句。占位符：{name}为对方的名字，{buff}为法术。"
L["A line too long for a macro is skipped; Try a few shows what would go out."] = "宏放不下的过长台词会被跳过；“试几句台词”可以看到会发出什么。"
L["In character picks one of its %d lines when you click, to fit your race, faction, class and the moment. The box below shows only a few examples; editing it turns In character off."] = "“入戏”会在你点击时从%d句台词中挑选一句，贴合你的种族、阵营、职业和当时的情形。下方只列出几句示例；编辑它会关闭“入戏”。"
L["Never say my last line again"] = "再也不说我上一句台词"
L["Your last line was one of your own: change it in My own lines, mixed in."] = "你最后说的是自己的台词：请在“我自己的台词，混入其中”里修改。"
L["No In character line has been said yet this session."] = "本次登录还没有说过入戏台词。"
L["Leaves this line out of In character for good: %s"] = "将这句台词永久排除出入戏：%s"
L["left out: %s"] = "已排除：%s"
L["Lines left out"] = "已排除的台词"
L["One per line."] = "每行一句。"
L["In character never says these lines. Delete a row to hear its line again."] = "入戏永远不会说这些台词。删除一行即可再次听到那句台词。"
L["Your lines"] = "你的台词"
L["Editing these turns In character off and uses only your lines. Continue?"] = "编辑这些台词会关闭“入戏”，只使用你自己的台词。继续吗？"
L["My own lines, mixed in with In character"] = "我自己的台词，混入入戏"
L["With In character as the set, some presses say one of these instead of an In character line: How often my own lines are said, below, says how many. {name} is their name and {buff} is the spell. Leave it empty to hear In character alone."] = "选用入戏台词时，部分按键会说这里的一句，而不是入戏台词：由下方的“我的台词出现频率”决定多少。{name} 是对方的名字，{buff} 是法术。留空则只说入戏台词。"
L["How often my own lines are said"] = "我的台词出现频率"
L["How many presses say one of your own lines instead of an In character one. With Every press, In character speaks only when none of your lines fits the macro."] = "多少次按键会说你自己的台词而不是入戏台词。选“每次按键”时，只有在你的台词都放不进宏时才说入戏台词。"
L["About one press in three"] = "大约每三次一次"
L["About half the presses"] = "大约一半"
L["About two presses in three"] = "大约每三次两次"
L["Every press"] = "每次按键"
L["Go back to In character"] = "切回入戏"
L["Try a few lines"] = "试几句台词"
L["Prints sample lines in your chat; only you see them."] = "在聊天框中显示几句示例台词；只有你能看到。"
L["Somebody"] = "某人"
L["A line goes out only with a buff that can land: in range, ready to cast, and with the mana for it. When Manners cannot tell, the buff goes out without it. Line of sight cannot be checked."] = "只有增益能加上时才会说台词：在范围内、可以施放、法力值足够。Manners无法判断时，只加增益、不说台词。视野无法检查。"
L["In combat: changes here show once the fight ends."] = "战斗中：这里的更改在战斗结束后显示。"
L["Lock position"] = "锁定位置"
L["Unlock to drag the prompt; it will not cast until you lock it again."] = "解锁后可拖动提示框；重新锁定前它不会施法。"
L["unlocked, but the addon is |cffff8080off|r so there is no prompt to drag -- switch it on first."] = "已解锁，但插件已|cffff8080关闭|r，没有提示框可拖动——请先开启插件。"
L["Move it in Edit Mode"] = "在编辑模式中移动"
L["While the game's Edit Mode is open the prompt is unlocked, so you can drag it there with everything else. It casts nothing meanwhile and locks again when Edit Mode closes."] = "游戏的编辑模式打开期间，提示框处于解锁状态，可以和其他界面元素一起在那里拖动。期间它不会施放任何法术，关闭编辑模式后会重新锁定。"
L["Where it sits"] = "所在位置"
L["Pick Above the action bars to put it back where it started."] = "选择“动作条上方”可把它放回最初的位置。"
L["Dragging the prompt afterwards sets this to Where I dragged it."] = "之后拖动提示框，此项会变为“我拖到的位置”。"
L["Above the action bars (default)"] = "动作条上方（默认）"
L["Where I dragged it"] = "我拖到的位置"
L["Size"] = "大小"
L["Scale"] = "缩放"
L["Opacity"] = "不透明度"
L["Width"] = "宽度"
L["Height"] = "高度"
L["Style"] = "样式"
L["Use my class's look on each character"] = "每个角色使用我职业的外观"
L["Each character on this profile wears the look made for its class: a druid the Druid look, a paladin the Paladin look. Where a class has several, as a mage does, it wears the one you last clicked on that class, else the first. Any other look you click becomes this profile's own, which every character wears with this off."] = "此配置文件中的每个角色都使用为其职业设计的外观：德鲁伊使用德鲁伊外观，圣骑士使用圣骑士外观。若某职业有多个外观（如法师），则使用你最后在该职业上点击的那个，否则使用第一个。你点击的其他任何外观会成为此配置文件自己的外观，关闭此项后所有角色都使用它。"
L["Panel style"] = "面板样式"
L["Pick a theme for the prompt from the list. It switches at once."] = "从列表中为提示框选择一种样式。立即生效。"
L["%s: its settings"] = "%s：它的设置"
L["Earlier art"] = "旧版美术"
L["Draws every look with the art it had before it was repainted. Off, a repainted look wears its new painted frame."] = "以重绘之前的美术绘制每种外观。关闭后，重绘过的外观使用新的手绘边框。"
L["Show my key on the prompt"] = "在提示框上显示我的按键"
L["Whether the key you press for the prompt is shown on it. As the look has it: on the class and themed looks, not on the calmer ones. Nothing is shown while no key is bound."] = "是否在提示框上显示你按下它所用的按键。随外观而定：职业外观和主题外观显示，较素雅的外观不显示。未绑定按键时什么也不显示。"
L["As the look has it (shown)"] = "随外观而定（显示）"
L["As the look has it (hidden)"] = "随外观而定（隐藏）"
L["Never"] = "从不"
L["Panel colour"] = "面板颜色"
L["Colour by why they are offered"] = "按推荐原因着色"
L["Pale yellow for your own target, orange for a favour owed, deep pink for somebody who asked, sky blue for your group, violet for passers-by -- the order they are offered in."] = "浅黄色表示你自己的目标，橙色表示待还的人情，深粉色表示向你要增益的人，天蓝色表示你的队友，紫色表示路人——也就是他们被推荐的先后顺序。"
L["Pale blue for your own target, amber for a favour owed, pink for somebody who asked, deeper blue for your group, grey for passers-by -- the order they are offered in."] = "浅蓝色表示你自己的目标，琥珀色表示待还的人情，粉色表示向你要增益的人，较深的蓝色表示你的队友，灰色表示路人——也就是他们被推荐的先后顺序。"
L["A colour that shows why this person is on the prompt."] = "用颜色表示此人为什么出现在提示框上。"
L["Colour set"] = "配色"
L["The colour-blind set keeps the reasons apart for red-green colour blindness, in colours that differ in lightness too."] = "“色盲友好”配色让红绿色盲也能分清各种原因，所用颜色的明暗也各不相同。"
L["Standard"] = "标准"
L["Colour-blind friendly"] = "色盲友好"
L["Colour to use otherwise"] = "其余情况的颜色"
L["Used when Colour by why they are offered is off."] = "“按推荐原因着色”关闭时使用。"
L["Put the colour on"] = "颜色显示在"
L["Where the reason's colour is drawn."] = "原因颜色绘制的位置。"
L["Ring around the icon"] = "图标外圈"
L["Stripe on the left edge"] = "左侧色条"
L["Both"] = "两者都用"
L["None"] = "无"
L["There is nothing left to colour: %s puts it on the icon, which is switched off."] = "没有可着色的地方了：“%s”把颜色放在图标上，而图标已关闭。"
L["Getting my attention"] = "提醒我"
L["Flash when someone buffs me"] = "有人给我加增益时闪烁"
L["Needs the spell icon, the colour marker or Full animations."] = "需要显示法术图标、色标，或将动画设为“完整”。"
L["Pulse until I buff them back"] = "持续脉动，直到我回加增益"
L["Flash once"] = "闪烁一次"
L["Calm only fades in and out: no sweeps of light, rings, waves, cracks or shaking."] = "“柔和”只有淡入淡出：没有光线扫过、光环、光波、裂纹或抖动。"
L["Hide the prompt in a fight"] = "战斗中隐藏提示框"
L["Off the screen for the whole fight, and nothing casts from it meanwhile: not its key, not a name in its list, not the Manners macro on your bar. It comes back when the fight ends. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "整场战斗中都不显示，期间也不会施放任何法术：快捷键、列表中的名字、动作条上的 Manners 宏都不会。战斗结束后重新出现。战斗中所做的更改从下一场战斗起生效。"
L["While In a fight, my key casts names a spell, the prompt's key casts that spell in a fight instead."] = "只要“战斗中我的快捷键施放”选了某个法术，提示框的快捷键在战斗中就改为施放那个法术。"
L["In a fight, each press buffs the next person in line"] = "战斗中每按一次，为队列中的下一个人加增益"
L["A fight locks the prompt, so Manners hands it everybody who still needed a buff as the fight began, and each press of the prompt or its key casts at the next of them in turn. Off, every press in a fight casts at the one person the prompt was on. The Manners macro on an action bar keeps to that one person either way."] = "战斗会锁定提示框，因此 Manners 会把战斗开始时仍需要增益的所有人交给它，每次按下提示框或它的按键都会依次对下一个人施放。关闭后，战斗中的每次按下都只对提示框当时所在的那一个人施放。动作条上的 Manners 宏在两种情况下都只对那一个人施放。"
L["In a fight, my key casts"] = "战斗中我的快捷键施放"
L["The prompt's key buffs out of a fight. Pick a spell here and the same key casts it in a fight instead, for as long as the fight lasts; nothing extra appears on screen. Clicking the prompt still buffs. Only spells you know are listed. It needs a key for the prompt, and the Manners macro on an action bar keeps to buffs. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框的快捷键在战斗之外施放增益。在这里选一个法术，同一个快捷键在战斗期间就改为施放它；屏幕上不会多出任何东西。点击提示框仍然施放增益。列表里只有你已学会的法术。提示框需要设有快捷键，动作条上的Manners宏仍只用于增益。战斗中所做的更改从下一场战斗起生效。"
L["A spell you can cast on others lands on your target when it is a friend, else on you."] = "你能对他人施放的法术，目标是友方时落在目标身上，否则落在你自己身上。"
L["Nothing (keep to buffs)"] = "无（只用于增益）"
L["Cast it on"] = "施放在"
L["For a spell you can cast on others. A spell only for yourself always lands on you."] = "适用于你能对他人施放的法术。只能对自己施放的法术总是落在你身上。"
L["Whoever is under my mouse, else my target, else me"] = "鼠标下的玩家，否则是我的目标，否则是我"
L["Me"] = "我"
L["Show a Will of the Forsaken button when I am feared, charmed or asleep"] = "我被恐惧、魅惑或沉睡时显示亡灵意志按钮"
L["A button of its own beside the prompt, with its own key. It shows while you are feared, charmed or asleep: lit when the spell is ready, dim while it cools down. Show the fight buttons can keep it there, dim, all fight. A change made in a fight counts from the next one."] = "提示框旁边一个单独的按钮，有自己的快捷键。当你被恐惧、魅惑或沉睡时显示：法术就绪时亮起，冷却期间保持暗淡。“显示战斗按钮”可以让它在整场战斗中暗淡地留在那里。战斗中所做的更改从下一场战斗起生效。"
L["Key for Will of the Forsaken"] = "亡灵意志的快捷键"
L["%s was bound to %s; it now casts %s."] = "%s原本绑定的是%s；现在改为施放%s。"
L["Key for Mend Pet"] = "治疗宠物的快捷键"
L["Show the fight buttons"] = "显示战斗按钮"
L["For the Will of the Forsaken and Mend Pet buttons. Only when needed: a button appears when you need it and fades after; its key casts it, and a click too when no key is set. All fight: it sits dim beside the prompt for the whole fight, lights up when needed and takes a click. Where the game hides your pet's health in a fight, only All fight shows the Mend Pet button."] = "用于亡灵意志和治疗宠物的按钮。仅在需要时：需要时按钮出现，之后淡出；由快捷键施放，没有设置快捷键时点击也可以。整场战斗：它在整场战斗中暗淡地停在提示框旁，需要时亮起，也可以点击。在游戏于战斗中隐藏宠物生命值的地方，只有“整场战斗”会显示治疗宠物按钮。"
L["Only when needed"] = "仅在需要时"
L["All fight, dim until needed"] = "整场战斗，需要前保持暗淡"
L["Key for my cure in a fight"] = "战斗中驱散的快捷键"
L["The prompt stays up in a fight, its key binding still casting, unless %s is on; this stops only the flashes that say what a click did, red if it failed."] = "除非开启了“%s”，战斗中提示框仍会留在屏幕上，快捷键也仍会施法；此项只会停止表示点击结果的闪光（失败时为红色）。"
L["Fade this window while I change the look"] = "更改外观时淡化此窗口"
L["On: after a change on Look, and while you drag a slider or pick a colour, this window fades for a moment so you can see the prompt behind it. Off: it stays as it is."] = "开启：在外观页更改设置后，以及拖动滑块或选择颜色时，此窗口会短暂淡化，让你看到后面的提示框。关闭：窗口保持不变。"
L["Dim the prompt in combat"] = "战斗中让提示框变暗"
L["In a fight the built-in looks are drawn at about half strength, so the prompt reads as held. Off, it stays at the opacity you set."] = "战斗中，内置外观以约一半的强度绘制，使提示框显示为冻结状态。关闭时保持你设置的不透明度。"
L["When a new person appears on the prompt."] = "提示框上出现新的人时。"
L["Sound"] = "音效"
L["%s |cff808080(not loaded)|r"] = "%s |cff808080（未加载）|r"
L["Only for people who buff me"] = "仅限给我加增益的人"
L["Off, every new person makes a sound, passers-by included."] = "关闭时，每出现一个新的人都会播放音效，包括路人。"
L["%s is silent. Pick a sound above."] = "“%s”为静音。请在上方选择一个音效。"
L["Tooltip"] = "提示信息"
L["Tooltip on the prompt"] = "提示框的提示信息"
L["What the prompt and the names in its list show when the cursor is on them. Short is the name, why they are offered and a hint; hold Shift for everything. The note about dragging that shows while the prompt is unlocked stays whatever you pick, since it explains the drag."] = "光标移到提示框及其列表中的名字上时显示的内容。“简短”只显示名字、提示的原因和一行说明；按住 Shift 可看到全部。提示框解锁时显示的拖动说明不受此选项影响，因为它是用来解释拖动的。"
L["Short (hold Shift for more)"] = "简短（按住 Shift 查看更多）"
L["Only while holding Shift"] = "仅在按住 Shift 时"
L["Off"] = "关闭"
L["Tooltip position"] = "提示信息位置"
L["Beside the prompt puts it above or below, on the side with more room on your screen, clear of the prompt and its list. Where the game shows tooltips uses your usual tooltip corner."] = "“提示框旁边”会把它放在提示框的上方或下方，选屏幕上空间更大的一侧，不会盖住提示框及其列表。“游戏默认位置”使用你平时的提示信息位置。"
L["Beside the prompt"] = "提示框旁边"
L["Where the game shows tooltips"] = "游戏默认位置"
L["Text"] = "文字"
L["Font"] = "字体"
L["Font size"] = "字体大小"
L["Text colour"] = "文字颜色"
L["White turns dark by itself on a light panel; any other colour is used as you pick it, except for names while this is on:"] = "白色在浅色面板上会自动变深；其他颜色按你选的使用，但开启下面这项时，名字除外："
L["Colour names by class"] = "按职业为名字着色"
L["Shadow and outline on the text"] = "文字阴影和描边"
L["The shadow under the words, and the outline Minimal draws with no panel behind it, on Glass, Framed and Minimal. Off, the text is drawn flat."] = "玻璃、带框和极简样式中文字下方的阴影，以及极简在无背景时绘制的描边。关闭后文字为平面绘制。"
L["Show a second line"] = "显示第二行"
L["Needs a prompt at least %d pixels tall."] = "提示框高度需至少%d像素。"
L["Show their guild under the name"] = "在名字下显示公会"
L["Adds <Guild> after the reason on the second line, and in the tooltip, for somebody who is in a guild. Needs the second line."] = "对方在公会中时，在第二行原因之后和鼠标提示中加上 <公会>。需要显示第二行。"
L["Icon and waiting list"] = "图标和等待列表"
L["Show spell icon"] = "显示法术图标"
L["Size of the consumables button"] = "消耗品按钮大小"
L["The button your consumables come up on, with Put consumables on a button of their own on. Unlock the prompt to drag it."] = "开启“把消耗品放到单独的按钮上”后，消耗品出现的那个按钮。解锁提示框即可拖动它。"
L["Icon size"] = "图标大小"
L["The icon stays inside the prompt: make the prompt taller or wider for a bigger one."] = "图标留在提示框内：想要更大的图标，请把提示框调高或调宽。"
L["This look sizes the icon from the prompt's height: %d at %d high. Make the prompt taller for a bigger icon."] = "此外观按提示框高度决定图标大小：%d（高度%d）。把提示框调高可以让图标更大。"
L["The icon is held at %d to fit a prompt %d wide."] = "图标被限制在%d，以适应宽度为%d的提示框。"
L["The icon is held at %d to fit a prompt %d high."] = "图标被限制在%d，以适应高度为%d的提示框。"
L["Round the icon off"] = "将图标裁成圆形"
L["Masks the icon into a circle. Reads more like a portrait than a spell, so it is off by default."] = "用遮罩把图标裁成圆形。看起来更像头像而不是法术，所以默认关闭。"
L["Frame round the icon"] = "图标边框"
L["The metal bezel round the spell icon, on Glass, Framed and Minimal. Off, the icon stands on its own."] = "玻璃、带框和极简样式中法术图标周围的金属边框。关闭后只显示图标本身。"
L["Gryphons at the ends"] = "两端的狮鹫"
L["A gilt gryphon at each end of the Glass look, as on the game's old action bar. Off, the bar ends at its rails."] = "玻璃外观两端各有一只镀金狮鹫，如同游戏旧版动作条。关闭后，动作条止于滑轨。"
L["Show the global cooldown on the icon"] = "在图标上显示公共冷却时间"
L["Sweeps the spell icon while the global cooldown runs, like your action bars, so you can see when the next press will go through."] = "公共冷却期间，法术图标上会像动作条一样显示冷却动画，让你知道下一次按键何时能生效。"
L["Hidden in a fight while this is on:"] = "开启下面这项时，战斗中隐藏："
L["Show how many are waiting"] = "显示等待人数"
L["List the next few below"] = "在下方列出接下来的几人"
L["How many to list"] = "列出几人"
L["Click a name in the list to buff them"] = "点击列表中的名字，为对方加增益"
L["Turns each name in the list into a button: a left click buffs that person as if they were on the prompt. Right-click skips them for now, shift-right-click puts them on your never-offer list. Names cannot be clicked in a fight."] = "把列表中的每个名字变成按钮：左键点击会为对方加增益，就像对方在提示框里一样。右键点击暂时跳过对方，Shift+右键点击将对方加入永不推荐名单。战斗中无法点击名字。"
L["Advanced"] = "高级"
L["The defaults suit most players; change these only if something bothers you."] = "默认设置适合大多数玩家；只有觉得哪里不对劲时才需要更改。"
L["In combat: targeting changes apply once the fight ends."] = "战斗中：与选择目标有关的更改在战斗结束后生效。"
L["Reset this page"] = "重置本页"
L["Put every setting on this page back to its default? Where the prompt sits, the lines you wrote and the never-offer list are kept."] = "将本页的所有设置恢复为默认值？提示框的位置、你写的台词和永不推荐名单都保持不变。"
L["Only class buffs count as favours"] = "只有职业增益算作人情"
L["Only class buffs such as Fortitude count as a favour to return."] = "只有真言术：韧这类职业增益才算作要还的人情。"
L["The same goes for /thank people who buff me."] = "“对给我加增益的人/thank”也是如此。"
L["Off, somebody who buffs you and already has everything you could give them, with time to spare, is offered nothing, whoever cast it: a thank-you is enough, and the favour is let go. A buff they are missing, or one about to run out, is still offered back."] = "关闭时：给你加增益的人如果已经拥有你能给的全部增益，且剩余时间充裕，无论是谁施放的，都不会再被推荐——道声谢就够了，这份人情随即勾销。对方缺少的增益，或即将到期的增益，仍会被推荐回加。"
L["On, the buff they already have is offered again to return the favour."] = "开启时：会再次推荐对方已有的增益，用来还人情。"
L["How long someone who buffed you stays on offer."] = "给你加过增益的人会被推荐多久。"
L["Let them go sooner if they have probably left"] = "对方很可能已离开时更早放弃"
L["Manners can rarely tell whether somebody who buffed you is still in range, so they are let go after the time below."] = "Manners 很难判断给你加过增益的人是否仍在范围内，所以过了下面设定的时间就会放过他们。"
L["Let them go after"] = "放弃前等待"
